  ('zcrm_1579374000043577012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043000021', 'Joseph DeGain', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 11/21. Billing set up to start 11/22. Good to go for 12/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-21 06:59:23', '2019-11-21 06:59:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271309', 'Liesa Smith', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Liesa was really great and Redirect is going to be a great fit for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-20 19:13:43', '2019-11-20 19:13:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929123', 'Diane Brennan', NULL, 'member called to cancel, I sent form and tagged Jane. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-20 16:40:42', '2019-11-20 16:40:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257470', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, '11-20-19 Cancelling bc started a new job with ins. Wants effective 12/1/19', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 16:36:07', '2019-11-20 16:36:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784709', 'Paul Knaysi', NULL, '11-20-19 Considering adding a MEC for family for $99 simply for tax benefits of HSA. He''d pay $1200 to save $2000, so $800 benefit and can get his wellness visits that aren''t covered by Appleton Clinics done via the MEC. He''ll talk with his accountant to decide what''s best.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 16:34:51', '2019-11-20 16:34:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043852079', 'Rick Morey', NULL, '11-20-19 Rick just turned 50 and he''s an ER RN. He''s getting a subsidy and paying only $200 in 2019 and will be $260 in 2020. Has some back problems but reached a baseline now again. Chiro isn''t helpful. 2018 has bicep repaired. 2017 had bilateral cataract surgery. Interested in DPC or Provider Directed. He''ll look into local DPC''s in GJ but not sure he wants to go down that path.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 16:24:05', '2019-11-20 16:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043602047', 'Amy Rittenberg', NULL, '11-20-19 Family of 4, Amy 50, Doug 50 in Jan. 2020, Brie 14 and Daughter 16 with cerebral palsy. They are able to get Medicaid as back up for daughter but she doesn''t trust Medicaid at all. She''s working with a broker for traditional ins for $1100/$7500 ded with Cigna. They can appy for the CO Health Ins Buy-In (HIBI) Program to get the cost of Cigna discounted for their daughter''s portion, ie. a few $100 discount of the $1100. She''s more comfortable with that. Also husband got laid off and is looking for a new job and no idea when that will happen. Husband also is on statin. Rest sounds healthy, no tobacco. This is not a good option for their family but Amy would like it if it were just her on the membership. She will tell some other friends who need assistance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 15:44:50', '2019-11-20 15:44:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806003', 'Michael Stimens', NULL, 'Rachel called to cancel.  Sent form, coppied Jane. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-20 15:31:08', '2019-11-20 15:31:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, '11-20-19 Francis is trying to get bill cost down at Denver Health and Jasmine at Denver Health told him to apply for Medicaid. He''s earning about $50K and will not qualify. But, then we clarified that he needs to tell them he''s Not insured and he wants their best cash price. He will do that. It was confusing since doesn''t completely understand how this works as a self-pay patient. It will help once he''s a member of the DPC moving forward with Nextera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 15:04:34', '2019-11-20 15:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257470', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-20 14:56:54', '2019-11-20 14:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007177', 'Chris Morley', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  member already had everything completed!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-20 14:53:17', '2019-11-20 14:53:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007131', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Member is very smart and took lots of notes. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-20 14:50:13', '2019-11-20 14:50:13'),
