  ('zcrm_1579374000043597033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608546', 'Paige Kaufmann', NULL, '11-20-19 Aidan SS - 667 26 2541, Elle 671 34 4299', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 14:11:42', '2019-11-21 11:14:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043578081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575482', 'Christina Brown', NULL, 'This application will be pended bc of missing Children''s SS#"s I have left VM &amp; will email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-20 14:10:42', '2019-11-20 14:10:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043578076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575482', 'Christina Brown', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-20 14:08:39', '2019-11-20 14:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309236', 'Matthew Funke', NULL, 'Sedera had never entered dependents and that is why they were having issues registering with Teladoc.  I let the family know that the entire family has now been entered into Sedera''s system, and that they all will be able to register with Teladoc come Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-20 14:08:36', '2019-11-20 14:08:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608589', 'Genifer Murray', NULL, '11-20-19 Genifer is SUPER excited about this and wants to share with all her friends! She was laid off in Oct. 4th and Cobra will cost $900! She just did her yearly mammogram and pap screening and needs to figure out if better to pay Cobra or cash for those items. She''s 48, single, no kids. Had softball sized fibroid removed last year via surgery. Has 4 meds, spiralactone which is diuretic for acne, progesterone, NP thyroid, lemotrigine/lemictol. She looked at some other program that cost $350 but she didn''t trust it. Group Legion Benefit Medical from Access. I have no idea. Genifer if ready to enroll and will try on own. She wants today for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 14:03:16', '2019-11-20 14:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043597018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608641', 'Monique DiGiorgio', NULL, '11-20-19 Spoke with JC this morning since she wasn''t connecting with Monique. Monique was getting frustrated and didn''t want to miss the deadline. She was eager to move forward. JC had some personal things come up and was on vacation and had technical difficulties which caused the lack of communication and missed communications with the client. After talking with JC this morning she decided I should just finalize the membership with Monique since Monique was already frustrated with JC and she didn''t want to start off on a bad note. Monique will send their other employee back to JC who also wants to enroll. Monique is member of Whole Health which is only $55 a month and includes women''s wellness visit! She just joined DPC membership at $2500/$173 for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-20 13:58:57', '2019-11-20 13:58:57'),
