  ('zcrm_1579374000043578043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001659002', 'Dorothy Fears', NULL, 'Member called in she will be going on Medicare,  however she does not know when it will be effective.  I advised her of the timing of the billing and when she would have to get her Cancellation request in to avoid being billed.  I sent out the link to the cancellation for so she can have it on hand to submit.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-20 10:14:17', '2019-11-20 10:14:36'),
