  ('zcrm_1579374000043510032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038170085', 'Jeffrey Dickinson', NULL, 'called in confused because he went to the doctors office yesterday and now needs to make another appointment.  I gave him Redirect''s phone number, as well as guided him to the extrahelp page.  I also recommended that he download the app on his phone to make use simpler.  I told him that he is to call redirect for anything medical BEFORE he goes to an appointment. He said he does understand now but that he was just overwhelmed by everything.  He thanked me for all of my help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-19 18:35:43', '2019-11-19 18:35:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043517080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, '11-19-19 She never knew she was cancelled! Nobody ever called her and nobody notified me either. She missed the emails and the system shows clearly none of them were opened by her. She called me back immediately now to re-enroll. She completed the updated payment with checking account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-19 16:51:41', '2019-11-19 16:51:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043510027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001799013', 'Ray Iglesias', NULL, 'called in to speak to Reid. transferred the line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-19 16:35:14', '2019-11-19 16:35:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043510022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309236', 'Matthew Funke', NULL, 'Welcome call with Tracy complete (Matthew had asked her to do it in his absence) I told Tracy that I would do the welcome call with her, but would send Matthew another scheduler so that he could pick a time for us to go over this with him because he is the primary.  She agreed.  Welcome call went well- except for the fact that there were glitches with the Multiplan site- it wasn''t loading- gave an error message, then no RCI cards, and then Teladoc registration wasn''t showing Tracy or the kids.  I let John and Patti know of the issues. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-19 16:32:34', '2019-11-19 16:32:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043517075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781294', 'Lisa Paxton', NULL, '11-19-19 Looking towards Jan. 1st start since can''t find out if can cancel employer coverage right away. She''s covered through Dec. She''s currently paying about $230 a month for her portion of the cost and employer paying rest. She''s very excited about this option and we have appt on Dec 5th on her day off when she can focus and possibly enroll in Redirect. Looking at $1500 IUA or maybe $1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-19 16:31:43', '2019-11-19 16:31:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043517067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '11-19-19 Natalie is 54 and husband 53, 23 yr old son likely on own and not eligible and same for 28 yr old son on own. Natalie and husband own Daniel''s Food Inc. and run restaurant called Mirabelle''s at Beaver Creek. Their other employees are 50, 52, 29 and one in 30''s about 34.  They lost an employee since couldn''t afford to offer health ins anymore when prices doubled and tripled. Used to offer it and pay for part of it, but employees couldn''t even afford cost when they were only paying a portion. So, no longer offering it. These prices are tolerable where she can pay half. We''ll do list bill as Association members.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-19 15:17:35', '2019-11-19 15:17:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043510017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447040', 'Catherine Placek', NULL, 'called in needing some help in finding the update cc info on mpowreing site.  all set. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-19 14:32:19', '2019-11-19 14:32:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043517057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, '11-19-19 Calling to find out how to re-enroll. Reminded her $25 annual fee. Told her the Concierge # to start a new need if Bob''d skin biopsy cost is looking to exceed $2500. She will hold tight on that for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-19 13:54:58', '2019-11-19 13:54:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043509115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043541176', 'Megan Bush', NULL, 'Acct set up charged 11/19, Billing set to start 11/22. Good to go for 12/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-19 13:48:12', '2019-11-19 13:48:12'),
