  ('zcrm_1579374000043517052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758402', 'Blake Eliasson', NULL, '11-19-19 Still hasn''t had time to read through info I sent or show to husband. She will contact me when ready. Now looking at 1/1/19 start date. Leaning towards PSDHC for HSA option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-19 13:10:02', '2019-11-19 13:10:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043517047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758402', 'Blake Eliasson', NULL, '11-18-19 Hasn''t had time to read through info I sent or show to husband. Moved appt to tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-19 13:09:18', '2019-11-19 13:09:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043535029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '11.19.19:  Stan (Peggy''s husband) called.  Peggy had a colonoscopy in July. All providers were in network and procedure was preventive only.  Stan submitted bills to RCI and got paid for anaesthesia, OR, some equipment. Was denied for gastroenterologist and  anaesthesiologist due to wrong coding. Coding was rectified. When they didn''t get paid, Stan called agian and was told they would receive pmt. in 7 to 10 days.  When they didn''t get paid, Stan called agian and was then told these providers were out of network but they are not, so, again, RCI told him they would be paid within 7 to 10 days. They have not been paid to date despite Stan''s calls semi-monthly to find out about pmt. In order not to be in collection, Stan has paid 2 pmts. of $113.00 to a bill collection service thus far to keep his credit rating in tact.  I called John who asked me to get the information he needs to contact RCI and resolve this matter. I spoke again w/Stan who is sending me that information which I will forward to John along with a ticket.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-11-19 12:57:01', '2019-11-19 12:57:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043531079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933073', 'Bonnie Solan', NULL, 'This member is unable to enroll since Sedera is unable to sell in state of WA.  I have cancelled RCI and asked Sunny to refund Set up &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-19 12:30:29', '2019-11-19 12:30:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043510005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041599111', 'Matthew Vendetti', NULL, 'I gave Matthew a ring per Sunny because he had called in with many questions and hasn''t yet had a welcome call.  Matthew had many questions and I answered them all, towards the end I offered to do a welcome call for him on the spot, or some other time today and he declined, stating that he wasn''t going to need it- that all he needed from me would be a few sites and links and he would figure it out on his own from there.  I did send him many emails on-opening up a need with Sedera, Sedera videos, provider search/ACA services, 5 steps, and wellness visit instructions.  I am also going to reach out to Patti for her to request another RCI card because they only received one. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-19 12:28:12', '2019-11-19 12:28:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043531071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491639', 'Kristian Pruitt', NULL, 'Member called in with her Children''s SS#''s I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-19 12:10:53', '2019-11-19 12:10:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043517036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575365', 'Leonard Hunt', NULL, '11-19-19 Leonard is turning 56 very soon and Regina is 54. Choosing Dec. 1st start date. They are currently LHS members and understand it''s too risky to stay with LHS. Also don''t like the religious aspects of LHS. Leonard is healthy. Regina has cervical dystonia for many years. There is no treatment but it''s a tremor disorder so symptoms always. She uses holistic treatments to manage it now. She also has an under active thyroid/Hashimotos. She had a colonoscopy 2 years ago and they removed 2 polyps that were non-cancerous. No tobacco, no meds. Provider Directed and enrolling now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-19 11:45:24', '2019-11-19 11:49:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043509053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037471035', 'Judith Lucas', NULL, 'CC Expiring. Sent notice', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-19 10:38:08', '2019-11-19 10:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043500106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Quentin called in and advised that he was just getting to seeing providers for an accident that he had a while ago.  Falling off a ladder.  I told him that he had $1000 IUA and asked him how much he had already spent.  He has gone over his IUA.  I told him to get in touch with Sedera and gave him the contact #.  He to contact them - PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-19 10:31:49', '2019-11-19 10:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043518008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Mary called today because she wants to have a wellness visit for pap.  I advised her to call the PHCS number on her card to make sure whomever she scheduled with (her old doctor) is in the network.  If not ask to get a referral to a doctor or facility in her area that is.  She said she would do that.  I also cautioned her not to discuss any other medical conditions or symptoms of with the doctor or facility because they will more than likely code the visit as a diagnostics visit and not wellness.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-11-19 10:24:05', '2019-11-19 10:24:05'),
