  ('zcrm_1579374000043535018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001176011', 'Shannon Rahlves', NULL, '11-18-19 Spoke with Shannon to consider move from LHS to MPB Assoc bc LHS is defaulting on one of her bills now for about $900. She had gall bladder removed in Nov 2017 and appendix removed in 2018. They are removed so she believes nothing further can be related to this health issue. I was adamant about the pre-x clause to make sure she''s 100% certain there''s nothing further that can be related. She doesn''t believe so. She''s looking towards a Jan. 1st start date. She will connect with me after Thanksgiving. She is a NV resident, so no need to worry about CA laws!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-18 20:24:10', '2019-11-18 20:25:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043535013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659491', 'Jeffery Nolte', NULL, 'I spoke to Jeffery for quite awhile, went over questions he had after his welcome call,  preventive care..I helped him look up doctors online, sent him a bunch of preventative care emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-18 16:37:04', '2019-11-18 16:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043535008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141445', 'MarySue Bonetti', NULL, 'MarySue called in not knowing if she had called the right place.  She said that she was experiencing symptoms that made her doctor do an ultrasound- which in turn now warrants more tests.  I told her that she needed to speak to Redirect about further testing and appointments, but went over Needs Sharing protocol with her, I sent an email with a link and instructions on what to do with the bills.  She is doing really well on her first Need so far...she presented as cash pay and asked for a discount- they gave her 20% off.  She ALSO knew to ask for the detailed/coded medical bill along with her cash receipt. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-18 15:46:23', '2019-11-18 15:46:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043535003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Mary called to find help in figuring out if her doctor was in network or not, I verified that she was.  I went over preventative care protocol and sent her 3 separate emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-18 14:52:00', '2019-11-18 14:52:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043531021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, '11-18-19 Gary 63 and wife 60 are in excellence health, no pre-x, no tobacco, ski and active. Live in retirement community and paying on $380-$400 now bc gain subsidy. But, subsidies are going away for 2020 in NV apparently. Provider Directed as 2 separate memberships. Wife is German and they spend some time in Germany with her mom, so using internationally is appealing as well. He will share with wife and is excited to move forward. They are probably fine for Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-18 14:26:24', '2019-11-22 13:22:41'),
