  ('zcrm_1579374000043531016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781294', 'Lisa Paxton', NULL, '11-18-19 Lisa is 63, healthy, no pre-x, wants to get her annual physical done soon. She''s paying $100-$150 per paycheck which is about $325 per month and her company is paying $100 of that. She thinks they''d be willing to pay for part of this instead since they are doing that for 2 other employees already. We got interrupted a lot bc she''s at work. So, I''m sending her the audio to listen to on her own time. She knows of the deadlines as well! Her current ins. has high ded of $6K and not sure of mop but network is limited.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-18 13:40:21', '2019-12-05 14:05:48'),
