  ('zcrm_1579374000043531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045005030', 'Scott Tesoro', NULL, '11-18-19 Laurel had a torn meniscus 1 1/2 years ago and had surgery. She wanted to make sure if she blew out her knee if had full recovery on meniscus if that''s pre-x. I told her it would be up to her doctor''s diagnosis if caused from old injury or if new diagnosis. Scott takes Lexipro for depression. Kids are healthy. No meds for rest of family, no tobacco. The own and operate a Crossfit Gym! Rarely go to Dr. Likes to see naturopath for annual wellness, etc. I told her she would have to pay the difference of the negotiated rate. She thinks cost is $150 for 30 min. I explained she might have to pay $75 of the cost of that visit and that''s fine with her. She''s ready to join and doing so tomorrow with me on phone. Matt Holstein is her brother and has talked it up. Really believes is a great option! They are using a non- ACA compliant option now for $750 but not comfortable with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-18 11:43:36', '2019-11-18 11:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043500051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, 'This member to be charged $25 set up fee since her is a re-enrollment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-18 11:07:59', '2019-11-18 11:07:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043500046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, 'I heard back from Dania re:Francis new membership.  Since he has a current need that will continue to be processed under the Select Guidelines.  Any future needs will be processed under Access guidelines.  He also can change to a $500 IUA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-18 11:07:17', '2019-11-18 11:07:17'),
