  ('zcrm_1579374000043335013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823048', 'Mary Marchwinski', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  Mary''s anxiety raised when I went over the pharmacy plan- she said that it was her understanding that meds would get paid for after 3 months of paying for them.....I thoroughly went over medication guidelines with Sedera and then what we offer at MPowering.  At the end I asked if she had any questions...she said no, but now she has all of these things on the list to complete.  I assured her that she can call us anytime for extra support and reassurance. I sent her pretty much all of the info that she will ever need via email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-13 18:26:22', '2019-11-13 18:26:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043338029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '11-13-19 Removed Frances from Joy''s membership bc he''s an independent now. He rejoined DPC/Sedera and Nextera. Chose $500 IUA but might not be allowed since already at $1000 IUA with Sedera. There cost will change from $184 to $177 month. Joy is EO now MPB Group with DPC at $264 plus $99 Nextera and $79 for Frances. They can remain together with Nextera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-13 17:03:46', '2019-11-13 17:03:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043338024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045454012', 'Laura Hanssen', NULL, '11-12-19 Laura is looking to join for Feb 2020. She needs to decide if this will work for her bc of degenerative disc that causes back pain for 30-40 years. Just does occasional PT and chiro but still needs to be comfortable with pre-x clause. She will think hard about it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-13 15:18:25', '2019-11-13 15:18:25'),
