  ('zcrm_1579374000043256083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'I spoke with Julie, she told me that the mammogram was fine and covered.  When asked again, she told me that her mammogram bill wasn''t the issue.  The issue is the radiologist being out of network, she wanted to speak with someone with the authority to "fix this" so I transferred the line to Guy.  Guy told her that she shouldn''t have to pay the bill, that the reading SHOULD be included in the charge.  If the facility is in network (which it is) it is their responsibility to let her know that they send the images out to be read.  He gave her detailed instructions on what she needs to do next. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-12 17:48:59', '2019-11-12 17:48:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043258023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '11-12-19 Francis called to understand his new membership with DPC/Nextera and Sedera. Explained it to him and his mom will make the changes for him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-12 16:56:43', '2019-11-12 16:56:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522128', 'Keira Gannon', NULL, 'all set.  I spoke with her, as well as sent many emails- the member update form for her new baby to be born in 2 weeks.  She was under the impression that there was no network for preventive care, so I explained that as well.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-12 16:52:47', '2019-11-12 16:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043258018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650188', 'Lauren Stanko', NULL, '11-12-19 Family of 4, 30 Lauren, husband 34, son 3 and daughter 9 months. Healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Never goes to Dr. Already members of Cloud Medical.  Really just want catastrophic and deciding on best numbers for family $1000-$2500. Looking towards Jan. 1st start date. Members of LHS now and wanting to switch bc of their current challenges in reimbursing members.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-12 16:25:22', '2019-11-12 16:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508078', 'Charles Edwards', NULL, 'Spoke to member and I advised him of the filling out of the Cancellation and the re-enrollment of his wife.  Sent the cancellation and asked him to submit after 12/1.  He will contact Jeff for this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-12 14:24:03', '2019-11-12 14:24:03'),
