  ('zcrm_1579374000043256068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530062', 'Debra Alier', NULL, 'Debra called in today to cancel herself and ask how to keep her husband on the plan. She got new insurance through her job but her husband still needs to have coverage with us. Patti is going to send her the cancellation form to fill out and then Debra''s husband needs to get with Dennis Watkins to re-enroll. For there to be no gab of coverage for the husband he needs to re-enroll by November 20th.  She fully understands and will fill the form out the second she gets it and will be calling Dennis as well ASAP. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-12 13:42:29', '2019-11-12 13:42:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043258013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608641', 'Monique DiGiorgio', NULL, '11-12-19 Came through Sedera but is actually connected to JC Clark''s client Hayley Kirkman who works with Monique. Tried connecting her with JC but no ans. Answered remainder of her questions and sending her info email about DPC membership and passing back to JC for next steps. Goes to Whole Health DPC in Durango and pays only $55 mo. Monique does like to see chiro but already has DPC, so Redirect no longer makes sense. Has some lower back pain. Wants annual wellness items included. Called her back and clarified it does NOT include pap screening and ACA compliant items except for mammogram and colonoscopy. She understands and will ask DPC where to go for those to get best prices. She is 45.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-12 13:32:51', '2019-11-13 19:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953021', 'Barbara Batt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Member was always one step ahead of me, Wendy did great! Member was thrilled about all of the guidance she has been given thus far by MPowering. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-12 13:23:47', '2019-11-12 13:23:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043264033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212131', 'Dana Kuzma', NULL, 'Member called upset that she called Liberty a month ago. Refunded November and cancelled', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-12 13:23:11', '2019-11-12 13:23:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265152', 'Jared Volkers', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-12 12:57:10', '2019-11-12 12:57:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'Monica called in and wanted to know what to do because her doctor is referring her to get an MRI done on her leg. She asked what card she shows, ect.. I stopped her and let her know that an MRI is not something that is considered preventative and there is no card. It would be something she pays out of pocket up to her IUA of $1000. She did not know what any of that was and what IUA even stood for. I explained everything to her on the difference between Preventative and Diagnostic Injury/Illness. I told her what her IUA is and what that means. I explained how she will present herself as a cash pay patient and ONLY pays out of pocket up to the $1000. Anything after that is when Sedera comes into play and who they are and the exact process that they do. She asked if she needs to have a referral when she goes or if she can just go and have one done. I told her no she does not have to have a referral and there is no network she needs to stay in and it is up to her choice on where she goes. I gave her Sedera''s phone number to give them a call to explain everything she told me to give them a heads up because some MRI''s can be pretty expensive and she might be cutting it close or be more than the $1000. She understood after I explained everything and took down the number. I also told her I would send her an email that explains how she submits her bills over to Sedera. She was happy and will be looking for that and give Sedera a call when she has another moment. Very happy and now not confused member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-12 12:39:56', '2019-11-12 12:39:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'Charge $75 Set up $50 to NAWBO $25 to Academy', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-12 12:08:48', '2019-11-12 12:08:48'),
