  ('zcrm_1579374000043258003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043259001', 'Brittany Cardozo Lease', NULL, '11-12-19 Choosing to stick with Kaiser. Husband was very skeptical of this option and companies involved apparently.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-12 09:17:12', '2019-11-12 09:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041357088', 'Mark Gonzalez', NULL, 'Wife called in and wanted to know how this whole plan works. I let her know that I did not see her under him but he did not have a Welcome Call yet and that is something that he needs to have. I told her that the Welcome Call will give the whole run down of his plan and how it works, what is covered with Preventative and what is not. She was very happy to hear that and really wants to do that with him, I told her I would send the email on file a Welcome Call Scheduler and he can pick out a time and day and one of our wellness coordinators will give him a call at that time and day. She sounded very excited about that and will be looking for that email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-12 08:53:50', '2019-11-12 08:53:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043256003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064015', 'Mary Jo Wood', NULL, 'Mary Jo called in EXTREMELY upset because she has spoken with multiple people and has been being billed incorrectly for MONTHS. She has gotten NOWHERE with anyone she has been put through with and gotten NO call backs from anyone and is just very fed up. She needs an answer and it fixed now! She must have been talking to the Kelly C because I am not aware of this situation at all. Jane apparently is supposed to be getting this fixed because she is the one that started billing wrong. Handed off to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-12 08:47:22', '2019-11-12 08:47:22'),
