  ('zcrm_1579374000043220013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758402', 'Blake Eliasson', NULL, '11-11-19 Tracy is 45, husband 47, son 8. Husband and son healthy. Tracy is overweight, uses CPAP machine at night, has asthma, high blood pressure and knows the pre-x clause. She will consider remaining on Anthem and putting other 2 on HEP. She hates supporting ins now and might switch also but needs to discuss with husband first. Looking at PSDHC or PDHC. Likes HSA capability too. Also likes unlimited dr and chiro visits since sometimes see chiro too. Pays $65 per visit when pays for 5 up front at $65. Take meds lysinopril, inhaler and flucasone. On Anthem Bronze Pathway X for $1150 this year and $1000 in 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-11 17:34:02', '2019-11-11 17:34:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043220008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, '11-11-19 Julie called to inquire about additional bills all related to fybroids she now learned she has all related to same issue that she''s already started a Need for. Also son has a cyst on wrist and went to CU Sports Medicine who referred him to Children''s Hospital where they drained it. She will upload that as a separate Need in account. Gave her Concierge # again if wants a 2nd opinion for fybroids after her appt tomorrow for bleeding ongoing. She was dreading dealing with her 1st incident and all old bills from ER visits bc she then promptly went to Costa Rica for 5 months and came home to tons of unpaid bills bc she gave them the ASi card. Ultimately the process was WAS easier than she expected and all was paid!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-11 16:41:16', '2019-11-11 16:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043215018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906068', 'Sue Lepping', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  Wendy covered everything already! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-11 16:10:13', '2019-11-11 16:10:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043220003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406197', 'Suzanne Muller', NULL, '11-11-19 Almost ready to join but $ is tight and she wants to talk it over with her mom one last time and reconnect on Wed. Turning 50 in a week. $256/$1500 IUA Self Directed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-11 15:38:28', '2019-11-11 15:38:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043215013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, 'Karl called in for some extra reassurance before his preventive care apt tomorrow.  Note- he realizes that the the introduction exam and the followup exam may be out of pocket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-11 15:35:52', '2019-11-11 15:35:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043215008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042343089', 'Carrie Stephens', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Carrie was thrown for a loop when I asked about her understanding on how IUA''s work.  She was told that it would be $1,000 per person ONLY every year for ALL things medical.  I told her how IUA''s actually work- per need.  I apologized that she was in that situation, she told me not to be because it wasn''t my fault.  She asked me to complete the welcome call just in case. I did, she is going to talk this all over with her husband to see if she wants to stay with the program or not. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-11 14:42:31', '2019-11-11 14:42:31'),
