  ('zcrm_1579374000043206003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043000021', 'Joseph DeGain', NULL, 'Completed presentation with client...moving to enroll  Partially Self Directed, Member + Family...$500 IUA.   Prospective to be eff 12/1/2019.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-11-11 09:08:48', '2019-11-11 09:08:48'),
