  ('zcrm_1579374000043198008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508078', 'Charles Edwards', NULL, 'Called and left VM for Mr Edwards re: his aging into Medicare.  Advised him to call me so I could explain the process.  Spoke to Jeff and told him to be in contact with member  and that he would have to enroll spouse in the Access plan for last 6 mos.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-11 08:43:53', '2019-11-11 08:43:53');
