  ('zcrm_1579374000043198003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871102', 'Julie Weck', NULL, 'Member called into to cancel.  I have sent out the cancellation link email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-11 08:29:29', '2019-11-11 08:29:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043155021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043191048', 'William Bradford', NULL, '11-8-19 Enrolled in $1500/$539 PDHC with Redirect for Will and 4 1/2 yr old son. All set and wants to refer his friends to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-08 16:17:45', '2019-11-08 16:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043157008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 11/8. Billing set to start 11/22. Good to go for 12/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-08 15:42:18', '2019-11-08 15:42:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043157003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 11/8. Billing set to start 11/22. Good to go for 12/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-08 15:36:59', '2019-11-08 15:36:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043152012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508078', 'Charles Edwards', NULL, 'Charles Edwards called in to cancel by Jan 1 because he is going on medicare.  He is the primary on the account.  His wife ages out in June, and he would like to know what their new premium will be.  I told him that I would give you all of the info and that Patti would call him sometime after noon (his time) on Monday.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-08 15:31:23', '2019-11-08 15:31:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043155016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043191048', 'William Bradford', NULL, '11-8-19 Thinking of adding his son since cost for both of them will be equal to cost for just son on employer plan! $500+ for 4 year old!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-08 15:28:35', '2019-11-08 15:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043155008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043191144', 'Beverly Tester', NULL, '11-8-19 She''s enrolling now in PDHC at $1000/$350 month. Saving $600 a month! Feels like it''s Christmas. Might join HMA in 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-08 15:22:53', '2019-11-08 15:22:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043155003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043354114', 'Eric Charapata', NULL, '11-8-19 Anna is 37, husband is 41 and daughter 2. Healthy, just minor pre-x like carpel tunnel syndrome. She spoke with New Health which is another Sponsoring entity with Sedera and she asked to speak with another one in hopes of finding a cheaper cost. They quoted her $506 month for the $5000 IUA for their membership. The only way to get the price lower is with SDHC which she likes and will just pay for wellness on her own. Then she can afford the $1500/$559 and wants a Dec. 1st start date. She was fairly well versed in how Sedera works and understand IUA is per incident. She was uneasy about the $5000 IUA. Told her of the $125 Assoc fee and other services included. We have enrollment appt set for Wed. next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-08 13:59:14', '2019-11-08 13:59:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1500 IUA 50-59 DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-08 13:46:55', '2019-11-08 13:46:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, 'Tracking #9289703
Sent by MPowering Benefits Broker on 11/8/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-08 13:45:41', '2019-11-08 13:45:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271017', 'Robert Gerrity', NULL, 'Member requested ID card for Kelli added eff 1/1 thru Denny Watkins.  I ordered new ID cards and told Denny that I was able to send PDF copy of ID if he needed it.  I emailed  him copy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-08 13:38:21', '2019-11-08 13:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-08 13:31:17', '2019-11-08 13:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, 'Patrick emailed me earlier and said he needed to know where to submit his bill for reimbursement from a lab bill. I emailed him back number one asking if this profile is the correct one because this is all that comes up when typing in Patrick Rose which is what the email said. Secondly I asked him the the Detailed Medical Bill with the CPT Codes on is to be able to get it to the right department and figure out why he was billed. Just waiting for a response from him. Once I get all the correct info and bill I will send it over to Leena at ASI and get this started. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-08 13:27:56', '2019-11-08 13:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Margaret called me today and said that her Dr. has ordered her to have a Tomosynthesis type of mammogram due to having dense breasts. I told her that I was told this something that could be possibly covered due to her Dr. ordering it out for her. I know John has mentioned this before and told him that she called and emailed me the Dr''s. order. He told me to forward the email to him so I did. Just waiting to see what will be done. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-08 13:25:16', '2019-11-08 13:25:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384233', 'Gregory Tatham', NULL, 'Greg called in asking where he can submit his bills to get reimbursed for his Colonoscopy. I asked him a few questions as to if the provider was in the PHCS Network, he said yes he made sure, I then asked if his agent explained that to him and that he needs to present his RCI card upon arrival at his appointment. He said yes everything as explained to him and that it was also just his Preventative screening, which I asked as well and it was. I then proceeded to ask why he paid out of pocket then because that is not what he is supposed to do. He said after checking everything that he was supposed to when he got there they said he HAD to pay out of pocket. He is not sure why and so he just did. I told him that is not what is supposed to happen and he should NOT have done that and needed to call RCI or his agent right away when being told this. I told him to get the detailed medical bill with the CPT Codes on it and to send that over to me. Once I get that I will then send it over to Jennifer at RCI to take a look and see why he was asked this and for a reimbursement. I also asked in the test email I sent him to have my email address for the providers name and the facility with the address and phone number so I can look all that up on the PHCS Network site we use to look up providers. I did not want him to think I was doubting him I just wanted to double check to be safe. I am waiting for a reply with the bill and all other info I asked for. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-08 11:26:09', '2019-11-08 11:26:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'Lewis called in and told me that he had gone to a dermatologist who recommended surgery for a skin cancer.  Said it would cost around $3000.  Said so far he paid out $69 for the office visit.  Told him that her had a $1000 IUA and that he would have to pay that before Sedera would share anything.  Told him to save financial receipt and Super Bill.  Told him to contact Sedera now since Elective Surgery was recommended and that he will be going thru 2ndMD program. -PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-08 10:21:48', '2019-11-08 10:21:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, 'I have done the research that I told Kathleen I was going to do for her and sent her all the list''s that she needed. I also explained in detail how the preventative side works with her plan and what to say and how to present herself. I told her to just make sure everything is strictly PREVENTATIVE and to let her providers and the billing dept knows this. TO make sure the bill''s are coded correctly and not as diagnostic. I explained the difference and what would turn the appointments into diagnostic and what her IUA is for out of pocket expenses. I am also sending her the email that fully explains what she says to the front desk upon arrival and to make sure she brings her ASI Card with her to be able to have her coverage checked an verified with the number on the back. She was very happy that I was helping her out with all of this and will be looking out for everything that I am sending her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-08 08:44:04', '2019-11-08 08:44:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530137', 'Sarah Pak', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-08 08:30:30', '2019-11-08 08:30:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529094', 'Dustin Smith', NULL, 'Brianna called in with questions about Maternity says she is due in May of 2020.  I asked if she had been in contact with Sedera and she said that she had been.  I directed her to be in contact with Sedera with any questions about her need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-08 08:26:23', '2019-11-08 08:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Christine called in and said she has had a very bad UTI since 3AM today. She said she has some medication but not she is seeing blood in her urine. Christine was just wondering what the process was and where she has to go. I let her know that this would be considered injury/illness and would be an out of pocket expense up to her IUA of the $500. I also let her know that she can go to any urgent care that is close to her and that there is specific place she HAS to go to, it is up to her digression. She was perfectly fine with everything and just wanted to make sure that she was doing the right thing. I told her to make sure to keep all her receipts and proof of statements just in case this can proceed over her $500 IUA, she will then need to give the proof over to Sedera to help her out after she met her IUA. I explained all that to her and let her know I would send her an email that explains how she submits those bills to Sedera. She thanked me for the explanation and will be looking out for the email for future "Need''s".  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-08 08:04:50', '2019-11-08 08:04:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043129003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001042108', 'Mark Nowak', NULL, 'Member called into update CC.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-08 07:36:09', '2019-11-08 07:36:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, '11-7-19 Rick 100% understands pre-x clause including his cancer! He''s joining PDHC now. I''ve reiterated everything many, many times and he''s willing to take the risks. Enrolling now. He''s 59. I told him the price jumps $200 a month when he hits 60. He knows.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 17:25:58', '2019-11-07 17:33:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, '10-29-19 Rick wants this knowing full well about the pre-x clause and limits on preventative visits beyond ACA compliant items. I recommended he go to Provider Directed solution since wife''s membership is capped and closed and Redirect will give him much greater benefits at a low price of $335/$1500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 17:25:33', '2019-11-07 17:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, '7-8-19 Rick is potentially leaving current job to work for small company w/o benefits and wanted to understand pre-x clause. He has prostate cancer in last 2 years and is in active surveillance for past 18 months. Had knee surgery 10 years ago but within past 2 years has bone on bone and may need knee replacement in next 1-5 years. Also diagnosed with low testosterone within last 1-2 years. No treatment for that. I told him this is NOT a good option for him bc of the pre-x clause and it''s too risky for him in this situation. He appreciated the guidance and is looking at other options. He didn''t sound as convinced that this isn''t an option as he should though. He was hoping to wait out the pre-x clause but again told him I highly discourage him from joining. Not a safe option!  RickWhitcomb@q.com.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 17:25:01', '2019-11-07 17:25:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, '11-7-19 Rick 100% understands pre-x clause including his cancer! He''s joining PDHC now. I''ve reiterated everything many, many times and he''s willing to take the risks. Enrolling now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 17:23:55', '2019-11-07 17:23:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043259001', 'Brittany Cardozo Lease', NULL, '11-7-19 Communicated with Brittany this summer in Aug but they were working on moving. They are officially moving now in a week to Golden. They are a famliy of 5. Brittany 37, Brian? 45, kids 6,4 and 1. Recommended Redirect to give them flexibility in doctors and unlimited PCP for kids. They are generally healthy, no pre-x. Paying $1350 to Kaiser now and told her she can cancel for Dec. 1st if they choose. Were thinking of Jan. 1st. But, I''m reconnecting next Tuesday to move forward. Looking at $1500-$500 IUA range, $801-$905 range.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 17:09:58', '2019-11-07 17:09:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '11-7-19 Kelly Millard actually recommended Sandra but she is member through her employer and not showing in our CRM as a member. Sandra is enrolling now for DPC option for her family.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 15:24:29', '2019-11-07 15:24:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043110013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257367', 'Marta Heston', NULL, 'Carl Nicholas called to cancel himself, Marta, and their child.  I spent 10 min on the phone with him trying to find any sort of an account.  Finally he gave me Marta''s phone number and it popped up.  He wanted to make sure that even though they were leaving that Sedera would still be responsible for his hospital bill for a hernia.  But when I found this account, he back tracked and asked if I could just send his wife a cancellation form.  He spoke about Cigna not paying for it, so he didn''t know what to do.  I gave him Sedera''s phone number and sent the cancellation link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-07 15:15:10', '2019-11-07 15:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043110008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, 'called in stating that she never heard back from Kelly- that she was waiting on an email.  I tried to get a hold of Kelly at home office but couldn''t get a hold of Patti or Ali so I could pass the info along.  I found an email that Kelly had just sent and guided Kathleen to it.  She was very understanding and will just wait to hear back from Kelly tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-07 14:47:40', '2019-11-07 14:47:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043110003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'called in having trouble registering his QR Life Code. I sent John a Slack message about this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-07 14:24:58', '2019-11-07 14:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043085013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331041', 'Karen Tips', NULL, 'Payment was finally processed on 11/7. Charged her $50 late fee+ November. Will be the last time late', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-07 13:32:28', '2019-11-07 13:32:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043071028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674403', 'Elaine Moyer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with all vendors.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-07 13:01:24', '2019-11-07 13:01:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043071023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674403', 'Elaine Moyer', NULL, 'Member called and left VM asking about cancellation, she to go on Medicare I will send link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-07 12:38:27', '2019-11-07 12:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165330', 'David Fenerty', NULL, '11-7-19 Thank you for enrolling!!

HOWEVER, YOUR PAYMENT INFORMATION WAS NOT ACCEPTED BY THE INSURANCE COMPANY. Please allow 48 hours for your insurance company to receive your ENROLLMENT information. You will need to contact your insurance company within 7 to 10 days to make your initial payment TO BEGIN YOUR COVERAGE and to set up ongoing payments. Please save your enrollment id: 254488790

If you want contact your carrier(Kaiser Permanente Colorado)for further assistance, please call: (844) 524-7370. Please allow at least 24 hours before calling.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 10:51:38', '2019-11-07 10:51:38'),
