  ('zcrm_1579374000042958003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called in for help finding a mammogram facility in network.  I helped pull a list for her because she didn''t have a preference.  I told her that she would just need to make sure that her doctor was in network, to which she told me she was, and that the facility was as well.   She asked if she could have a list of dermatologists because her husband has a basal cell on his nose he needs to have taken off.  I told her that she may go to whomever she likes, but to use healthgrades.com as a good starting point.  I told her how to handle a visit like that - present as cash pay/ask for discount/grab detailed receipt.  I told her that I would send her important emails based on everything that we had gone over and to call me with any questions.  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-05 09:02:50', '2019-11-05 09:02:50'),
