Tuesday November 5th
Mary T Wirth Tue Nov 05 6:03 AM

Hi when I need to go to a walk in clinic ie for sinus infection what card do I use to get the membership discount on the bill? I used the ASI card in a prior situation that was not preventative and the bill was discounted and I paid it. This last situation ASI sent a letter indicating SEDERA needs to be contacted. All I want is a discount I know I am responsible for the bill
You Tue Nov 05 8:57 AM

Good morning Mary!  For any injury/illness you are to present yourself as a cash-pay patient, and ask for a cash discount.  Please remember to ask for a detailed medical receipt along with the cash receipt.  You are responsible for the cost of treating your medical need up to your chosen $1,000 Initial unshared amount.  
Mary T Wirth Tue Nov 05 9:04 AM

Thank you I had confusion over the ability to access the PCHS network for discounts on situations like this as my providers participate in that network Thank you for clarification
You Tue Nov 05 9:09 AM

Oh you are very welcome Mary!  Please give our Concierge line a call at 1-800-519-2969 if you have any further questions!  I am going to send you a few emails- one of which you can fill out if the doctor scripts you out some medication.', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-05 07:15:13', '2019-11-05 07:15:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042929003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006263049', 'Peter Sarata', NULL, 'Peter called to update his payment info because his old cc is lost. sent him the form and explained how to fill it out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-05 07:11:01', '2019-11-05 07:11:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042887049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '11-4-19 Sandra is a member of Appleton Clinic in GJ. Anthem costs $2K+! They are healthy, no tobacco. Daughter Ellie, 21 has excema and asthma. Takes Advair and some topical ointment for skin. Daughter goes to LSU in Baton Rouge. Sandra is 56 and husband is 52. Husband has high blood pressure. Told her of new pre-x clause not excluding high blood pressure. But, knows it excludes it now so wants to join before it''s changed bc it might be grandfathered for small period of time but nothing is decided with guidelines yet. Knows it may change very soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-04 20:13:27', '2019-11-04 20:13:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042887036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045454012', 'Laura Hanssen', NULL, '11-4-19 Laura is super interested in this option. She had a rare and unique year with 3 surgeries but they are all one and done. Shouldn''t have any more problems hopefully. She''s getting her gall bladder taken out this week. Had a deviated septum and broken nose. Had hip surgery done arthoscopically at Steadman clinic.  Husband is super healthy and no real issue other than they both use nasal spray called fluticosone. Cost is going up to  $1100-$1200 for them each I think. Now $850 and $700 each. Husband wants to work PT for City of Glenwood and won''t have ins. Also wants to ski patrol and won''t get insurance. If they divorce he will pay only $100 for his ins because income low. They were considering doing that simply for ins purposes since it''s so crazy expensive in Carbondale. They are athletes and ski, hike, etc. She wants to talk with Callie more since she said her son broke an elbow and it went super smoothly. She going to go over it all with her husband. She wants to get through her surgery before she reaches out to me again. Looking at 1/1/2020 start date. Provider Directed with Redirect best and will have them split membership since she''s 54 and he''s 59 turning 60 in June, 2020. Best to have separate for cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-04 18:06:31', '2020-01-06 14:11:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042894036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659491', 'Jeffery Nolte', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  He really knew the plan well before we spoke.  He knows that if he has any questions whatsoever that he can call to get direction. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-04 17:50:12', '2019-11-04 17:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042894031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283187', 'Joan Wood', NULL, 'Joan called back to apologize for being a bit rude.  She said that she was just a bit overwhelmed and had just hit her head before calling me.  I told her that wasn''t necessary, but very thoughtful.  She said that she had just checked with her doctor''s office and they too confirmed that Rose sx cntr is in network, so I told her to speak to a manager or someone in billing to give Jennifer Chasteen a call tomorrow to verify benefits.  She was thankful for the help. I told her to feel better! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-04 16:39:00', '2019-11-04 16:39:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042894023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Sara called in because her knee is in a lot of pain, she wanted to go over what to expect and do.  I gave her Sedera''s number, told her to present herself as cash pay, if and when she gets the doctors orders for an MRI- to call Sedera and give them the CPT code so that they could find a fair price on the imaging.  I sent her an email with a link and instructions on opening up a need with Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-04 14:54:44', '2019-11-04 14:54:44'),
