  ('zcrm_1579374000042879054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, 'I followed up with ASi re: Cobra Letter.  They stated that a recent change of address generated this to be sent out to them.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-04 14:09:55', '2019-11-04 14:09:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042894013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004737105', 'Patricia F. Brunner', NULL, 'she called in stating that she has a colonoscopy scheduled on Wednesday and that she needed someone to call the office so that the billing doesn''t get messed up.  I told her that I could help her with that.  I asked if she had already looked to see if the doctor was in network, she told me that no, she didn''t even know there was a network.  I told her that I would do a search now for her....she became pretty agitated by the process by complaining that no one had ever shown her how or where to look up for doctor''s in network.  I ended up finding the doctor. Told her that he was in network.  I also told her that John had sent a link and instructions on a provider search at the end of Aug.  She then got upset and started saying that this was why she was thinking of dropping this plan- she doesn''t want to have to read emails or go through hoops.  I asked her to hold- and transferred the line to John. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-04 13:47:05', '2019-11-04 13:47:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042894008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716875', 'Cynthia Hunt', NULL, 'she called because Direct Labs was suggested to her via Kelly F, but she thought that all she needed to pay was the fee to them.  Now she is getting a bill of $400 from Quest and she thought that we would be able to fix this.   I tried to explain that she would need to call Direct Labs, she asked for their number and I looked it up for her.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-04 13:08:00', '2019-11-04 13:08:00'),
