  ('zcrm_1579374000042887021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933004', 'James Pendleton', NULL, '11-4-19 Jim just enrolled in Provider Directed $1000/$530 and he''s all set to go. Reviewed Redirect portion with him. Also discussed challenges of LHS vs Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-04 12:23:42', '2019-11-04 12:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042879034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James was transfered to me by Kelly C.  He wanted to speak to someone else other than Sunny about the transition to automatic payment.  This member calles in a pmt every month, I explained to him that we needed to get everyone on auto pmt..  I advised him that I would send him out the Payment update form and that he needed to get that to me by 11/20 to get pmt set up.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-04 12:15:18', '2019-11-04 12:15:18'),
