  ('zcrm_1579374000042887003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043191048', 'William Bradford', NULL, '11-4-19 Referred by Jay and Megan Wright. Also know Lindsay and Judd Rogers are happy with their membership as well!  Will, 41, super healthy, no pre-x except toe fungus med at the moment. No tobacco, no other meds. Employer plan ending Nov. 15th and wants to start Dec. 1st. Meeting again Friday to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-04 10:37:47', '2019-11-08 15:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042879006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116123', 'Ronald Levis', NULL, 'Bonnie left me a VM because she was unsure where to call or since spouse Ron had some lab work that she was sure was going to be more than $500.  I directed her to contact Sedera and that they would step her through the process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-04 10:31:02', '2019-11-04 10:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042877003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005171', 'Steve Lass', NULL, 'November refunded', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-11-04 09:08:43', '2019-11-04 09:08:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042853021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031904135', 'Rene Perdue', NULL, 'Rene called in and told me that her husband was aging out and would be going on Medicare eff 1/1/2020.  She asked me the new pricing.  I will send her the link to the Member Change form.  I asked her not to submit until after 12/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-04 09:06:07', '2019-11-04 09:06:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042853016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593093', 'Teresa Nash', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Apex &amp; Sedera &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-04 08:55:23', '2019-11-04 08:55:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042853008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002037017', 'Daryl Dietrich', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation for HES.eff 11/1/19.  I will cancel subscription', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-04 08:49:16', '2019-11-04 08:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042853003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005171', 'Steve Lass', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel ASI &amp; Sedera &amp; have Sunny refund Nov pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-04 08:29:51', '2019-11-04 08:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042828013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Chaz called to complain about the fact that he had an annual physical right before he cancelled his plan and that it wasn''t being covered by ASI because the doctor wrote down diagnostic coding stating that they had talked about allergies.  I asked him for the date of service, and the name of the doctor so that I could reach out to ASI to ask for an explanation.  Then he said he had just spoken to them and they told him that it was a no go because the doctor wrote down diagnostic codes.  I explained to him that he had a preventive care only plan and that the only way that they would process the claim is if the notes were strictly preventive.  He tried to turn it around and say that an annual visit is about "his body" and that it''s "stupid that one little thing" was keeping his bill from getting from getting paid.  I told him that the only thing that he could try would be to contact the doctors office and ask that it be coded as preventive- I told him that if it was something passing in their conversation and NOT such a big deal as the doctors notes were saying that he may have a chance with that.  He told me that they wouldn''t- and that he would just pay the bill before it goes to collections.  to which I replied "or....you could call your doctors office" he started stating why all of this was reminding him of why he cancelled- I told him that there is a bit of leg work involved, and the program isn''t for everyone.  He said that we never told him that annual''s were preventive care only insurances.  But he has opened a few emails that shows he was told.  He at least was nice when ending the call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-01 17:01:47', '2019-11-01 17:01:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042800020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857240', 'Eric Wade Erickson', NULL, '11-1-19 Enrolled in PDHC for Wade who''s 63 and chose $1500 IUA. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-01 16:27:22', '2019-11-01 16:27:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042828008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041185005', 'James Roberts', NULL, 'called in to go over what his steps should be about his hip bothering him and possibly seeing a doctor.  I went over protocol as well as sent appropriate email. I gave him Sedera''s number as well if the doctor wants to do any imaging other than xray- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-01 15:21:12', '2019-11-01 15:21:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042828003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  He knows the plan very well and will call us to fill in any further questions once he receives everything from the vendors. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-01 15:11:42', '2019-11-01 15:11:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042800015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644161', 'Holly Hooker', NULL, '11-1-19 Holly and family used to be Jolie Curneen''s client who came via Kristen Judd. They show as only members of LHS for 1 month. They now came to me via Mara Simoneau. They''ve been with Kaiser ever since and paying $1200 a mon through husband''s employer. They have a family of 7 all U18! They are healthy, no meds, no tobacco. Occasional Urgent Care visits and routine wellness visits. Recommending PDHC with Redirect for ease of use and small needs to be handled easily. May want Dec. 1st start date. Go to Chiro now and thinks they pay $100 per visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-01 14:00:43', '2019-11-01 14:00:43'),
