  ('zcrm_1579374000042800005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857185', 'Molly Palmer', NULL, '11/1/19 Molly just enrolled in PSDHC for Dec. 1st $1500/$269. Super appreciative and said this was way easier than expected. She was fearing what to do otherwise.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-01 09:53:34', '2019-11-01 09:53:34'),
