  ('zcrm_1579374000042747008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, '10-31-19 I spoke with Michelle at Humana who located your account. There is no SS# attached to it BTW, which is probably why they couldn''t locate you with the SS#. They sent you cards on 8/28/19 to Stewart address in Lyons. They are re-sending your card to the new PO Box in Lyons, CO. It will take 7-10 biz days. It will come in a very plain, white envelope that looks like junk mail from Humana. Your member ID is 0000025715414 for the Preventative Plus membership which is Preventative services ONLY. The member # is 855-680-6891. The providers can call a separate # at 855-680-6890 for your Individual Policy Comprehensive Preventative Benefit.  That should be everything you need to start using this.

Thanks!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-31 11:58:26', '2019-10-31 11:58:26'),
