  ('zcrm_1579374000042693124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474326', 'Timothy Dulany', NULL, 'Tim called in again and both Kelly F and I went over all the same information with him as was covered on previous note of 10/8.  Bottom line member does not want to spend the money on a Dr''s referral and just wants to go out and get MRI.  He was concerned that he wouldn''t get the "right" provider and would be balance billed.  I explained needs processing and that Sedera does not pay any providers directly.  Also asked if he could use Teledoc for this referral.  I sad no that they are just for minor illnesses.   Hopefully member will contact provider to start process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-31 11:40:47', '2019-10-31 11:40:47'),
