  ('zcrm_1579374000042717033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'Louise called into me today and was asking about bills she is now getting from her husbands blood work at Quest. She said they paid $200 of it but that is it. I told her that if they only paid for a portion of it then that means the other portion is non preventative and is diagnostic. She told me that is not true and everything is preventative. She said she MADE sure she told the provider and told Quest several times that everything HAS to be Preventive and they all said it is don''t worry. And here we are with her getting bills. I told her that what I can do is have her or her husband send me the bill''s they are getting and I will send them over to Leena at ASI. I let her know that I will CC her in all the emails so she can stay in the loop with what is going on. She was very happy for the help and will get those bills to me asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-31 08:41:09', '2019-10-31 08:41:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042717028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167692', 'Andrew (Andy) Ioele', NULL, 'Andrew called into me again and was happy to hear that it was me helping him out again. Everything that I helped him out with before was incredible and really made him feel a LOT better about this plan and just Multi-Cost Sharing in general. So he needed some help finding a Gastroenterologist in his area. Well him first question if who and does he need to be in network to have someone look at his eye for some sort of lesion or pain. I explained to him how this would be something considered injury/illness and not preventative. So this is when his IUA of $1000 comes into play, out of pocket. He fully understood and said that''s exactly what he thought was going to happen, he just wanted to call into me and make sure he was correct. I told him he is and to make sure to keep and "eye" *wink *wink, get it "Eye" because he is having an issue with his eye, haha, He thought it was hilarious. Anyway just to make sure he keeps all bills and receipts from any of the visits and make sure to get in contact with Sedera when he is close to the IUA and they will help guide him the rest of the way. He knew exactly what to do, was just double checking. Very MPowered Member :) -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-31 08:30:48', '2019-10-31 08:30:48'),
