  ('zcrm_1579374000042734003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042738053', 'Clint Williamson', NULL, 'Presented Provider(Redirect) plan for family 2 + 2 children, $1500 IUA,,,quoted them and they stated that they will enroll for 12/1/19 start date.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-10-30 18:46:15', '2019-10-30 18:46:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042728013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002834005', 'Anthony Moreno', NULL, 'called to ask about steps on getting a flu shot that is covered by his plan.  I looked up the Hy-vee grocerry to see if it was in network, and it was not.  I then suggested that he go to his local Walgreens clinic because there were 9 in his area that were showing as in network. He asked me how he could do a search on his own as well as how to present his APEX card.  I explained as well as sent him all corresponding emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-30 17:29:23', '2019-10-30 17:29:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042728008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529333', 'Joseph Hartzell', NULL, 'Joseph and Shanna called to understand how their son''s medical need will be shared.  He went to the ER and wracked up a $7000 bill.  Joseph did not wanted to be transferred to Sedera for help with his Sedera app password but he told me that he requested help off of their site.  I went through the needs process and sent them detailed instructions as well as Sedera''s phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-30 16:30:28', '2019-10-30 16:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042729013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '10-30-19 Andy got a letter stating his rights with Cobra which he will forward to me since I''m not familiar with the letter that was sent by ASi. It arrived via mail just recently.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-30 16:19:49', '2019-10-30 16:19:49'),
