  ('zcrm_1579374000042728003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, 'Jeff Parker just wanted to let Kelly F know that he had looked into why his bills were not being paid and the provider told him that they had used his old insurance which is blue cross blue shield.  And that they would resubmit to the appropriate TPA.  I let Kelly F know that he says that for now no further work on this case needs to be done on her part. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-30 14:12:00', '2019-10-30 14:12:00'),
