  ('zcrm_1579374000042717023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716025', 'Richard O''Krepki', NULL, 'Richard had someone that was working at the front desk of a Dermatologist''s office, call in and ask on how payment works with that. I told her that anything that is diagnostic he pays out of pocket up to his IUA of $1500. 
Nothing more than that. He needs to get in touch with Sedera when he is close to that amount or he has met that. NOTHING more. I explained to her who Sedera is and what they do. I told her to have him call Sedera now because he is having some sort of "Surgery". Something small that is being cut out and sewn back up. So I made it clear that he needs to talk to them NOW! There are a few things that he needs to so with Sedera before he can do anything with wherever he was right now. She was very nice and took down Sedera''s phone number. I am sure to be hearing from him about this at some point soon. For now he is given the info he needs right now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-30 13:46:30', '2019-10-30 13:46:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042711028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-30 13:13:10', '2019-10-30 13:13:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042711023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535076', 'Todd Lary', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request for an 12/1 start date.  I will process and sunny has cancelled pmts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-30 13:04:33', '2019-10-30 13:04:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042711018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000919273', 'Laura Kupperman', NULL, 'Spouse Robert Stewart called in and call was missed.  I returned call and got VM.  I told hi to call me if they had any questions but they had cancelled our services eff 6/18', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-30 10:38:33', '2019-10-30 10:38:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042711013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207073', 'Sara Nolan', NULL, 'We received note below from Sarah (spouse) after a couple of attempts to collect Monthly Share Amount.  I have directed Sunny to send her the link to fill out the cancellation request, however I will cancel her at this time and attach when we receive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-30 10:18:35', '2019-10-30 10:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042717003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028501138', 'James Munro', NULL, 'Sara called in and was a little concerned with her annual physical that she just had not too long ago. She got an EOB in the mail and was confused why because the Preventative Annual Physical is something that is covered as long as all the right steps were taken to make sure it was only preventative. She checked with and made sure the provider IS in network, she gave the provider''s front desk the correct RCI card upon her arrival, and make did not talk or bring up anything that would make the visit diagnostic. I told her to send me the bill and I will take a look and get it over to someone, most likely Jennifer Chasteen, at RCI and they will look into it. As I was saying that she stopped me and said she thinks she was just reading it wrong because she saw a section that said Patient Responsibility $0.00. I told her to still send the EOB into me just in case and I will get it taken care of and get her an answer either today if everything is ok and she is NOT being billed. If there is some sort of issue it can take a few days to get it processed. She was perfectly fine with everything that I explained to her. Very nice and she is very patient. Will keep her cc''d in all the emails between me and Jennifer so she can stay in the loop and we don''t have to keep calling back and forth all over the place. Will update notes along the way of communication. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-30 10:03:33', '2019-10-30 10:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042693027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member was not able to be in front of computer at the time of welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-30 09:21:17', '2019-10-30 09:21:17'),
