  ('zcrm_1579374000042693003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141041', 'Dan Nguyen', NULL, 'November payment refunded 10/30.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-30 07:57:49', '2019-10-30 07:57:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042672008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori wanted to speak with John because "Sedera just isn''t paying"  she said that they are being fussy about the type of bills she is submitting and when she "does all of the work" they are not processing fast enough.  She said that she has been just "dumping" bills on them and seeing no return, she and her husband just went into debt with another credit card, and that  she is going to need another epidural and all of this stress is compounding and making it harder for her to heal.  I told her that it was after hours but that I would give this note to John. I asked if she wanted me to also contact Sedera about this and she said no, that she wanted John to process this complaint himself.  I told her that I was sorry that she was so stressed out.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-29 15:55:45', '2019-10-29 15:55:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042672003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Hillary called in demanding that I find her specific doctor''s lists off of the bat,  she talked over me the entire time- I had to keep asking nicely if she could slow down or to spell a name again.  When I couldn''t find the doctors she wanted she asked me to get her a list of a 10 and 20 mile Internal Medicine doctor radius.  She then wanted me to send her a link- when I explained it would be PDF she said nothing.  Very rude, she told me that the list KF sent her was only for general practitioners and she ONLY goes to an Internist for her annuals. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-29 15:31:01', '2019-10-29 15:31:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042644036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, '10-29-19 See notes in Karyn Whitcomb''s file.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-29 13:27:35', '2019-10-29 13:27:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042644031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, '10-29-19 Rick wants this knowing full well about the pre-x clause and limits on preventative visits beyond ACA compliant items. I recommended he go to Provider Directed solution since wife''s membership is capped and closed and Redirect will give him much greater benefits at a low price of $335/$1500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-29 13:26:40', '2019-10-29 13:26:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042644026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '10-29-19 Nelson called bc he''s having stomach pain and his family has history of pancreatic cancer. His sister is in medical field and can get him to be part of a study in NY for this type of issue. Much of the cost will be paid for by the study if he''s accepted. But, first needs to determine cause of the pain. John Kach wasn''t answering so I gave him Sedera''s direct phone line to proceed with process to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-29 13:08:14', '2019-10-29 13:08:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042644018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696258', 'Joanne Mielnick', NULL, '10-29-19 Completing enrollment right now with her on phone. She chose $578/$500 IUA Redirect. All set and appreciative of my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-29 12:39:43', '2019-10-29 12:56:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042644013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857185', 'Molly Palmer', NULL, '10-29-19 Molly is 30 and healthy, no pre-x, no meds. Forgot to ask about tobacco. Work is PT and no ins. now. Also income fluctuates often to not super comfortable with C4 since may have to pay money back. Never goes to dr. Often uses Planned Parenthood for wellness visit and is willing to drive to places to do annual wellness visit since nobody close by.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-29 12:30:35', '2019-10-29 12:30:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042614187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, 'Belinda called in and said that she received a bill from Quest for her husbands blood work that didn''t have any Ins Info on it.  The blood was drawn in doc''s office.  I advised that it sounded like provider didn''t send ins info over the Quest that she would have to get w/doc and correct or give that info to Quest directly.  I also made sure that she know that this had to be coded as Preventative.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-29 12:24:17', '2019-10-29 12:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042644008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509132', 'Brandi Webber', NULL, '10-29-19 Left vm for her to update her payment information. It''s past due.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-29 10:56:29', '2019-10-29 10:56:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042644003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '10-28-19 Sally discovered she and Pete are covered through her employer through the end of the month and her employer is paying the whole thing! She wants a 1/1/20 start date. She will go over it all with Pete and let me know when they are ready to enroll. Will take care of this in the next week or so. Looking at Redirect $1500/$970 ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-29 10:47:34', '2019-10-29 10:47:34'),
