  ('zcrm_1579374000042616003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207073', 'Sara Nolan', NULL, 'November declined.1st notice 10/28
2nd notice - 10/29
UPDATE: Cancelling

From: Sara Nolan <saranolan55@gmail.com>
To: "Sunny Terziyska"<sunny@myahe.org>
Date: Tue, 29 Oct 2019 14:16:35 -0400
Subject: Re: Payment Declined for MPowering Benefits Health Plan - 2nd Notice
============ Forwarded message ============

    Hi Sunny - i cannot pay this i guess. I''m flat broke - this month i paid over 1000 for a broken bone.  It did me in.  and unfortunately its a couple dollars short of the 1500 min spend so i''m getting no help with it.  If you have to cancel my membership then i guess i cannot do anything to stop it.  My apologies.  I''m completely embarrassed and am seeking a third job to help pay some bills.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-28 07:43:14', '2019-10-30 07:59:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042614003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'Jacqueline called and needed to have her birth date updated in the RCI system. it was correct here on the CRM, but in RCI''s system was incorrect. Patti spoke with member and put the correct birth date in the system. Patti let her know that this could take a few business days to take affect. Member was fine with that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-28 07:22:53', '2019-10-28 07:22:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042609003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042610028', 'Allen Harmon', NULL, 'Allen Harmon has completed 2 of 3 steps to be MPB Advisor....needs to complete MPowering Benefits test...prospective Advisor has Sedera Certification already....Emailed him and waiting for MPowering Test Completion and time for final training setup.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-10-27 20:14:17', '2019-10-27 20:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042595003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '10-25-19 Robin just wanted to make sure she was doing the right thing when brings son to Doctor today and she goes in on Monday. She paid the cash price for visit of $100 and will pay the rest when gets bill assuming it''s less than $1000 which it will be. She''s going back to Dr. on Monday for follow up testing from pap and will pay that as well and track until exceeds $1000 if that happens. She''s on track. She tried calling Concierge line today and it didn''t work for her. I just tried calling now and reached Kelly C no problem. Called Robin back to verify the #. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-25 16:02:44', '2019-10-25 16:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Member called in to ask how to update her Payment information.  I sent her the link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-25 13:30:05', '2019-10-25 13:30:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042594008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535076', 'Todd Lary', NULL, 'I called Todd today, it appears he called Sedera to question why he can''t stay on this current plan. I call me yesterday, she was contacted by Sedera asking us to field the question and answer him.  I call Todd and explained again that MPB over the age of 65 he has aged out of the MEC (ASi).  I did tell him that Sedera would allow his to stay on the plan but MPB will not.  I offered him (2) options.  He can enroll in the Self-Directed plan (no MEC/Access plan), or he can stay on with Sedera (w/no MEC) but he must Medicare as his primary health (Part A&B) coverage and Sedera would be secondary to Medicare.  He is staying with Medicare and his wife Diane and (2) children will enroll into the PSC plan', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-10-25 12:57:04', '2019-10-25 12:57:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042594003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535076', 'Todd Lary', NULL, 'I called Diane to discuss which new plan on the Access platform she was going to select.  She is moving forward with the PSD (Association ) plan.  I took the time and took her to my click funnel and the MPB.org site to provide her some additional education about how our plans work and the various components of the coverage.  She was a little weak on the MCS terminology and I thought it best to re-educate her before I enrolled her.    Unfortunately, when I went to enroll her I discovered my click funnel enrollment platform was not properly connected and I could not enroll her.  I ask John and he instructed me to contact Madison which I did.  She said she would fix it sometime today.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-10-25 12:49:13', '2019-10-25 12:49:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030962071', 'Jason Salisbury', NULL, 'Tracking #9230535
Sent by MPowering Benefits Broker on 10/25/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-25 11:37:59', '2019-10-25 11:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030962071', 'Jason Salisbury', NULL, 'Was notified thru Cognito that this employee termed eff 11/1 I will cancel in Redirect &amp; Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-25 11:37:45', '2019-10-25 11:37:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497204', 'Charles Strother', NULL, 'Received a email from this member wanting to know why the Seders Published rate is $564 and he is paying $703.  I contacted him and left him a VM and explained to him what the price difference was and to contact me with any further questions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-25 09:09:23', '2019-10-25 09:09:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141445', 'MarySue Bonetti', NULL, 'I spoke with Elizabeth to ask if we would retain this spouse on the plan while any final Medical bills were cleared up.  She said that they would just make a note in the system and that we could reduced members Monthly Share amount. I have asked Wendy to reach out to Mary Sue to get a sense if there would be any Medical bills that are pending..  Will advise Sedera when I hear.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-25 08:57:17', '2019-10-25 08:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141445', 'MarySue Bonetti', NULL, 'Tracking #9229290
Sent by MPowering Benefits Broker on 10/25/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-25 08:53:39', '2019-10-25 08:53:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042556017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042588004', 'Akhtar Gudaro', NULL, 'Met contact at Miami Realtor Meeting 10-24-2019....Interested in individual health plan, also interested in being MPB advisor...Works with United Realty Group...Has spoke with managing broker of United Realty Group office - would like us to do presentation to realtors at local office ....need to set up presentation at local office....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-10-25 08:42:29', '2019-10-25 08:42:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630165', 'David Macaione', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I had spoken to him previously and he asked if he had been cancelled because he had cancelled w/ Jane.  I told him that we had not received that and that he had been charged.  To which he replied that we3 probably would not get it as he had his wallet stolen a few days previously.  He submited cancellation request I will cancel all Vendors and refund pmt if we receive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-25 07:26:56', '2019-10-25 07:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042550020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! Member only IUA $1500 - called in completely confused, I told him that''s why he needed a welcome call, and asked if he had time to do this and he said yes!  I answered a question he had about his knee bothering him-sent him instructions on how to submit a need and guided him to the Sedera app.  He thanked me for taking on the welcome call without any notice.  Nice guy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-24 19:02:28', '2019-10-24 19:02:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042560031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857240', 'Eric Wade Erickson', NULL, 'One of them is Medicare age and the other is interested in this solution. I think Crystal is 65+ and Wade younger. Look back at notes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-24 16:52:27', '2019-10-24 16:52:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042550015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, 'called asking for Redirects number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-24 16:23:12', '2019-10-24 16:23:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042550010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, 'letter of invitation for an overview of the plan with Guy sent. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-24 15:36:18', '2019-10-24 15:36:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042560018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '10-24-19 Explained Provider Directed solution and DPC. Likes PDHC best bc they go to Taos a lot of time and it will be easier to use when not in Boulder.  It''s also a little more affordable than DPC with Nextera. They are paying only $400 now including dental and vision as well. Pete can stay on her plan ''til end of Nov. Then join this for Dec. 1st start. She can join in Jan. if need be. She''s healthy and just does all of her well checks for medical, dental and vision. Pete has high blood pressure and cholesterol and takes a low dose combo med for that. They want to make a decision asap to get it off their plate. May call me tomorrow. Discussed $1500 / $907 Redirect and keep membership together as one.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-24 15:36:10', '2019-10-24 15:36:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042550005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029894103', 'Deborah Doolittle', NULL, 'Second Welcome Call Complete!  She called in dazed and confused and I realized that she had no idea how to use her plan since switching to Redirect.  She said that she didn''t understand anything that was said during her first welcome call and that time wasn''t spent hand holding a bit more like she needed.  So I asked if she wanted a welcome call, and she said yes!  She couldn''t find anything from Redirect (digital id cards)  and also says she doesn''t think she''s signed up for the 24alife program.  I will reach out to appropriate parties. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-24 15:35:12', '2019-10-24 15:35:12');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000042560013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696196', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, '10-24-19 Danny is 30 and healthy, just has acid reflux and takes OTC Prilosec to manage it. David Berg is a mentor or contact of some kind and referred Sedera to Danny. Once Danny understood what Redirect does, he really likes the concept and was happy to pay the slightly higher monthly fee for all of the additional services included. He will happily tell David that he''s joining Redirect and Sedera. He''s paying $295 now for catastrophic coverage that isn''t good. He will cancel his plan for a Dec. 1st start date with our Provider Directed solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-24 14:33:45', '2019-10-24 14:33:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042573003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, 'Ryan called in and needed help with finding a provider in network for his wife to get a mammogram. I told him I would be more than happy to find that out for him. He also said this would be their first time using anything preventative yet. I explained how it all works and what his wife, and him for future preventative services he might be needing, needs to do when it comes to making the appointment and so on. I told him he will call into here or he can do it himself at home with the website instructions I will email him. He first needs to make sure he finds a provider in the PHCS Network. Once he finds a provider he will than call and make an appointment and I stressed to him to make sure he stresses to the providers that the appointment NEEDS to be strictly Preventative and that the billing needs to be Coded as Preventative as well. That is most of the time the issues are when members get billed, but it can be an easy fix. After making the appointment I said they need to make sure they have their ASI Card. That is one of the most important parts of all of this. ASI''s phone number is on the back of the card and whomever is at the front desk of the appointment would call their number to verify benefits and their eligibility. I told him I would be sending him a list of providers that I have found via email as a PDF copy and I will also send a couple other emails that helps explain all of this better so he does not have to sit there on the phone and try and remember everything I just told him. He was very happy that I took the time to sit here and actually explain everything. He also is looking forward to the email''s I will be sending him and him and his wife will sit down and take a look at everything so they are all on the same page. Ryan also needed to get another copy of his ASI card''s because he lost his. I told him I will email someone over at the ID Dept for ASI and get a PDF copy sent to him and a hard copy will be sent out to him as well in about 7-10 business days. He was fine with that and thanked me very much for taking the effort and time to speak with him today. Emails and provider list sent! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-24 13:09:25', '2019-10-24 13:09:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042560008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152191', 'Gulrukh Rizvi', NULL, '10-24-19 Hi Wendy, 

I was wondering if you could introduce me to the local Sedera rep so there is a  link and phone # to give to interested patients, as well as a web link for online enrollment for individuals. When they are doing Sedera enrollment, there will be a drop-down to choose my DPC practice. 

Donna Givens, MD is working with Sedera and I was having the same set up for my practice. Let me know!
 
~gulrukh

-Gulrukh Rizvi, M.D.
(541) 972-3627
www.docrizvi.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-24 12:07:23', '2019-10-24 12:07:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042556012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032104090', 'Chelsey-Rae Williams', NULL, 'Sent a cancellation form.


