  ('zcrm_1579374000042423008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672389', 'Scott Schemel', NULL, 'Scott called in very confused stating that he had been arguing with RCI to pay for his sons ER visit- now he has an incredibly large amount of bills coming in- he paid the ER $900 and he has a $500 IUA.  I went over everything with him, and could''ve gone over much more, I told him that I was going to send him a Welcome call scheduler and that would give us time to go over the entire program in better detail.  He then apologized for not taking the time to do one sooner.  I sent him appropriate emails and then transferred the line to Thomas @ Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-22 15:19:01', '2019-10-22 15:19:01'),
