  ('zcrm_1579374000042390033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547236', 'Kaya Sarzynska', NULL, 'Member sent an update payment form and tried to back date it. Payment authorization on her CC has already been processed. Per FTNI I cannot reverse the authorization (it might be that the CC is no longer valid). Either way I discarded her CC payment and processed November through the bank she provided and set it up for all future payments. If she still has the card she will only see an authorization (payment pending) and that will fall off in a few days.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-22 08:48:11', '2019-10-22 08:48:11'),
