  ('zcrm_1579374000042390013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Member wants to delay monthly payment to 10/25.. again. I held the 10/22 and scheduled a one-time payment for 10/25. I was very clear that as we try to be understanding, moving forward we have to keep the due dates and deadlines the same and we can''t keep delaying her payments.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-22 07:45:01', '2019-10-22 07:45:01'),
