  ('zcrm_1579374000042279003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, 'Sherry called in wondering about how to go about getting a mammogram.  She was extremely confused between the difference of preventive care and illness/injury care.  I could not find the name of her doctor on a multiplan search, and she only had the name of an affiliation of where the facility might be.  I told her, that the information she was giving me was not enough, I told her to send the name and address of facility and doctor so I can get them to Leena to check on the tax id.  Sherry was a bit anxious about us needing to find out for her stating that her apt with this doctor was on Wed- I told her that we would definitely know by then.  I gave her a mini welcome call and sent tons of corresponding emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-18 16:10:48', '2019-10-18 16:10:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042277003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309116', 'James Maynard', NULL, '10-18-19 Legal name is James Christopher Maynard and goes by Chris. Joining now for DPC Family membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-18 15:47:52', '2019-10-18 15:47:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042251016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411228', 'Emily McGill', NULL, '10-18-19 Emily is enrolling again into PSDHC since lost insurance through her employer. She''s choosing the $1500/$269 at age 34.  All set and thankful. She will do her Welcome Call again bc she didn''t really understand it all the first time around.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-18 14:19:50', '2019-10-18 14:24:13'),
