  ('zcrm_1579374000042245008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881237', 'David Stichter', NULL, 'David called in and said he got billed for his preventative wellness visit and for his blood work from that visit. I told him to email me the bills and I will take a look and send them over to someone at ASI and get this situated. From the sound of what he was saying I am not sure he made 100% the provider was in network or the provider did not code it correctly. I also kinda have a feeling that David asked questions that turned the visit into diagnostic. It did not really seem like he understood how the plan works. That is just my feeling, it may not be the case. I am waiting for him to send me the bills and I will send them to ASI. I also told him if he wants to contact ASI himself in the mean time he very well could. I provided him with their phone number in the test email I sent him, the test email is so he has my email address and can just respond to that email. I wrote a lot of things as to why it may not be covered. Hopefully everything will be ok and ASI can process it through. I will keep the notes updated as to what is going on each step of the way. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-18 10:52:39', '2019-10-18 10:52:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042224044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929123', 'Diane Brennan', NULL, 'CC updated. October processed', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-18 10:30:33', '2019-10-18 10:30:33'),
