  ('zcrm_1579374000042224031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221122', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-18 09:51:44', '2019-10-18 09:51:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042245003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'Valerie called and was looking for someone to sit down and explain exactly what this plan is and how everything works. I explained the preventative side to her about making sure that providers are in network with us, he using her ASI card when she gets to her preventative appointments, so on and so forth. I let her know that it would be best for her and her husband to sit down and have another Welcome Call. I explained to her what that is and how is works. She was thrilled to hear that there is something along those lines for her to do. I told her I will be sending her a Welcome Call Scheduler and she can pick a day and time of her choosing and one of our Wellness Coordinators will call her at that time and day. I also told her I will send a few more emails to her about presenting herself with her ASI card, 5 steps to avoid surprise bills, the 64+ Preventative Care Services that are offered, and I went a little into detail about Sedera with a few emails. She looks forward to having the Welcome Call and I think it will help her a lot. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-18 09:47:24', '2019-10-18 09:47:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042224026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271490', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member didn''t get all 4 QR Life code cards yet. I said give it till middle of next week if not call our concierge services. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-18 08:51:41', '2019-10-18 08:51:41'),
