  ('zcrm_1579374000042224011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130432', 'Desiree Smith', NULL, 'I heard back from both Redirect &amp; Sedera that they would reinstate this member.  I will change entries in CRM and reset up billing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-18 07:56:51', '2019-10-18 07:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042224003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953152', 'Roger Ariza', NULL, 'Roger changed his application in Selerix to reflect SD option..  I changed entries in CRM &amp; updated billing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-18 07:53:47', '2019-10-18 07:54:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042208013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152005', 'Krista Barker', NULL, 'Krista called because she wanted to find a therapist in network for family counseling.  I told her that therapy is not something that is covered by her plan.  I told her about Head to Heart though Sedera as well as the discounted Teladoc services for Behavioral Health.  I sent her all the info on those things.   - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-17 16:09:30', '2019-10-17 16:09:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042208008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Samantha called in to verify that the preventive mammogram that ended up showing some things concerning the doctor will now be out of pocket up to her IUA.  I told her that yes, she would now how to pay for that out of pocket and submit the rest to Sedera.  She is also dealing with her daughters bout with food poisoning when they were in Jamaica, and since the trip they had to use the Teladoc service for more medication.  She said that she is so overwhelmed by scanning and uploading so many needs all at the same time.  She was having a hard time trying to submit the need from Jamaica on the Sedera App...so I told her to contact her needs coordinator about it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-17 15:30:38', '2019-10-17 15:30:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042190013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696258', 'Joanne Mielnick', NULL, '10-17-19 Enrolling for Redirect since 62 and choosing $500/$578. She will apply on her own by Oct. 29th at the latest. She was super appreciative! She is 99% certain she will choose this. She just wants to absorb it all a little more. Her friend is LT Governor and just informed her of the 21% decrease in rate and she recognizes that barely helps anyone bc it''s still outrageous and totally broken. She''s thrilled to have this option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-17 15:12:58', '2019-10-17 15:12:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042208003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584008', 'Ahmis Loving', NULL, 'Ahmis called in sounding annoyed.  Wondered how she could go about changing her banking information. Sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-17 15:04:04', '2019-10-17 15:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042205003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953152', 'Roger Ariza', NULL, 'Roger called in and said that he was probably going to change his plan to SD since he has not had any luck finding a DPC.  I advised him that he would have to log back into to Selerix and change his application and advised him of the timeframe.  Will check tomorrow.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-17 14:41:15', '2019-10-17 14:41:15'),
