  ('zcrm_1579374000042180003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082754', 'Ricardo Trespalacios', NULL, 'Ricardo called in and just needed to know how to go about having a wellness visit for him and his family. I explained that what I will do is look up providers in his area and send him a list of providers that are in the PHCS Network. Once I have done that I will be sending him some other emails that will help him understand what he needs to do. I also explained on the phone briefly how it works. I told him that he HAS to have his RCI card when he goes to his appointment and that is what he is going to show the front desk upon arrival. I also stressed to him that he needs to let the provider know that the visit HAS to be Preventative ONLY and the bills need to be coded as Preventative ONLY as well. I explained in one of the emails what will happen if anything is billed as Diagnostic and what that even means. I after telling him everything that he needs to do with his Preventative Care. I VERY VERY much stressed to him about making sure he tells the provider and/or whomever that will be evolved to make it clear to them that everything HAS to be coded and written down as Preventative for anything to be covered with his MEC plan RCI/APEX. He seemed to understand and wanted me to put everything down in the emails that I was going to be sending. I sent all emails that I thought were necessary for him. When I asked him if there was anything else I could help with today, he said no you have been very very helpful an he was so glad that I took the time and effort out of my day to help him and full explain what needed to be said. He said that I have helped him out greatly more than anyone he has ever spoke to on the phone, whether it was here or any other company. He lastly said that people need to be given a lesson from me on how to speak with customers of any sort. He feels so much more knowledgeable about his plan and in general. He thanked me quite a lot and wants me to never stop doing what I am doing with helping people and how I speak on the phone made him feel like he is welcomed and a lot more comfortable with asking questions and whatnot. Lets just say Ricardo is now a very MPowered Member!!!! :) -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-17 09:29:37', '2019-10-17 09:29:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042175003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040874041', 'Robert McCord', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-17 08:40:24', '2019-10-17 08:40:24'),
