  ('zcrm_1579374000042143003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743101', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, 'Maria called in to ask about preventive care, protocol for seeing an acupuncturist for gut issues that she thinks are caused by parasites, if she can submit her year old annual bill to  ASI- so essentially I gave her a 20 min welcome call. Sent all corresponding emails.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-16 14:31:03', '2019-10-16 14:31:03'),
