  ('zcrm_1579374000042108008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445103', 'Karen Neiderman', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted an outline of what the plan covered.  I advised her that she would have received this via email and also asked if she had had her welcome call, to which she replied no.  I told her that I would resend Scheduler & copy of Access Guidelines. When I told her this she seemed uninterested and that she was not going to do it regardless of the fact that she said to send these email''s. Patti reiterated that the Welcome Call is VERY VERY important to have. The call goes over everything about her plan, how it is used, what it does, ect.. Again she seemed very uninterested in the Welcome Call specifically. I will ask whomever does the welcome call, if done at all, how it went and how she seemed. I just want and need to know, if she seems like she doesn''t care or same as today, uninterested. If so than maybe we should tell her that this is not the right type of plan for her. I hope things and her attitude will change once she has the welcome call. -KF/PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-16 13:15:54', '2019-10-16 13:41:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000042108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039755208', 'Catherine Rouse', NULL, 'Cathy called in and all she needed to do was go about how to cancel her plan. She is going to have to new coverage on November 1st. I told her that all she has to do is fill out the cancellation form I am sending her via email and send back to us BEFORE the 20th of the month b/c that is when payment comes out. She fully understood and is filling out the form as soon as she gets it, which will be in a few minutes. I informed her that no matter what it always has to be submitted before the 20th. Otherwise she will see money come out of the account on file and it can talk a while for her to get the money back b/c we have to wait until we physically get the money from her account which usually comes through by the 24th or 25th at the latest and then refund it back which in itself can take up to 7-10 business days. She completely understood. Will be sending form back today at some point. I told Patti to be on the lookout for her name. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-16 10:50:04', '2019-10-16 10:50:04'),
