  ('zcrm_1579374000042041003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026777092', 'Lucas Vogel', NULL, 'Asked what to do via email for cancellation his service. I sent the cancellation email and made it clear that it has to be submitted before the 20th of ANY month. It does not have to be this month exactly, just anytime before the 20th of ANY month of their choosing. It doesn''t matter what month, just the fact that is fear before hand because the 20th is when we bill the members monthly premium for the following months coverage. I also asked him if he could write in an email that explains why he is cancelling and if here is anything that we could possibly improve to make it better for future and present members. I told him he doesn''t HAVE to put why he cancelled but just any sort of feedback on what we can improve on for the future. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-15 12:52:58', '2019-10-15 12:52:58'),
