  ('zcrm_1579374000041986013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659491', 'Jeffery Nolte', NULL, 'Jeff called to inquire about an introduction call to the program. I told him that it would be best for him to wait until most of the emails and cards come to him in the mail first.  I sent him a scheduler and asked him to book a spot on the first or second week of November. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-14 17:26:44', '2019-10-14 17:26:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041986008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Megan called in with a heavy heart, her son''s pediatrician is thinking that the type of depression he is suffering from is clinical and that he recommends him seeing a psychiatrist.  I went into detail on her Sedera benefits, Head to Heard counseling, the extra Teladoc services and our prescription program and send her many emails detailing that information. She cried on the phone for a bit, and after I spoke with her she said she felt very relieved. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-14 16:05:36', '2019-10-14 16:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041955081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'Called and confirmed client that he will complete Selerix enrollment on 10/16/2019....informed him to call me with any issues.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-10-14 15:32:38', '2019-10-14 15:32:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041956038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006420003', 'Jaclyn Haswell', NULL, 'This member called in and said that she submitted a cancellation and that we had continued to charge her for Sept &amp; Oct.  I went into Rylan McNamara (who is her 7 yr old son) and saw that there was a cancellation submitted for him however we were not billing him.  Account was under mother''s name Jaclyn Haswell.  I toild her that I would refund her 2 mos. and cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-14 13:35:29', '2019-10-14 13:35:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041968013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963121', 'Doree Post', NULL, 'Doree called in to cancel, she told me her husband just got offered health benefits through his job at the post office. Haha go figure it''s at a Post office.  I am sorry I had to put that pun in lol. Anyways, her husband was just offered coverage through his job. She was very very sweet and apologized for cancelling on such a short notice since she joined in July of this year. So they were only on the plan for 3 months never used it yet. She was very apologetic and I told her there is nothing to be sorry for. It happens. We are just happy that she gave this type of health care a try, even though she never used it, she still took the time to try. She was also very ecstatic that when she called she got a live person on the phone and not a robot. She said she hates the face that everywhere you call no a days is a robot and not a real person. She said it is very frustrating because of having to press so many different buttons and never gets the answer she is looking for and then having to sit there and wait forever to get connected to a live person. So she was very happy with that and said to never change that. I reassured her that, that will never happen. There will always be a live person. Even if she can''t get put through to someone the answering service is even live people that write down the message and send its right to me or anyone in the office that has access to the tickets section in the CRM. Anyway, I sent the cancellation form to her and told her to fill it out and send it right back in, once she does that she will get a confirmation email from Patti Baron who handles the enrollments and cancellations. She asked "Well what about Sedera and anything else that I am associated with or "signed up" with, with this plan?" I told her that Patti will be taking care of that and lets all vendors know you are cancelled and, like I said, a confirmation email will be sent to her to let her know she is cancelled for good. Doree was very happy to hear how quick and easy everything was for this situation. She will recommend us to anyone she knows that might be looking for something different and cheaper health care alternative. Very happy member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-14 13:13:12', '2019-10-14 13:13:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041988022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, '10-14-19 Spoke with Ron and looked at my email records. I had connected with Ann on Aug. 27th, offered a time to talk and sent her link to my site and audio. She said she''d call me when she''s ready. Today is when she called. Ron is allowing me to take it from here again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-14 13:00:30', '2019-10-14 13:00:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041988011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, '10-14-19 Ann called me at 10:21 am and did not leave a vm. I just left her a vm. I then checked the records and found the above... No chance to connect with her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-14 12:40:41', '2019-10-14 12:43:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041956033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214017', 'Joe Morris', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member has passed away.  So she asked me to cancel HES portion of plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-14 12:36:27', '2019-10-14 12:36:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041967023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, 'I took an inbound call from Ann.  She is presently a Liberty Health Share member and looking to switch.  She called Sedera who gave her Wendy''s number but Wendy hasn''t called her back.  I spoke to Rod about that and he said to take the call.  I took her to my click funnel and went through the introduction about our program.  Her understanding of MCS seemed ok.  We went thought our products and she selected either the Partially Self Directed or the Self Directed plan.  Her husband and herself is in the healthcare business so they will handle wellness on their own.   She is 42 and her husband is 47, have I child (girl).  She will most likely enroll very shortly before the 20th.  She will contact me to help her enroll.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-10-14 11:54:42', '2019-10-14 11:57:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041955076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271228', 'Barbara Henderson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated address unit # was not in. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-14 11:44:39', '2019-10-14 11:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041956028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993023', 'Tom LaScola', NULL, 'Member called to follow up to make sure newborn daughter was added to the member ship.  Said now that his wife was almost finished  w/treatment they were going to add her as well.  Wanted to know pricing for that.  Also gave me Sienna''s SS#.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-14 11:32:28', '2019-10-14 11:32:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041988003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007177', 'Chris Morley', NULL, '10-14-19 Chris 63 and Kristin turning 56 in a week are healthy, no pre-x, no smoking, Kristin taking Estradial for menopause. Sees her Dr. in Minneapolis for gyn since they have all her records. They did a ton of research before they called me and talked with Sedera folks, even knew of Karis Group. Using BCBS through employer now but has retired and will no longer be allowed to keep it past Jan. 1st. He''s finding out if they can cancel for Nov. 1st. I assume they can. She already had a mammogram scheduled in Nov. Told her she can keep it and call Customer Care line first to go through the process. They are paying $1852 for medical and dental right now. Their total cost will be $842 monthly with new Redirect and splitting up couple since age difference is significant enough.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-14 11:28:42', '2019-10-14 11:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041986003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271228', 'Barbara Henderson', NULL, 'I called and left message that I was calling for her 30 min welcome call.  I told her that I would wait 15 min for a call back to reschedule or to continue.  I told her that if I did not hear from her in 15 min that I would send a link for her to reschedule. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-14 11:19:15', '2019-10-14 11:19:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041956023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255524', 'Ana Leighton', NULL, 'Anna called in and told me that she was looking to have a colonoscopy done and that she had a prior history of polyps.  She she realized after she had  presented the ASi card that it would not shareable and provider will not treat it as self pay now that she has insurance.  I told her that she might have to go to another provider if they would not do that.  she asked if proviser could call me to verify I said yes they could.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-14 10:49:33', '2019-10-14 10:49:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041955071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406001', 'Lynn Sheretta', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-14 10:32:34', '2019-10-14 10:32:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041967018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Called Allison to check up to see how see likes our services?  Left a voice message.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-10-14 10:14:20', '2019-10-14 10:14:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041968008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402156', 'Jeanette Malki', NULL, 'Jeanette called in and said that her provider was going to order Comprehensive Blood Panel, Lipid profile associated with her yearly exam asked if that would be covered,  I reiterated that it must be coded as preventative.  She told me it was very complicated and was ok with it - PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-14 10:04:56', '2019-10-14 10:04:56'),
