  ('zcrm_1579374000041887013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1500 IUA 50-59 DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-11 10:01:30', '2019-10-11 10:01:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041887008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, 'I have left VM for this member Application on hold as the address is incomplete.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-11 10:00:43', '2019-10-11 10:00:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041900003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Liz from RADNET called to confirm coverage.  Mammogram yes, MRI for her spine, no.  Sent Liz the plan summary.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-10-11 09:38:48', '2019-10-11 09:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041898003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361667', 'Deborah Caulfield', NULL, 'Called in and just wanted to see if there was anything else she needed to do when it comes to her woman''s wellness visit. She already made sure that the provider and facility are in the PHCS Network. I told her that is the first thing that we do and then after that you are good to go to make an appointment. I told her that she has to have her RCI card at the time of the visit and the front desk will be able to call the number on the back of the card to verify her benefits. I also let her know that when she calls to make the appointment to really stress to the provider that her visit is to be ONLY Preventative care and everything HAS to be coded as Preventative, not Diagnostic. If it is coded that way then that is something she pays out of pocket, unless it was a mistake, She would then send her bill in to get looked at and if anything was coded as diagnostic then she needs to speak with her provider and ask them to re code the bill and then re submit it to RCI with the correct coding. She fully understood everything and was glad that she called here first to make sure she was going about everything the correct way. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-11 09:24:00', '2019-10-11 09:24:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041887003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529298', 'Sarah Pastoriza', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with RCI &amp; Sedera and cancel pmt in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-11 08:35:15', '2019-10-11 08:35:15');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000041879003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271017', 'Robert Gerrity', NULL, 'May be adding spouse.  Sent new pricing and link to change form.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-10-11 08:18:54', '2019-10-11 08:18:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041836033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711386', 'Kami Teral', NULL, 'Sent her a cancellation form and cancelled billing.

From: Kami Teral <KamiTeral@outlook.com> 
Sent: Thursday, October 10, 2019 4:34 PM
To: Billing and Accounts <admin@mympb.com>
Subject: Re: Your Payment has been initiated

I have called twice regarding this payment, 
This account should have been cancelled thru Liberty Healthshare.
I was told the email link to cancel would be sent to ktbrockway@msn.com
but I have not received it. Would you please send it to kamiteral@outlook.com instead
THANK YOU

Kami Teral
970.846.1088
kamiteral.lifevantage.com
www.biohackingyourbody.com', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-11 08:09:48', '2019-10-11 08:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041873013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711386', 'Kami Teral', NULL, 'Member called in and said that she cancelled LHS and of course.did not cancel us.  Payment date was changed to the 11 so her pmt was charged today.  Both Kelly &amp; 1 tried to send her the email cancellation request.  I cancelled &amp; refunded her pmt and will cancel her account.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-11 08:09:14', '2019-10-11 08:09:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041874003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207130', 'Monica Robinson', NULL, 'Monica called in and said she was have trouble making sure that certain providers that she looked up are in the network. Linda Reid is one of the providers, she DID come up on the PHCS network site that I use to determine who is in network. Monica said when she called to make an appointment whoever she spoke to had no clue what she was talking about and told Monica that Dr. Reid is NOT in network. I just called on her behalf and spoke to Chelsea. I said that I work for a Medical cost sharing "Insurance" and I have a member that needs to make an appointment. Before she can do that I need to confirm that Linda Reid is IN the PHCS MultiPlan network. Chelsea looked all that up for me and said yes Dr. Reid IS in the PHCS MultiPlan network and is good to go. I called Monica back and told her the good news, she was very happy, but upset at the same time because she said whoever she spoke to at this facility with Linda Reid , was on the phone with them for over 10 minutes and was kinda fighting back and forth. I reassured her that everything should be perfectly fine. We just needed to confirm that Dr. Reid is in fact in the PHCS network and I made sure of that. She should have no issues going forward. I told her I will be sending some important emails that explain how she is going to present herself when she gets to the doctor, or even on the phone beforehand. If anything else happens I will update in notes. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-11 07:48:36', '2020-02-26 08:06:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041873008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402156', 'Jeanette Malki', NULL, 'New address sent to ASi &amp; Sedera.  Will update in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-11 07:22:51', '2019-10-11 07:22:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041873003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647130', 'Isabella Malki', NULL, 'New address sent to ASi &amp; Sedera.  I will update in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-11 07:22:20', '2019-10-11 07:22:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041869026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781050', 'Catherine McGowin', NULL, '10-10-19 Catherine has family of 4, 49, 49, 8 and 11. Both she and husband are turning 50 Nov. 11 and 30th. Price goes from $655 to $783 for family at $1500 IUA level for PSDHC. All health, no pre-x except husband has thyroid issue. They see Dr. 0-1 time per year aside from wellness visit. No tobacco. Super excited about this option. Paying $1600-$2000 month, couldn''t remember! Wants to discuss with husband and will call me with questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-10 17:31:06', '2019-10-10 17:31:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041869021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906068', 'Sue Lepping', NULL, '10-10-19 Sue is enrolling now in Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-10 16:49:49', '2019-10-10 16:49:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041869013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906018', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '10-10-19 Heidi is paying $1260 a month to Anthem with $10K ded. Tired of paying so much for nothing! Super healthy, active, no meds, almost no alcohol, no tobacco, etc. Learned about us from neighbor''s good friend who is self-employed. Came through guy Brian Pettit but doesn''t know name of woman. Also came directly from CPA Dyan and Mark Murphy who are clients as well. She sprained wrist last year and broke ribs few years ago. Otherwise no issues. Super happy and joining right now in 1st call! Saving $900 a month! Chose $1000/$350 Redirect bc lives in Carbondale.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-10 16:29:37', '2019-10-10 16:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041869008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, '10-10-19 Court enrolled today for DPC with Nextera. May offer to employees at a later date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-10 16:16:03', '2019-10-10 16:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'Nicole called in because she wanted to know how to go about seeing an annual care doctor for a wellness visit and to have labs done.  So I told her what I normally tell our members- that I was going to send out an email that contained a link and instructions on finding doctors in network- that there was an attachment that went all of the services covered, that I would be sending her another email that contained an article giving tips on how to avoid surprise bills during a wellness visit, and lastly a wellness check script of sorts so she wouldn''t have any trouble presenting her RCI card.  she was silent the whole time, and then she said very angry and frustratingly that she was told that this concierge number was "sold" to her with the expectation that we were to do everything for them when they called- NOT sending emails for her to read, and if she gave me a name of a doctor could I do a quick search for her..please.  I told her that I would LOVE to help her with this, but we really do strive here to help mpower members so that they can take charge of their own health- that we would be happy to help her and her family understand until they were comfortable doing it on their own.   I found the doctor.  I told her that I did twice before I got a response from her.   She then asked if she could have her annual wellness check at the same time of her thyroid check.  I told her that we would not recommend that due to the fact that diagnostic blood work is not covered by her plan.  She argued that a thyroid check was in fact part of her wellness exam over the years.  I did bring up the option of directlabs.com you could tell that this interested her but scared her because it''s all new.   I am going to reach out Guy about this because I really think that with all of the people on this plan.  This family needs to get this right and know how to use it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-10 16:00:26', '2019-10-10 16:00:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402156', 'Jeanette Malki', NULL, 'Jeanette called to make sure that her son could use her ASI card, even if it had her name on it.  She also requested that her daughter receive her ASI card- we found the problem- Isabella''s address was never updated.  So I changed it and sent the new address info to ASI with a card request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-10 15:38:33', '2019-10-10 15:38:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737005', 'Bernard Mumford', NULL, 'tried to call for welcome call and it went straight to vm.  I left a message for a call back, and then sent an email asking for him to reschedule. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-10 15:35:16', '2019-10-10 15:35:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647130', 'Isabella Malki', NULL, 'just changed her address- I sent that to ASI so they can resend her card. I updated Patti as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-10 15:34:14', '2019-10-10 15:34:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819507', 'Brian Teske', NULL, 'Christina called in and was asking if IVF treatments are something that is sharable. I was not sure and took down her name, number, and email to get back to her. I asked Patti and she said no it is not. No sort of fertility treatments are sharable with any type of plan. While I was on the phone with her I told her how it works if it is something that is not sharable. I discussed Sedera and how they work. She also thought that if there is another incident that is not related to the IVF she will be paying for out of pocket, happens then is she add that to her IUA? I told her no that the IUA is per "Need". Not just a one time use. She totally understood and I will be sending her a few emails that will help her along the way. The How to Submit Your Bills to Sedera, the 64+ Preventative Services that are sharable under the ACA, how to present herself at any sort of wellness visit. I am not sure if she is going to call back with any other questions. I called her back to let her know what the outcome was and she did not answer, so I left her a voicemail and explained a few other things. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-10 15:03:14', '2019-10-10 15:03:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335249', 'Terrie Parrott', NULL, 'called to update address info because they are moving. sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-10 14:44:36', '2019-10-10 14:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041831018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, 'Received HI Claim for for this member.  I reached out to the member and asked what this was for and she advised that provider was confused as to who to send it to.  Said she presented as self pay.  I will scan and email to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-10 14:29:05', '2019-10-10 14:29:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041836028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034425052', 'Douglas Osness', NULL, 'Member called and updated payment info and address. FTNI updated.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-10 11:40:43', '2019-10-10 11:40:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757110', 'Brandon Lowitz', NULL, 'Called and asked how to go about getting a Flu shot. I pulled up his profile and he has Redirect. So I told him that with his plan and Redirect his first point of contact is ALWAYS going to be Redirect. No matter what, for ANY type of question''s and concern''s. I gave him Redirect''s number. He is calling them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-10 11:06:52', '2019-10-10 11:06:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', NULL, 'Lynda''s husband James gave me a call asking if there is some type of form that gets sent out or if we can send out a form for anything that has to deal with taxes. I sent back the call to Patti because she is the one that deals with tax question''s. She handled everything during March when it was the start of the tax season. She told James that during that time in March we sent out 10-95B forms for all members because the members are technically employees with the company. Patti looked at when he started and he would not have gotten one for this tax season that just passed, 2018. He will be getting one (if he is still a member and did not cancel) for next year when filing for 2019. She let him know that all he needs to put down is when he was covered by the employer plan. She also let him know(as goes for every single person that called in asking for the 1095-b form and saying that they CAN''T file their taxes if they don''t have the form, wrong!) that we are actually told by the IRS to NOT, I repeat DO NOT file that form. That it is just for their records(the member''s). He understood and got the information he need. -KF/PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-10 10:56:12', '2019-10-10 10:56:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041836023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823048', 'Mary Marchwinski', NULL, 'Acct set up charged 10/10. Billing set up to start 10/22/ Good to go for 11/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-10 10:01:33', '2019-10-10 10:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041836018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 10/10. Billing to start 10/22. Good to go for 11/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-10 09:55:05', '2019-10-10 09:55:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041836013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770071', 'Debra Flick', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 10/10. Billing will start 10/22. Good to go for 11/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-10 09:43:54', '2019-10-10 09:43:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041831013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, 'Tracking #9170992
Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 10/10/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-10 09:38:14', '2019-10-10 09:38:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041836008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Acct set up charged 10/10. Billing set up to start 10/22. Good to go for 11/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-10 09:37:05', '2019-10-10 09:37:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041826005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711386', 'Kami Teral', NULL, 'Kami called me to ask why she was seeing a charge from Health Excellence Plus when she has already cancelled with Liberty. Once again Liberty is not letting the members know that they have to cancel with us as well because we were a part of the plan  that she had. That is what the $50 charge is from. I let her know that all she has to do is fill out the cancellation form that I will be sending her. I also let her know that she does not need to print the form and send it back via mailing address. I told her it is just a simple form that you fill out online and send it back to the same. she wasn''t very happy that I was able to take the time and help her out with this and explain everything, instead of just throwing the form her way and not explain any of the process and she also liked that I told her she is not the only one that this keeps happening too. I said that Liberty does this every single time. They do not tell the member that if they are cancelling with them( Liberty) they need to get in contact with us to cancel otherwise she will still be charged the $50. Sent her the form to her email, I confirmed that was the correct email and now we are just waiting for her to send it back in and get the refund process started. Very happy member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-10 09:20:18', '2019-10-10 09:20:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041836003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666816', 'Michael Weeks', NULL, 'Cancelled.


