  ('zcrm_1579374000041831008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823048', 'Mary Marchwinski', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-10 09:00:32', '2019-10-10 09:00:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041831003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 30-39 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-10 08:29:51', '2019-10-10 08:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041812003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020015', 'Daniel Patterson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  This new member is incredible, he was already very well informed, but eager to make sure that he was understanding everything correctly.  I asked how to pronounce his wife''s name- he said that she goes by "Toon". - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-09 14:55:28', '2019-10-09 14:55:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177059', 'Teresa Vannoy', NULL, 'Teresa called in and needed help with quite a few things. She said this is going to be her first time using her plan and benefits. Her children need a wellness exam. She used the PHCS MultiPlan website to look up a provider the correct way. She said when she called them to make sure they are in fact in the network they said they did not know what she was talking about. So I told her I would look into that for her and she provided Patti with the name and address of that provider. Before all of that she had some questions about what to say and how to present herself and how far does the preventative go when she needs to ask the providers questions about her children. I put the call into Patti b/c this was m first time being asked that and I am not sure when it comes to the children and how that would be handled. Patti told her (and me) that when is comes to questions that she should leave that for a completely separate visit b/c the pediatrician''s can be a bit of a stickler when it comes to that. It is solely up to the provider on how they would want to code the bill and most of the time they will code is Diagnostic when it comes to questions, especially about children. Teresa specifically wanted to know about allergies with her son. She has the co-pay plan and Patti recommended she use one of those visit''s that will only cost her $20 for all and any questions she will have for her kids. Before I transferred I was also telling her about the difference between Preventative and Diagnostic. I explained to her what her IUA is and how that will be used for anything that is along the lines of Injury/Illness.I told her who Sedera is and how they work. I let her know that she should get in contact with Sedera BEFORE she has met the full amount of her IUA, that will give Sedera a heads up on what is going on and can start the process sooner than later and will assign her with a case worker that will work with her the whole way. I sent her a few emails. One for how to present herself at the appointments and what exactly to say and that she HAS to have her RCI card with her, which she does. I sent her the 64+ Preventative Services that are covered by the ACA, I sent her the one list of providers that has the provider she gave us Dr. Micheal Frand right at the top, but with a different address and phone number. I made sure I highlighted his name so she see''s it and doesn''t get confused with all the other names. I also sent a list of Pediatrician in her area just in case she needs to find a new one. I sent her how to submit her bills to Sedera in the future when need be, and I sent her lastly 5 steps on how to avoid surprise bills. I told her if she needs anything else to please do not hesitate to call and that after 4PM there is another Kelly, Kelly Cheever that takes over the phones at 10PM. So no matter what the time is she will have someone there to help her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-09 14:31:44', '2019-10-09 14:31:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033271', 'Shannon Drake', NULL, 'On 10/8 this member emailed into the Concierge asking how pregnancy would be treated with MCS as she was contemplating getting pregnant next year.   I tried to contact her to explain how it works, but was unable to reach her.  Left a VM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-09 12:45:04', '2019-10-09 12:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041807003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, '10/9/19 Angie is enrolling in Redirect right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-09 12:18:09', '2019-10-09 12:18:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636005', 'Homeira Loghmani', NULL, 'Homeira called in and needed to update his Credit Card on file with us. He stated in the call that he got an email from someone in our dept. saying the charge could not go through. I put him on hold to transfer to Sunny. While I was waiting for her to pick up I looked in the emails section from multiple options, as in from CRM, MPB Concierge, and I looked up email''s sent from Sunny. There was nothing sent to this member ever, about anything. There is only 1 note under his name and it is from Wendy stating this is Steve Cabrera''s client and she was updating the system to show then at 02:10PM. Anyway, Sunny did not answer. I then could not get the transfer to go through to Patti so I just gave Patti his name and number to call directly. She called him and updated his card to a new one that is not expired. When she asked Homeira who he got a letter from about his card being expired and he went silent. We are assuming the letter was from Liberty, that is the plan he has is HES LibertyHealth Share. He stated though that he already updated everything with Liberty, so he is good to go and Patti will be charging him his monthly premium and is all set. FYI Mr. Loghmani is VERY difficult to understand on the phone due to his very thick accent. Just wanted to give everyone a heads up when they read this note, so try and be patient and speak very clear to him as well, B/C I noticed that it is hard for him to understand us as well, so speak loud and clear, Thank You! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-09 11:24:58', '2019-10-09 11:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217067', 'Skylir Bryant', NULL, 'Received RCI EOB back a 2nd time after sending to updated address.  I will scan and attach.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-09 09:41:22', '2019-10-09 09:41:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521016', 'Catherine Jaimes Llanos', NULL, 'Catherine reached out to me via Skipio saying she needed help wit a bill she got from Quest Diagnostics. I asked her to please send the bill over to me via email. She sent the bill over and I looked at it to make sure it had the CPT codes on them to be able to determine what was going on. I let her know that I was going to send it over to Leena over at ASI and will cc her in it so she can stay in the loop. Leena got back to me and stated that the tests were ordered by her doctor for a specific ailment of anemia. Leena said that she can not reach out to the provider and ask to re-code the bill and resubmit it, that Catherine has to do that. I forwarded the email over to Catherine and gave her the run down of what Leena said. She(Catherine) is going to have to contact her provider herself and ask them to re-code everything if she believes that those tests are supposed to be preventative and if she did not order those tests as diagnostic. I gave her Leena''s phone number and email if she has any other questions. I told her at this point there is nothing else that I or Leena can do right now, until Catherine contacts her provider and gets and answer. Will keep the notes updated when I get a response. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-09 09:04:04', '2019-10-09 09:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770071', 'Debra Flick', NULL, 'Tracking #9165550
Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 10/9/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-09 08:56:34', '2019-10-09 08:56:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Tracking #9165453
Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 10/9/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-09 08:44:59', '2019-10-09 08:44:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041771018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770071', 'Debra Flick', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA 60-64 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-09 08:36:05', '2019-10-09 08:36:05'),
