  ('zcrm_1579374000041754023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Christine called in about a claim from last year when she was with ASI.  I transferred the call to Leena.  Leena is taking care of it. She''s showing that the claim was already paid so Christine is sending the most recent statement over to her so she can get to the bottom of it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-08 15:48:31', '2019-10-08 15:48:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041754018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030419', 'Christopher Ambrose', NULL, 'Christopher called stating that he had never heard back from Patti, he could not find anything in his email from her.  I found an email that Patti sent yesterday, I re sent it to Chris- he is going to fill out the form attached. Also he says that his voicemail is never full and that he thought we were trying to call the house number- I took down the mobile number that he would like us to call 208-757-1618 - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-08 15:15:46', '2019-10-08 15:15:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041754013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963048', 'Drostan Baker', NULL, 'Drostan has been having issue setting up his HSA account.  His wife had one through her job...but now he wants to roll that over into his.  He told the HSA employee that he was with Sedera and tried to explain Health Cost Sharing with her.  I told him that that could''ve been part of the problem.  Then I explained about his MEC and the high deductible so on and so forth.  I sent him detailed instructions about how to set up his account.  I also sent him the link to the article that Ron just shared with us all.  He was happy with that.  I told him that if he had any more issue that Ron would speak to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-08 15:10:47', '2019-10-08 15:10:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041756003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, 'Called Jeff Parker back to discuss his colonoscopy procedure....informed him that we do not want him paying anything....waiting on call back from client.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-10-08 13:37:02', '2019-10-08 13:37:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041754008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002065001', 'Rob Winings', NULL, 'Dania fixed the issue- he was somehow registered with them without a phone number.  I sent Rob and email to let him know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-08 13:09:37', '2019-10-08 13:09:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041754003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002065001', 'Rob Winings', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  explained how we use the .com site for our welcome calls but that we are working on adding the VCP/Bow Tie plan, went over everything and answered all questions.  Rob is a very attentive member and wrote some notes.  I have reached out to Sedera to see why his phone number isn''t being recognized on the app- and reaching out to John about getting Rob a QRLife code so he can play around with the site. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-08 12:53:25', '2019-10-08 12:53:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041720013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474326', 'Timothy Dulany', NULL, 'Tim called in asking what the process is for getting an MRI on his knee and what referrals we have for him. I let him know that when it comes to something like that(as in getting an MRI) he does not have to stay in network with an specific  provider. I told him that is considered something that is Diagnostic Injury/Illness. He pays out of pocket up to his IUA of $1000. Once he is close to that he needs to get in contact with Sedera. I told him that it is best for him to call Sedera today after he is done with my phone call. The reason for that being to call Sedera today ASAP is because, he said it might also lead to an ACL surgery. I told him then yes call Sedera ASAP! There is a few things that he needs to do with Sedera for them to help out 100%. I let him know about the 2nd MD program and if he refuses to do that and go along with what 2nd MD recommends than Sedera has the right to penalize him and raise his IUA, as in he will have to pay more out of pocket if he does not do what Sedera tells him to and or recommends. He understood and is going to call Sedera now. I sent him an email with Sedera''s information because he was driving down the highway. (Not being very Preventative in that situation, is he? Hahahahah, I had to)  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-08 12:34:17', '2019-10-08 12:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041720008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741134', 'Susan Nadeau', NULL, 'I am waiting to hear back from Jennifer over at RCI about where Susan can get it done for it to be 100% covered and what to do if it is not something that is preventative. Once I have gotten the answer I will email Susan back to let her know what to do. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-08 12:28:11', '2019-10-08 12:28:11'),
