  ('zcrm_1579374000041720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537009', 'Jeanine Ford', NULL, 'Jeanine called in because she just wanted to know how to pay or what the process is for getting a flu shot. I told her she can go to any pharmacy that would do that type of shot and she would pay out of pocket and then just submit the receipt or proof of payment to ASI and they will send a check out for reimbursement. If she wants to be covered and not pay out of pocket she would need to get the shot done at her primary provider during her wellness preventative exam. She understood and will just go to a pharmacy and pay out of pocket and submit to ASI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-08 07:26:49', '2019-10-08 07:26:49'),
