  ('zcrm_1579374000041678016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006970007', 'Janina Freund', NULL, 'Janina called in stated that back in August she had cancelled and was wondering why this past Saturday on 10/5/19 she got an email that she was charged. Come to find out that she only cancelled with Liberty and not us, that is why she was still charged. Patti explained all of this and told her that she is going to send her an online cancellation form for her to fill out, sign, and submit it back to Patti ASAP. The longer she waits she will not be able to get the refund b/c we pay the vendors on her behalf and it will be too close to the month being over and getting refunded for the whole month she has it does not work that way. Patti told Janina this and she understood and will send it back to her within this week sometime. The form was sent via email that was confirmed is correct. -KF/PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-07 12:47:13', '2019-10-07 12:47:13'),
