  ('zcrm_1579374000041678008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679079', 'Bonnie Kern', NULL, 'Bonnie called in and just wanted to make sure that she is taking the right steps to go and have her annual physical done. I told her that if she has a provider she goes to, I can look them up and make sure they are in the PHCS Network. She provided me with her primary care doctor''s name and when I looked her up the name did not show up, but other providers from that same facility did. And I know for a fact that a few months ago I have looked this provider up before and she WAS in network and on the list, I highly remembered that name vividly. SO, what I told Bonnie was that I could not find her name but I was going to call the facility and check with them, b/c I very much do remember the providers name from MAYBE 2 or 3 months ago, and she was in the network when I looked before. SO I called the facility and spoke with Rachel at the front desk. She looked up in their system and said YES that Kristine Thorne specifically WAS and IS still in the PHCS network. I emailed Bonnie in writing that I spoke to Rachel and she said YES she is in network and is good to go for her preventative care and will NOT be billed for the provider not being in network, Miss. Thorne is in network so there should be absolutely no problems what so ever. I also sent Bonnie a few other emails the will help her along the way to make sure even MORE that there should be no issues with billing. I told her what to say and how to say that the bills NEED to be coded as preventative not diagnostic. I sent her as well what she needs to do if she ever has any issues with Injury/Illness. I explained who Sedera was, what the process is, and what she as in herself Bonnie, needs to do if the time comes to some sort of emergency or Injury/Illness. She fully understood what to do and how her IUA work''s. The whole 9. Very MPowered Member hahah :) she was very very grateful that I took the time to call the New West Physician''s facility to make sure Miss. Thorne was in network. No issue at all for me, I told her I was more than happy to do that for her. Take some pressure off of her back. She is all set and couldn''t be happier with this process and all the help we provide. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-07 09:34:16', '2019-10-07 09:34:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041698008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659570', 'Jane Pulliam', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-07 08:49:09', '2019-10-07 08:49:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041698003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659491', 'Jeffery Nolte', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 50-59 Copay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-07 08:36:57', '2019-10-07 08:36:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041666028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509108', 'Sunday Phillips', NULL, 'Sunday called and said that she got a cut with something rusty and needed to go get a Tetanus shot.  I told her that she would present herself as cash pay and that she may go where ever she liked.  I sent her an email going over how to open up a need with Sedera if needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-04 17:27:29', '2019-10-04 17:27:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041666023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176349', 'Elie Ouellette', NULL, 'I asked Sunny to call him back on Monday to go over previous payment on file and update her with the latest. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-04 16:25:14', '2019-10-04 16:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041682008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041664098', 'Jill Pettingill', NULL, 'Acct set up charged and billing set up. Good to go for 11/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-04 14:50:07', '2019-10-04 14:50:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041666018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819469', 'Joseph Stafford', NULL, 'Kellie called in to see when the deadline would be to have her daughter removed from the plan she said that if her daughter can find something that will cost under $148 a month (like she is spending on her family plan) than they will go ahead and fill out the membership change form that I sent before the 20th of the month. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-04 14:48:31', '2019-10-04 14:48:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041682003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041664048', 'Akihito Ishiwatari', NULL, '$25 acct set up charged, billing set up to start 10/22. Good to go for 11/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-04 14:44:38', '2019-10-04 14:44:38'),
