  ('zcrm_1579374000041678003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, 'Shawna''s physical therapist called in to see how payment is going to work for them, She stated "I have never heard of MPowering Benefits and I do not know how is works". I put her through to Patti to see how she would word everything to Sherrie from the sports physical therapy provider. I know what to say and how it works, I just wanted to see how Patti was going to work it so I make sure I understand how everything is going to work and make sure that I am saying the correct information. -KF/PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-04 13:23:09', '2019-10-04 13:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041666003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833121', 'Gregory Olsky', NULL, 'Member spouse Nancy emailed and said that Greg Olsky would like to cancel HES.  I advised that she would have to get cancellation in today.  I have cancelled already so not to incur refund.  Will wait for cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-04 11:18:26', '2019-10-04 11:18:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041645003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737213', 'Debra Leech', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member very overwhelmed. Was not able to get in site to be on checklist at time of the call. Having problems with internet in her area. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-04 08:29:45', '2019-10-04 08:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041583023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271366', 'Hayley Kirkman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Hayley had many questions and was taking down notes....very attentive.  Good member.  Told her to call in anytime for any additional questions that came up.  We had her phone number wrong- it is supposed to be 5054356857- I am going to let Patti know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-03 18:08:04', '2019-10-03 18:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041573033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, '10-3-19 Court 59 and wife 58 are already members of Nextera for past 7 years but don''t have any insurance. Court has arthritis and takes moroxican (sp?) and ambien for sleep. He''s considering offering this to his employees to pay for themselves or list bill. He has 5 FT and 2 PT. Wants Nov. 1st start date. DPC membership and we have enrollment meeting schedule for next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-03 16:00:01', '2019-10-03 16:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041583018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, 'called in because he got sick and wanted to file a claim for the $400-$500 he paid out of pocket.  I asked if he had called Redirect before he made those appointments and she said that he did not.  I told him that he needed to speak to someone at Redirect about this. I explained the difference of our phone number and Redirects. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-03 15:31:21', '2019-10-03 15:31:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041583013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362080', 'David Kimble', NULL, 'David called in asking about whether or not cataract sx is something that is shareable.  I told him that it may be if it has to do with his vision and told him that I could sift through the guidelines and get back to him OR I could transfer him to someone at Sedera- he declined and I helped him to the Sedera App- he is going to reach out from there. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-03 15:30:09', '2019-10-03 15:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041573023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033577031', 'Margaret Thoreson', NULL, 'Margaret called in because she needed help finding a provider in her area for a annual physical. She gave me her providers name and he was not on the list in network. I did find a few other physicians in her area that she can go to and send the list in an email. I also sent her the well visit instructions that she will need to look over so she knows what to do and what to say. I told her to make sure that she tells the provider that her visit is to be coded as preventative not diagnostic. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-03 13:41:40', '2019-10-03 13:41:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041583008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'I am still trying to help Michele find a mammogram facility that is one that she has been too before, and it isn''t really working out the way she''d like.  I have nominated providers, Leena has called facilities to get tax id''s, I have done tons of searching for her and sent her a list of who she could go to...Leena has done the same.  Now I found the NAME of the hospital she wants, it''s an imaging center IN network with a different address than the one she provided me with.  I just sent her the latest email with many options for her to choose from.  Now we wait...... KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-03 12:42:36', '2019-10-03 12:42:36'),
