  ('zcrm_1579374000041573018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041625015', 'Dale Smith', NULL, '10-3-19 Dale is 61 and wife is 58. Wife SMOKES! Not option for her. They live in PA and may also claim residency in CO instead. Plan to travel around country without real residency. Unsure of income but thinks $1500 month which is $18K per year, Medicaid level for couple. Might be $20K-$25K best case. He has high blood pressure meds and she takes Synthroid for thyroid issue. Just sold their house. Not good candidates for this. $507 for Redirect is way too much for just him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-03 11:30:42', '2019-10-03 11:30:42'),
