  ('zcrm_1579374000041573013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '10-3-19 Robert called to clarify if ACA compliant and told him the penalty is not happening in 2019. So, not relevant this year. He still sorting out when he''s going to leave his job either this Dec. or next Dec. 2020 is what he said this time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-03 10:38:41', '2019-10-03 10:38:41'),
