  ('zcrm_1579374000041604008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737100', 'Colette Kirkendall', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Will call us if she doesn''t receive QR Life code card by Oct 15th. Very overwhelmed member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-02 08:59:07', '2019-10-02 08:59:07'),
