  ('zcrm_1579374000041604003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041459005', 'Amy Nielsen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Verified address. Will call us if she doesn''t receive QR Life code card by Oct 15th. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-02 08:10:00', '2019-10-02 08:10:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041594008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041599023', 'Amber Neumann', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-39 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-02 08:03:45', '2019-10-02 08:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041594003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, 'John has been speaking with Katherine as of today. She called me yesterday asking about what has happened with the HMA situation. Last I was told and she was told, was that is was processed and paid out. According to Katherine that is not the truth and is STILL waiting. I emailed Joe Lovelidge about this because it is pretty much 1 YEAR that this has been going on and she very frustrated. Also she has just gotten a bill in the mail now from a Mammogram screening she has done about a year ago as well and is now getting billed for that too!! She is VERY VERY upset about this. I told her to send me the bill and I would send it over to Jennifer Chasteen at RCI to see what is going on.. I got back from Jennifer that it has been submitted but denied because it was out of network. This has been a back and forth issue every single time she goes to get anything done she is telling me. She has been arguing the SAME thing every time. She is told from Sedera and I that the facility IS IN NETWORK. But what the issue is, is that the radiology center that is part of this facility is NOT in network..... I handed it off to John because she was just arguing with me and demanded to speak with him about all of this. He is working on it and last he needed her to send the bill that has the CPT codes on it before he can do anything. Without that he can not help her he told. She called me back and said that whomever that she spoke too was told that they can NOT send her that bill with the CODES on them but was told them and wrote them down. I went to give it to John before he left and he said no, he has to have the physical bill or he can not do anything to help her. John told me he will call her tomorrow to discuss this with her. If she calls or anything that is the latest news we have. She wanted to talk to him earlier but he was on a phone conference and I told her I would relay the info with the codes she was given and that''s when he told me that he can not use that, he needs the PHYSICAL bill.... -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-10-01 14:52:00', '2019-10-01 14:52:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041587013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020063', 'Mitchell Bloom', NULL, 'Welcome call complete kinda cocky and sarcastic.  He kept scaring me a bit and then "Kelly!  I''m only kidding!  it was a joke!"   I feel like this welcome call was an annoyance more than anything, and when I asked if he knew certain things he would say "yeah....kinda"  he was taken back by there being a 36 month lookback for any symptoms, treatments or diagnosis.  He thought that it was just going to be diagnosed ailments, I told him it was not. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-01 14:46:21', '2019-10-01 14:46:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041587008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672169', 'Nermijad Mehmedovic', NULL, 'Nermijad has been suffering from abdominal pain, he has presented himself cash pay for doctors office and ultrasound and wanted to know what to do next in the needs process.  I told him that if the doctor wants anymore tests to give Sedera a call so that they can help find him the best place/price for it.  I sent him the how to submit needs to Sedera email, as well as a prescription med quote form just in case the doctor prescribes anything. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-01 14:29:22', '2019-10-01 14:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041587003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020121', 'Amy Bloom', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Started call off badly with Amy berating me thinking I was a telemarketer....she told me that she was sorry but has been getting hounded.  Yup.  Weird call. I felt like it was a hassle to her, and that she didn''t really care all that much- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-10-01 14:17:53', '2019-10-01 14:51:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041577010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271091', 'Roy Simmons', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-01 14:00:07', '2019-10-01 14:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041577005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005185086', 'Michelle Gossen', NULL, 'Member submitted a change of payment form. Zoho updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-10-01 13:50:01', '2019-10-01 13:50:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041573003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, 'Angie is 36 and healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no ins at the moment. Considering the $1500/$290 Redirect. Revisiting with her tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-01 13:16:04', '2019-10-01 13:16:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041550013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '10-1-19 Talked with Sandra and she is having new onset of hormone issues unexpectedly. Thought she was done with it many years ago. She was referred to Functional Medicine Dr. Amy Reedhead who did a much more extensive blood panel for $90. But the consultation is 2 hours and $600! She wants to know if that will be shared if she exceeds $1000. I told her to call Sedera directly and tell them her situation and ask if any portion of the cost will be shared if she exceeds her $1000 IUA. Since it''s via holistic dr. and their rates are super high, she''s aware they may not share any of the cost but might possibly share a portion of cost if she exceeds her IUA. Boulder Holistic doesn''t accept any insurance. It''s all cash pay already. She was appreciative that I called her and will call Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-01 11:54:42', '2019-10-01 11:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '10-1-19 Left her vm to see if I can help solve her problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-10-01 10:53:42', '2019-10-01 10:53:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041521023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032064118', 'Catherine Broad', NULL, 'Received the claim form associated with ER visit that Kelly C referenced in last note. (Copy in attachments) I spoke to member who advised me that she had gone to the ER and that they had collected her $1500 IUA from her.  I told her that this was likely the bill from the ER Physician.  She told me that she would look into this.  I will scan and attache this bill and send to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-01 10:48:47', '2019-10-01 10:57:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041521018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165315', 'Debra Jackson', NULL, 'Member requested cancellation.  I sent out form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-10-01 10:44:27', '2019-10-01 10:44:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041534008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271091', 'Roy Simmons', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Verified address. Will call us if he doesn''t receive RCI card and QR Life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-10-01 08:39:27', '2019-10-01 08:39:27'),
