  ('zcrm_1579374000041509023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005322969', 'Kenneth Peter', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent him the form! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-30 18:47:04', '2019-09-30 18:47:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041509018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925142', 'Kelly Schest', NULL, 'She has had severe on and off back pain since May- at that time she was given steroids and it helped immensely.  Now the pain is back but worse- the doctor has tried giving her more meds and now xrays and found that there is some arthritis in that area.  She said that the pain is at times incapacitating and wanted to know how she would begin uploading bills for a need- I told her that if the doctor wants to do an MRI to call Sedera first so that they can find the best place/price for that.  I sent her the how to email for Sedera and opening a need.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-30 18:20:08', '2019-09-30 18:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041509013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601530', 'Perla Pimentel', NULL, 'Good Morning,

 

She does not owe anything, this was indeed preventive exam. That is an explanation of benefits and not a bill, that is from us showing the member how we processed the claim.

On this claim there is no patient responsibility in that column, so she would not owe anything.

 

Thank you!

 

Jennifer', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-30 15:01:28', '2019-09-30 15:01:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041509008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, 'Mary and her husband called in due to the fact that Mary has been experiencing abdominal pain.  The doctor ran all sorts of tests including a pap smear- husband wanted to know if that would be covered because it''s preventive care.  I explained to him why it wasn''t and all of those costs would go toward the need.  The doctor ran blood as well and is now ordering a CT scan of the abdomen.  Clients did right in calling in so that Sedera could find the best price and place for them to get that done.  I transferred the call to Natalie at Sedera and sent how to submit medical bills to Sedera email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-30 14:50:07', '2019-09-30 14:50:07'),
