  ('zcrm_1579374000041457023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Michele called for an update on Rose Imaging facility, I verified that they are not in network- Leena had called them for their tax id and it was a no go.  I told her that they had received the nomination, but that it was basically just sitting on someone''s desk.  I told her that the ownership just changed hands officially to Solis Mammo- and according to their site they do not accept the PHCS network.  I emailed her to ask about the other facility she had her eyes on.  Waiting for a reply.  Also went over flu and shingles vax protocol with her. I gave her two walgreens clinics in her area that accept her insurance. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-27 16:34:58', '2019-09-27 16:34:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041457018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601530', 'Perla Pimentel', NULL, 'Perla finally sent me her statement from RCI- I sent it to Jennifer Chasteen to help explain. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-27 15:38:24', '2019-09-27 15:38:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041457013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529238', 'Mark Hanna', NULL, 'Mark called in because his wife went to get a flu shot- when the provider called RCI, they were told that the name had a different spelling and the birthdate was wrong as well.  I updated it in the CRM.  I called RCI and spoke with Lindsay- she told me that the new info would either need to be processed through our human resources OR Mark could email her a written request with the correct changes.  I called Mark back and told him that he should send this email to Lindsay because our home office was closed.  I gave him her email.  He thanked me for my help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-27 15:26:12', '2019-09-27 15:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041463013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, 'We received what looks like a medical bill from Mercy Hospital for this member (copy in attachments).  I contacted her to ask what it was in relation to but was unable to find a date of service.  Member advised that she was out of town and could not check on this.  I let them know that I would scan and email to them and that they would have to research this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-27 12:04:23', '2019-09-27 12:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041463008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041459005', 'Amy Nielsen', NULL, 'Pmt Set up in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-27 11:51:52', '2019-09-27 11:51:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041463003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041459005', 'Amy Nielsen', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Ch $1500 IUA 50+ Select Grp', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-27 11:23:52', '2019-09-27 11:23:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041457008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Sandra had called in very anxious saying that she was at a doctor''s office and didn''t have her ASI card with her.  I told her that even if I requested it from ASI now- it wouldn''t get to her until later in the day.  She told me that she was ACTUALLY at a lab to get a very large panel done that was scripted out by her holistic doctor "that you probably aren''t going to pay for anyway, but that''s another story"  she said she has been dealing with "issues" and she wanted to go the holistic route.  I told her, that she would need to cash pay, I told her that giving this office her ASI card wasn''t an option.  She insisted, I repeated. She insisted, I repeated...she was having a melt down at the doctor''s office she was in, so asked her to hold and then transferred the line to Guy.  I am going to send this info along to Wendy.  If you look at the notes Sandra KNOWS what she needs to do....she just doesn''t want to do it and throws a fit.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-27 09:50:08', '2019-09-27 09:50:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041458003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'spoke with Sandra Haber, she was informed she would have to pay cash...she said she would just pay cash...to go towards need...client stated she will go that way and hang up.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-27 09:30:44', '2019-09-27 09:30:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041457003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871102', 'Julie Weck', NULL, 'Julie called in so that she could get Sedera''s number.  She received a letter in the mail from ASI that stated that her bill was not preventive and that she needed to contact Sedera.  I could tell she was on a mission that she didn''t want to be on,  but the way she asked for their  number I didn''t feel like she wanted me to jump in at all so I just let her go to let Sedera answer her questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-27 09:07:57', '2019-09-27 09:07:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041414054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677458', 'Susanne Kortals', NULL, 'Member was charged even though she aged out. Refunded September payment', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-27 07:38:20', '2019-09-27 07:38:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041416033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  Member never got a link for HRA, Member found a flaw in the welcome pack we have online.  Member''s were pretty sweet about all of the flaws that were found.  Also- they said that they talked with John weeks ago about not being able to register with Teladoc - they waited to hear back but they never did. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-26 17:38:44', '2019-09-26 17:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041416028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, 'I called at 6:30 for Kenneth''s welcome call- his wife Amy answered and asked if she could do the call without him, that he wasn''t home yet.  I gave her my number and told her that they could call back when he get''s home.  She appreciated that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-26 16:39:38', '2019-09-26 16:39:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041409048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993577', 'Lori Bacon', NULL, 'Spoke to client ...informed client she would have to go to PHCS network practitioner office...client complained it was very far over 100 miles....instructed her to additionally ensure that all practitioners were in network...otherwise it would be self-pay.  Client not happy ...but understood the issue...she will call me back with other questions,,,,', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-26 16:33:32', '2019-09-26 16:33:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041416023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993577', 'Lori Bacon', NULL, 'called in complaining that getting her preventive care visits was too much work and she pays all of this money.....I asked her to hold and transferred the call to Guy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-26 16:06:56', '2019-09-26 16:06:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041416018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Samantha called in not really knowing how to handle her newest need- pos bones spurs in her neck and spine.  I know that she is and was in alot of pain, but she went against my advice (see below) and has been handing her RCI card to almost everybody.  I told her again why she shouldn''t do that, then she wanted info on getting a mammogram- I went over protocol and she made me look up her provider and facility. They were in network.  I kept going over the differences of preventive care vs. injury/illness  - it didn''t seem to matter how hard I tried....it still seemed like she keeps blurring the lines. She thanked me so much for my help and time explaining, that it really helped to hear someone that knows the plan and it makes it less confusing. I tried transferring her to Sedera but got their voice mail, she said that she has been calling all day and only gets their vm.   I sent a message via Slack for someone, maybe her daughter''s needs coordinator to reach out to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-26 15:58:38', '2019-09-26 15:58:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041409043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'Spoke to client...wants to enroll...effective Nov 1. 2019...$5000 IUA Partially self Directed...Has over $7500 in HSA at this time....wants to continue HSA contributions...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-26 15:24:14', '2019-09-26 15:24:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041416013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993577', 'Lori Bacon', NULL, 'Lori called in for a preventative care refresher.  She was pretty confused.  I went over all protocol and explained and sent all coinciding emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-26 15:17:24', '2019-09-26 15:17:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041446003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402156', 'Jeanette Malki', NULL, 'Kelly Cheever was working with Jeanette earlier but needed to go to an appointment for herself. I took over and the last email from Kelly was that she did not need anymore help with the medication, but needed help finding a provider for an annual physical in her area. I was more than happy to help her out. I found a few providers when searching for General Practitioner and sent that to her. I explained in the email what I was sending her and also gave her a few pointers on making sure her visit stays strictly Preventative and that if she brings ANYTHING up at all then the visit could very well turn Diagnostic and she will be responsible to pay that. For example I told her, if she brings up any sort of pain, sickness, ect. that her bill MAY be coded as diagnostic. I also told her to let the front desk know that her visit is ONLY Preventative. I told her what card she HAS to bring and that the phone number is on the back for the front desk receptionist at her appointment can call to verify her benefits and plan with us. I also told her that I would be sending a few more emails further explaining all of what I told her so she doesn''t get confused and have to remember everything from my 1 email. I sent the Well Visit Instructions, the 5 steps to avoid surprise billing, how to submit her bills to Sedera if need be in the future and explained who they are and what they do, nothing to worry about at this time, but just wanted her to know for future reference. I also sent her the 64+ Preventative Services that are covered under her plan by the ACA. She should be all set to go and told her to call or email if she has any other questions. I also, because I noticed the GP Provider list was very small, looked up Internal Medicine, which I explained is the same thing with a GP just a little more fancy haha. That list came up with 7.5 pages long, so I figured that would help a little more if need be. Lastly I said in that email about the IM Providers how she can go to www.healthgrades.com to look up reviews for providers if she would like, so she feels a little more comfortable and knows who she is going to and can be reliable. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-26 14:39:49', '2019-09-26 14:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041409038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Lori - client called in to request additional information about one of her daughters possible conditions...specifically requested information about Interstitial Cystitis....Gave client the information that I was aware of....informed her to request information about from a Urologist that her daughter may have interstitial cystitis.  Client was happy with information and will give MPowering Benefits an update related to this possible need with her daughter.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-26 14:27:07', '2019-09-26 14:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041436003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, '2nd Welcome call complete. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-26 11:02:53', '2019-09-26 11:02:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041409033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033498005', 'Ronald Voelker Jr.', NULL, 'Spoke to Michelle about her issue with Sedera paperwork and her complaints to Sedera.....Michelle remembered that I did inform her about the amount of paperwork required....she apologized and informed me that she will contact Sedera and inform them that I did instruct her properly....Michelle stated that she completed Sedera paperwork and will get it to them.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-26 10:59:28', '2019-09-26 10:59:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041416008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402156', 'Jeanette Malki', NULL, 'I am trying to find a good price on BRAND Zyprexa 2.5 mg x 30 this is a mental health drug and Jeanette needs it straight away.  The problem is, is that the cheapest I could find it for was $360 for a 30 day supply.  Jeanette didn''t even want the coupon because it was so expensive.  I told her that I would keep digging- I have reached out to Reid for a quote as well as Kelly F to follow up to try and dig for anything cheaper. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-26 10:51:17', '2019-09-26 10:51:17'),
