  ('zcrm_1579374000041416003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie called to ask and see if her follow up visit with her gyeno would be covered along with a follow up pap smear.  I told her that it would not and I explained to her why.  There were a few abnormal cells found on the first annual pap smear.  I told her to hold on to her receipts- that she could upload them to the Sedera app to keep in case this need goes over her IUA.    We also went over the emails that I had already sent her as resources. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-26 09:10:02', '2019-09-26 09:10:02'),
