  ('zcrm_1579374000041389003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330097', 'Craig Nelson', NULL, 'Kim called to ask about the different key terms to do a multiplan search for doctors that you would see for an annual physical- I gave her those as well as resent all of the preventive care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-25 16:57:22', '2019-09-25 16:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041387003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Left message for Joanna.  has 13000 in hospital bills for Ernesto.  Mayo Clinic is looking for payment and refusing to see him until it''s paid.  Had a Member Portal pin reset sent to his phone.  when he sends the new pin, I will review what they have in the system vs the bills the member has.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-09-25 16:49:31', '2019-09-25 16:49:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041385016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, 'Liat called in and she needed some help finding some providers in her area''s she will be moving to or be around which is in Newport Beach CA and Costa Mesa CA. She needed to find a general practitioner for just a wellness visit and then a OBGYN for a woman''s wellness visit. I was able to pull up a few lists for her in the 2 different areas she can choose from. She also just wanted to know what to say when she makes the appointment. She pretty much needed a whole run down of how EVERYTHING works. I was more than happy to explain everything to her. I let her know that I would be sending quite a few emails for her that are general education and further explains how she presents herself and provider searching on her own time in the future, and how and who Sedera is and what they do. She was MORE than thrilled that I was able to sit down and help her out and that there will be emails sent to her to make it easier and help guide her through. Very very grateful member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-25 14:20:40', '2019-09-25 14:20:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041360083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217067', 'Skylir Bryant', NULL, 'Received update address from this member.  Will change in RCI protal &amp; inform Sedera &amp; update in FTNI.  Also will resend RCI Mail', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-25 14:11:40', '2019-09-25 14:11:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041360078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, 'Made 2nd attempt via email to contact this member re: returned mail from RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-25 13:47:53', '2019-09-25 13:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041360073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217067', 'Skylir Bryant', NULL, 'On 9/16 I attempted to contact this member as I received returned mail from RCI.  Was unable to leave VM.  So I sent final email attempt on 9/25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-25 13:44:39', '2019-09-25 13:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041385008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416027', 'Judson Rogers', NULL, 'Lindsay called in and wanted to know if an MRI or Ultrasound that her provider for her mammogram recommended for having dense breasts was covered. I told her that it is not and explained how she would go about that with paying out of pocket up until her IUA of $1000 and to contact Sedera ahead of time to give them a heads up that she will most likely be going over her IUA with the MRI, if recommended. She said that her and her husband have done that before and knew what to do. I sent her the email anyway on how to submit bills to Sedera and so they could have their phone number when needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-25 12:43:34', '2019-09-25 12:43:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041385003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032104090', 'Chelsey-Rae Williams', NULL, 'Chelsey-Rae called Patti and needed to see if her OBGYN provider was in network with us. Patti took her phone number and the providers name down for me to look up for her. I looked up the provider and she is indeed in network with us. I emailed Chelsey-Rae to let her know and sent the attachment of the list just so she can see and have proof that the provider is in network. I also sent an email explaining how she would present herself at her visit and made sure to tell her to have her ASI card. That is the proof that she has coverage to give the front desk at her appointment. I was also informed by Patti that Chelsey-Rae needed a PDF and hard copy of her ASI card sent to her asap. I emailed ASI ID department and gave them her email and mailing address to be sent to her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-25 12:41:23', '2019-09-25 12:48:12'),
