  ('zcrm_1579374000041354003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'Good Afternoon Andy,

 

I have looked into this bill for you and found that we did receive this claim in our office, only the bill came in as non-preventative. We called your provider as a courtesy and they confirmed since this was a follow up appointment it is not considered/billed as preventative which is correct. Since your plan only covers services that are preventative, this one will not be processed by ASi. You should have received a letter from our office stating that this claim was a non-preventative claim and we were forwarding it over to Sedera as a courtesy; I have attached a copy for your records. The letter also gives a contact for Sedera that you can follow up about this claim. Please let me know if there is anything I can assist you with Andrew.

 

Thank you,

Salena Abreu

Claims Department Supervisor

