  ('zcrm_1579374000041316042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Christine called in for instructions on how to handle a dermatologist appointment. Has spots she needs removed.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-09-24 11:48:03', '2019-09-24 11:48:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041334008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993023', 'Tom LaScola', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add newborn daughter.  I have emailed Sedera and no need for price adjustment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-24 11:46:26', '2019-09-24 11:46:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041338003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, 'Dave called in and he just wanted to know where or who he should speak to about a potential "Need" that he will be having starting tomorrow. He is pretty sure that he has carpotunnel in his hand and he has been having on going pain for several weeks now. He has an appointment with a hand specialist tomorrow that has a cash paying discount. I explained to him that he is doing the correct thing and that he only pays up to his IUA of $1500. Once he is close to meeting that or he can even get in contact now, is with Sedera. I explained what Sedera does and who they are in relation to submitting a "Need". I let him know that I will be sending an email to him that explains how to submit his medical bills over to them and that the email will also have Sedera''s phone number and information. He seemed to understand and was glad that he called here ahead of time to make sure he is going about this the right way. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-24 11:43:34', '2019-09-24 11:43:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041334003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711523', 'Michael Yocom', NULL, 'Member called into request cancellation. I sent out form link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-24 10:54:24', '2019-09-24 10:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041319008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Needs QR Life code cards with Redirect for her and 2 daughters as well. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-24 10:10:08', '2019-09-24 10:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041319003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216055', 'Paul Geersen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member will call us if he didn''t receive QR Life code cards for him and wife. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-24 10:05:27', '2019-09-24 10:05:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041318003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, 'Member was set up for $610 monthly share amount which is not the correct premium for Member and child $1500 60-64 Redirect. I corrected the reoccurring payments to $938.00 and charged $328.00 for the difference in September payment', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-24 09:57:11', '2019-09-24 09:57:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041302018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James called yesterday to get in contact with Jill but Jill was out sick, he just called again and I did tell him that Jill is on her way in as we speak. He said he is on his way into work and asked if Sunny could give him a call from billing, I let him know that she was currently on the phone with another member. I told him I would give his number to both Jill and Sunny. I spoke with Sunny to transfer the other member and let her know James Forro just called and she knew immediately and has his phone number to call him very shortly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-24 09:49:47', '2019-09-24 09:49:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041302013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937187', 'Kathy Young', NULL, 'Called and asked to speak to billing. She stated we did not pull the right amount from her account because she has switched plans. I transferred her to Sunny. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-24 09:44:35', '2019-09-24 09:44:35'),
