  ('zcrm_1579374000041301023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529298', 'Sarah Pastoriza', NULL, 'Member returned my call frm 9/20, she wanted to remover her and her son from plan and leave husband on the plan.  I advised that since she was the primary that would cancel whole plan.  I advised that in order to do this she would have to cancel and have her husband reapply on his own.  I sent cancellation request and advised her to submit after the 1st of the month for cancellation 11/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-24 08:33:26', '2019-09-24 08:33:26'),
