  ('zcrm_1579374000041301003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257334', 'Daniel Hilkert', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel  Sedera &amp; RCI.  Also will cancel pmt in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-24 08:03:14', '2019-09-24 08:03:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041286058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'Jacqueline called in to get a better grip on how her plan works, also she is dealing with recurring strep throat.  She has used Teladoc for this twice already and now needs to see a doctor.  She thought that she needed to search in network to find a doctor that would be covered.  I explained why that isn''t the case- all out of pocket for injury or illness up to her IUA per need. I spent a bit of time with her until she understood, I sent all corresponding emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-23 18:18:41', '2019-09-23 18:18:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041286053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030403328', 'Kayla Neale', NULL, 'Called to cancel, sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-23 17:29:44', '2019-09-23 17:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041286048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601530', 'Perla Pimentel', NULL, 'Perla called to update her info- I told her that Sunny was gone for the day, but that she could update the payment via the link that was sent.  She will do that, she also asked about the deadline if she wants to cancel because she soon will be receiving benefits for her employer.  I told her that the cancellation form would have to be done by the 20th of the month.  She is also sending me a preventive care bill that I will send off to Jennifer Chasteen. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-23 17:05:32', '2019-09-23 17:05:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041286043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039657162', 'Bob Borden', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Bob is a super star member having everything down before the call but wanting to hear it all again to make it concrete. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-23 15:51:12', '2019-09-23 15:51:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041293076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271543', 'Thomas Kiley', NULL, '$25 acct set up and October charged. Billing set up. Good for 10/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-23 14:13:53', '2019-09-23 14:13:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041286038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Liz called in stating that ASI is holding on to her check until we release it.  I explained that it means that she will receive her check the next time we pay them....I went over how this is a group membership.....on and on... she understood but still wanted a time frame of some sort to gauge what to expect.  I reached out to Jill and tagged Liz in it.  Also we went over how her foot has been bothering her quite severely. I transferred her to Mady to discuss the PRP therapy. Sent how to email as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-23 14:09:27', '2019-09-23 14:09:27');
