  ('zcrm_1579374000041286018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216134', 'Larry Glore', NULL, 'Tara was pretty unhappy about the fact that Darius had told her that specialist visits were covered, the brochure he gave her said something else, and Redirect said that they weren''t. Now she wants to change plans.  I told her that redirect does negotiate down cost before any appointment but she compared it to the co-pay plan that she was thinking of getting and said she rather pay $50 and KNOW what the cost will be beforehand rather than it all being "up in the air".  I emailed Darius about this, I also have emailed Liset from Redirect to see if there is a ballpark sort of figure that members usually pay at specialist visits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-23 12:25:29', '2019-09-23 12:25:29'),
