  ('zcrm_1579374000041286003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039657131', 'Myla Borden', NULL, 'Myla called in panicked that her QR life code registration wasn''t working because she thought she needed to set it up before her MRI scan appointment today.  She thought she needed to do that to receive any benefits- she said her Dad told her that is how it works.  I explained everything to her- I gave her Sedera''s phone number and tried to transfer her to Mady at Sedera but the call dropped.  I sent a Slack message to Maddy and asked that she call Myla asap.  I sent Myla an email on how to upload bills to Sedera and created a ticket for John to look into her QR  life code situation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-23 10:29:53', '2019-09-23 10:29:53'),
