  ('zcrm_1579374000041188018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009143063', 'Adam Rothberg', NULL, 'Member submitted Member change request to add his son.  He did not supply SS#.  I tried to call &amp; leave VM but MB was full I email him and Wendy.  I advised I would change pricing for billing for this evening but would need SS# early next week.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-20 13:44:47', '2019-09-20 13:44:47'),
