  ('zcrm_1579374000041188008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667255', 'Kathleen Kronz', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know what she was paying the $50 for.  I explained.  She also asked if she could re-sign up I advised her no.  Will send out cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-20 10:12:42', '2019-09-20 10:12:42'),
