  ('zcrm_1579374000041190008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, 'Eric called confused that his Apex card didn''t cover the prescription meds that he asked me for coupons last night.  I explained why, he was fine with it but you could still tell he had more questions.  I told him that I would be happy to go through the whole program if he wanted but he declined and laughed stating that he just needed to go over all of the "paperwork" that he had.  I told him that I would send him all of the educational emails I had about how his plan worked and that if after he reads everything he still has questions he can call on us 9-9 est for the answers. happy member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-20 09:05:01', '2019-09-20 09:05:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041190003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096243', 'Karen Sebbens', NULL, 'Karen called thinking we we Liberty and needing only info that they can give her.  I made sure that they had their number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-20 08:32:34', '2019-09-20 08:32:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041188003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041185005', 'James Roberts', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-20 08:03:11', '2019-09-20 08:03:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041138018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141080', 'James Ashford', NULL, 'called about how to go through the 2nd MD program because his son is scheduled to have knee surgery. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-19 17:31:03', '2019-09-19 17:31:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041138013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574112', 'Brianne Spitz', NULL, 'called in with questions revolving her new pregnancy- I have emailed Jennifer at RCI to ask about pre-natal visits being covered.  She then started to ask about her C-section and how much it would cost- I told her that I would look through the guidelines for her but beyond that it would be a question for Sedera. Then she said she just spoke with them. So now we''re waiting on an email back from Jennifer and I am going to go hunting through the guidelines for her now. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-19 16:01:36', '2019-09-19 16:01:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041138008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039601017', 'Peggy Garrett', NULL, 'Peggy had to go to the ER a few days ago and thought that she was calling Sedera. I went over the needs process with her.  She said she understood and just had dialed the wrong number. I sent her the instructions on opening up a need. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-19 15:30:55', '2019-09-19 15:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041148016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391169', 'Carrington Garrett', NULL, 'Per ticket that was created about a a question on getting an Echo Cardiogram and wondering why she was told it is not covered. I was told per John to call her and first of, ask who told her that, and second that it is not preventative and is not covered. It is Diagnostic, injury/illness and she needs to pat out of pocket only up to her IUA of $2,500 and who Sedera is and the whole 9 about what to do. I called Peggy and she said she just got off the phone with the other Kelly, Kelly Cheever and she explained everything that she needs to to. RCI is who told her it was not covered. Ticket Closed. All worked out, per Peggy stating that she understands and no longer needs help for the time being. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-19 15:23:10', '2019-09-19 15:23:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041150002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391169', 'Carrington Garrett', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 553 
Question : I need to have an echo cardio gram done, having issues with SVT. My cardiologist tried to schedule one and when they called the customer service number, they were told this test is not authorized. I am confused.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-09-19 14:17:47', '2019-09-19 14:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041139048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005137', 'Katie Irvine', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel w/Sedera, ASi', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-19 14:17:43', '2019-09-19 14:17:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041139043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377081', 'Ross Young', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera, ASi &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-19 14:12:38', '2019-09-19 14:12:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041139038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659160', 'Alicia Venegas', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel ASi &amp; Sedera and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-19 14:06:20', '2019-09-19 14:06:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041148008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Sandra called in and she had a list of questions. She wanted to know what or where she can go to get some extensive blood work done for an issue she may be having. I told her that, that is not covered as preventative so she does not have to go to a specific provider in network. It is up to her choice where to go for these test for ANYTHING that is diagnostic or injury/illness. She was actually very pleased to hear that because she was recommended a provider from her primary women''s provider. I explained again how Sedera works and what they do, along with her IUA. I made sure to tell her to keep all records and receipts from those visits to show proof that she had met her IUA to Sedera. She totally understood all the steps. I told her that I was going to send her the email again on how to submit her medical bills over to Sedera so she doesn''t have to go digging through all her email from what I sent that email in June. She was very happy with all the information I provided for her and that i took the time to sit and explain everything to her. She was very thankful and stated whenever she has had to call into here that I am always extremely helpful and I always answer all her questions with ease and detail. Very happy member :) I also sent her and email that has the 64+ Preventative Services that are covered with her plan and the ACA. In that email I told her what times days I am here answering the phones and emails and then explained when Kelly Cheever is. I just wanted to let her know that there will ALWAYS be someone to help out, even through the night until 10PM! Very happy to here there is always help when she needs it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-19 13:52:18', '2019-09-19 14:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041160011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299005', 'Julia Rockich', NULL, 'Cancelled.

