  ('zcrm_1579374000041148003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039613005', 'David Anderson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Verified address. He did receive the QR Life code cards for him and his wife. Redirect finally did get back to him yesterday late afternoon. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-19 10:30:40', '2019-09-19 10:30:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041139008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033498005', 'Ronald Voelker Jr.', NULL, 'Since this group will be effective 10/1 I have to cancel the billing for this member for MPBA.  Billing early this month, I have advised Guy to have Michelle submit cancellation request and I will request change to own group.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-19 09:29:44', '2019-09-19 09:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041139003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Wendy emailed me asking what the pricing would be for Cari if she were to switch over to the DPC plan.  I quotes a price of $251 and advised that we would need that today or early tomorrow to process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-19 09:20:54', '2019-09-19 09:20:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041138003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Mitchell wound up in the ER with an injury a few days back- they think that they may have torn some muscles in his chest and that is what is causing him pain.  He says that they did not do any imaging there because they said it wasn''t necessary yet- to just take it easy and take Ibuprofen for the pain and swelling.  He said that it has only gotten worse.  I explained that he may go to the doctor or his choice- that there wasn''t any network that he needed to adhere too.   So he is going to reach out to an internist that he had seen before about this. I told him that he should give Sedera a call, let them know what is going on, and if the doctor wants to do any imaging service to give them a call so that they can point him in the right direction of the best facility/price for that test.  I also told him that I was sending him an email that contained a video and instructions on how to open up a need with Sedera and upload all of his detailed medical bills to them.  I also told him that I was going to send him a script quote form for any other medications the doctor wants to put him on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-19 08:47:29', '2019-09-19 08:47:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041135003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039613005', 'David Anderson', NULL, 'Spoke with client and told him we would set up welcome call on 9/19/2019 at 12 noon EST.  Asked client if he had any medical issues....client stated no...just wanted to get all information on plan.  Client was initially upset, but I calmed him down and assured him we would contact him tomorrow.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-19 08:41:36', '2019-09-19 08:41:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041108013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039613005', 'David Anderson', NULL, 'Guy spoke with him, set him up for a welcome call at 12:00, I sent an email to Vanessa concerning this.  I also contacted redirect on David''s behalf.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 18:10:59', '2019-09-18 18:10:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041108008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377081', 'Ross Young', NULL, 'called to cancel- work is offering them insurance. sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 17:59:22', '2019-09-18 17:59:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039613005', 'David Anderson', NULL, 'very upset, stating that he has left two calls with Redirect and left two messages and never got a call back.  I confirmed all of his contact info because he says he hasn''t received anything from anybody.  He was upset that I couldn''t help him immediately when Wendy implied that the concierge can fix everything. I asked if he wanted to be transferred to Wendy and he declined because she didn''t "fix it" the first time.  So then I got a hold of Guy to speak with him.  He kept asking me if this was a scam, I told him that it wasn''t, and I apologized that he hadn''t received anything via by mail or email.  Guy is going to give him a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 17:06:07', '2019-09-18 17:06:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041096013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003599029', 'Joseph Libkey Jr', NULL, 'called thinking that we might be able to tell him who his primary care doctor was that he saw last year. I gave him Liberty''s number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 16:05:15', '2019-09-18 16:05:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041096008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389081', 'Kelly Mills', NULL, 'It turns out that RCI never got Kelly''s bill to begin with and that is why it shows them paying nothing!  Jennifer asked Kelly to call the office and have them send it over for processing.  In the meantime, I sent Kelly the exclusions document that Wendy had found. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 15:31:22', '2019-09-18 15:31:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041096003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, 'Georgeanna called in needing some reassurance as to how she and her wife have been handling medical bills and er visits due to an injury in the Caribbean first slicing a big toe open, then stepping on a jellyfish....having the toe looked at to check if there was coral left inside- strange allergic reactions.  I told her that what she was doing is right- cash pay the IUA and then ask for billing BUT that she needed to call Sedera and open up a conversation with them.   I gave her Sedera''s phone number, all corresponding email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 15:23:00', '2019-09-18 15:23:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041078001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756054', 'Ricky Simmons', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 552 
Question : My premium is way to high and so I got another insurer so I wish to cancel my policy with you please...Rick Simmons', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-09-18 13:46:04', '2019-09-18 13:46:04'),
