  ('zcrm_1579374000041019045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Samantha called in a bit distraught talking about the 3 times in the last few months with her hospital needing to go to the ER- for heat stroke symptoms.  She said that every time he presented the ER with his APex card and asked if that was correct- I explained why it wasn''t- then she started speaking about her own health care issues, that she has a horrible pain on the back of her head.  She told me that a few days ago she went to a doctor for this that wanted to prescribe steroids, but she didn''t want to take them because she''s holistic but she knows that it is more than just a headache and wants a CT scan and full lab work.  I explained that Sedera would not cover these expenses if they were not doctor''s orders.  Then she said "I guess I''ll turn around"- it turns out she was on her way to the ER the whole time, I told her that she should go if she feels like she needs to go!  That would be the advice that we or Sedera would give.  She said "well what''ll I do? say that I am cash pay? that''s so embarrassing" I urged her to get the help she thought she needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 11:50:46', '2019-09-18 11:50:46'),
