  ('zcrm_1579374000041019040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212188', 'Shawn Valentine', NULL, 'cancelled Liberty a few months ago and thought that this membership would automatically cancel as well, I explained that this is not the case, sent a cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-18 10:50:57', '2019-09-18 10:50:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000041046008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020287', 'Brendan Duffy', NULL, '9-18-19 Other son of Karen Vaughan. He''s files his taxes independently so he''s on his own membership. Healthy, no tobacco. Chose $500 IUA bc price difference is tiny for the extra security. He rarely goes to dr. as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-18 10:46:00', '2019-09-18 10:46:00'),
