  ('zcrm_1579374000040923041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040874041', 'Robert McCord', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-16 13:44:50', '2019-09-16 13:44:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040939081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, '9-16-19 Amanda''s fiance!  Also Susan Davis referred him to me first. But, Amanda is a client for trad ins. Neither of them can get referral money since not MCS clients. Dave is healthy, just has Celiac disease. He''s anti-meds. He''s paying $300 Aetna for Cobra but ending Oct. 1st I think. Income from unemployment annualized is $31,044. But, might get contract work for $800-$1200 per job at 2x per month. Also he''s not paid until 30 days beyond end of project. Isn''t worried about dental or vision. MCS is $278/$1500 PSDHC. OR, SDHC is only $212/$1500 if he''s done his wellness visits already. Then maybe move to PSDHC if/when Amanda joins after married.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-16 13:43:36', '2019-09-16 13:43:36'),
