  ('zcrm_1579374000040939046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737213', 'Debra Leech', NULL, 'Charged acct set up fee 9/16. Billing set up to start 9/20. Good to go for 10/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-16 11:52:22', '2019-09-16 11:52:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040939035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152148', 'Justin Acker', NULL, '9-16-18 Justin is 41, wife 36, kids 4 and 15 months. Listened to audio. Healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Justin never goes to Dr. but kids once every few months for ear infections, sick, etc. Redirect best for PCP visits with kids! $1500/$801 Redirect. Possibly Oct. 1st start date. Meeting again on Wed. 18th to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-16 11:45:23', '2019-09-16 11:45:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040939030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271219', 'Jacklyn (Jackie) Gartman', NULL, '9-16-19 Jackie is considering switching from LHS to HEP, But has some pre-x to consider now. High cholesterol but well managed and gone off statin and changing her diet, therefore it''s well managed. Husband has foot issues and saw orthopedist for potential fusion which he''s choosing not to do. Jackie has degenerative disc in neck that she''s gotten epidural for and acupuncture. Nothing has solved it and nothing really helps, so leaving it alone. Redirect will be best and splitting them up as couple best for price. Monthly will be about twice the amount though, at $842 instead of $400. She will ponder and figure out if they have any pre-x to worry about with skin issues as well. Husband had benign skin thing removed around 3 years ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-16 11:40:45', '2019-09-16 11:40:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040939017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003890013', 'Jason Bernstein', NULL, 'September declined. Sent notice', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-16 10:53:23', '2019-09-16 10:53:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040932008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Spoke with client...informed her about the situation and why she was billed the amounts....client understood and was no going to pay the bill...further educated her on the process for preventative visits and her IUA responsiblity....client understodd and was appreciative.  Matter at this time is closed.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-16 10:27:41', '2019-09-16 10:27:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040923031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, 'Linda from ASi called in and told me that she received chart notes from Valley View provider who then told ASi that they need more information from patient in order to submit claim.  ASi did not have any contact number for member.  She said that she would contact provider.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-16 10:20:02', '2019-09-16 10:20:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040925022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716875', 'Cynthia Hunt', NULL, 'Called in and needed a list sent to her for General Practitioner''s in her area. I sent her the list and explained how she needs to go about presenting herself. I let her know that I would be sending her a separate email that explains in FULL detail what she needs to do upon her visit to the appointment. She was very happy that I could send her the list so easily and quickly.  Happy Member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-16 09:48:21', '2019-09-16 09:48:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529094', 'Dustin Smith', NULL, 'Called member for scheduled welcome call. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-16 09:42:26', '2019-09-16 09:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040925017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, 'Charles called in and spoke with Patti. All he needed was a few list''s of providers he needed for him and his girlfriend Anna Thaxton. He needed a list for Orthopedic, general practitioner, and a gynecologist for the girlfriend. I explained to him how the orthopedic is not something that is covered under his plan but I am more than happy to still send him a list of people in his area. I explained why it is not covered and what he needs to do to pay out of pocket up to his IUA of $1000. I explained that he needs to keep every bill and receipt as proof to Sedera that he has been paying up to it. I then explained what he has to do for the IN Network providers and sent him the email that in full detail, explains what he needs to do and how to present himself with his ASI card. Sent all three lists and educational emails. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-16 09:37:54', '2019-09-16 09:37:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040925012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'called in regarding process for seeing a podiatrist.  Explained cash patient, ask for a discount, request complete bill.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-09-16 09:30:06', '2019-09-16 09:30:06'),
