  ('zcrm_1579374000040827164', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601059', 'Jered Garrison', NULL, 'Jared called in because he was trying to register with Teladoc due to what he thinks is an ear infection, he stated that he get''s them off and on because he is a surfer.  I wanted to transfer the call to Sedera, I got a hold of Mady there and we figured out that they had his birthday wrong as being the 10th rather than the 20th of Jan.  I relayed her message that she was going to submit this to Teladoc today and that he should be able to use it on Monday at no charge, in the meantime, if he wanted to use the service, he would have to pay for it but that Sedera would reimburse him. He told me that he would probably wait until Monday if it was still bothering him.  Mady sent registration info and I sent him a prescription medication quote form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-13 16:28:56', '2019-09-13 16:28:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040882022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041616103', 'Kai Philipp Olshausen', NULL, '9-13-19 DPC Dr. himself but wants to join Sedera as family. Is willing to join DPC locally if necessary but really wants to keep their own Pediatrician. He will look up Ped to make sure in the PHCS network. Family is healthy, but youngest has Type 1 insulin dependent diabetes. He can get it at a low cost since he''s dr. Hasn''t been a problem so far as members of LHS. He wants to switch bc they are taking 6 months or more to reimburse. He''s not comfortable in case they have a larger medical incident. He also works for Teladoc! Wants a Nov. or later start date. Not in a rush at all. He''s 44, wife is 42 and kids 9 and 11. Uses Atlas for billing. He has signed an agreement with Sedera to offer this to his patients. He''s open to learning more about what MPB has to offer as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-13 16:04:08', '2019-09-13 16:04:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040882017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, '9-13-19 Family of 4, Ayala is 30, husband 36. Healthy, no tobacco. She is taking a medication for weight loss. They are paying $1006 now for entire family with Kaiser. Likes this idea and concept and it''s way more affordable with tons of access. Needs to read a little more before commits. Possibly Oct. 1st start or Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-13 14:36:16', '2020-03-10 13:25:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040825043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033498005', 'Ronald Voelker Jr.', NULL, 'Spoke with Michelle Voelker and finalizing all steps for group setup for start date on Oct 1, 2019.  Sedera has been informed and ReDirect plan will be finalized by 9/16/2019.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-13 14:20:36', '2019-09-13 14:20:36'),
