  ('zcrm_1579374000040827100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, 'I spoke with Cathy, she is awesome and I sent 2 seperate doctor lists for Karl, she is going to call me back on mon or tues if she has any questions! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-13 10:44:06', '2019-09-13 10:44:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040834053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002065001', 'Rob Winings', NULL, 'Acct set up $25 charged 9/13. Billing set up to start 9/20. Good for a 10/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-13 10:25:47', '2019-09-13 10:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040827095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, 'Joan had asked that I reach out to Cathy yesterday because she would like to get Karl started with his preventive care.   I called and left a message, when I didn''t hear back I sent all preventive care emails tagging Joan in them.  I sent a follow up email today asking if she had any questions or needed any assistance. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-13 10:14:18', '2019-09-13 10:14:18'),
