  ('zcrm_1579374000040827090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'called to ask why when she went to use Teladoc did it all of the sudden show that she needed to pay $49 - she asked if there was some sort of policy change and I told her no, but that she receives her service through Sedera and that I could reach out to them on her behalf to see what happened and get it fixed but she said she rather give them a call herself and I gave her their number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-13 09:59:01', '2019-09-13 09:59:01'),
