  ('zcrm_1579374000040827047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Iris called to check and see what would happen if she wants to get her breast implants removed and winds up in the hospital.   I told her that this would be a question geared towards Sedera....I tried to transfer the call but it went to VM, I left a message on Iris'' behalf for a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-13 09:38:43', '2019-09-13 09:38:43'),
