  ('zcrm_1579374000040886018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040511013', 'Autumn Cole', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request after being on the plan 13 days cancellation will be effective 10/1. I will notify Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-13 08:33:17', '2019-09-13 08:33:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040827024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032064118', 'Catherine Broad', NULL, 'Poor Catherine wound up with a painful infection behind her ear a few days ago, had to go to the ER and was scripted out some antibiotics, the doctor told her to come back if her symptoms worsened or if she developed a list of symptoms.  She called in stating that she needed to go back and wasn''t doing well at all and wanted to know what the next steps she needed to take to begin submitting this as a need, due to the fact that the visit a few days ago was already at her IUA amt.  I transferred the line to Priscilla @ Sedera, sent a how to email on opening up a need with Sedera as well as a prescription medication quote form for any further meds.  She was really happy for all of the help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-13 08:07:42', '2019-09-13 08:07:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040886013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085237002', 'Marie Pond', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel Sedera &amp; FTNI Billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-13 08:01:35', '2019-09-13 08:01:35'),
