  ('zcrm_1579374000040844026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029295100', 'Dennis Watkins', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat with Kelly Cheever', 'Visit ID : 547 
Question : I have a client who recently moved to Florida from Canada. He is not a US Citizen but has started the process, to include getting his Green Card. Can we write him? Thanks, Denny Watkins, Affiliate Agent in Florida', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-09-13 07:30:26', '2019-09-13 07:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040878013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'turns out....someone has been using their "insurance" card for all kinds of care- two urgent care bills came back from collections and she was shocked because they weren''t paid.  The collection bill that did came back from planned parenthood I have sent over to Jennifer Chasteen to look into but that was only for $100.  I explained the entire needs process again, spelled it all out to her with two other emails that explain the same thing.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-12 17:08:58', '2019-09-12 17:08:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040878008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039755285', 'Robert Hill', NULL, 'welcome call complete!  he was 3 steps ahead of me and knows the product inside and out!  His girlfriend Sue was also on the line and will be in need of her own coverage come Nov 1- I sent Patti and email that I tagged Analisa in so that Patti can reach out and go through the logistics. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-12 16:11:02', '2019-09-12 16:11:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040878003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Jacquelin called upset because she received a collections bill apparently linked to her annual physical.  I told her to take a picture of or scan what she was looking at, send it into me and that I would forward it to Jennifer Chasteen over at RCI to see what is going on.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-12 16:06:37', '2019-09-12 16:06:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040813038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522149', 'Ruth Lininger', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to remove son from plan.  I will let Sedera know.  No billing adjustment needed since member has another son on plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-12 13:20:26', '2019-09-12 13:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040813033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005980613', 'Mark OConnor', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I have cancelled &amp; refunded Sept pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-12 13:05:43', '2019-09-12 13:05:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040871003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085237002', 'Marie Pond', NULL, 'Ticket was made in regards to her wanting to cancel. I sent the cancellation email with the form for her to fill. Called and left a message saying I sent her the form via email to marie.wrinn@cox.net, I confirmed email address in voicemail that I left. Form is sent. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-12 13:05:35', '2019-09-12 13:05:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040825028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '9-12-19 Called to ask her if she''s been helped with finding best price for MRI in local area.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-12 12:22:29', '2019-09-12 12:22:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040825023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, '9-12-19 Just let Darius know to call Jack to reach out about possible group. Suggested doing list bill since small group and all 1099 people. He will reach out. One of his longest time clients.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-12 12:06:51', '2019-09-12 12:06:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040834023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, 'member called in to inquire about group rates for his business...informed him to gather information about possible group members, then a quote can be constructed for review...waiting on member to call back with info on possible group members.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-12 11:35:50', '2019-09-12 11:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040825013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, 'Jack called in for guidance on how to approach his preventive care visit. I also sent him the 5 steps article. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-12 11:17:32', '2019-09-12 11:17:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040834018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, 'Acct set up charged 9/12. Billing set up to start 9/22. Good to go for 10/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-12 11:12:10', '2019-09-12 11:12:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040825008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, 'Mary called in asking for help finding out if  the facility she wanted to get her mammogram at was in network- her doctor I had found easily, but the address to the women''s center I couldn''t find.  Also Suzanne was saying that she needed a 3D mammogram, I called Leena, she said that a 3D mammogram was covered if medically necessary (and Mary has family hx of breast cancer) that they may need to pay a fee anywhere between $25-$100 because her insurance shows as ACA mandated only services, and that the amount will not be reimbursed.  They were fine with that.  I got the phone number from them and sent it to Leena, she is going to call and ask them for their tax id and see if they are in network.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-12 10:45:29', '2019-09-12 10:45:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040813028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-12 10:20:08', '2019-09-12 10:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040834013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039164151', 'Reid Holtzclaw - Swan', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-12 10:05:50', '2019-09-12 10:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040834008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039601017', 'Peggy Garrett', NULL, 'Already had welcome call from plan that she was on with spouse before he went on Medicare. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-12 10:01:49', '2019-09-12 10:01:49'),
