  ('zcrm_1579374000040806003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005832243', 'Marci Marg', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel and refund September pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-12 07:18:41', '2019-09-12 07:18:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040793018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005653245', 'Michel Abboud', NULL, 'Michel called to update his payment due to Sunny''s email sent.  He didn''t want to fill out the online form so he is going to call in tomorrow when the home office and finance is open. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 17:33:37', '2019-09-11 17:33:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040793013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005832243', 'Marci Marg', NULL, 'Ken called in stating that he thought cancelling Liberty would cancel our services as well.  I explained the entire situation to him (in typical Patti Baron style) and said that it was highly unlikely that that would happen, he said "I didn''t use the services" I replied "but you had access to them." - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 16:42:52', '2019-09-11 16:42:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040793008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509132', 'Brandi Webber', NULL, 'Brandi called in needing a script via text because she was at Walgreens. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 15:43:55', '2019-09-11 15:43:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040793003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031936015', 'Brian Schey', NULL, 'Brian called in at a doctors office picking up meds, and having absolutely no idea of what to do in the situation.  I stayed calm and tried my hardest to explain.  He says that he has a $700 preventive physical bill that he needs to submit and get his money back.  He says he has some other bills as well- not related to his diabetes and asked how he could submit them to Sedera, I told him that this first year there would be no sharing because this is pre x -then he started mocking me irately saying he is in the doctors office now.  I told him that he needs to call redirect.  He was very confused- looking back on the notes below we need to make sure that Redirect gets to him and fast....it sounds like he may have fallen through the cracks with them.  I tried to get a hold of Wendy....I will go ahead and email her now.  sent prescription quote form and how to submit bills to Sedera- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 15:19:12', '2019-09-11 15:19:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040741044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, 'Ticket was made stating:
She has a few questions about what to do for diagnostic exams when they are not covered.
Both me and Kelly Cheever had tried reaching out to her to help with her questions and have no gotten any response back. I will send a general email to her explaining a few things that might be of use. I sent a VERY VERY long email explaining word for word and detail detail on how to go about something that is Diagnostic and Injury/Illness. I also attached the 64+ list of the Preventative Services that are covered by the ACA. There should be no confusion or very little questions asked after my email. I was very thorough Ticket will be closed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-11 14:32:25', '2019-09-11 14:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040741039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617067', 'Robert Picheco', NULL, 'Ticket was made with no information written. Both me and Kelly Cheever have called and left messages a few time over. Going to send a general email seeing what we can help with. Email may be the best way to contact Robert. Ticket will be closed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-11 14:26:39', '2019-09-11 14:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040741034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, 'Ticket was made asking for help with finding a provider for a check up and asking about testing since he has not had anything like that done in along time. Both me and Kelly Cheever have tried calling multiple times and left messages, no call back. So I am sending him an email that explains how to look up providers in the PHCS network off of the MultiPlan website. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-11 14:23:33', '2019-09-11 14:23:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040741029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509132', 'Brandi Webber', NULL, 'Brandi called in and asked if there is any sort of Teladoc that she can use instead of going to the doctor, all she has is a sore throat. I let her know that upon enrolling and during the welcome call with Vanessa she should have registered then. She said she did not register. I let her know that I sent an email that has the registration instructions for her to sign up with Teladoc. She was very very happy that we were able to do that. She mentioned that she is very happy with us and we are always so helpful and really loves us and out product! She was "Jumping with joy", for how happy she is with the help all the time. Thanks us several times over. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-11 13:17:45', '2019-09-11 13:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040741024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617087', 'Veronica Niang', NULL, 'Called into cancel membership. I told her I would send her a cancellation email and to just fill it out and send right back and we will take care of the rest. I went to click send email and she has opted out to receive emails from us. I gave her name and number to Patti to call her and take care of it, since Patti deals with the cancellations and enrollments. She called and did not pick up, Patti left a detailed message on how to cancel and left her phone number as well just in case. She directed her to the website she can use to cancel. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-11 13:14:21', '2019-09-11 13:14:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040741019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111417', 'Dimitri Soris', NULL, 'Called in to ask what he needs to do to schedule an appointment with a dermatologists. He explained what was going on, he has a mole of some sort on his forehead. He said over the last month or so that it has started hurting, growing, and itchy. I let him know that this situation would be something that is diagnostic, injury/illness. So there is no doctor in network and all he has to do is pay out of pocket up until he meets his $1000 IUA. Once he has satisfied that then Sedera takes over and they will negotiate the bill down to a final cost and send a check over to Dimitri to pay the provider. He 100% understood and was perfectly fine with the process. I told him I would send an email that explains how to submit his bills over to Sedera when the time comes. Very happy member with the ease of this process.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-11 13:00:52', '2019-09-11 13:00:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039601017', 'Peggy Garrett', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-11 11:26:47', '2019-09-11 11:26:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039755208', 'Catherine Rouse', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-11 11:22:35', '2019-09-11 11:22:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039780073', 'John O''Connor', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-11 11:10:10', '2019-09-11 11:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039830081', 'Geraldine Gardner', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-11 10:33:01', '2019-10-07 12:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040097022', 'Jaya Prakash', NULL, 'Spoke to member booked her 15 minute welcome call for Thursday, September 12, 2019 at 11:30 a.m. eastern time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-11 10:28:49', '2019-09-11 10:28:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'Angela called in again today stating that she is still hitting a wall when it comes to her daughter getting her vaccinations....I told her that the best course of action is going to be to contact Jennifer over at RCI, tag her in that message, and ask for advice and assistance. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 10:26:40', '2019-09-11 10:26:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'Jaime called in because she wanted to try Teladoc for one of her children that is running a fever.  I transferred her to someone over at Teladoc, told her to call in any script that she get''s so that we can get her a coupon or discount. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 10:21:51', '2019-09-11 10:21:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Member called updated bank account. Processed payment and a $50 reinstatement fee', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-11 10:14:33', '2019-09-11 10:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, 'Julia called back in with the CPT code for a wrist MRI.  I transferred her to Luis over at Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 09:49:53', '2019-09-11 09:49:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040732014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257357', 'Benjamin McDonald', NULL, 'Megan called in because she had a doctors order for an advanced MRI that the doctor wants her to have every 6 months due to a family history of breast cancer.  I transferred her over to Luis @ Sedera- Luis said that he would have someone in the correct department give her a call to find the best price and facility for her.  I also sent her instructions as to how to open up a need with Sedera just in case it is something that they deem sharable. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-11 09:06:50', '2019-09-11 09:06:50'),
