  ('zcrm_1579374000040732003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594106', 'Sharon Carducci', NULL, 'Commissions changed to reflect removing of spouse', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-11 07:44:40', '2019-09-11 07:44:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040707023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039830025', 'Julie Gibson-Clark', NULL, 'I did Julie''s welcome call at 7:30 instead of 6:30 per her request.  Her internet was out at her house but she followed along the best that she could on her cell phone.   She is very eager to start her program! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-10 18:09:00', '2019-09-10 18:09:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040707018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036932155', 'Amy Betancourt', NULL, 'I gave Amy a call at 6:00 for her welcome call- no answer.  left a message, and sent email to reschedule. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-10 16:11:17', '2019-09-10 16:11:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040707013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'called in to get the step by step on submitting a need. sent corresponding email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-10 15:20:41', '2019-09-10 15:20:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040707008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362080', 'David Kimble', NULL, 'Simon''s Uni called to get an understanding as to what his health benefits are.  The woman was very open-minded and sweet.  She asked for Sedera''s phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-10 14:54:02', '2019-09-10 14:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040711008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029375016', 'Jacob Walters', NULL, 'Jake called up and wanted to know if the TDAP shot for him would be covered under his plan. Him and his wife are about to have a baby and their doctor said they needed to get this shot before the baby is born. I was not sure and spoke with Patti about this. With his type of plan he does not have a MEC, which means it would be an out of pocket expense. She spoke with Jake and let him know this. He said he figured so and was fine with it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-10 14:40:13', '2019-09-10 14:40:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040711003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925007', 'Rani Reichow', NULL, 'Rani called in and she just needed help with finding a provider in her area to go and get her yearly Mammogram. She gave me a few places to look up for her if they are in network, they indeed are in network. I sent her a couple lists in regards to the names she provided me. I also sent her an email that explains how to present herself at the front desk upon arrival at her appointment, I attached the 64+ preventative services that are covered by the ACA. And lastly I sent her an email that explains how she submits her bill to Sedera to start a "Need" with them. She was very happy I was able to further assist her more with searching for a provider. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-10 14:10:59', '2019-09-10 14:10:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040643053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010714068', 'Karie Walker', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change for to update her address.  I updated with vendors &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-10 13:36:35', '2019-09-10 13:36:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040707003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, 'welcome call complete,  took awhile to do but that''s ok, she had many many questions for me. sent all educational bills that I could think of, asked Patti to issue two new QR life codes as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-10 13:34:33', '2019-09-10 13:34:33'),
