  ('zcrm_1579374000040643008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019034', 'Cheryl Cunningham', NULL, '9/9/18- member called in wondering why she was still paying for Lib Rx.  I looked thru the notes and Vanessa left VM on 5/18 advising of feasibility of Lib Rx and to contact us.  She never did. I advised her that I could take it off going forward.  Member ok with this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-10 07:29:37', '2019-09-10 07:29:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040643003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011695018', 'Michael Finn', NULL, 'I was notified by Sedera that this member needs to add newborn to their membership.  I asked Thomas @ Sedera to direct any member that had any changes to me in the future.  I also sent Plan Change form to this member to get newborn information.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-10 06:56:25', '2019-09-10 06:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040632018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, 'welcome call complete, Melissa seems a bit scattered and ask that I hold on the line for every line item until she completed it.  She was taking notes, asking questions, she said that she might just use this plan for a colonoscopy, mammogram, and pap smear.....and see how it goes.  she is afraid that she will not be able to qualify for change of life and get back onto actual health insurance.  She thanked me for listening to her vent and we closed the conversation with us both agreeing that she should give this non insurance approach a try. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-09 16:32:03', '2019-09-09 16:32:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040632013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031810039', 'Morgan Adams', NULL, 'Thomas called to cancel his daughters insurance because the whole family is switching insurances- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-09 16:23:32', '2019-09-09 16:23:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040632008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, 'welcome call completed.  Marjorie already was working on the online check off list when I called!  she  still has yet to received either a digital or hard copy of her redirect card- I have reached out to Liset to find out what is going on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-09 14:56:47', '2019-09-09 14:56:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040594053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007168141', 'Bridget Agnew', NULL, 'Updated CC member called in  Charged for Sept pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-09 14:47:36', '2019-09-09 14:47:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040594048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283187', 'Joan Wood', NULL, 'Joan called in and had a few questions about testing.  She has no thyroid and her provider ordered among her Preventative test thyroid bloodwork, I advised that this would be diagnostic and not shareable.  She also wanted to see if the Shingle vacc was covered and I told her yes.  Also wanted to see if her Bone Density would be covered, as she is only 56 it would not be.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-09 14:22:48', '2019-09-09 14:22:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040633003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, '9-9-19 Called to see if there are any cheaper options but she''s 62, so I told her no. She has the absolute best possible option for her age.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-09 13:42:44', '2019-09-09 13:42:44'),
