  ('zcrm_1579374000040581003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031189195', 'Clay Rice', NULL, 'Met with Clay...very interested in plan with Mpowering Benefits....need to discuss it directly with wife....Looking at providing Redirect(Provider Directed or Partially Self-Directed Plan)...Price is fine with him...Client + Spouse, 3 children...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-09 07:43:48', '2019-09-09 07:43:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040538013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'Jacqueline called in sounding pretty sick and needing some assistance with coupons for meds she needs to pick up.  She had them all filled at CVS...which didn''t turn out to be the best price, but she chose to get them filled anyway because she was feeling so ill.  All coupons sent to her via text.   I am sending her another script quote form to fill out before she gets anything filled next time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-06 18:10:26', '2019-09-06 18:10:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040538008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007168141', 'Bridget Agnew', NULL, 'Bridget called due to receiving an email from finance...she was calling to update her credit card info...I sent her the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-06 16:37:49', '2019-09-06 16:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040521018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '9-6-19 Robert is 58 almost 59 and Kathleen 57. They don''t need this until maybe Jan 1st or Aug. 1 2020. Non smoker, non drinker. He has sleep apnea handled with mouth gaurd. She has high blood pressure, high cholesterol and changed diet recently so may be off meds for cholesterol, but still on for high blood pressure. Understands pre-x clause. Understands concept and even open to going elsewhere if Cleveland Clinic is too difficult to work with. Provider Directed with Redirect is best option for them $1500/ $625.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-06 16:02:41', '2019-09-06 16:02:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040538003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039755139', 'Shelley Scipione', NULL, 'welcome call complete!  Used Wendy''s rough draft script and worked well.  Shelley is super excited about this plan and was happy to have some time to ask all of her questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-06 13:21:10', '2019-09-06 13:21:10'),
