  ('zcrm_1579374000040528003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'finalized problem with billing regarding lab issues....JKach authorized RCI to pay the remainder of the $50.00 patient responsibility ...emailed sent to Jennifer Chasteen authorizing the $50.00 payment.  Spoke to client and informed her everything will be covered and she should not pay any balances sent to her....instructed client to contact us if any additional bills are received from Quest Labs.  closing ticket on this issue.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-06 10:14:54', '2019-09-06 10:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040521003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040511013', 'Autumn Cole', NULL, 'Acct set up fee and September payment processed. Future payments set up', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-06 09:20:33', '2019-09-06 09:20:33'),
