  ('zcrm_1579374000040513003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819433', 'Kaimey Ela', NULL, 'Scott called in and I spoke to him twice confused re:change over to RCI.  I let him know that they were changed last year to RCI sent him PDF copy of card and ordered new cards sent.  Has Doc appt today for children.  told him to present RCI card', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-06 07:48:29', '2019-09-06 07:48:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040492003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Spoke to client Melissa about issue regarding lab bills...informed client that I only saw that patient responsibility was $50.00....client was really upset and I tried to calm her concerns.  Informed client not to pay anything until further research can be conducted between bills she received from Quest and RCI.  Requested client to scan in bill she received and send it to me directly for research purposes.  Client will scan in bill and send to my corporate e-mail....waiting on client to send me documents and I will research issue with bill and contact RCI regarding this issue....will continue to work on this issue with Kelly Cheever...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-09-05 18:56:12', '2019-09-05 18:56:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028390001', 'Chyla Walsh', NULL, 'sent guidelines over to Chyla and instructions on how to search for pregnancy and maternity key words.  Tomorrow she and her partner are going to call Sedera to ask questions and gain some footing.  I also sent a link and instructions as to how to open up a need and submit bills to Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 18:23:52', '2019-09-05 18:23:52'),
