  ('zcrm_1579374000040463043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Guy called Melissa to go over her EOB from RCI , Melissa said that the bill that she was holding showed that she owed $400, Guy asked Melissa to send us the bill so that he could look over it.  It may be that quest is double billing- because all that he can see form the EOB sent is that she merely owes $50 and that is due to a test that is no longer considered "preventive". - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 17:10:12', '2019-09-05 17:10:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, 'Belinda called in wondering why part of her mammogram wasn''t covered by ASI- I transferred her directly to Coreen at ASI to answer that for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 16:54:13', '2019-09-05 16:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'Maureen called in to state that the original facility that she had an appointment with for a mammogram (see note below) told her that they didn''t accept her insurance...so she told them never mind...went home and called Multi Plan...she asked for a list of facilities that she could go to for this and it was sent to her.  The facility WAS on the list but she decided not to go back fearing that there may be some problems and booked another appointment at a different facility.  She wanted us to be aware that it happened...a heads up that it can be a possibility for others.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 16:29:38', '2019-09-05 16:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990335', 'Charles Grigsby', NULL, 'Shirley called in with many questions surrounding "Scott''s"  back/nerve issues- the doctor is recommending a lamenoctomy (meaning to clean out around where the nerve is pinched)she wanted to know about the 2nd MD process, I told her that I would send her that info along with how to open up a need with Sedera and Sedera video''s - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 16:02:52', '2019-09-05 16:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'I missed her call- called her back and left a message on her machine. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 15:35:20', '2019-09-05 15:35:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Melissa called in pretty upset that she received another bill from Quest  after she say''s Shelley told her that it would be taken care of 6 months ago (see note below) I tried to transfer the call to Jennifer Chasteen but it went to voicemail.  I told Melissa that I left a message with Jennifer on her behalf.  I also told her that I would be reaching out to Shelley and  Jennifer to help shed some insight as to what is going on.  Melissa thanked me for all of the help and I told her that I would get back to her with any new info about the status of this bill. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 15:31:36', '2019-09-05 15:31:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038730169', 'Emily LeMasters', NULL, 'sent welcome call scheduler, I just completed speaking with her Dad Eric, he was pretty excited that we were doing this(he didn''t expect a separate call) now that she''s off and doing "adult" things.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 14:51:00', '2019-09-05 14:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040463008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '2nd welcome call went great,  the only thing that Eric wanted more concrete info was was 2nd MD- I told him that I would send him along what I could find. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 14:26:14', '2019-09-05 14:26:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040466023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038086', 'Mary Ellen Richardson', NULL, 'I received email form RCI this member submitted cancellation to them wanted to cancel eff 11/1 when she goes on Medicare.  I contacted member and explained that all cancellations go through us.  Sent her link to fill out and advised her to submit around 10/10.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-05 14:17:56', '2019-09-05 14:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040484003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006366101', 'Laurie Adams', NULL, 'Looked through all records, no requests to cancel ever.
I sent a detailed member explaining we won''t be able to honor a back-dated cancellation and all we will do is a 3 month refund- 150$.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-05 12:38:19', '2019-09-05 12:38:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040466018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040511013', 'Autumn Cole', NULL, 'Wendy called in about this member near COB on Fri before holiday weekend to ask about this referral from another Sedera employer group re:Cobra.  Told her this was too late for a 9/1 start.  She called back and told me that Sedera would put her on eff 9/1 and that she would go in Self Directed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-05 12:25:03', '2019-09-05 12:25:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040466013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011007', 'Ashley Kidder', NULL, 'Per Kelly C this member called in and was annoyed that she got charged after she cancelled.  We did not receive any cancellation from her.  Likely only cancelled LHS.  I left VM and will send out cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-05 10:42:01', '2019-09-05 10:42:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040473003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011007', 'Ashley Kidder', NULL, 'called in upset because she says she cancelled with us last month and is still being charged. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 09:49:50', '2019-09-05 09:49:50'),
