  ('zcrm_1579374000040452003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005980613', 'Mark OConnor', NULL, 'called to cancel because he just cancelled Liberty.  Sent him the form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-05 09:00:34', '2019-09-05 09:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040419011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280148', 'Roland Reed', NULL, 'Kari called in regarding getting blood work done for her annual physical.  Gave her re-direct''s number and instructions', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-09-05 08:05:05', '2019-09-05 08:05:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040439008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005223005', 'Barbara Savastano', NULL, 'Cancelled billing as of 9/30.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-05 08:03:31', '2019-09-05 08:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040439003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'Spoke to member on 9/4 re: waiver for Childrens college.  Said she went into college to submit.  She advised third party vendor that her son did same thing last year and it was accepted.  vendor advised her that they were being "audited" this year so not the same.  I advised her that Sedera was not a "ministry" nor a 501 (c) (3) nonprofit.  I advised her that sedera was a privately held for-profit corp, therefore does not disclose and financials.  She to furnish vendor with all this information.  She was told by vendor that they would be given a semester to comply.  She asked if there was anything further that Sedera was coming out with.  I advised no.  My suggestion to her was if this did not work just enroll son on ACA until he finises school next year.  he is 22 and it would be affordable since CO no longer has ST options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-05 07:26:09', '2019-09-05 07:26:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040424033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, 'Julia called in because she hurt her wrist somehow and all of the physical therapy treatments with needling, and red light aren''t helping.  She spoke to a doctor via Teladoc this evening and he guessed that it may be a chip in the bone.  So she wanted to know if we could find the best priced facility in her area for the xray.  I told her that she would need to see an actual doctor first so that they could give her a script for the procedure and then when she gets that CPT code that is attached to it, she will be able to call Sedera and that they will be able to find the best price in her area for her.  I went over opening up a need, I sent that email along to her, as well as the Sedera videos. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-04 18:56:43', '2019-09-04 18:56:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040432011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '9-4-19 She''s ready to go to wellness visit and none of the All Valley Women''s Care drs. are in the PHCS network. Her PCP is in network but she''s not excited to see him for her pap. She''s going to decide if they want to switch to Redirect for extra $69 a month, or pay cash for visit herself or go to PCP. She will ponder and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-04 16:58:28', '2019-09-04 16:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040424028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'I apologized for the misinformation earlier with this family and asked that the call anytime so that we can finish the welcome call, or if they are more comfortable rescheduling online I sent them a scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-04 16:27:14', '2019-09-04 16:27:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040424023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018699825', 'Erick Sanchez Barrita', NULL, 'Erick called back so happy that he finally got a breakthrough at the clinic he wanted to go to and got an appointment for tomorrow!!! He thanked me for always being there to answer his questions today and walk him through it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-04 16:24:54', '2019-09-04 16:24:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040424018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018699825', 'Erick Sanchez Barrita', NULL, 'I have contacted the facility that Erick would like to go to because he seems very overwhelmed at the process.  I tagged him in the thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-04 16:10:03', '2019-09-04 16:10:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040432003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162382', 'Juan Rosas', NULL, '9-4-19 Celeste called bc $290 of Juan''s wellness visit was not shared. It was in fact because of some stomach issues. Told her it''s her responsibility to pay for that part since it''s not exceeding their $1000 IUA. She understood. Also gave her Concierge phone number to call in the future. She was super nice and satisfied.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-04 15:57:28', '2019-09-04 15:57:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040424013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018699825', 'Erick Sanchez Barrita', NULL, 'Erick called waiting for Kelly F to send him a list of doctors in network.  I told him that I would be happy to help him instead.  I guided him through the process of searching and finding a doctor in network, I sent him all email templates relating to preventive care.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-04 15:11:58', '2019-09-04 15:11:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040424008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038225', 'Edward Gerber', NULL, 'called in for help finding his doctor on the plan so that he can go in for his annual and get a refill on his blood pressure meds.  found  DR Matthew Claussen- also sent him a script, a provider network link and a script request form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-04 14:46:27', '2019-09-04 14:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040424003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'attempted to go over welcome call with Eric and Stephanie- they were under the impression that they would never have to pay to see a doctor, ever again, through this plan.  Eric asked me "what happens when we want to see a doctor for our cold and not Teladoc?  How much is it going to cost?" I told him that he would be out of pocket up to his IUA- that''s when they asked to cancel.  called into Wendy twice- also called into Patti (internet issues). - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-04 13:11:40', '2019-09-04 13:11:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040419003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757110', 'Brandon Lowitz', NULL, 'PB-Brandon called in and wanted to know about a blood draw that was in relation to an ER/overnight hospital stay that he had due to chest pains.  I directed him to speak with Sedera to open a need.  He advised that he has not paid any of his $1500 IUA.  I told him that he would have to pay that to the hospital and that then Sedera would start negotiating all other bills.  Phone was cutting in and out having a hard time hearing him prior to getting cut off altogether.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-09-04 12:09:44', '2019-09-04 12:10:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040390003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001669107', 'Fawn Gilmore Kraut', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-09-04 09:40:23', '2019-09-04 09:40:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040385003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, 'member called in for instructions on preventative care services.  Sent emails.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-09-04 09:08:47', '2019-09-04 09:08:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040371003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111268', 'Kristie Toothman', NULL, 'Tara called in to let me know that this employee left their employ 7/1.  Told me she had cancelled w/ ASi I will amke sure she is cancelled w/ 
Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-04 08:00:10', '2019-09-04 08:00:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040364003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012906002', 'Jana Shumway', NULL, 'September declined as well. Multiple attempts for communication - no response. Cancelling.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-09-04 07:25:22', '2019-09-04 07:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, 'I helped explain preventative care to him for his daughters annual and sent all corresponding emails.  I did a doctors search with him and sent him the list via email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 18:51:28', '2019-09-03 18:51:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939079', 'Patricia Mitchell', NULL, 'Patricia originally called to speak to Guy about a possible torn hamstring that is bothering her.  She asked if I could help her out instead.  She listed all questions...I told her that I could answer them all for her.  Went over the needs process, I told her that she would need to have a doctor script out any sort of testing and that she could relay the CPT code or codes to Sedera and they could find the best facility/cost for those tests.  I went over 2nd MD, I sent corresponding email.  I went over the importance of keeping Sedera in the loop.  She was happy for the help, she''s got it down pretty well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 17:21:33', '2019-09-03 17:21:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963048', 'Drostan Baker', NULL, '9-3-19 Drostan called to inquire about pricing if he pays for a new employee using PSDHC or DPC through another local DPC, not his of course. He''s thinking of paying for parent/child or entire family via stipend or list bill. Employee is 26 and husband around 27, baby is an infant. He will let me know what he chooses.  PSDHC EC $1500/$405 or EF $552. DPC will be similar in cost once add in DPC monthly cost as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-03 17:03:19', '2019-09-03 17:04:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216192', 'Jeffrey Ford', NULL, 'Jeffery called with many questions- from what happens in an emergency, or what happens if we are diagnosed with cancer.  Then he asked if his son who will turn 2 on Sept 7 can go for his annual pediatrician visit and vax- I told him that it would be fine, but that we ask our new members to hold out for the "bigger ticketed items" such as colonoscopy for 3 months.  I did a provider lookup for him and sent all emails pertaining to preventative care plus a welcome call scheduler just in case he misplaced the Sedera email pack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 16:12:35', '2019-09-03 16:12:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034221050', 'Lily Williams', NULL, 'called to see if there was a discount on the shingles vax for being a member with us...I told her that if she had a script from a doctor I could give her a coupon that would discount the vaccine- but then she would need to bring it to her doctor to receive the vax.  I told her that the cheapest price I could find for her was $151 on goodrx, then she told me that she had found a cash price of $170, that she would just stick with that and it would be less hassle. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 15:48:30', '2019-09-03 15:48:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737144', 'Catherine Rongey', NULL, '9-3-19 Shelley Scipione and Tonya Dueri both referred Cathy to me. Shelley mentioned it while hiking and Tonya gave her my contact information. So, she''s deciding to give it to Tonya. Cathy''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Wants an Oct. 1st start date. Applying now. Husband is teacher and benefits is too expensive to add her. Household income is $85000 even while she''s on unemployment bc of husband''s income. Her income now is $500 weekly for unemployment. She''s joining the PSDHC now for $278/$1500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-03 15:42:35', '2019-09-03 15:42:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529238', 'Mark Hanna', NULL, 'Mark called to request an Apex card with his wife''s name rather than his. - I explained that it will only come in the primary members name- he asked how the front desk would know what to do and I explained ( sending educational emails as well) he also said that he wondered where his registration email  for his QR life code is...I told him that it usually takes 24 hours...he replied and said he had only submitted it a few hours ago and he would call us and let us know if he needed added assistance with this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 14:25:49', '2019-09-03 14:25:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351098', 'Teresa Brachle', NULL, 'Andrew called in because his daughter had er bills due to a dog bite.  he was pretty anxious- I transferred the line to Natalie at Sedera and sent the "how-to" email on opening up a need with Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 13:19:57', '2019-09-03 13:19:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233082', 'Daniel Wisdom', NULL, 'Daniel says that he has been sitting on some bills for awhile- one preventive for his son, one ER visit for his daughter, and one due to his own back injury.  He said that only the ER bill was from within the last 6 mo- I told him to just open up a need for his daughter and speak to his needs coordinator about the back injury bill to gain some insight on how to proceed.  I told told him to send the preventive bill to ASI.  Sent how to submit bills to Sedera email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 13:17:18', '2019-09-03 13:17:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529830', 'Joseph Lopez', NULL, 'spoke with Joseph he is a bit confused about his plan, he didn''t like the fact that back office betties couldn''t tell him that he needed to call Redirect instead.  I apologized for the confusion, stressed the need for a welcome call- he told me that he was sorry he hadn''t scheduled one yet and get to that as soon as possible.  I told him that I would reach out to redirect on his behalf to have someone call him asap.  I told him that as soon as he hears from them and gets things explained and as soon as he completes his welcome call he will feel much more grounded.  sent message via redirect extra help to have someone contact Joseph. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 13:10:51', '2019-09-03 13:10:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822208', 'Natty Bandasak', NULL, 'called to get info about last years taxes- I told him that Sunny would give him a call back within the next 24 hrs. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-09-03 12:43:31', '2019-09-03 12:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040337003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459064', 'Lisa DeGan', NULL, '9-3-19 Wants dental insurance for family of 4. No dental issues, just want preventative covered. She will talk with new recommended dentist to see who they accept in network and then we''ll see if price is worth it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-09-03 11:00:47', '2019-09-03 11:00:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040310003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006793353', 'Rylan McNamara', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation, however was not being billed. unclear on how we acquired this member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-09-03 06:49:10', '2019-09-03 06:56:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040293002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 540 
Question : How do I find if an imaging center is in my network?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-09-02 17:21:14', '2019-09-02 17:21:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040260018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962935', 'Sherri Kikly', NULL, 'Guy has tried getting a hold of Sherri Kikly  multiple times and has left multiple voicemails trying to help her understand her plan better but with no reply. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-30 16:55:53', '2019-08-30 16:55:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040260013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, 'I tried calling both numbers associated with JoAnna''s account and they both sounded answered and then dropped.  I wrote her an email to let her know about the paper check, when it was sent and the number associated with it.  I told her to contact us if there were any discrepancies or if she hasn''t received it mid to end of next week. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-30 16:49:29', '2019-08-30 16:49:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040260008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, 'JoAnna says that her doctor''s office has yet to receive any checks from HMA- she has already paid the doctors bills in full because they all were on their way to collections.  It has now been a year since her girls first had their annual exams and JoAnna is fearful to take them to a preventive visit ever again because she doesn''t know if it will turn out to be out of pocket again- even after everything was coded as preventive and even after making sure she went in network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-30 16:49:16', '2019-08-30 16:49:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040260003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'I spent an hour calling around the doctor and facilities in this case- very shady and lazy company.  You can not speak with the billing department because it is a TPA- It is up to the doctors office themselves to say what is and what isn''t accepted.  It turned out that the doctor''s office is aware that the the PA Jennifer is showing as in the network but they don''t accept this coverage any longer because it doesn''t cover most services.  I also found out that this is a rapidly growing DPC type operation.  I explained to Steven what happened and we found an alternate doctor in network for them.  He appreciated all of the help, the front staff had spoken so poorly to his wife that she came home crying and humiliated (they are very unhappy at the doctors office) . All set. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-30 16:12:11', '2019-08-30 16:12:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040241013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040511013', 'Autumn Cole', NULL, '8-30-19 Healthy, no tobacco, meds bc and 2 anti-depressants. Goes to dr. 2-3 x per year. Referred by her former employer Exodus Road. She just got laid off and membership with Select is ending Aug. 31st. Switching to Access for Sept. 1st. Already a Sedera member so just switching to new Guidelines. Spoke with Luke and this is how they handle keeping members on past when their employment ends. They no longer offer a Cobra option. Autumn is 28.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-30 15:13:45', '2019-08-30 15:13:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040257003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377153', 'William Moomaw', NULL, '"Mat" as he said is his name, even though the profile is under William, called in and said he is a newer member and wanted to figure out who to call and what to do. He stated that he hurt his back and just wanted to know how to go about what happened. I told him that he has Redirect so they are ALWAYS going to be his first point of contact. He repeated their phone number to me to make sure and he does have to correct number. He is calling them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-30 14:03:12', '2019-08-30 14:03:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040242008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508001', 'Emily Essig', NULL, 'Refunded September payment. Cancelling as of 9/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-30 12:43:39', '2019-08-30 12:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040241008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796049', 'Andrew Sutton', NULL, 'Andy called in because his daughter needed stitches and wound up in the ER- with a bill to the tune of a little over $1500 - I told him how to submit bills to Sedera, as well as gave him an overview of the plan again because he was a little confused.  I sent all corresponding emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-30 10:21:58', '2019-08-30 10:21:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040246003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'Was notified late afternoon on 8/29 that Wendy &amp; this member were trying to get Tobacco surcharge removed since end of June.  Told that Sedera was issuing a credit for July &amp; Aug.  Per Rod we will issue a check for Sept and when we receive credit on Sept invoice we will then cut check for remaining $150. I adjusted MCS going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-30 10:00:27', '2019-08-30 10:00:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039419008', 'Dean Sawyer', NULL, 'Called member and there was one number missing from the bank account number that they initially put through the click funnel. Processed payment and account set up. Voided late fee as it is first time and it was a number off. Should be ok for a 9/1 start.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-30 09:26:45', '2019-08-30 09:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040241003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'Angela called in with questions surrounding her daughters vaccine visit to the doctor- we had already gone over a lot of this during the welcome call last week, but she is new and a bit uncertain, and that''s ok.  I went over protocol more than once because her phone kept cutting out- there is a medication that her daughter will need and she couldn''t tell me the name or details on it so I told her that someone will help her and be here until 9:00 est- but that if she couldn''t get a hold of us later it is due to the storm affecting fl.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-30 08:57:36', '2019-08-30 08:57:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040216013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529351', 'Rebecca Stirling', NULL, 'A doctor''s office called in to get Rebecca''s plan info for a well women''s visit.  I told the person that Rebecca has Redirect health and that she needed to call them if she would like to make a well women''s visit.  I gave the person Redirect''s phone number and instructed her that when she calls Rebecca back to tell her that she needs to call redirect. I am also going to send Rebecca an email concerning this. - KC (Kauai Med Clinic 800-335-0499)', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 18:54:39', '2019-08-29 18:54:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040216008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592249', 'Gregory Meell', NULL, 'Gregory called in to ask what to do for a wart that has started growing under his nail.   I told him that there wasn''t any network for illness or injury- to make sure he asks for a detailed medical receipt along with the cash receipt- to give Sedera if he thinks that this medical need will go over his IUA.  We then talked about how he needs to send us his colonoscopy bills.  Turns out that there was blood found in his stool but the doctor himself didn''t think much of it and told Greg that he has an amazingly healthy colon.  So I told him to speak with his doctors office and ask then if they could submit the bills to RCI with preventive coding.  I told him that if not, he will only need to pay for his IUA and submit this to Sedera.  I gave him many emails going over everything we talked about, I also gave him a an overview of his plan as requested.   I sent him all of Jennifer Chasteen''s info (RCI) just in case the doctor''s office re codes as preventive. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 17:19:12', '2019-08-29 17:19:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309116', 'James Maynard', NULL, '8-29-19 Courtney is 41, husband 48, kids 3 and 12. She just got laid off. They''ve done Medishare in the past and know it works. Her DPC Dr. recommended Sedera and they''re excited to set it up. Happy with price at $1500/$339 for Parent/Child and $501 for Family plus the $190 they pay to DPC. She just tweaked her knee and is choosing to stay on Cobra until it''s dealt with. Might possibly need surgery. Will add herself once it''s healed. We are doing her enrollment next Tuesday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-29 16:02:25', '2019-08-29 16:02:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040173055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006793353', 'Rylan McNamara', NULL, 'Member ''s mother called in to let us know that they would probably be cancelling.  I sent out the cancellation request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-29 11:52:42', '2019-08-29 11:52:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040154013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039419008', 'Dean Sawyer', NULL, 'Called and left message, texted message and emailed message....re: possible no coverage due non-payment from banking information provided.  Waiting on return phone call from client.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-08-29 11:51:30', '2019-08-29 11:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040180028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268087', 'Jason DePaola', NULL, 'eager member calling in about welcome packet and wondering if a derm visit was preventive.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 11:13:10', '2019-08-29 11:13:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040180023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674456', 'Kevin Moyer', NULL, 'Kevin called in because he is scheduled to have hip replacement surgery done, and the hospital told him today that he would have to come up with the cash price of $14,000 before they did the procedure and he needs help.  I transferred the line to Maddy at Sedera, she told me that his needs coordinator wasn''t in the office today but that they would figure out who he would be reassigned to.  She asked that I tell Kevin to call member services back in 10 minutes- he told me that he would. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 11:12:39', '2019-08-29 11:12:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040173050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522064', 'Anne Kubitschek', NULL, 'Per it is this members intention to cancel also we did not receives Sept Pmt.  I have cancelled Redirect &amp; Sedera.  Sunny cancelled billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-29 10:54:27', '2019-08-29 10:54:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040173045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522064', 'Anne Kubitschek', NULL, 'Tracking #9005317
Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 8/29/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-29 10:43:33', '2019-08-29 10:43:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040180018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Linda called in to ask to make sure that she is in the DPC plan (she is in group without MEC, special coverage, if you need more info ask Patti) and to make sure that she is in compliance with all of the ACA mandated services.  After speaking with Patti, I told Linda that there are a handful of states that are individually mandating that this would be a requirement- but as far as Pennsylvania is concerned this is not a requirement as of yet.   I told her that she would just need to keep her eyes out for this change in her state to know whether or not they need to reevaluate their plan to add the MEC back on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 09:55:39', '2019-08-29 09:55:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040188003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039164151', 'Reid Holtzclaw - Swan', NULL, '4TH QR CODE = H0ZTB', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-08-29 09:45:52', '2019-08-29 09:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040173037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919141', 'Damien Petta', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel RCI, Sedera &amp; billing in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-29 09:31:10', '2019-08-29 09:31:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040173032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636855', 'Paula Moore', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel subscription.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-29 09:24:42', '2019-08-29 09:24:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040180013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636855', 'Paula Moore', NULL, 'called because she was having a hard time finding the form I sent her- it was in her spam. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 09:18:06', '2019-08-29 09:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040173027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040112001', 'Michael Pray', NULL, 'Set up one time billing.  Member to be part of List Bill to Employer going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-29 08:58:14', '2019-08-29 08:58:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040180008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636855', 'Paula Moore', NULL, 'called in to cancel- sent form.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 08:44:32', '2019-08-29 08:44:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040180003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002568035', 'Julie Tokar', NULL, 'Called in to be reminded of what her benefits were.  Went over the whole list.  Doesn''t know if she will cancel or not but I sent her the cancellation form just in case. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-29 08:42:16', '2019-08-29 08:42:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040177003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000316', 'Symone Sandquist', NULL, 'Kthy from the Holy Trinity Lutheran Church updated the bank account from which Simone''s monthly payment comes out of. FTNI updated.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-29 08:28:19', '2019-08-29 08:28:19'),
