  ('zcrm_1579374000040173008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280118', 'Michael Lazanis', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request  after 1 month on the plan.  Reason Pre Ex that would not be covered.  Unsure weather he would be able to get on spouses plan. Sedera &amp; Redirect cancelled.  Group given a credit on next months invoice.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-29 07:34:39', '2019-08-29 07:44:22'),
