  ('zcrm_1579374000040106018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Jacqueline rang in right after she got off of the phone with Teladoc- she was diagnosed with strep throat and scripted out antibiotics- but she didn''t grab the info.  She is calling Teladoc back for the details and will give me a call back so that I can get her a coupon.  Jacque did end up calling me back after 9 and we figured out her meds together and sent her a coupon - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-28 18:28:06', '2019-08-28 19:17:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040106013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553143', 'Craig Celentano', NULL, 'Mary called in a bit short.  She said that they are going to cancel Liberty so are going to cancel our services as well.  I think that there is some confusion because of the age but I told that I would send an online cancellation form for her to fill out and submit.  She said that she will see how that goes because sometimes they don''t get internet.  I am going to message Sunny and Patti to just cancel them. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-28 16:35:57', '2019-08-28 16:35:57'),
