  ('zcrm_1579374000040127018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040112001', 'Michael Pray', NULL, 'Enrolled Michael yesterday with much confusion.  He did not have his children''s SS# and said he would get them and go back into the enrollment platform and add.  Patti alerted me today (Wednesday) the SS# numbers were only temporary number and we need the real SS# numbers provided asap to process.  Aso Michael did not enter any credit card information.  I called him today and told him time was of the essence and he agreed to complete the missing information today.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-08-28 12:38:13', '2019-08-28 12:38:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040121016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322295', 'Phillip Aronoff', NULL, 'Phillip called in to change his email address, and he also wanted to see if he could change his IUA to lower some costs for him. Due to the fact he started a new job and his monthly income is going to less than what he was making before, so he wanted to change his IUA or lower some costs of some sort. I put him through to Patti who takes care of this type of situation. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-28 12:20:41', '2019-08-28 12:20:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040127013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004971047', 'Jeff Myers', NULL, 'September payment processed', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-28 12:18:01', '2019-08-28 12:18:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040121011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522001', 'Michael Higgins', NULL, 'Lisa called in and just wanted to make sure that she was doing the right thing and just needed a little refresher with how Injury/Illness works and who to get in contact with and what not. I let her know what her IUA is and that she presents herself as a cash pay patient. I let her know to never pay more than her $1500 IUA and to get in contact with Sedera to let them know what is going on and to keep all her statements and receipts that she gets when she is paying toward her IUA and toward this one need. She understood and I gave her Sedera''s phone number to let them know what is going on and they can help guide her the rest of the way. I will also send out an email that explains how to submit the bills over to Sedera. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-28 12:13:21', '2019-08-28 12:13:21'),
