  ('zcrm_1579374000040121003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737053', 'Angelina Kalianda', NULL, '8-28-19 Angelina is enrolling now for the SDHC. She chose Self Directed bc husband can do wellness visit in Spain and she may just wait for hers in case she gets a new job with benefits within the next year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-28 11:15:43', '2019-08-28 11:29:54'),
