  ('zcrm_1579374000040109003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040097091', 'Ken Zarn', NULL, 'This member is set up for a one time draft of the Set up Fee &amp; MCS.  List bill to be set up going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-28 09:56:40', '2019-08-28 09:56:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040106008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, 'Deb called in wanting to get the name of an eye doctor in her area, but didn''t know where to start.  I told her that for a general eye exam that is something she would have to find out on her own but that healthgrades.com would make a good start! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-28 09:50:33', '2019-08-28 09:50:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040106003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, 'Nancy called in worried that ASI would be closed during the hours she needs to go to her well women''s visit- I told her that I was going to send  her a script that she can use so that she can have the doctor''s office call ahead to confirm her benefits so that she doesn''t have to worry about ASI being closed.  I also sent her the 5 tips to avoid extra cost''s with your preventive care checkup.  She was happy to find out that MPowering Has two very nice concierge that can help her! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-28 09:39:33', '2019-08-28 09:39:33'),
