  ('zcrm_1579374000040082003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, 'Received email from ASi that they had received returned mail for this member.  I emailed and got updated address.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-28 07:29:29', '2019-08-28 07:29:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040076026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962935', 'Sherri Kikly', NULL, 'Sherri called in again...about an hour after her first call.  Still very wound up and confused.  She said that she did what I told her and that Redirect still was silent.  She started going over everything that she doesn''t have yet- she mentioned Teladoc and I asked if I could transfer her to someone there that can help her set up her account. Before we ended the call I told her that she should be hearing from someone because I reached out to David Slepak at Redirect. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-27 18:25:46', '2019-08-27 18:25:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040076021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280148', 'Roland Reed', NULL, 'Roland called to see if his wife could set up her own health profile, I told him that the HRA was just for him- I also told him him that they each had a separate QR life code- but he was talking his redirect health profile on Spruce.  I told him that he would have to call the 888 number on his card, and I let him know about the extrahelp page if ever he feels they need it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-27 17:13:47', '2019-08-27 17:13:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040076013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962935', 'Sherri Kikly', NULL, 'Sherri called in a bit...cranky. She said that she demanded to know how to use her plan that she has been paying for, for almost a year.  So, very sweetly told her that I would go over it all with her- right out the gate as I was going over what services she would call us for, I thought she had said something, I asked and she snapped at me and said "I didn''t say nothin'' you''re the one that is doing all of the talking"  then in the middle of me going over our prescription service "that would be NICE, but I need to find a doctor first, I don''t even know how to do that!"  I told her that for all calls medical she needs to call the 888 number on her card, she quickly said "ok, bye" and I asked her to hold on one more minute so that I could give her a good tip with Redirect.  I told her to go to the extrahelp page to get a hold of management the fastest. She said ok, and hung up on me. sent to Dave Slepak- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-27 16:39:10', '2019-08-27 18:46:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040076008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000316', 'Symone Sandquist', NULL, '"Kathy" from a Lutheran Church called inquiring about our banking info- I tried to transfer the call to Sunny- but emailed her instead with Kathy''s info. (I guess Symone works at the church) - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-27 14:36:34', '2019-08-27 14:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040076003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, 'I spoke with Salena- she gave a green light on the CPT code that Beth gave us- but said to make doubly sure that it will be covered Beth should request the ICD10 code as well- because that is what determines if it is being billed preventive or diagnostic.  I tried giving Beth a call to let her know the news but it went to a full voicemail.  I will email her the latest. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-27 14:12:56', '2019-08-27 14:12:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040052026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc emailed me this afternoon and said that he is getting billed for his lab work over at LabCorp for his preventative check up. He also stated that his bill got rejected by ASI and wants to know why. John looked at the 2 attachments that Marc sent and it looks like there were sent to the wrong address. I called ASI to see if they have any record of these bills on file. I spoke with Marcella and she said there is nothing that they have, so it was not rejected by ASI it was rejected by LabCorp. Marcella said she needs to have the actual medical bill with the CPT diagnostic codes on the. I emailed Marc all of this info and most importantly he needs to get in touch with this provider and get the bills with the CPT codes, otherwise ASI will not be able to help. I let him know that once he gets those bill to send it over to www.asibenefits.com or to me and I can get them over to someone at ASI on his behalf, I told him it would much more beneficial and less confusion and less time to be taken up. Waiting for his response. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-27 13:41:36', '2019-08-27 13:41:36'),
