  ('zcrm_1579374000040052021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Called into make sure that her payment method was updated when she filled out the form on Aug 23rd, had Patti double check and everything is updated and she is good to go. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-27 11:23:40', '2019-08-27 11:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040052016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, 'Marjorie called in and was a little bit worried that she has not gotten any of the emails that Wendy told her she should be getting. The Sedera, Redirect, and one from us MPowering Benefits. I asked Patti and she talked with John about it and said that she should be getting them by the 1st of the month, as in September 1st. She was fine with that, she just didn''t want to be missed out on anything. If she doesn''t get them by the 3rd or 4th she will call back in to figure it out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-27 11:15:22', '2019-08-27 11:15:22'),
