  ('zcrm_1579374000040052011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, 'Nancy called in and just wanted to make sure of a few things that would be covered or not as preventative. Chest Xray, EKG, and spirometry, I let her know that those 3 things would not be covered or part of her preventative testing. She was perfectly fine with those items not being covered, she stated she feel like she needed them anyway. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-27 09:24:17', '2019-08-27 09:24:17'),
