  ('zcrm_1579374000040032028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'Dania made up an official ASI coverage letter for Patricia''s kids to give their college. I sent it to Patricia and asked that she let us know how it goes.  I have also added it here as an attachment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-26 18:10:50', '2019-08-26 18:10:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040032023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, 'to update my earlier note- I spoke to Guy about this and he said that the CPT code of the test Beth''s Dr wants her to have is diagnostic- because it shows that it is in essence that there is a previous diagnosis attached to it.  I emailed her all that info as well as sent her "how to submit bills to Sedrea" email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-26 16:28:59', '2019-08-26 16:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040032018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529351', 'Rebecca Stirling', NULL, 'was trying to call Redirect and she called into us mistakenly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-26 16:13:02', '2019-08-26 16:13:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040033008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Spoke with Wendy and everything is fine with Client....client is working with Sedera and Wendy Scipione informed to close the ticket in the system....Ticket closed at this time.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-08-26 15:26:13', '2019-08-26 15:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040017018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, '8-26-19 Kristy called bc upset about colonoscopy that she went in for as preventative. Removed one polyp and they turned it into diagnostic. She''s working with Karis Group who has told her they will waive her IUA for this and work for her on getting bill reduced. They''ve already reduced bill by 20% and are willing to reduce it by another 5% if paid soon. Still crazy for just one plolyp. But, Guy will close out ticket and she will continue to work directly with Sedera on this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-26 15:21:03', '2019-08-26 15:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040033003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Called client for 3rd time to confirm situation  with submission to Sedera re colonoscopy....waiting on call back.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-08-26 14:16:23', '2019-08-26 14:16:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040032013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '"Angenique"  called from a hospital to confirm Suzanne''s benefits- I told her that she should call Redirect instead. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-26 13:54:33', '2019-08-26 13:54:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040032008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'Patricia called confused that the ASI info that her kids had used last year for college was being rejected this year.  I explained to her why, and told her that I would reach out to Sedera and ask that a letter of explanation for each child would be emailed to her.  I emailed Dania about this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-26 13:43:32', '2019-08-26 13:43:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040032003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, 'Beth called in to verify that a preventative bone scan is covered under her plan,   I told her that it is as long as it is being recommended due to her age- that she hasn''t been diagnosed with any sort of bone disease- she said that would be her, and we verified that she was an age that would qualify.    She is going to grab the name and address of the facility that her doctor would like her to go to-  it is related to Boulder Community Health - but I was unable to find the exact facility without a name to go with it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-26 13:13:12', '2019-08-26 13:13:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040017013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, '8-26-19 She was working with Ryan (Miller?) but she just kept getting Google Voice to talk with him and could never reach him. Then we she did he wanted payment made to Google Wallet which she wasn''t comfortable with. She asked to work with another Advisor and Sedera sent her my way. She lives in NM.  She''s healthy, no pre-x, no drugs, no tobacco, no meds. Sees naturopath and pays out of pocket. Does her annual wellness visits when appropriate. PSDHC is best option for her. In NM cost will be around $450 for super high ded plan. $1500 IUA / $278 for her at 48 years old.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-26 12:24:01', '2019-08-26 12:24:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040014030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033064', 'Michael Matyasz', NULL, 'Sent member a detailed email as he didn''t respond to Patti on Friday. Waiting for him to respond if he would like us to refund him the September payment and charge it our of the right account. FTNI is updated to draft monthly payments out of the correct account moving forward.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-26 11:55:49', '2019-08-26 11:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000040014019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Received payment update form and FTNI is updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-26 10:46:00', '2019-08-26 10:46:00'),
