  ('zcrm_1579374000039998008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662001', 'Suzanne Delaney', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request to Jane who did not notify us in thime to stop pmt for September 2019.  So we will refund.  Will cancel in Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-26 08:18:39', '2019-08-26 08:18:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039998003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Sedera &amp; Cancel in RCI portal &amp; cancel FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-26 07:18:50', '2019-08-26 07:18:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039961038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025174061', 'Phillip Jackson', NULL, 'Phillip called us from the ER- he is hoping that he didn''t break his back. I told him to present himself as cash pay, ask for a cash discount, and pay no more than his IUA of $500.  I told him that I would contact Redirect on his behalf- which I did via the extrahelp page.  He had the doctor just coming and looking in on him, but he said that he would give me a call back.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-23 18:14:09', '2019-08-23 18:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039961033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925142', 'Kelly Schest', NULL, 'Kelly called in because her husband is turning 65 and no longer needs to be on the plan- I sent her a member change form and Patti''s direct line so that they can follow up on Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-23 17:10:00', '2019-08-23 17:10:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039961028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006852003', 'Elizabeth Thiessen', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent him cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-23 14:16:40', '2019-08-23 14:16:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647004', 'John Grigsby', NULL, 'Sent out link to Payment update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 13:17:08', '2019-08-23 13:17:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039961023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162322', 'Esther Turner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete- Ryan went over medical cost sharing/how Sedera works.  This was welcome call #2 - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-23 13:12:11', '2019-08-23 13:12:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039947021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, 'Wes called in and just had some general questions on how his plan works. He stated he has not really used this at all yet and just wanted a refresher on how it all works. I broke it all down to him, making sure for preventive that you call and make sure the facility or provider are in the PHCS Network, I explained his IUA and ASI to him, I explained Sedera and how they work with starting a "Need" if he is close or there is a bill that is over his IUA. I looked up facilities and provider''s for his wife to go have her annual mammogram done. He was very very happy with the information I was able to give him. He really appreciated that I sat down and explained everything about his plan and how it works, he stated that he feels a LOT better now about his plan and actually how easy it can be if you just listen and understand what needs to be done and how to go about it. He really likes this plan and so does his wife Vicki. Very happy and satisfied members :)  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-23 12:38:22', '2019-08-23 12:38:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779565', 'Michael Kinne', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with ASi &amp; Sedera &amp; FTNI.  Will refund Sept pmt.and cancel at that time.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 12:21:03', '2019-08-23 12:24:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039961018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033064', 'Michael Matyasz', NULL, '8-23-19 Mike called and was upset bc he placed a payment change in March and now money is coming out of wrong acct. March, April and May came out of correct acct, then reverted back to old account June-Aug. Patti and Sunny learned of this problem from another client and will correct the issue moving forward. Patti can fix it for Aug. if he wishes. Told him to call Patti back to complete the resolution. He will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-23 12:18:39', '2019-08-23 12:18:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, 'Member requested cancellation of Lib Rx and refund.  I advised that she hadn''t been paying until March when we learned this thru an audit.  I offered to refund Aug and cancel. Emailed Elizabeth to cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 12:15:59', '2019-08-23 12:17:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039947016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601171', 'Susan Bradley', NULL, 'PB-Member called in to ask about how to handle tests that her doc ordered Nuclear Stress test.  This is in connetion to High Blood pressue.  I advised her to pay cash whenever possible and keep all bills up to $5000 IUA that she has.  Also answered question on Preventative &amp; Proof of Insurance.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-23 11:38:52', '2019-08-23 11:38:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039961013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '8-23-19 Ali is aware that she has to submit the bills herself. They are thinking about getting pregnant in the next year or so. Proposed Sedera to her but also told her cost will be significantly higher. She and Ben will discuss. Also told her Avista Women''s Care has submitted to LHS in past and clients have had great success with that. She lives super close to Avista so that would be the plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-23 11:28:46', '2019-08-23 11:28:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039961008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '8-23-19 John says Ali found Naturopathic Women''s Wellness to bill directly to LHS. I just called her to tell her, as far as I know, they don''t bill to anyone. They will give you the Super Bill and ask allow you to submit it for reimbursement.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-23 11:14:56', '2019-08-23 11:14:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Sent out link to update Pmt information', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 10:44:14', '2019-08-23 10:44:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039947008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033064', 'Michael Matyasz', NULL, 'Called in to fix his payment method that he changed back in march and said that his payments are still being pulled from the wrong account. I told him Sunny is in the finance dept but wont be back in until Monday,I let him know though that I called and left a voicemail, I was made aware by one of the group admins here that she may be around for a little bit today. So hopefully Sunny will get my message and call Micheal back. He was pretty frustrated when I said she is out until Monday. When I told him that he got angry and said "So you guys only have 1 person in finance? That is ridiculous!!". Asked to send him the cancellation form because of this. Highly upset we don''t have more people working and no one can help him right now. He didn''t say that he was 100% going to cancel, he just wanted it just in case, he doesn''t have a good feeling about "The way things are run around here, not enough employees to help members and we need to fix that". So my feeling is if Sunny can not get to him today he is going to cancel. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-23 09:59:13', '2019-08-23 11:20:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647085', 'Christopher Lopez', NULL, 'Member called in and spoke to Kelly about adding newborn daughter to plan.  Transferred to me, I advised to fill out Member Change form I emailed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 09:23:02', '2019-08-23 09:23:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779565', 'Michael Kinne', NULL, 'Member called in and was wondering why he did not receive cancellation link pmt was taken again.  I advised that I sent that out to him on 8/14 and would resend again.  Emailed again.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 08:51:21', '2019-08-23 08:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039947003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'Michele called in and said that she is getting billed for her routine bloodwork of $366. I asked her if she had the EOB or just the statement. She said she only has the statement, so I let her know to get in contact with the lab and get the EOB that has all the CPT codes on them. Once she gets that I told her to send me to bill via email and I will get it over to someone at ASI and see why she is getting billed. She was perfectly fine with that and understood. She also mentioned that she has stitches that need to be taken out and she was afraid since she is getting billed for lab that the stitch removal would not be covered. I let her know that with that situation it would be considered injury/illness and is not a shared procedure. She then asked what card she uses for that. I explained that there is no card or network when it comes to injury/illness. I let her know that she can go wherever and she presents herself as a self pay patient and ONLY pays up to her IUA of $1000. Once I said that she stated that she remembers now, she had forgotten how that works. But after me explaining she said she fully remembers now how that works. Will be waiting for the EOB from her blood work. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-23 08:14:42', '2019-08-23 08:14:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064120', 'Robert Land', NULL, 'received Beiitegram that this member called and was interested in lowering his monthly cost.  Left VM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 08:05:45', '2019-08-23 08:05:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039932013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039484004', 'Cheryl Winn', NULL, 'Per John the Sedera file has not been sent as yet so he will delete this member so she will not be enrolled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-23 07:26:42', '2019-08-23 07:26:42'),
