  ('zcrm_1579374000039907023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'Hour long welcome call completed!  Nice family, eager to learn and excited to use their plan. Trying to figure out the person who is responsible for extra QR Life codes at home office. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-22 17:42:43', '2019-08-22 18:03:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039907018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039484004', 'Cheryl Winn', NULL, 'called to cancel, asked if there was to be any refund.  I sent the online cancellation form and told her that Patti would get back to her about any sort of refund tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-22 17:37:49', '2019-08-22 17:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039907013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Camille called in freaking out that we charged a wrong bank account after she turned in newer information.  She was shocked and appalled that I wasn''t giving her someone RIGHT NOW.  I told her that the best I could do is try to reach out to Sunny tonight so that she can fix it but that our home office was not open at the moment and that I was sorry I couldn''t do more than that. - text and emailed Sunny. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-22 17:32:17', '2019-08-22 17:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039906013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, '8-22-19 Pam called bc nervous about how she read the pre-x clause. I clarified it for her. She thought even if they didn''t know something was an issue it could be considered pre-x even without symptoms before membership began. He did not have symptoms or problems until just recently. He just learned he has an enlarged prostate and has to do green light therapy which will cost a total for all bills about $5200 as self-pay which it sounds like they already paid. I told her to call Sedera now to gain assistance right away to make sure everyone is on the same page. She will do that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-22 14:58:25', '2019-08-22 14:58:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039906008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039613005', 'David Anderson', NULL, '8-22-19 He called in to see what else he has to do to begin his membership. Told him to wait for Sedera and Redirect''s emails that he should receive in the next week or so. Must follow through with Welcome Call. He''ll keep an eye out for emails.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-22 14:44:48', '2019-08-22 14:44:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039907005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037016068', 'Mary Heiberger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete, Mary was very happy for all of the help! Her health care advisor went over what medical cost sharing is. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-22 14:36:23', '2019-08-22 14:37:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039881003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039880001', 'Debra Golden', NULL, 'Enrolled in RCI Portal for a 9/1 start', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-22 07:16:23', '2019-08-29 09:51:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039869018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, 'Nancy called in because she thought she never received her PDF copy of her ASI card- but then she found it.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-21 15:36:46', '2019-08-21 15:36:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039869013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, 'Alison called in to ask about finding a naturopath that is in network for her annual exam, I told her that she would either need to search on the provider list that is on Liberty healthshare.org- or to give Liberty a call.  She got very upset and said that this is where they call in all the time for help, and that she just called us last month for help with an eye infection and we helped her with that.  I told her that I thought she may be confusing calling us and Liberty- because there were no notes that would indicate that we spoke with her.  I tried to transfer the line to John twice and she declined both times.  I gave John a call afterwards to let him know what was going on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-21 14:52:49', '2019-08-21 14:52:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039869008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497031', 'David Harap', NULL, 'from David via email-  I have sent over all of this to Kelly F-
Hi Kelly-

 

I spoke with you a few weeks ago when during my annual wellness exam, I was given referral for a screening colonoscopy.  It was based on that I am 52 and never had a colonoscopy.

 

When we spoke, I needed to get an estimate of the costs from ARC.

 

It took many steps to get billing information from ARC.  The coding for that procedure is Z12.11.

 

What additional information do I need to get before scheduling the procedure?

 

Thanks!', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-21 14:05:45', '2019-08-21 14:05:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039869003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209064', 'Damian Smith', NULL, 'requests for Damian, Jacci and Dominic for replacement APEX cards that were accidentally thrown away. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-21 13:59:20', '2019-08-21 13:59:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039843023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Member called and requested a one-time delay on the September payment due to some family financial issues. Never had a problem with them so as a courtesy held payment that was scheduled for 8/22 and set a one time payment for 8/31.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-21 13:47:11', '2019-08-21 13:47:11'),
