  ('zcrm_1579374000039843013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220031', 'Amanda Van Blaircom', NULL, 'Still outstanding balance for August. Reached out, waiting for response', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-21 09:43:17', '2019-08-21 09:43:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039850008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039830081', 'Geraldine Gardner', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-21 09:37:15', '2019-10-07 12:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039851003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002638010', 'Elyse Larkin', NULL, 'Elyse called in and asked about some "Claims" that are outstanding and needed an update. I asked her if she has started these "Claims" (which I told her the name for them is "Needs" not Claims, claims is a term for traditional insurance and let her know that they are called Needs because this is medical cost sharing, not traditional insurance) with Sedera. She said she has no idea what Sedera is. I looked further at her profile and she has Liberty HES. She said that she spoke to someone from our department on June 22nd. I looked in the notes and told her there is nothing from any of us here from June 22nd. She then asked if she was speaking with Liberty. I told her no that she called MPowering Benefits. She then realized she called the wrong number and thought she was calling Liberty. Asked for Liberties phone number, which I gladly gave her. Those are the people she needs to speak with b/c she said she submitted the claims with them. So I told her to call Liberty now after this phone call. She apologized and is calling Liberty now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-21 09:25:43', '2019-08-21 09:25:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039850003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039830025', 'Julie Gibson-Clark', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-21 09:16:47', '2019-08-21 09:16:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039843008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039780073', 'John O''Connor', NULL, 'Acct set up charged 8/21, billing will start 8/22, set for 9/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-21 08:46:36', '2019-08-21 08:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039843003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420053', 'Patricia Purdy', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-21 08:35:41', '2019-08-21 08:35:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039837003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037016198', 'James Geib', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-08-21 08:26:04', '2019-08-21 08:26:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039817064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, 'called in a bit snippy because she wasn''t able to find a list of preventative care services on our website.  I told her that I would send her an email...then she stopped me and said that it better not be with a bunch of other information. I told her that the email was to connect her to providers BUT the attachment, and the ONLY attachment was the list she was wanting.  she had no further questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 17:43:16', '2019-08-20 17:43:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039817059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038206005', 'Marie Brennan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Marie had pretty much everything from the checklist done already!  Great member!  Requested from Patti that Marie be sent another card for her husband. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 17:27:08', '2019-08-20 17:27:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039817054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037016198', 'James Geib', NULL, 'called in because he wanted to book a welcome call- I sent him a scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 16:57:47', '2019-08-20 16:57:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039817049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025370020', 'Patricia Druckman', NULL, 'called because she is having an issue with her blood work not being paid- she said she had spoken to someone at ASI, to John Kach, and to Patti Baron. I told her that unfortunately these things can take some time, but encouraged her to speak with Jennifer over at RCI and then go from there.  I tried to transfer the line but it went to voicemail. I gave Patricia Jennifers direct line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 16:07:39', '2019-08-20 16:07:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039781016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Faith called in and I had a a 50 minute conversation with her. She just needed help remembering every little detail about her plan, who is who, how to go about dealing with all the different vendors. She needed guidance on where to go or who to talk to about certain situations and procedures. She needed help with using her IUA and what it means, and what happens when a bill is more than that. I told her every single thing about her plan and how to go about using her card and who and where she needs to go. I also did provider look up for her OBGYN to see if Gayle Brokowski was in network, which Gayle is. Her family doctor is not though. So I told her that I would send her a list of providers that are in her area, I came up with 38 results for a Family Doctor. I told her all the emails that I will be sending out so she doesn''t have to sit there and try and remember everything that I just told her. I will be sending the 64+ Preventative services that are covered, Provider lookup instructions, how to present herself with her MEC at a wellness checkup, how to submit her bills to Sedera(I explained to her who they are and what they do), 2nd MD explanation,  and lastly a Welcome Call Scheduler. She said she does remember having one but I recommended for her to have another just to refresh herself. She thought that would be a great idea. She did not know you can have another one. She was very very very very very grateful for all the info that I provided her with and said that I was a HUGE HUGE help today with her. She said she couldn''t have called at a better time and is very happy that I took the time to sit here and go over everything for her. I said it was my pleasure and I told her what times I work during the week and what days. She said I very sweet and loved talking with me, she also said that I made her feel so much better about her plan, and life!! wow. So VERY HAPPY customer.  :) :) -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-20 15:02:38', '2019-08-20 15:02:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039791081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677539', 'Robert Pfeiffer', NULL, 'Received &amp; sent in Proof of DPC to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-20 14:03:08', '2019-08-20 14:03:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039817018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Cari Adams is not happy that her IUA is due per need, she said it was never explained as such.  She said that she would have never signed up.  I offered to transfer her to Wendy, but she said she would call her later because she knows Wendy well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 13:55:38', '2019-08-20 13:55:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039791076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299051', 'Clare Vazin', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with all vendors.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-20 13:42:12', '2019-08-20 13:42:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039791071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677539', 'Robert Pfeiffer', NULL, 'New Plan eff 9/1: Emp &amp; Spouse 50+ $1000 IUA DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-20 13:34:59', '2019-08-20 13:34:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039817013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209064', 'Damian Smith', NULL, 'welcome call complete,  I need to order her all cards, send ALL emails- they had no idea of what medical cost sharing was.  Jacci seems overwhelmed but was grateful for all of her questions being explained. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 13:24:28', '2019-08-20 13:24:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039791063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677539', 'Robert Pfeiffer', NULL, 'Received change form the this member to remove daughter from plan.  He to submit DPC invoice to me now that he was DPC option I will cancel ASi and notify Sedera to remove daughter Hannah', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-20 13:21:58', '2019-08-20 13:28:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039819005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Had a scheduled call with Allison today and did a full presentation.  She currently is with Aliera Health.  She was concerned about pregnancy because she has been with Aliera for over a year.   She also was under evaluation is her thyroid due to family history.  She had testing done but her thyroid is normal but they are want to do  PTH labs which she hasn''t had been done yet.  Other, she has no medical issues.  I told her to call Aliera and confirm what they would pay beyond the $7500 IUA.

Contact -
Waggener Allison
•
Add Note
• Jul 15 by Ron Patterson', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-08-20 13:19:15', '2019-08-20 13:19:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039791058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-20 13:00:19', '2019-08-20 13:00:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039791053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Following note was copied from Lead for this enrollee:
Received a call today from Allision asking if she was ready to go (meaning enrolled for an 8-1 effective date.  I checked with Patti and in the enrollment platform but we show nothing.  She said she had canceled her Aliera program and I advised her to contact them immediately and ask to extend it another month.  Fishy....I don''t even have her email in the CRM record file and I always get that information.  I ask her she entered her payment information and she said no.  I told her well then you did not enroll if no payment information was provided.  I ask her she had time to enroll right now and she said she was on a train.  I ask to set-up a time and date and she said well I''m kinda busy so I''ll call you when I have the time to enroll. ?*?', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-20 12:53:03', '2019-08-20 12:53:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039781011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299149', 'Grant Hudson', NULL, 'Grant called in and said that he has a few questions and needs to know who he spoke to that told him they are "His go to person". I asked him what this person''s name was and he replied "I don''t know I forgot their name". So I went to his notes and read off a few of the people''s names to him and asked if any of those name''s ring a bell. He than got extremely nasty and said "No no no, you are being an f&#%ing idiot and not listening to me. I should be the one asking questions not you asking ME questions!!" I said "I understand sir I am just trying to help narrow down who you could have spoken to. Every time we speak with someone, we leave notes on you''re profile." Again he started yelling and screaming at me saying I am not listening to him, and asked for a manager. I said I am sorry I could not find out the person''s name for you, he cut me off and very angrily he wanted to speak to a manager. Patti was right behind me and I gave the call to her. She said the same exact thing that I was telling him. He than started raising his voice to her and said that I was very rude and everyone else in this office he has spoken to was rude as well. Patti preceded to ask him what his questions are and all she is trying to do is help out. He said it was in regards to a bill from APEX that he has now been waiting 2 months or more on an answer or it just being paid and him reimbursed. Patti then let him know that it can take a a little bit of time and that it doesn''t happen over night. Patti stated that if this is for a bill than he was probably talking with Shelley over at APEX. Patti let Grant know that Shelley is not in that department anymore and there is Jennifer Chasteain for him to be able to speak with. Patti provided the phone number Grant can use to call. Per Patti, John is going to give Grant a call and speak with him. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-20 12:35:09', '2019-08-20 12:35:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039791048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085037', 'Kaitlin Robinson', NULL, 'Tracking #8966878
Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 8/20/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-20 12:15:05', '2019-08-20 12:15:05'),
