  ('zcrm_1579374000039817008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209064', 'Damian Smith', NULL, 'Jacci did mention to me that she was going to have to reschedule her welcome call for today at 2:30- I sent her another scheduler. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 12:10:55', '2019-08-20 12:10:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039817003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Mitchel had expressed that he was going to have to change his welcome call appointment due to him now having to run around with his daughter concerning her foot- I sent a new scheduler to him last night. I also tried to call to confirm this cancellation- but only left a voicemail on the machine. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-20 12:03:43', '2019-08-20 12:03:43'),
