  ('zcrm_1579374000039813003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '8-20-19 Called to make sure enrollments are set to go. She''s going to call Anthem for Sam to provide further SEP proof with proof of school enrollment and USPS change order. Also going to show proof of coverage with Ambetter in AZ and change of address with that bill as well as cable bill. She''ll call Anthem to make sure that sufficient and all is well before she cancels Ambetter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-20 11:04:13', '2019-08-20 11:04:13'),
