  ('zcrm_1579374000039781003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677539', 'Robert Pfeiffer', NULL, 'Patti-member called in and told me that 1. Daughter now on her own plan thru employment and would be coming off the plan.  2. Member now has a DPC and will be sending Proof.  I will send Member change form and charge DPC rate when I receive proof.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-20 07:56:58', '2019-08-20 07:57:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039741038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209064', 'Damian Smith', NULL, 'called to be reminded of their IUA, and also wanted to know what their new monthly cost will be- sent Patti an email to follow up. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-19 18:04:37', '2019-08-19 18:04:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039741033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695160', 'Harold Siegel', NULL, 'called to cancel for effective date of Sept 1- I sent the cancellation form and told Mrs. Siegel that they needed to have it filled out and signed right away because tomorrow is the deadline. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-19 18:02:09', '2019-08-19 18:02:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039741028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Mitchell called in because his daughter''s foot is hurting her, I asked when she initially hurt it and he said last Thursday or Friday, that they have waited because they wanted to make sure that she wasn''t "faking it" - I went over the needs process and sent appropriate emails. KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-19 17:46:19', '2019-08-19 17:46:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039741023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280148', 'Roland Reed', NULL, 'Welcome call completed.  This was the first time he heard an explanation of medical cost sharing.  Kari and Roland are an awesome couple.  They listened and asked questions about everything- Kari is going to be filling out a script form for a powder she takes everyday for her gallbladder.  Very positive, they are excited to use an alternative to regular insurance.  They were paying $1,900 a month. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-19 16:39:49', '2019-08-19 16:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039741018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, 'Kristen was having a hard time finding an eye doctor on the multi plan site, so I walked her step by step through the process.  She was seemingly overwhelmed by the process, very anxious.  She thanked me for my help,  I told her that she could call back with more questions anytime.  I also sent her a script, provider search, and 5 steps.,,, -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-19 15:50:02', '2019-08-19 15:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039741013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Christine called for a few medication coupons via text.  Searched with her and sent them to her phone. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-19 15:46:11', '2019-08-19 15:46:11'),
