  ('zcrm_1579374000039759018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990158', 'Loren Jinkins', NULL, 'Lori called in and said that she has tried off of her home comp, her laptop, her ipad, and her husbands electronics and NOTHING has worked when trying to fill out her HRA. It keeps popping up saying the Format for her Email Address and her Phone Number is incorrect Patti is working on it. I will update in notes here when I get an answer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-19 10:33:53', '2019-08-19 10:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039759013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028844054', 'Michael Matz', NULL, 'Michael called in to ask about the IUA change that he got an email about. He wanted to know if he changes his IUA and his wife comes off the plan Feb 28th to be going on medicare, is he still going to have the $1000 or if he changes it to $500 will that stick. He was concerned that he wont be able to keep the $500 IUA he wants to change to b/c his wife is coming off. I gave the call the Patti b/c she is the one that is doing the IUA changes and knows how it all works. He also will be coming off the plan Sept 25th of next year 2020. Patti explained in detail that no, he will not loose his change of IUA b/c the wife is coming off in a few months. He is good to go but HAS to fill out the IUA change form and send it back TODAY. Today is the deadline date. Anything after this won''t be able to be changed. He understood and it going to get it done. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-19 10:17:12', '2019-08-19 10:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039759008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919719', 'Dan Haski', NULL, 'Meghan from Sedera called in asking to have a member Dan Haski cancelled. I told her that I would simply just send an email out to him that is a cancellation form to fill out, and all he has to do it fill it out, sign it, and send back to is via email. He doesn''t have to worry about printing anything and sending it through the actual mail. I confirmed the email address with Meghan on the line and she said that was correct. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-19 10:16:14', '2019-08-19 10:16:14'),
