  ('zcrm_1579374000039759003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962334', 'Juanita Franco', NULL, 'Juanita called in and said she needed to set up an appointment for a physical. When I pulled her up on here(CRM) she has Redirect. I let her know that Redirect is ALWAYS going to be her first point of contact and they are the ones that set up appointments and guide her on what to do and where to go. She stated that she had no information given to her when "you guys" came out to us. She said the only card she has is the mpowering card to call the concierge for guidance. I told her to go ahead and give Redirect a call and they will be helping her with anything that she needs. She asked what I am to here and I explained that I help with questions she might have, certain emails, and to put her through to the right department if needed. She was not upset or confused after I explained this and is giving Redirect a call now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-19 08:37:12', '2019-08-19 08:37:12'),
