  ('zcrm_1579374000039726057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039755139', 'Shelley Scipione', NULL, '8-16-19 My SISTER!!! Shelley has Lyme disease and jaw issue that is getting corrected now and paying on own already. Also neck issue from fall and doing chiropractic to address.  Enrolling now for VPC Redirect $500/$333.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-16 15:53:18', '2019-08-16 16:16:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039703033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Robert called in asking for an ASI card with his name on it- I told him that I could request another card but it would still only have Jacqueline''s name on it.  I explained that the provider would call the ASI number to verify that he is on the plan.  He said it was hard getting out of the "traditional insurance mindset"  I empathized and told him that that is what the concierge is there for, that I would send him many educational emails to help make him feel more grounded about the program, and of course he could call in with questions anytime. He also was having a hard time registering with Teladoc- I told him that I would send him step by step instructions, that his wife would need to make sure that she registered first, and that the family should download the Teladoc app on their phone, and expressed to him how well the app walks you right through the process.  He said I was very informative.  I did send in a request for another hard copy ASI card to be sent to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-16 15:26:48', '2019-08-16 15:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039703028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005671043', 'Susan Chapman', NULL, 'Susan called us because she had many bills to upload to Liberty, had never done it before and wanted some assistance.  I told her that because it was now after hours, her best be would be to call Liberty about this.  She was confused and thought that this is what we do- wanted to know if we offered her any other services.  I told her that we did-  first Teladoc and then explained, and help with rx scripts- she said she had no idea that she had those services available.  I sent her Teladoc registration instructions and a prescription med quote request form. happy member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-16 15:10:56', '2019-08-16 15:10:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039703023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001934005', 'Jennifer Teie', NULL, 'Jennifer called in upset because she hear that she really didn''t "need" to be paying $50 a month for years, and that she wanted to cancel.  I explained that she had access to our services the whole time, how at the time, yes- we were sold as a package deal with Liberty health at the time.  She asked if she was ever informed and I told her that she was via email from Liberty.  I sent her the cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-16 14:50:42', '2019-08-16 14:50:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039726052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '8-16-19 Nancy, had 2 hip surgeries, one 5 years ago and 1 one year ago. The recent one was done through LHS and she only paid $500 since she got it pre-approved and was billed directly to provider not to her. She''s still super nervous about LHS bc of the time it take for the smaller stuff to be reimbursed. She''s now nervous to switch in case she has any problems with her hip but plans to call her surgeon to see what the risk is at this point. She takes armor thyroid for thyroid issue and also takes bio-identical hormones. She''s 59, almost 60. Told her of price jump when reached 60 and described VPC Redirect option to her. She will ponder if worth the risk to stay with LHS or to then have the pre-x clause begin for hip.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-16 13:40:27', '2019-08-16 13:40:27'),
