  ('zcrm_1579374000039653033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, '8-15-19 Called and spoke with Tess. Greg was out on bike ride and she''ll have him call me when he can to discuss his Dr. David Borchers that he wants to keep who is supposedly now part of a DPC. I will have to make sure they BOTH would want to see Dr. Borchers and switch. But, Dr. Borchers is an Internal Medicince Dr. so this may not be true. His site doesn''t show anything about DPC at the moment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-15 16:17:28', '2019-08-15 16:17:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039674008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006852003', 'Elizabeth Thiessen', NULL, 'Willard called in tonight slightly concerned that his credit card was charged $309 instead of $50 on July 21st and in looking back June 21st as well, he said that he was alarmed by this.  I told him that home office was closed for the day but that I would send an email to our finance department now and someone will reach out to him tomorrow about this. I emailed both Jill and Erika in regards to this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-15 16:08:03', '2019-08-15 16:37:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039674003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Greg called in for some prescription medication assistance, also asked where the best place would be for him to get some vaccine''s for EMT school- he said that he couldn''t go to his regular doctor probably anymore because his doctor was a DPC- I told him that I would mention this to Wendy.  I sent many emails to the family because Greg said that he hardly knew anything about the program besides all he will have to pay is $1,000 and "you guys will take care of the rest"  he is going to call me back when he gets to his pharmacy so that I can text him a coupon.  He doesn''t know the medication details. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-15 15:21:00', '2019-08-15 15:21:00'),
