  ('zcrm_1579374000039663003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032830004', 'Thomas Schell', NULL, 'Thomas called in this morning stating that he got a rejection letter from his son Phinley''s wellness visit due to incorrect age. Here in the CRM we have the correct DOB of 10/16/2012 but in RCI''s system they had 10/16/2002. I got with Patti and she corrected the DOB in RCI''s system. She said to let Thomas know that it may take a day or 2 for it to be completely updated in their system and to call RCI either tomorrow or the next day and let them know the DOB was fixed and to resubmit the bill. He was very happy to hear we were able to fix the issue in a matter of minutes. He will give RCI a call to let them know in the next couple days. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-15 08:14:07', '2019-08-15 08:14:07'),
