  ('zcrm_1579374000039647003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037016017', 'Lysa Burianek', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member requests QR Life code cards for their 2 children also. Sent email to Patty of request. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-08-14 13:35:16', '2019-08-16 11:52:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039644008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, 'Jennifer called in and she just wanted to make sure she was doing the right thing when it comes to her wellness visit she will be having shortly. I let her know that she is absolutely doing the right thing to cal in to here and get the information that she needs. First off we need to make sure that whomever she is going to is going to be in network with us under the PHCS network with MultiPlan. I checked a few providers that she gave me and they were all  indeed network. Once she has confirmed that she needs to make sure when she makes the appointment that she has her RCI card. I let her know that all info that the receptionist will need is right there on the card. There is a phone number they can call to make sure of her eligibility. I also explained what the difference is when it comes to injury/illness, diagnostic services. I told her about her IUA and what that means and how Sedera comes into play once she has met the IUA. I explained who Sedera is and what they do. I let her know that I would be sending her emails that further explain everything that I have told her today, about her preventative care and non preventative. Jennifer was so so so very happy with the help that I provided her today, She told me that she is 100% way more comfortable and FULLY understands how all of her plan works and all the different components and factor''s and vendor''s there are. She is perfectly fine with everything. Very very happy member now and loves how this all works and stated that she will DEFIANTLY recommend our program and to ask to speak with me when they need anything. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-14 12:49:44', '2019-08-14 12:49:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039637016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039657162', 'Bob Borden', NULL, 'Myla Borden - daughter 23 and only needs the Self Directed bc just completed all of her wellness visits for this year. She might she employer coverage sometime this coming year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-14 12:48:21', '2019-08-14 12:48:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039644003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364233', 'Chelsea Bibb', NULL, 'Chelsea called in and needed some help with getting some copies of her RCI/APEX card''s sent to her. I let her know that Patti will be able to send her a PDF copy to her email right now and will receive it in a few minutes. Patti will also put out a request for hard copies to be sent to her mailing address. I confirmed her email, which was correct, and when I confirmed her mailing address she said it was wrong and she recently moved. I wrote down her new address to give to Patti to send the cards. I let Chelsea know what I will be sending her a Member Change Form to fill out and put her new address and have it updated in everyone''s system. She also needed to know how to present herself at her Dr.''s appointments. I let her know what to say and what to bring with her, which is her RCI card or the PDF copy if she has not gotten the hard copies just yet. I let her know that I would be sending out an email that has all the instructions on hat to do and what to say exactly to the receptionist at her appt''s. Chelsea was very thrilled that I was able to help her over the phone and get emails sent to her further explaining everything so she does not have to sit there and try and remember everything off the top of her head. She was very very thankful for my help and said I made things a LOT easier for future times and appointments. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-14 12:39:02', '2019-08-14 12:39:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039627023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364233', 'Chelsea Bibb', NULL, 'Member submitted Member change form to update her address.  Also asked for new set of Apex Cards Will wait until address is update to order new cards', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-14 12:15:00', '2019-08-14 12:33:04'),
