  ('zcrm_1579374000039614003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, 'Nancy called in firstly to ask for copies of her ASI cards, she has lost them. I let her know that I will send out an email request to get her a PDF copy and hard copies sent to her. She has her annual wellness check up next week. She also let me know that this would be her first time having to use anything with her plan and asked how it work. I explained everything for her. I told her that First she needs to either call in or she can do it on her computer at home, but to make sure the doctor and facility is in the PHCS network. I looked up a few for her and they were all in network except for one of the dr''s. They all work at the same facility and Ste # but the one Dr that she would be using is not. She was OK with that and gave me 2 other names to look up in that facility and dept and they indeed are in network for her. She was perfectly fine with that. I let her know that I can send her an email that she and her Dr. that is not in the network can fill out to "Nominate" the Dr. to be put on the list. She was very happy with that. I told her how to present herself and which card she needs to give the receptionist. I let her know that all info the receptionist would need is right on the card and the phone number they can call to verify. I also explained what her IUA is and how that works with injury/illness. I went over what the difference is between that and Preventative care.I will be sending her all emails that will explain everything that I did to her over the phone, so she does not have to sit there and try and remember everything. She was VERY grateful for being able to help her over the phone and very quickly as well. She thanked me several times over and stated that I was a HUGE help today and that she pretty much fully understands her plan and feels a LOT more confident with everything now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-14 09:12:22', '2019-08-14 09:12:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039599016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039601017', 'Peggy Garrett', NULL, 'Member to be billed $25 set up as a re-enrollment from spouse aging into Medicare.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-14 08:48:16', '2019-08-14 08:48:16'),
