  ('zcrm_1579374000039558013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788094', 'Daniel Webb', NULL, 'Dan called in and needed to set up an appointment for him to get his yearly physical. I let him know that with his plan Redirect that they are always going to be his first point of contact and Redirect will set up the appointment for him and let him know the process with everything he needs to know and what to do. I gave him Redirects number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-13 12:22:36', '2019-08-13 12:22:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039558008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779589', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'Jennifer messaged me via the SalesIQ chat asking about mammograms and what types are covered. She also needed help with finding a provider and facility in her area. I sent her the email that has the instructions on looking up providers in her area. I only found 1 search result after looking up mammogram. I went ahead and then looked up Radiology. That gave me a result of 116! I have noticed with radiology that is the best way to go when looking up mammograms. I sent her both the lists that I found. I also sent her the email that explains how she presents herself at the providers office and gave her ASI''s phone number if she may need it. She was very grateful for all the information I was able to provide her and how quick it was for me to get everything sent to her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-13 12:21:02', '2019-08-13 12:21:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039526033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529298', 'Sarah Pastoriza', NULL, 'Received RCI mailing back I emailed member and got an updated address Apt # was incorrect.  Member was moving at the time of enrollment..  I update with Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-13 12:12:40', '2019-08-13 12:12:40'),
