  ('zcrm_1579374000039559008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001896127', 'Christina (Christy) McCord', NULL, 'August declined, sent an email, she called, very frustrated because she''s had to call every month... there is no records of any previous communication with  her besides name and address change below back in 2018. She said she''s been calling us, not Liberty. verified info and went to collect the payment, Subscriptions is telling me it can''t find the customer profile. Contacted Zoho support, waiting to hear back on what the issue is as all info is present', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-13 10:26:31', '2019-08-13 10:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039526023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899526', 'Andrew Dougherty', NULL, 'Member called in and asked how to cancel his plan.  I advised and sent him out link to cancellation request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-13 10:16:57', '2019-08-13 10:16:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039526018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716025', 'Richard O''Krepki', NULL, 'Received a email from ASi to update this member mailing address.  I email member and he responded with 2 alternate addresses.  I advised that I would use the FL one.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-13 10:06:54', '2019-08-13 10:06:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039559003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679158', 'Cheryl Stephenson', NULL, 'After updating FTNI with the bank account info, August payment failed to go through. Manually charged the payment today, no late fee, notified member. August payment is up to date', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-13 09:58:07', '2019-08-13 09:58:07'),
