  ('zcrm_1579374000039558003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377244', 'Kay Magruder', NULL, 'Kay called in and said that she had a mammogram last month and was wondering why she got billed for it. I pulled her up on here the CRM and I see she has Redirect. I let her know that her first point of contact is going to be with Redirect. I told her they will most likely have her submit the bill over to them and they will be the ones that can help her and let her know why she was billed. She thanked me and said she would call Redirect now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-13 09:56:24', '2019-08-13 09:56:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039526008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $500 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-13 09:46:48', '2019-08-13 09:46:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039526003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010281023', 'Malcolm Pointon', NULL, 'I received Bettiegram from this member after hours wanting to know how much he spent on his MCS plan.  I will email him to let him know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-13 07:30:33', '2019-08-13 07:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039516036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779506', 'Susan Weiner', NULL, 'Susan had called while I was doing a welcome call- I called her back and left a message on her voice mail. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-12 16:56:06', '2019-08-12 16:56:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039516031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010281023', 'Malcolm Pointon', NULL, 'Malcolm called in wanting to know about how much he spent with us last year to use for his taxes.  I told him that Sunny would reach out to him tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-12 16:33:13', '2019-08-12 16:33:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039516026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'called in for more help- sent him prescription med quote form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-12 16:24:35', '2019-08-12 16:24:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039516021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280118', 'Michael Lazanis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete and I sent his prescription quote request over to Reid. Very nice guy, still needed to get some things on the list done, but he said he was happy to do them. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-12 16:16:25', '2019-08-12 16:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039516013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280361', 'Sally Pistilli', NULL, 'Welcome call completed.   Sally is quite anxious about the fact that she has not received emails back from the QR life code site and because she can''t log in to do her HRA.  I tried to explain that information is still being processed and it should all be in in just a couple of days.  I felt like she was focusing more on an email and how many names there are of things instead of listening about how the plan worked.  I sent some educational emails, I told her she should call in anytime for her questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-12 16:10:15', '2019-08-12 16:13:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039516008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'just called in for a little hand holding with the preventative care process. happy to help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-12 15:49:53', '2019-08-12 15:49:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039516003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529441', 'John Digirolamo', NULL, 'Welcome call complete, and sent educational emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-12 14:26:00', '2019-08-12 14:26:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039502021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039780073', 'John O''Connor', NULL, '8-12-19 John 28 and Adrianne 29 and both are teachers looking to explore and travel for a year or so before teaching again. Healthy, no tobacco, no meds, looking for Sept 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-12 14:15:29', '2019-08-12 14:15:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039485023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039484004', 'Cheryl Winn', NULL, 'FTNI Set up for billing eff 8/22', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-12 13:46:43', '2019-08-12 13:46:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039502016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039657162', 'Bob Borden', NULL, '8-12-19 Healthy, only issue was stage 0 skin melanoma spot removed from Maria 1 years ago. Understands pre-x clause. Rest of family no issues. Daughter graduated in May and is not dependent so needs own membership. She doesn''t have employer coverage yet. She''s 23. Other kid is 19 and dependent. Looking at Redirect bc of age of parents and ease of use. $910/$1500 plus $267/$1500 daughter. Learned of Sedera from friends Katherine and Rick Radcliffe in NM. They are not in CRM.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-12 12:59:04', '2019-08-12 12:59:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039502011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '8-12-19 Marjorie and Robert are signed up the for Provider Directed Healthcare for $710/$500 IUA for Sept. 1st start date. They understand Pre-X clause that I reiterated again. We signed up son for Anthem plan for $494.55 for Silver HMO 2000 bc of asthma. Signed up on C4 and site requested payment set up direct with them bc it wasn''t accepted. Told her to wait until Thursday to call them to set up payment ongoing. She will do that. Also told her to see if she can transfer her Delta Dental to CO from AZ. She will try.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-12 12:20:31', '2019-08-12 12:20:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039502006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, 'Jenifer called in and she just needed some guidance on the correct way to go about a couple doctor appointment she needs to make. The first appointment is with a dermatologist tog et some moles checked out, I let her know that, that is not a preventative are service that her plan provides. I told her that she can got o any dermatologist of her choice and to present herself as a self pay patient. I explained to her that that visit will be part of her IUA of $1500. She was not too failure of what her IUA is or what it means. I let her know all the details on how to go about this process and what she needs to do and who she needs to call if the bill/"Need" is going to be more than the IUA. I let her know who Sedera is and how they work and what they do when her bill is going to be more than the IUA. She seemed very pleased with how the process works and seemed very confident with using it and presenting herself. She seemed very knowledgeable with the whole process.Her next appointment was just for an annual woman''s visit. I asked her if she has a provider that she goes to or someone from the past that she may know, provider wise, and I looked up the doctor for her. The provider she gave me was indeed in the network which works out great for Jenifer! I let her know this and explained how the preventative care visits work. I told her when it comes to these type of appointments she does need to look up in the PHCS network through the Multi Plan websites. I walked her through the whole process and explained how she presents herself and made sure over the phone that she has her RCI card, which is what she is going to be using in the future. Strictly for preventive care. I told her that I would be sending her some emails that will further explain everything that I had just told her, so she does not need to sit there and try and remember everything we went over on the phone. She was very very thrilled by this and extremely happy she can have all this information to save. Jenifer seemed very very empowered and ready to use her plan ASAP. Very happy with what I sat and went over with her and also very happy that there are emails for her to keep and look over. Satisfied member for sure!!!!!!! :) :) -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-12 11:58:07', '2019-08-12 11:58:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039485013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036561060', 'Yvonne Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Apex &amp; Sedera &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-12 11:44:58', '2019-08-12 11:44:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039505011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Verified address as well. Member request a new QR Life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-08-12 11:35:22', '2019-08-12 11:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039505003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member requests new QR Life Code cards for him and his wife Heather and also his 2 children. Sent email to Patty of request. Verified address as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-08-12 11:32:38', '2019-08-16 11:51:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039467008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 523 
