  ('zcrm_1579374000039485003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039484004', 'Cheryl Winn', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 60-64 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-12 09:25:32', '2019-08-12 09:25:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039428023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Yen-Yen called because she just banged her knee outside while gardening and she didn''t know what steps to take.  I told her that if it is bothering her this much she should go get it checked out at an urgent care.  I told her that if the doctor requests any sort of high end test that she should ask for the CPT code so that she can let Sedera do a search in their system for the best price.  I went through the entire needs process with her at least twice and will send out appropriate emails.  I also have an email over to Salena at ASI because she just got bills for her annual, colonoscopy and mammogram even though she though that ASI already had all of the info to process already. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-09 16:41:23', '2019-08-09 16:41:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039428018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529553', 'Shelly Jamieson', NULL, 'Shelly called and we spent a bit of time going over how her preventative care works as well as how illness/injury is handled.  I answered all of her questions and told me that I was a great help.  She is requesting more Apex cards because she had lost hers and her son will be needing to have some vax before school starts. I sent Patti an email requesting this. I sent a multitude of educational emails that went along with everything we spoke about. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-09 16:17:39', '2019-08-09 16:17:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039428013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078004', 'Jason Scheier', NULL, 'called to ask about his IUA and non compliance email- he said that the link didn''t work- I told him that was because it is no an old link.  I told him that I would let John be aware of this and he will get back to him on monday with the login info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-09 15:59:58', '2019-08-09 15:59:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039428008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028844054', 'Michael Matz', NULL, 'called to update payment and ask what he would need to do to remove his wife from the plan soon because she will be going on medicare.  I sent payment update form as well as a member change form.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-09 15:54:10', '2019-08-09 15:54:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039428003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082183', 'Eliot Hinshaw', NULL, 'called in due to a new pregnancy and wanting to understand the guidelines.  I tried to transfer the call to Sedera but left a voicemail on Eliot''s behalf.  I told Eliot that there are guideline changes come Sept 1- and that is why I had rather him speak to the source as to what they should expect.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-09 15:48:21', '2019-08-09 15:48:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039377012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295052', 'Susan Hodson', NULL, 'Member called in regarding an auto accident she had about 4 months ago.  I explained that her Auto Ins. is in first position and anything they don''t pick up can be submitted to Sedera.  Sent e-mail on how to open a need.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-08-09 13:36:00', '2019-08-09 13:36:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039408013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '8-9-19 Lori never received the email from Redirect. I resent her the Welcome Call email to go over her new membership with Redirect. She''s ready to get this going 100%.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-09 12:54:04', '2019-08-09 12:54:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039366023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Received Fulfillment Pkg back.  contacted member and got updated address.  Was correct in FTNI &amp; Selerix.  Corrected RCI and CRM. Will resend fulfillment pkg.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-09 12:23:17', '2019-08-09 12:23:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039363008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280361', 'Sally Pistilli', NULL, 'Sally called in and was just a little concerned because she was not getting any of the emails that she was told would be sent to her. To book the 15 minute welcome call and the Sedera welcome packet. I checked and the welcome packet was bounced and the welcome call scheduler she just never got. I re sent those 2 emails while on the phone with her and she got both of them right away. She was also a little confused on the 2 different cards that she got in the mail. The QR Life code and her RCI card. I explained to her what both of those are used for and how they work. i stressed to her to defiantly book the welcome call because all of this information will be gone over with her. She is going to schedule that right now. She was a lot less confused after explaining everything she needed to her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-09 11:38:26', '2019-08-09 11:38:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039408008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001669107', 'Fawn Gilmore Kraut', NULL, '8-9-19 We are connecting on Aug. 14th. I will recommend Provider Directed Option to her for ease of use and no up front pay for small items and her age at 59 now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-09 11:31:47', '2019-08-09 11:31:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039366018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384340', 'James Frohman', NULL, 'This member called into the Concierge requesting MEC card copy &amp; new.  I sent PDF copy and ordered new cards sent via portal.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-09 11:24:21', '2019-08-09 11:24:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039408003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508039', 'Joy Spring', NULL, '8-9-19 Hi Wendy,

Not sure if you have heard this news and I’m very sorry to let you know that Joy died on Tuesday. She was doing well with the treatment and the tumors were shrinking, but her WBC and platelets were critically low so they tried to give her transfusions but her body rejected it. She went into cardiac arrest and was not able to be revived. 

Of course the hospital has immediately been trying to collect their bill. I did see her health insurance card and I’m sure it will all get worked out. I may ask you to help if need be. I’m assisting her husband in sorting they a lot of details. If you have any advice, greatly appreciated.

Thanks,

Nancy Thompson
