  ('zcrm_1579374000039366008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, 'Received Member change form re: address change &amp; removing daughter.  I will change in Apex portal and inform Sedera. Also change billing going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-09 08:17:07', '2019-08-09 08:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039366003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391169', 'Carrington Garrett', NULL, 'Member''s wife Peggy called in and let me know that Carrington was going on Medicare eff 9/1. I advised that she would have to cancel and re-enroll as a single.  Analisa had already given her the Selerix link to re-enroll.  I advised her of the deadline.  I will send out the Cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-09 08:06:18', '2019-08-09 08:06:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039363003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391169', 'Carrington Garrett', NULL, 'Peggy called in and has a question in regards to her husband who is coming off and going on medicare at the end of the month and she wants to stay on. I transferred her over to Patti who takes care of enrollments and cancellations. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-09 08:01:22', '2019-08-09 08:01:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039309013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, 'Dawn called in concerned if she was set up on an automatic payplan.  - I told her that I wouldn''t be able to tell but I would have someone from finance reach out to her in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-08 17:49:08', '2019-08-08 17:49:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039355008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '8-8-19 Needs the generic version of Adderall on GoodRX is around $30 for 20mg and 60 tablets. Asking about mammogram and if hers will be considered prentative vs diagnostic bc they always have her go back for a 3D scan bc always see something they can''t discern. I told her likely her responsibility to pay for since sounds diagnostic. Told her to call Concierge and speak with Guy Travis.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-08-08 16:09:07', '2019-08-08 16:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039350008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, 'Sondra called in and she needs to take her daughter Madeline off of the plan because she just found out Madeline is on Medicaid now. She also needs to change her address because they have just moved. I told her Patti is going to be sending her a member change form and to put in the comment section " Removing daughter Madeline and Change of address" at the bottom of the form. I let her know this and to just fill out all the required information on the form and to just send it right back through via email, she does not have to print it and physically mail it back in. Sondra was very please with how simple and easy this was to change info as needed. Happy Happy member! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-08 13:55:24', '2019-08-08 13:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039350003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001669107', 'Fawn Gilmore Kraut', NULL, 'Fawn called in and he wanted to directed to Wendy. I asked her what this was in regards to just in case Wendy did not answer and I needed to leave a voicemail. When she told me she just wanted help with finding a provider I told her I could help her with that. I asked her some general questions and asked what type of provider she was looking for and whatnot. She said she is looking for a primary care and OBGYN. She is looking to have her regular annual wellness visit. She said she is a little worried b/c the last time she has her wellness visit she had to pay ALL out of pocket for the entire visit which was roughly about $400. She stated she was never able to file a claim with Liberty and has never heard back from anyone over at Liberty. She stated that it has been about 5 years since she has last gone to a doctor and very concerned because of that. She has not gone b/c of the fact that her visit was not paid for the last time and how difficult it is to get in contact with ANYONE over at Liberty. Fawn said she has left multiple messages and voicemails and STILL has not been contacted back. She is pretty frustrated with Liberty and is not sure if she still wants to continue or not. But for the time being she wants to find a provider and have her wellness visit before she makes any sort of decisions.  John is looking into this for her and will give her a call back. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-08 12:59:23', '2019-08-08 12:59:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039313011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233293', 'Lauren Hinrichs', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; ASi &amp; cancel billing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-08 12:29:34', '2019-08-08 12:29:34'),
