  ('zcrm_1579374000039313003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, 'Wendy emailed me and asked if this member could cancel the MEC.  I said yes and advised of the new pricing.  Also that member is aware of the limited coverage and how it works.  She to let me know', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-08 07:40:15', '2019-08-08 07:40:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039309003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299051', 'Clare Vazin', NULL, 'Sent her the cancellation form but will go ahead and kill the billing and let Patti know to cancel with providers.


From: Clare Vazin <cvazin@gmail.com>
To: "Sunny Terziyska"<sunny@myahe.org>
Cc: "RobinKemp"<robin@kempbenefits.com>
Date: Thu, 08 Aug 2019 04:38:14 -0400
Subject: Please Cancel My Account
============ Forwarded message ============

    I need to cancel my account as I have insurance coverage effective after this month.

    Please let me know what I need to do to make sure my account is cancelled and no more payments are processed.

    Thank you,
    Clare Vazin', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-08 07:19:54', '2019-08-08 07:19:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039291018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819216', 'Rebecca Brignole', NULL, 'Rebecca called in with all questions for finance department.  I told her that I was unable to see her monthly premium, unable to see what for of payment was being used, unable to give her monthly receipts.  I told her that finance would call her tomorrow- I emailed Sunny and asked her to do so. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-07 16:20:46', '2019-08-07 16:20:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039291013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034425052', 'Douglas Osness', NULL, 'Both Douglas and Glenda called in to seek pre-approval for Glenda getting her hip scraped out due to her chiropractor taking an xray and diagnosing her with arthritis.  She wants to see a doctor by the name of Nathan Frakner.  I asked when the pain started.  and Glenda claimed a month ago.  I told her that this is something that she would need to get pre-approval with Sedera about and most likely be asked to go through the 2nd MD process.  Glenda tried to say that this procedure would be "preventative" because it would keep her from having a full hip replacement.  They didn''t really want to talk about 2nd MD and said that they would call Sedera on their own. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-07 15:16:04', '2019-08-07 15:16:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039269015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268087', 'Jason DePaola', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-07 13:55:25', '2019-08-07 13:55:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039301003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530219', 'Eva Hogan', NULL, 'Eva called in and needed some guidance on who to contact after being in the ER. I told her that she needs to get in contact with Sedera. She said word for word "Who the heck is Sedera? Why do I need to call so many people, why can''t you help me and tell me why you''re system sucks? Nothing is going through when I upload my bill." I explained to her who Sedera is and how they come into play with medical emergencies and anything that is an injury/illness. I told her about her IUA and to never pay more than that. Anything more than her IUA she is to ask to be billed the rest. She explained to me that "All of this is crazy and makes no sense". I tried to explain the best I could and that she really needs to get in contact with Sedera for her emergency bill''s before it meets her IUA. I also let her know that Redirect is her first point of contact when it comes to any other type of appointments. I asked if she spoke with Redirect before she went in to the ER and she said no. I explained that whenever she is trying to have any sort of appointment she needs to call Redirect first no matter what. They will guide her to where to go and what to do. She somewhat seemed to understand better after explaining everything and I provided her will Sedera''s number and Redirects number for future reference. Very very confused member. Somewhat better now but defiantly needs "hand holding" through everything.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-07 13:00:47', '2019-08-07 13:00:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039291008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001781007', 'William (Bill) Schaefer', NULL, 'Member spoke to Kelly F, I tried contacting him and sent him an email with all the ways to update CC, also told him to just give me a call directly if he needs assistance.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-07 10:31:55', '2019-08-07 10:31:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039291003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-07 10:23:44', '2019-08-07 10:23:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039269008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141080', 'James Ashford', NULL, 'Per John this member requested Proof of Insurance for child''s sports I generated PDF copy (in attachments) and sent out to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-07 09:40:36', '2019-08-07 09:40:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039286003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-08-07 09:30:20', '2019-08-07 09:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039269003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268017', 'Matthew Sayre', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 18-29 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-07 07:58:51', '2019-08-07 07:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called to ask what she should say at the ER, because she was there because her leg hurt.  I told her that she was to present herself as cash pay, to not pay anymore that and to ask to be billed for the rest.  She said that she thought it was different in an emergency situation and that she should have the hospital bill Sedera.  I told her no, it works the same way as any other need.  She still didn''t believe me and said that she wanted me to call Sedera.  I tried to transfer the line, spoke with Mady, Mady told me that Lori should speak to her case manager Lauren.  I left a message with Lauren- Lori had disconnected so I called Lori back- Evan answered the phone and said that it was all ok now because he gave his ASI card to the woman at the hospital- I explained that that wouldn''t work and explained to him everything that I had already explained to Lori.  He cut me off and asked that I speak with the person in charge of the hospital''s billing.  I said sure- I explained that they are cash pay patients, that they belong to a health cost sharing community, that they are not to pay anything over their IUA of $1,000 and will want to be billed the rest.   The person I spoke with on the phone seemed to understand completely what I was speaking of and thanked me.  I informed Mady as to what happened and she is going to have someone over at Sedera give Lori a call because obviously they want to re-hear the situation from Sedera directly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-06 16:34:24', '2019-08-06 16:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039222013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280302', 'Erin Tawney', NULL, 'Welcome call completed.  Member wants Husband and son (Collin) to complete risk assessment.  Needs new MEC cards and will call if she can''t find MPowering cards.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-08-06 14:03:54', '2019-08-06 14:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039219013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form on 8/1.  I have left 2 voice mails for him as he did not indicate what the change was.  I will wait for him to contact me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-06 13:10:28', '2019-08-06 13:10:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039222008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584008', 'Ahmis Loving', NULL, 'Member called in for help with the network.  I verified that her provider , Swedish Breast Center is in network.  Spoke to their billing office.  Sent email and left message for Ahmis', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-08-06 12:53:29', '2019-08-06 12:53:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039216018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756298', 'Kelly Niess', NULL, 'Kelly called in and she just wanted to make sure that she was doing the right thing when it comes to having an ultrasound on her hip tomorrow. I explained the whole process to her when it comes to an injury/illness and how to go about paying for that. I explained what her IUA is and to not pay anything over that. I explained that she needs to get in contact with Sedera when she is close to her IUA and what they will do to help her out. She seemed like she fully understood everything that I told her and I sent the email that explained how to submit her bill''s to Sedera. She was very thankful that I could help her out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-06 11:17:20', '2019-08-06 11:17:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039243003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, 'Jill spoke to member and updated account #. 
I processed August payment and acct set up on 8/6', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-08-06 11:06:05', '2019-08-06 11:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039216013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283187', 'Joan Wood', NULL, 'Joan called in and she needed some help with looking up providers in her area for Primary Care, Mammogram, and Colonoscopy. She had 2 providers that she used to go to the the primary care and mammogram. I looked them up and both of them are in network. So all I needed to do was email her a list of providers in her area for a gastroenterologist. I explained how she is going to present herself and to make sure she has her RCI card. She fully understood everything I told her and was very thankful with my help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-06 10:41:21', '2019-08-06 10:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039216008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191495', 'Wanda Loupas', NULL, 'Clyde called and asked if him and his wife are going to be getting the refund from us of the $50 charge. I spoke with Patti and she is processing the refund right now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-06 10:33:42', '2019-08-06 10:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039222003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295104', 'Michael Dendy', NULL, 'Member called in.  Had an irregular EKG test.  Referred to cardiologist who wants to do a cardiac catheterization.  Gave him instructions on contacting Sedera.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-08-06 09:15:32', '2019-08-06 09:15:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039219008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006781019', 'Debra Spry', NULL, 'Member submitted a cancellation request I will cancel subscription &amp; refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-06 09:12:06', '2019-08-06 09:12:06');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000039219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173062', 'Eileen Mlack', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I have cancelled subscription &amp; refunded Aug pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-06 09:06:25', '2019-08-06 09:06:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280403', 'Marne Gleason', NULL, 'Marne called in and stated that she wanted me to look up a few doctors that were given to her by Ron to double check they are in network still. All 3 were in the PHCS network. She asked what to present to the providers when she makes the appointments and I explained how to go about that with her RCI card and made it clear that she is not self pay, which she thought she was. I let her know she is only self pay for medical emergencies up to her $500 IUA. She understood. She then asked me to look up a few coupons for her for a prescription she will be needing in the near future. Her last request was to look up pricing for a dermatologist and eye care that she goes to. I let her know I would do my best with that and let her know if I find anything. Will be emailing her the coupons and also an email that explains how she presents her MEC. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-06 08:40:28', '2019-08-06 08:40:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039208003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039164151', 'Reid Holtzclaw - Swan', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-06 07:32:03', '2019-08-06 07:32:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039191018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'elliemorgantoevs@gmail.com Ellie called to find a list of doctors that are in network in her area because she just moved.  I sent her a link and instructions so she can do her own searches.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-05 17:29:43', '2019-08-05 17:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039191013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, 'called to reschedule welcome call- I sent her another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-05 16:57:33', '2019-08-05 16:57:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039191008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191495', 'Wanda Loupas', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent a form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-05 16:37:37', '2019-08-05 16:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039191003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757110', 'Brandon Lowitz', NULL, 'Brandon called in a bit frazzled over not knowing about anything involving the membership that he and his wife had enrolled in.   He said that it wasn''t what he was used to with traditional insurance.  I answered his questions and asked him to schedule a welcome call with the scheduler I sent him.  He was uneasy about Redirect making doctor appointments for him- and he was also uneasy about the fact that he will now have to pay out of pocket for his monthly chronic med script.  I explained to him how our prescription program helps- but he was feeling pretty annoyed with the fact that if his doctor were to script him something that is very expensive that he would have to wait 2 weeks to buy it from Reid and then have it delivered to his home. I sent him a prescription quote form, welcome call scheduler, and Sedera videos to keep him happy til his call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-05 14:24:59', '2019-08-05 14:24:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039184019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033498005', 'Ronald Voelker Jr.', NULL, 'Spoke again to Michelle Voelker - sent proposal to be signed...she will sign and send back to me...then we will arrange to speak with each member to explain program with Sedera and then send Sedera the company setup.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-08-05 14:00:21', '2019-08-05 14:00:21'),
