  ('zcrm_1579374000039120013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141256', 'John Phibbs', NULL, 'Jennifer Chasteen got back to me about the eye dilation and exam.  I emailed the member all of the details. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-02 15:54:12', '2019-08-02 15:54:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039120008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Called to update payment info. sent her the form.  she asked what she should do to seek holistic services for her stress as preventative care.  I told her that it wasn''t considered preventative care.  Then she said....well I guess Sedera wouldn''t.  I told her that if she would like to have Sedera share she would need pre approval of the treatment by Sedera. (Sept 1 guidelines) - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-02 15:16:19', '2019-08-02 15:16:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039120003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677493', 'Caroline McClure', NULL, 'Leo Brussel the son of Caroline called in to follow up with Kelly F per Andrea Hinman surrounding the price of a medication.  I couldn''t get in touch with Kelly so explained that she probably has reached out to Reid already and we will update he and his mother with the results of that. He wanted to make sure that we had his contact info 720-220-9578 and leo.brussel@gmail.com - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-02 14:39:28', '2019-08-02 14:39:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039115003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578112', 'Tiffany Covell', NULL, 'Member contacted me to ask questions about cancellation.  I advised of the deadline and sent out the email.  Possibility of them getting other coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-02 13:55:18', '2019-08-02 13:55:18'),
