  ('zcrm_1579374000039054019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311167', 'Sonia Brown', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to update address.  I will update with all carriers.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-02 07:32:20', '2019-08-02 07:32:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039054008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657058', 'Douglas Evans', NULL, 'Per Member''s request I was able to get Sedera to push back start date until 9/1.  I will just cancel the pmt for Sept and resume with Oct pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-02 07:18:34', '2019-08-02 07:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039054003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, 'Per Member''s request I was able to get Sedera to push back start date until 9/1.  I will just cancel the pmt for Sept and resume with Oct pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-08-02 07:17:48', '2019-08-02 07:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039043003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899490', 'Savannah Jones', NULL, 'Austin called in to report that Savannah is pregnant- I congratulated them both.  I told him that due to new guidelines coming out Sept 1, that it would be best to give Sedera a call in the morning to ask what they need to expect.  I sent the guidelines but told them to expect that update.  I sent Sedera videos, because there was some confusion on what we do, and what Sedera does.  I also sent a link and instructions on how to upload bills to Sedera.   He was surprised I answered so late but was happy for all of the help!. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-08-01 19:57:46', '2019-08-01 19:57:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039038003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359289', 'Jorge Zatarain', NULL, 'Jorge called in and wanted to know what his next step is going to be once he has met his IUA of the $5000. He let me know what was going on as of a couple month ago and that he still has a few appointments left he needs to take care of in regards to this same "Need". He said that he is already at about $4500 and everything he has left will put him at about $10,000. I told him that he needs to get in contact with Sedera ASAP right now after he gets off the phone with me before he goes in for any other of those appointment that are left. I explained how Sedera works and what they are going to do to help him and start a case for him. I 100% understood and took down Sedera''s phone number and is calling them right now. I also sent him an email that explains how to submit his bills to Sedera and that it has instructions on what to do. He thanked me very much for the info and is doing what he needs to do right away. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-08-01 13:37:05', '2019-08-01 13:37:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039020008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788057', 'Jean Thompson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-08-01 09:51:59', '2019-08-01 09:51:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039029003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085037', 'Kaitlin Robinson', NULL, 'Did second welcome call.  Member was on with her mother.  Kaitlin had kidney stones removed in April.  When told this was likely a pre existing condition, the mother said they need to look at another plan that would cover her potential kidney issues.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-08-01 07:52:20', '2019-08-01 07:52:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000039020003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038206005', 'Marie Brennan', NULL, 'Brian called to ask why he couldn''t access Teladoc or the HRA- I told him it was because his info was still being inputted.  He said that he scheduled a welcome call yesterday but didn''t hear from anyone.  I told him that a good rule of thumb would be to schedule a welcome call around the middle of the month, that way all vendors will have had time to get everything to you and you will be able to understand what is being said in the call better.  He sounded kinda bummed that "everything is on hold"  so I sent him the Sedera videos to go through for now!. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-31 15:46:32', '2019-07-31 15:46:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038992013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Member went ahead and got colonoscopy to the tune of $4K and has DPC.  I directed her to Sedera to see if they can negotiate this price and share.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-31 13:44:03', '2019-07-31 13:44:03'),
