  ('zcrm_1579374000038939055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004339007', 'Phil Guinouard', NULL, 'Called in and cancelled, sent cancellation email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-31 11:29:17', '2019-07-31 11:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038948008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809171', 'Joseph Ayers', NULL, 'Lisa called in.  Got her U.S. Corporate account squared away.  explained the reason for the risk assessment, sent provider lookup link and instructions on how to present MEC card.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-31 10:06:57', '2019-07-31 10:06:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038939047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '07.31.19:  Called Denise. She''s in Montreal vacationing but will call me when she gets back to FL. Said she will probably enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-07-31 09:21:17', '2019-07-31 09:23:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038939042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '07.24.19:  Called Denise. She wants co-pay plan. Told her we will no longer be offering it  and explained why. Recommended ReDirect plan. She like it until she realized she''d be paying more for our new plans than the original HEP plan she had.  Asked for website to review all plans again.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-07-31 09:18:47', '2019-07-31 09:18:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038981003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036932053', 'Brent Anderson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member not in front of computer at time of welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-31 09:18:03', '2019-07-31 09:18:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038939037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '07.23.19:  Recvd. text from Denise.  Wants to talk about program and possibly enroll.  Scheduled a call for tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-07-31 09:16:36', '2019-07-31 09:16:36'),
