  ('zcrm_1579374000038968018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547326', 'Kyle Evans', NULL, 'Good evening Kyle,

I got your email below and thought I would try to help answer your questions.  The phone number we have on this end is - 815-508-3752 I don''t know if that differs from the phone number that Sedera has in their system or not, but I will check in with them to see what is going on, either myself or Kelly Fredrickson (the daytime concierge) will get back in touch with you tomorrow with some resolution with that issue.

For the card- are you speaking about your Apex or RCI card, in other words the card you would show to receive your ACA mandated preventive services?  or are you questioning whether or not you are to receive a card from Sedera?
Sedera does not issue cards, because they are not insurance, but if you are referring to the card you use for your preventative care we can definitely help you by ordering one.

Have a great night and we will be in touch tomorrow!


-KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-30 19:55:58', '2019-07-30 19:55:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038968013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, 'Art called in hoping that MPowering Benefits could point him in the right direction on the best price for a vascectomy because Sedera told him that they wouldn''t cover it.  I told him that he would need the CPT code for that procedure and to give Sedera a call.  He asked even if they won''t pay for it?  I told him yes, that they still want to save him money.  He said he would call them tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-30 17:46:06', '2019-07-30 17:46:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038968008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036932155', 'Amy Betancourt', NULL, 'called in to ask a question about seeing a dermatologist.  Redirected her to Redirect and there online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-30 16:24:39', '2019-07-30 16:24:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038966018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085232', 'Richard Wilkinson', NULL, '7-30-19 Richard called to express he''s happy with his current IUA. Wanted to check on Melissa''s AUA. Told him her membership is different and her start date was Jan. 1st 2017 therefore changes will likely take place for the new year. Her AUA is $1000 with LHS right now. He''s happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-30 16:07:34', '2019-07-30 16:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038966008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '7-30-19 Called to move start date back to Sept 1 for Mary and Doug but wants to keep Aug. 1st for Augustine. Told her in vm it''s not possible to split start dates like that for a child. Also already been billed. She says she can''t cancel Medishare for Aug. 1st now. Not sure what to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-30 15:26:02', '2019-07-30 15:26:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038968003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809171', 'Joseph Ayers', NULL, 'Lisa called in upset because she was told that someone was sending a new link to her for the HRA- and it never came, she said that the last few weeks she has been trying to get this resolved and that she is scared we are going to cancel her.  She said that she didn''t understand why she needed to do this- I explained why and she said that no one told her that she needed to reffer people to the plan.  She said that she has called 4 times in the last 2 weeks and that every time someone promises her a link and she has never received it. I told her that if the link doesn''t work any longer then John Kach would have to get back to her with a link.  I gave her his direct line and work hours for tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-30 15:24:00', '2019-07-30 15:24:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038966003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '7-30-19 Wanted to understand pre-x clause with new Guideline changes. He understands again. He will also call Concierge to sign up for Teledoc which he never did initially.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-30 14:48:35', '2019-07-30 14:48:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038946017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, 'Matt called in and was a little confused on being told that he could not go to a Lab Corp to get his annual blood work done. He stated someone from here told him otherwise and that he had to go somewhere else 20 miles away. I transferred the call to Guy and Guy told him that he can absolutely go to the Lab Corp because Lab Corp is under the PHCS network. Matt was much happier to hear that and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-30 11:28:52', '2019-07-30 11:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038948003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068140', 'Michele Venne', NULL, 'member called Kelly C regarding the $3000 deductible on her card.  Left message', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-30 08:43:04', '2019-07-30 08:43:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038946008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'Called in to check and make sure that her daughters doctor was in network to go ahead and schedule a yearly physical for Ella. I checked on MultiPlan and the doctor is in network and explained to her on how to present herself and show her ASI card. Member is all set and understands the process and what to do. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-30 08:38:10', '2019-07-30 08:38:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038946003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004971047', 'Jeff Myers', NULL, 'August payment late. Sent notice', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-30 08:33:13', '2019-07-30 08:33:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038939008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455033', 'Manuel Viarrial', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  Have cancelled subscription.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-30 07:18:00', '2019-07-30 07:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Ian called in and wanted more guidance on how to sign up for US Copr Wellness I left him VM letting him know to log in w his email and QR Life code.  I will email him his QR Life code.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-30 07:08:37', '2019-07-30 07:08:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038921028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033417', 'Lauren Magin', NULL, 'Someone from Lauren''s University called in for an EOB, I explained the entire plan that Lauren has- explained that her MEC is only for preventative care, her Sedera membership - but not being an insurance.  I explained to this woman that if my explanation of Lauren''s benefits weren''t enough, that she would ask Lauren to contact Sedera for a letter and that is what has helped some of our other members. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-29 18:59:41', '2019-07-29 18:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038921023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141256', 'John Phibbs', NULL, 'Krista called in wondering if her husband''s medical eye dilation would be something that she can use her co-pay benefits towards.  She said that the doctor wants to do it to be safe as John has diabetes.  I told her that I didn''t know if her plan would be compatible with that test or not.  I tagged her in an email sent to Jennifer Chasteen so she can see the answer to this right away. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-29 16:38:07', '2019-07-29 16:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038887028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '7-29-19 She called to make sure she can cancel her current ins for Aug. 1st. I resent her the Welcome email since she hadn''t seen any of them. She will look for Sedera''s and Redirect''s emails.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-29 16:28:19', '2019-07-29 16:28:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038887023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455033', 'Manuel Viarrial', NULL, '7-29-19 Called bc LHS needs to send a letter to clear their name of $14,062.94 old bill from 11/28/17 which was finally paid 5/5/19. I told him that we''re not LHS and he will need to have them do that. I explained we severed ties with LHS a while back. Then he understood MPB is the $50 portion of membership which he said he''s never used. So, I showed him how to cancel membership online which he did while I waited for him to do so. Effective next billing cycle.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-29 16:21:22', '2019-07-29 16:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038921018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', NULL, 'Jay called in with many questions, but most surrounding his son''s Anxiety and wanting to see a psychiatrist.  I went over his guidelines (and sent a copy), went over the counseling service (and sent more info), and told him about the Teladoc Behavioral Health option with all info. He asked me about the necessity of filling out the HRA and he said that he would get it finished asap. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-29 15:57:16', '2019-07-29 15:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038911008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280403', 'Marne Gleason', NULL, 'Welcome call done', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-29 15:36:24', '2019-07-29 15:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038921013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, 'Carolyn called in upset that she received a $2,000 bill for her sons MRI, when she made sure that the facility was in network and had paid her $200 already.  I asked if she had spoken to RCI, she was a bit perplexed as to who they are- I explained and transferred the line to Jennifer Chasteen, who told me that she had been emailing Mrs. Assell back and forth all day. She did tell me "well, if Sedera had done their due dillegence we wouldn''t be in this position." I asked about that.  She said that they had gone through all of the "hurdles" that Sedera put them through, even 2nd MD and it was denied.  SO I told her that we would start with RCI to get their side, and if she needed we could touch bases with Sedera afterwards.  I am going to reach out to Jennifer to see how it went. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-29 15:35:58', '2019-07-29 15:35:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038921008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006366101', 'Laurie Adams', NULL, 'Laurie called in stating that she was just told by Liberty Health Share that we have not been affiliated with them since Fed 2018 and that she wants a full refund.  I told her that wouldn''t be possible at the moment because home office was closed.  She asked when they opened and I said 9-5 and she said would call back then. She was a bit ticked off. I sent a cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-29 15:09:14', '2019-07-29 15:09:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038921003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, 'Gordon called in because his college age daughter had broken her arm, during a time when she had health insurance through her college.  She gave the hospital that insurance card when she got to the ER initially and that is the insurance info that the surgeon has as well.  I told Gordon that I was going to send him instructions and a link on how to upload bills so he can open a need with Sedera. I tried to transfer his call to Natalie at Sedera but his call dropped.  I called him back and he told me that he didn''t have time to speak with Sedera today because he is running errands, but he had another question as to why he is paying the same amount if his IUA has been raised?  I tried to transfer him to Sunny, no answer, I told him that I would make sure to copy him in an email to her so that she could help explain it to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-29 14:54:11', '2019-07-29 14:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038915003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280169', 'James Karst', NULL, 'Member didn''t have access to a computer during the welcome call. He verbalized understanding of his plan and I encouraged him to schedule another welcome call if he needed more assistance.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-07-29 12:20:56', '2019-07-29 12:20:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038887018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '7-29-19 Clarified everything with Elizabeth. She cancelled her DPC membership in April of 2018 unbeknownst to MPB. She continued to get her discount until 7/1/19. With the Basic MEC paired with DPC it does not cover annual wellness visits. Purely just included to satisfy ACA laws for those with DPC. Her visit in Oct of 2018 will be her responsibility to pay for. She understands and will pay it. She now has her ASi card for her non-DPC Select Group membership. She will go in-network but she''s still looking for a good new PCP in-network. She''s knows most of the doctors and hasn''t found someone that she''s sold on yet. She will let me know if she finds someone and vice versa.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-29 12:19:07', '2019-07-29 12:19:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038911003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280403', 'Marne Gleason', NULL, 'Answered questions regarding tyroid and preventative', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-29 11:41:16', '2019-07-29 11:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038897023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672389', 'Scott Schemel', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-29 10:59:59', '2019-07-29 10:59:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038897018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115365', 'Elizabeth Bennett', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-29 10:27:55', '2019-07-29 10:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038897013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171129', 'Rhiannon Wilson', NULL, 'Spoke to Mom says daughter has a crazy schedule. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-29 10:14:19', '2019-07-29 10:14:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038897008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322368', 'Gretchen Wilson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-29 10:01:34', '2019-07-29 10:01:34'),
