  ('zcrm_1579374000038836016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '7-26-19 Called to find out how to change IUA. Remembered I told her she can change it for Aug. 1st. I left her a vm to let her know it''s been delayed tent to be effective Sept. 1st. She will receive an email when allowed to make the change.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-26 14:35:48', '2019-07-26 14:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038836008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '7-26-19 Called to find out if LHS will reimburse for cost of labs for annual wellness visit. She ordered the labs on her own. I told her to ask her Dr. to code the labs as wellness with the Z codes in order for it to be considered part of wellness visit.  She will do that. She learned how much cheaper the labs are as self pay and figured LHS will be very happy about that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-26 14:25:00', '2019-07-26 14:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038836003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411061', 'Donn Kellogg', NULL, '7-26-19 Donn called to apologize for his behavior last time when we talked. He didn''t understand how this all works and he now has a better understanding. He wants help to submit a Need with Sedera for a sudden hearing loss that happened two weeks ago. He was put on steroids and it seems to be helping bc he was talking to me with the "bad" ear. He''s planning to lay off employee (BD) soon and wanted to understand how that would affect everyone''s membership. Just told him we''d have to change the payment method for BD moving forward. Everyone is paid for Aug. already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-26 13:55:49', '2019-07-26 13:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038831003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653045', 'Mary Poole', NULL, 'We received check back because member hadn''t updated his address with us.  Member''s husband called in and spoke to John asking if check had been mailed.  We informed him that check had been mailed he then advised us of new address.  I am resending now.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-26 13:01:02', '2019-07-26 13:01:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038825008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162592', 'Aaron Lujan', NULL, 'Refunded August 2019 Payment $776.00', 'Jill Gretz', 'Jill Gretz', '2019-07-26 12:53:40', '2019-07-26 12:53:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038825003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021782202', 'Michael Deifik', NULL, 'Refunded August 2019 Payment $354.00', 'Jill Gretz', 'Jill Gretz', '2019-07-26 12:48:12', '2019-07-26 12:48:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038812018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, 'Matt called in and needed some information on what his next step is in regards to a persistent cough that has been going on for quite some time now. He understands what his IUA is and how much($1000). He informed me that he has spend about $500 already with doctors visit and medication that he had to get. His doctor now is recommending a CAT scan to check out his sinuses. I told him that he will present himself as a self paying patient and needs to pay the other $500 and then ask the provider to bill him the rest. Once he has gotten all the bills of proof that he has met his IUA he will then submit everything over to Sedera and they will start a "Need" with him. I explained how that works and what Sedera will be doing next. I sent him the email that explains how to submit his bills over to Sedera. I told him since he knows that this CAT scan is going to put him over his IUA to call Sedera ASAP to let them know what is going on and that they can start his case ahead of time. He will get in touch with his provider to get the bills that he has already paid for and to keep all records of them for Sedera. He fully understood everything and felt a lot better that it is not going to be a huge process to deal with. Very grateful for all the info I provided him and will call Sedera after he got off the phone with me. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-26 12:33:51', '2019-07-26 12:33:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038812013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659598', 'Christina Bremner Anderson', NULL, 'Patti spoke with Christina, her husband was in the hospital and wanted to know how to deal with it. She told her that she needs to start a "Need" with Sedera. Sent her the how to submit bills to Sedera. Patti also let her know that Christina is responsible out of pocket $1000 for her IUA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-26 12:22:02', '2019-07-26 12:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038812008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '7-26-19 Melissa selected me as her agent for C4 and we started app but she realized she''s not sure if her x has actually completed the divorce filing or not since she will have to show proof of the divorce for the SEP. She''s going to call her lawyer to get verification and will call me on Monday to apply for the cheapest plan for one month before HEP starts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-26 12:07:12', '2019-07-26 12:07:12'),
