  ('zcrm_1579374000038773018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'Terry called in because he had just moved to Texas and wanted to look up a doctor in his area for his preventative care benefits.  I sent him the link and instructions to do just that.  I also sent him the "script", and 5 ways to avoid surprise bills at your preventative care appointment.  Also sent the address update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-25 15:22:26', '2019-07-25 15:22:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038771008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '7-25-19 Called bc Eddisha with Sedera told Marta her cataract surgery that she suddenly needs is considered pre-x. Dr. Carl Hanson says it''s NOT pre-x. It just came about the other day bc it''s suddenly interfering with her vision. She already got the 2nd MD opinion that it''s not elective, it''s absolutely necessary right away. Her IUA will be lowered by $250. She''s in her 2nd year of membership which means costs are shared up to $25K. Dr. Hanson has told her costs will be around $5K for surgery. I told her to give all info to Eddisha and make sure she''s in agreement. If not, call me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-25 15:01:04', '2019-07-25 15:01:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038773013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005223005', 'Barbara Savastano', NULL, 'Called to cancel due to going on the medicare in Oct. sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-25 14:48:46', '2019-07-25 14:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038728056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384233', 'Gregory Tatham', NULL, 'Greg called and asked if there is any recommendation for wisdom teeth removal for one of his children. I was unsure of that and had Patti explain to him. There is no dental coverage for his plan and it would not go towards his IUA either b/c Dental is not under medical health, Dental is it''s own separate type of insurance. Even though wisdom teeth removal is a surgery it would still fall under the category of Dental. He was a little upset but understood and thanked us for an answer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-25 14:22:19', '2019-07-25 14:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038773008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141256', 'John Phibbs', NULL, 'It was CU Boulder calling to make sure my son has coverage and so we can waive the student provided medical insurance.

Thanks,
Krista Phibbs', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-25 14:08:37', '2019-07-25 14:08:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038773003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141256', 'John Phibbs', NULL, 'Krista called in regarding the doctor''s office that called in late yesterday afternoon to us.  She said that she has "no clue" who that doctor is, but that it may be the people who are handling her sons college admission, she says that her son was asked to provide proof of health cost coverage. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-25 14:00:54', '2019-07-25 14:00:54'),
