  ('zcrm_1579374000038771003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001347005', 'Lyna Norberg', NULL, '7-25-19 Lyna is still not making any progress with her sleep study bill to be processed by LHS. It''s about 1 year old now. She will send me all relevant communications and data for me to forward to Nancy. She was working with Amanda Stevens and has been passed of to Amanda''s Assistance Carla Welch.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-25 12:40:38', '2019-07-25 12:40:38'),
