  ('zcrm_1579374000038728051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'Sent provider list highlighted with the specific providers that are in network at the location Eban has been referred to. Good to go for making an appointment for a colonoscopy. Eban was thrilled it was so easy to find and that he can go to the facility his primary care doctor referred him to! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-25 12:25:44', '2019-07-25 12:25:44'),
