  ('zcrm_1579374000038728046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130659', 'James Kalow', NULL, 'Called into cancel, I sent the cancellation email. He said if his job is not going to offer him the medical benefits he wants to re-enroll. I said absolutely he can do that. Was happy to hear that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-25 12:12:21', '2019-07-25 12:12:21'),
