  ('zcrm_1579374000038749011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268087', 'Jason DePaola', NULL, 'I called Jason to follow-up.  I answered a couple more questions today about how Sedera covers sharing for illnesses the occur after enrollment.  He assured me that both of them have no pre-existing conditions.  He also ask if i could email him the wellness network information so he could call them to see if his/her doctors particiate in the network.  I am sending that out today.  I also spoke with him about the possibility of forming a small group (list bill) for 1-4 employees in his office.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-25 09:57:01', '2019-07-25 09:57:01'),
