  ('zcrm_1579374000038749003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Received a call today from Allision asking if she was ready to go (meaning enrolled for an 8-1 effective date.  I checked with Patti and in the enrollment platform but we show nothing.  She said she had canceled her Aliera program and I advised her to contact them immediately and ask to extend it another month.  Fishy....I don''t even have her email in the CRM record file and I always get that information.  I ask her she entered her payment information and she said no.  I told her well then you did not enroll if no payment information was provided.  I ask her she had time to enroll right now and she said she was on a train.  I ask to set-up a time and date and she said well I''m kinda busy so I''ll call you when I have the time to enroll. ?*?', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-25 09:24:42', '2019-07-25 09:24:42'),
