  ('zcrm_1579374000038634150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141256', 'John Phibbs', NULL, 'Someone called from a Dr Cherif Fall''s doctors office to verify coverage for John,  I told this person that John had a co-pay plan, and that John needed to give this office the correct card so that they can contact RCI about what kind of coverage he has.  The man told me that the appointment wasn''t today, but that he was just calling the number on the card.  I am sending John an email concerning this as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-24 16:06:42', '2019-07-24 16:06:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038634145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068140', 'Michele Venne', NULL, 'Michele called in wondering why her MEC card wasn''t working at her doctors office- I told her because she was giving them the wrong card.  I explained the situation and requested  that a card and a copy of the ASI card be sent to her and tagged her in that email.  She was uncertain about preventative care so I explained and then sent her many educational emails to support the conversation that we had. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-24 15:51:25', '2019-07-24 15:51:25'),
