  ('zcrm_1579374000038652029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Wendy called and asked me to refund August payment back to member''s account to avoid late fees and process the payment on the 28th instead. August payment was approved so I refunded it and scheduled a payment for July 28th', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-24 13:28:35', '2019-07-24 13:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038652021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Member had payments set up for the 28th of the month. After price changes FTNI was set up back to the payments coming out on the 22nd. She called upset that we have to reimburse her for her bank fees because the payment went through earlier. Did not refund her anything and explained technically she is an exception. Set up FTNI to pull reoccurring payments on the 28th.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-24 13:18:08', '2019-07-24 13:18:32'),
