  ('zcrm_1579374000038634093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677458', 'Susanne Kortals', NULL, 'After receiving an email thread from Sedera to this member where Sedera committed to keeping this member on thru August due to a pre-approved  Knee Replacement.  We will honor Sedera''s decision and then cancel her eff 10/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-24 13:04:55', '2019-09-24 13:29:11'),
