  ('zcrm_1579374000038651013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268087', 'Jason DePaola', NULL, 'Spoke to Jason and did a full presentation. Jason & Jennifer (wife) are age 46.  I covered everything!  He wants to discuss with his wife before he enrolls.  He kept asking about Sedera and if he could go direct.  I told him no.  Jason called me back shortly after our call and ask how many people does Sedera need to form a group and I told him 5.  I called and left a message for Luke via on Shana''s voice mail alerting Sedera they will probably get a call from Jason (who I think works at a law firm) that he will try to form a group and to direct.  I asked Shana to ask Luke if MPB can be a part of this since I spent over an hour talking to him.  Pending a reply.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-24 12:36:32', '2019-07-25 09:48:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038670010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788094', 'Daniel Webb', NULL, 'Dan called in and was curious why payment was taken out before he had his welcome call and before he starts in Aug 1st. I explained the payments come out on the 22nd of every month for that following month. He was fine with that after I explained and Liz will be calling him in about 5 minutes for a Welcome Call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-24 12:25:00', '2019-07-24 12:25:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038670005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, 'Scott called in and asked if a genetic depression test via mouth swab would be covered under this preventative plan. I spoke with Guy and he said it would not. Scott would need to get a prescription from his doctor stating that this test needs to be done and he can get the test done at a lab facility. I emailed Scott and asked if his doctor has done this already and if not that is what would need to be done. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-24 11:42:49', '2019-07-24 11:42:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038671008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '7-24-19 Enrolled in Provider Directed $1500/$410 bc uses tobacco on occasion. I read her the entire tobacco clause from the Access Guidelines to make sure she knows the limitations. I told her to focus on quitting over the next year and show proof via doctor and blood test to eliminate the clause. At end of call I asked again if she needed me to re-read the clause to make sure she''s comfortable with it. She said no, she understands.  We will sign her up for C4 tomorrow for the month of Aug bc she has SEP due to recent divorce and left with no ins for June, July and Aug. X chose not to pay Cobra.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-24 11:32:23', '2019-07-24 11:32:23'),
