  ('zcrm_1579374000038621008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '7-23-19 Kyle is looking for dental again for kids and someone who needs tooth extraction. Kids needs 2nd round of ortho soon. He''s looking at Spirit Dental and HMA. He can possibly have dentist delay payment by 1 year or so which would help to buiid HMA account. Or put the ins $ towards HMA entirely to have larger account. Not worth the 10% savings in year one for Spirit in my opinion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-23 17:11:41', '2019-07-23 17:12:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038620018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008568067', 'Andrea Williamson', NULL, 'Andrea called in wondering why when her husband got into a card accident yesterday that the hospital wouldn''t accept her ASI card and stated that it was only meant for preventative care.   I explained why.  Then she asked what he should have done...I told her that because he was in a car accident he would be going either through their car insurance or the person whom was at faults insurance.  Only after that and depending on the circumstances Sedera would step in.  I tried to transfer the call to Sedera, but they were closed for the day- I left a message with them on Andrea''s behalf- I sent Andrea an email about how to open up a need with Sedera, Sedera educational videos, and an email explaining that I tried to call and speak with her, but that it went to voicemail- I copy and pasted the sedera select guidelines concerning motor vehicles as well as a full PDF copy of the guidelines. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-23 17:04:57', '2019-07-23 17:04:57'),
