  ('zcrm_1579374000038583018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '7-23-19 Robin wants to be able to go to All Valley Women''s Care in Aspen and Basalt. I asked David after calling AVWC. AVWC told me they accept self-pay patients no problem. Annual wellness visit is $300-$330, urine sample $30, blood work draw $45. Regular Dr. visit is range of $75-$215 depending on diagnosis from visit. David with Redirect said this should be no problem to work with them.  I left  a vm for Robin to share this info so she can consider switching to Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-23 13:30:31', '2019-07-23 13:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038607028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130432', 'Desiree Smith', NULL, 'New pmt set up in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-23 12:51:58', '2019-07-23 12:51:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038621003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162592', 'Aaron Lujan', NULL, 'Aaron called in and wanted to cancel before the payment came out. Patti told them that the payment came out yesterday on the 22nd. Someone had told Aaron it comes out on the 24th. We informed him that I will send a cancellation email out and to fill it out and send it back. Patti also informed Aaron that once we get the money we will refund it back into his account. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-23 12:36:01', '2019-07-23 12:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038607023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'I got with ASi and was assured that Gideon was on the plan and has had continuous coverage since 1/1/18.   I left VM with Heather to let her know this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-23 12:05:44', '2019-07-23 12:05:44'),
