  ('zcrm_1579374000038583013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, '7-23-19 Left vm to find out date of service and clinic for her mammogram to help John Kach when he reached Monica at ASi. Lori has been talking with Monica and told her the bill had already been paid but the clinic says they haven''t received payment yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-23 11:12:28', '2019-07-23 11:12:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038583008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '7-23-19 She called to proceed but knows she missed the 20th deadline and wants to find out what she can do. I left her a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-23 10:59:19', '2019-07-23 10:59:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038583003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '7-23-19 Called to make sure her new membership is all set. I told her to keep an eye out for an email from Redirect with instructions and the Customer Care line that she must call First before going to any doctor! She understands and will wait for the email and for Aug. 1st to schedule an appointment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-23 10:54:51', '2019-07-23 10:54:51'),
