  ('zcrm_1579374000038561013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024916026', 'Elizabeth Hammond', NULL, 'Elizabeth called to state that she didn''t want the new form of payment to "bounce" on us, so I told her that I would let Sunny know.  She said that she would be calling Sunny tomorrow morning during business hours. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-22 18:01:42', '2019-07-22 18:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038561008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593044', 'Jonathan Blaylock', NULL, 'Sophia filled out a prescription med quote form for her birth control.  I emailed her all of Redirect''s contact info due to the fact that she should be receiving it at no change through their program due to it being an ACA compliant program. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-22 17:12:37', '2019-07-22 17:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038554024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038730073', 'Ashley Chod', NULL, '7-22-19 Enrolling right now for Provider Directed with Redirect bc lives in Aspen. Fastest enrollment ever.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-22 15:08:07', '2019-07-22 15:16:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038554019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '7-22-19 Looks like I connected with her 3 years ago at We2e meeting. Will have to merge files once this one is converted. She is 43 and daughter is 9, self-employed and cost is going to be $700+ for the 2 of them. They are very healthy and pay out of pocket for most services since seeks mostly naturopathic in nature. She''s an acupuncturist herself. She''s never had an HSA. She''s a good candidate for PSDHC or PDHC. Only goes to Dr. 1x year for annual physical and blood work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-22 14:53:59', '2019-07-22 14:53:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038561003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162541', 'Harry Shaffer', NULL, 'Harry called to ask about the needs process and his DPC doctor referring him to a urologist.  I explained the entire process as well as sent corresponding emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-22 14:37:18', '2019-07-22 14:37:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038554011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '7-22-19 Eric is turning 50 on 7/28/19, wife is 49 and Emily LeMasters 22 and son 20. Deciding if they will file daughter as dependent or not. Son is dependent. But, he has some digestive issues which seems to be somewhat managed and sees specialist about 2x year now. Will discuss if anything major can come from his issues. Told him to ask the Dr. He says they all see a dr. about 2-3x per yr. Redirect makes most sense for them.  Eric has high blood pressure and high cholesterol both managed by meds, Lipitor and Cozaar and they are each only about $6 per 30, 90 days. They do not have insurance now and job ended June 30th. Little time left to get son on trad ins if needs to go down that path. Cobra was going to be about $2700 a month! He likes the sounds of this and will talk it over with his wife. She will join us on our call on Wed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-22 14:10:06', '2019-07-24 13:08:24'),
