  ('zcrm_1579374000038502003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141209', 'Ryan Phibbs', NULL, 'Spoke w/Analisa about this member late 7/19.  She said that member wishes to cancel bc they now have access to Employer coverage.  She advised that member had be treated for headaches in the past and might be an issue re:Pre Ex.  I sent member Cancellation Request and will cancel &amp; have Sunny refund set up &amp; July share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-20 08:33:20', '2019-07-20 08:33:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038492008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000243019', 'Rachel Streater', NULL, 'accidentally called here instead of Liberty. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-19 16:04:44', '2019-07-19 16:04:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038477026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162382', 'Juan Rosas', NULL, '7--19-19 James White is likely part of a Group Employer membership, not an Indiv member through us. Therefore, he doesn''t get the referral fee since he''s not a member with us. James lives in Tacoma (I think), WA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-19 15:11:25', '2019-07-19 15:11:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038492003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032739022', 'Kim Fowlkes', NULL, 'Kim called to ask about how the preventative care portion, as well as the medical need portion works.   I spoke to her at length and explained everything, answered her questions and sent her a ton of educational templates to go through.  I told her to give me a call if she had any further questions after going through what the emails were intended to describe and instruct.  She also wanted to thank us for getting to her scripts so quickly, she has been pretty impressed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-19 14:32:36', '2019-07-19 14:32:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038491008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Commission - 50% Ron Patterson - 50% MPB/House', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-19 14:09:41', '2019-07-19 14:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038491003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Spoke to Allison today, she had more questions about annual wellness, how to use the program and general stuff.  She needs to cancel Aliera before the end of this month.  I walked her through the enrollment process.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-19 14:06:30', '2019-07-19 14:06:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038469008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called in and was asking how to get in contact with Sedera to get an update on his bill and the status. He is worried because the bill is over 90 days old and he is afraid of it going into collections. Informed me that he has been in talks with Guy about this and just wants to "Ball to get rolling ASAP". I told him i 100% understand where he is coming from and once Guy send the bills, which he did, to Sedera it gets working on right away. I gave him Sedera''s phone number and told him to call them and explain what he told me and they will be more than happy to give him an update and I also told him that he can get the case workers name and direct phone number for who is working on his case so he can get direct information from them instead of having to go through multiple people to get an answer. He was happy to hear that and was a little more relieved that he was able to get Sedera''s direct number. I told him that I would email or call Guy to let him know that he(John) has called in and needs an update. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-19 13:18:53', '2019-07-19 13:18:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038450023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'Member requested Apex ID Cards.  I ordered new set and emailed PDF copy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-19 12:32:14', '2019-07-19 12:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038477018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529351', 'Rebecca Stirling', NULL, '7-19-19 Becky is healthy, no pre-x, prefers holistic, Becky had cataract surgery and cold sores and daughter broke wrist this year. That''s it for pre-x. Listened to audion and watched videos. Very limited network for PHCS in 96714, only 6 options w/in 20 miles! Recommended Redirect so they can see the doctors of their choice. Looking at $1000/$567 for parent/child. Will add daughter and son. Husband has son covered but she doesn''t think it''s good coverage. So, since no extra cost she will absolutely add him. Enrolling now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-19 12:30:10', '2019-07-19 12:30:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038471023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, 'Acct set up charged 7/19. Billing will start 7/22. Good to go for an 8/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-19 12:05:48', '2019-07-19 12:05:48'),
