  ('zcrm_1579374000038477013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '7-19-19 Elizabeth called bc panicked about membership. Husband Dan may have a torn MCL and she called Apex to understand coverage and they told her it''s not covered of course. Left her a vm to let her know that card is ONLY for wellness and the MCS component will step in for this. Told her to call Concierge and for him to go to Dr. of choice as a cash paying patient. Call me if still concerned.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-19 11:54:34', '2019-07-19 11:54:34'),
