  ('zcrm_1579374000038440003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'Received Operative report from MD Office today....it looks like this procedure went to diagnostic....uploaded to Google Drive....per JKach, will start to process this through Sedera...spoke to client and informed him that we received the documents...and this will need to go through Sedera...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-18 16:08:50', '2019-07-18 16:08:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038434018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141080', 'James Ashford', NULL, 'I saw that he had called in earlier today, gave him a call back but he couldn''t remember why he called and he was cooking for a church camp. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-18 15:58:56', '2019-07-18 15:58:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038434013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie has a swollen ankle and wanted to make sure that she was following appropriate protocol.  I answered all of her questions, helped fill in the blanks, and then sent corresponding emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-18 15:39:19', '2019-07-18 15:39:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038434008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676445', 'Maureen Pisani', NULL, 'Maureen called in very upset that she found out we are no longer associated with Liberty and that we have been stealing from her for years. She wants to cancel- but she wants every $50 she has spent with us since we have gone separate ways with Liberty. I told her that this was not a decision that I could make. and then she said that she had spoken with Patti over the phone awhile back and was told that her bank account would not be charged any longer.  I told her that I did not see any notes from Patti and she said "well that''s convenient for you"....

She kept trying to get me to be as outraged as she was- and it irked her that I just wasn''t.

I told her that I would send the cancellation form to her tonight- and that I would have Patti call her tomorrow- she said to call her either before 11:00 or after 1:00 (our time) would be best for her.

also- for some strange reason or another the email opt out button would not turn off for me in her CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-18 15:36:47', '2019-07-18 15:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038434003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, 'Jeffery called because he was having trouble filling out the health insurance portion of his sons college papers.  I told him that I would request from Sedera that they send him a letter of explanation as to what his membership is.   He also needed help sorting he and his wifes QR life codes, he requested an extra RCI card for his son because he is moving away, and he had some preventive care questions- I answered them the best that I could and told him that I would send a bunch of educational emails to go along with what I answered. He said I was very helpful. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-18 14:21:12', '2019-07-18 14:21:12'),
