  ('zcrm_1579374000038383008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862440', 'Robert (Greg) White', NULL, 'Spoke to Greg on 7/17 and he advised that he has been having some financial issues and told me that he would have to cancel.  We spoke about him possibly coming back at some o=point in the future and I advised him that he would have to re-enroll in the Association plan.  I directed him to get in contact with Wendy at that time to explain the options.  He also asked about timing of refunds and I advised that we do not "refund" once the month has started..  I also explained that we are billed by the vendors and how the billing cycle works.  I sent link to the cancellation survey.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-18 07:26:00', '2019-07-18 07:26:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038383003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830002', 'Debra Boggs', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Sedera, ASi &amp; cancel billing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-18 07:00:33', '2019-07-18 07:00:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038370008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'Dania told me that Annette''s Liberty card was resent just yesterday, so she should be getting it in the mail any day now.  Informed the client. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-17 17:00:32', '2019-07-17 17:00:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038370003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'Annette called in again to ask about getting the best price on the MRI her doctor wants her to have.  I asked if she had the CPT code, she said that the radiologist office does.  I told her to just speak to her contact at Sedera that they have a tool they can use with that code to show the best price and facility in her area- AND at the same time she can let them know what is going on with this new need.  She then repeated the same scenario as previously mentioned in my notes, that she didn''t want to get "this person" in trouble, but that she really wasn''t getting anything out of her besides repeating that everybody has been slammed lately.  Annette does sympathize with the fact that people have been worked very hard recently- but she feels completely lost in the shuffle.  She is having a hard time uploading bills to the app- she needs a bit more hand holding- and a little bit more detail and explanation behind the process.  I told her that this is not the experience that I know Sedera to be and that if I were to let a supervisor know that they would fix the issue straight away.   Also- she called Liberty RX, left a message- she received a weird automated call to confirm her mailing address- but still has yet to get a card in the mail.  Annette was very anxious- she thanked me for listening to her.  She said that if she still felt the same tomorrow after calling Sedera she would let me know.  *sharing with Dania@ Sedera* - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-17 15:48:36', '2019-07-17 15:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038369003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'spoke to Lori Brandenberg about the issues related to her daughter''s...Sara Brandendurg PAP smear lab tests...informed client that ASI never received any bills....but did identify client that the bills look duplicated...informed client to check with provider regarding the duplication of bills....as of this time...nothing more Mpowering Benefits can do about any of the "Sara Brandenberg bills" at this time until client receives more information from provider....waiting on client to provide additional information.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-17 15:14:09', '2019-07-17 15:14:09'),
