  ('zcrm_1579374000038299003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022060028', 'Brianna Steed', NULL, 'Brianna is going in for a procedure due to an irregular pap smear, she has already paid $800 for this exact need from her last OBGYN appointment. Her IUA is $1000 so I let her mother Marion know that she only has $200 left to pay out of pocket until her IUA is met. I let her know that her appointment she has for today is going to be more than $200. I told Marion that Brianna needs to contact Sedera right now and let them know what is going on and she only has $200 left and her bill is going to exceed that. I gave Brianna and Marion Sedera''s phone number and they are calling right now to get a "Need" started. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-17 09:19:55', '2019-07-17 09:19:55'),
