  ('zcrm_1579374000038247052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'Brad called in to state that he had lost an email that the folks at Sedera had sent him in regards to a letter for his daughter''s college.  I reached out on Slack to the crew and asked that it be resent to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 16:42:37', '2019-07-16 16:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038261026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012485012', 'Colby Adams-Waneka', NULL, '7-16-19 Kaiser cancelled her plan bc of nonpayment. But, made payment for June and July on July 3rd. Just had cc stolen and got new card and updated it with them. Told her to call Kaiser directly to sort it out. Gave her the 303-306-2727 number to try.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-16 16:04:29', '2019-07-16 16:04:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038247047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785099', 'Dina Rabo', NULL, 'Dina called in to see if there was any way that she could change the date in which her monthly fee is taken out of her account, I told her that it was a question for finance- that they aren''t in the office for the rest of the day- she asked for a direct line to call tomorrow- I gave her Sunny''s- and 9-5 est hours. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 15:56:57', '2019-07-16 15:56:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038247042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165401', 'Denise Haines', NULL, 'Denise called to give updated payment info.  She said that she had been filling out an online form that wasn''t "sticking"  I told her to fill out the online form that I was sending over to her, and then give Sunny a call tomorrow to ensure that the correct information is being saved into the system.  I gave her Sunny''s direct line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 15:42:53', '2019-07-16 15:42:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038247037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963121', 'Doree Post', NULL, 'Doree called to speak with Liz- I told her that home office was closed but that I would be happy to answer any of her questions.  She was pretty anxious about the fact that Liz told her that she would have to use MPowering Benefits as the name of whom she receives the service through and the card that she just printed out says Sedera.  I told her that it was an easy mistake- because we have other members that will use our name instead.  I promised her that her card was correct.  I told her to just take her time, that she didn''t have to rush to do the HRA right this second- just breathe...she appreciated the fact that I acknowledged her anxiety- I had her laughing at the end. I told her that she could call us any time she needed us. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 15:35:36', '2019-07-16 15:35:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038247032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676915', 'Philip Charte', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent her the form.  she also requested a number that she should call to ask for July''s payment be reversed.  I gave her Patti''s direct line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 15:29:22', '2019-07-16 15:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038247027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001172005', 'Kate Paulin', NULL, 'called to ask why she was paying $50 a month- I explained it to her.  She said that she just got a hold of Liberty and they said they had no idea who we were.  She asked to cancel- I sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 15:22:55', '2019-07-16 15:22:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038247013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830002', 'Debra Boggs', NULL, 'Called to cancel- sent her a form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 14:24:36', '2019-07-16 14:24:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038247008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001837009', 'Andrea Hinman', NULL, 'Stephen thanked me for the list, I sent him all email templates related to preventative care. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-16 14:00:23', '2019-07-16 14:00:23'),
