  ('zcrm_1579374000038219046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605336', 'Lori Moehn', NULL, 'Tracking #8825000
Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 7/16/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 13:30:13', '2019-07-16 13:30:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038219041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605336', 'Lori Moehn', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera &amp; Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 13:30:09', '2019-07-16 13:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038215033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740001', 'Margaret Johnson', NULL, 'Margaret needed help with finding a few providers for some preventative services she need to complete. Yearly annual physical, mammogram, and colonoscopy. She had a Dr already for her physical and I looked up Dr. Ann Grace and she IS in network. I then did some searches for the other procedures she needs and sent both lists over to her. I explained on how she presents herself to the front desk at the dr''s office and I explained what the difference is between preventative and diagnostic. I also explained what her IUA is and how it works, along with Sedera and where they come into play, when, and what they do. She was very happy and felt a LOT more comfortable with her plan and how it works. I let her know that I was going to send a few different emails as well that have general education with what I just explained to her so she doesn''t have to sit there and try and remember everything that was just said. Margaret was so very thankful and is looking forward to getting what she needs to get done and is happy with how easy it is, if she follows step by step. ANOTHER very happy and satisfied member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-16 13:15:54', '2019-07-16 13:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038215028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Sondra called in and said that when she went to set up her appointment for her colonoscopy with a provider that I personally looked up for her and made sure that Dr. Donald Kirkpatrick is in network, was told by the facility and provider that her "Insurance" is not going to cover anything for that appointment and that ASI does not have colonoscopy as part of her benefits. I confirmed that this appointment is just a regular annual colonoscopy and she yes, nothing special or different about it whatsoever. So I told her that whoever told her that is incorrect and there isn''t even a way for the provider to look up her benefits. SO I told her she needs to get in contact with someone at ASI right away and get them involved to figure out why the provider would say that and for ASI to check even further than me that the DR. is in network, provided ASI''s phone number to Sondra and she is calling right away. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-16 13:09:01', '2019-07-16 13:09:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038219036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216192', 'Jeffrey Ford', NULL, 'Left VM for Joe Lovlidge @ RCI to advise me on how I can get this employee enrolled as I do not have a Portal for RCS Foods.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 13:06:52', '2019-07-16 13:06:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038219031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216192', 'Jeffrey Ford', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Ch $1000 IUA CoPay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 13:00:59', '2019-07-16 13:00:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038215023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899178', 'Daniel Klein', NULL, 'Carmen called and needed a run down of how her and her husbands IUA works and for what type of procedures and how to deal with the bills. I let her know that the IUA is what they are responsible out of pocket per "Need". She or her husband pay out of pocket ONLY up to the $500 IUA, nothing more. Once they have met the$500 she needs to ask the provider to bill them the rest and they need to get in contact with Sedera asap. I sent her the email that has all of Sedera''s information there to get in contact with them. Carmen told me that they have an appointment for their daughter to get her tonsils removed and she didn''t know how much it would be. I am pretty sure, since it is a surgery of sorts, that it is most likely going to be over the $500. I told her to call Sedera right after she gets off the phone with me to let them know what it going on and that they are going to need to start a "Needs" case right away. She seemed like she fully understood everything I had told her and thanked me very much and said I was a great help and she has a better understanding. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-16 12:59:52', '2019-07-16 12:59:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038261016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '7-16-19 Andre needs help in setting up Teladoc! He doesn''t believe he ever set it up. He might want an MRI for his knee and is hoping Teladoc can prescribe it so he doesn''t have to pay big dr. visit bill just to get MRI done. I sent him the Welcome Call email to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-16 12:38:06', '2019-07-16 12:38:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038219023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216134', 'Larry Glore', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Fam $100 IUA Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 12:36:18', '2019-07-16 12:59:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038215018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716731', 'Brandon Mahurin', NULL, 'Called into cancel with us due to getting health insurance through his job. I told him I sent him a cancellation form and to just fill it out and submit it back to us and we will let all parties know to stop the billing and fully cancel him. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-16 12:30:38', '2019-07-16 12:30:38'),
