Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 7/16/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 12:26:10', '2019-07-16 12:26:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038261008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038730073', 'Ashley Chod', NULL, '7-16-19 Referred by Jay Wright 6 months ago and then again by Matt and Kate Holstein just recently. Using 6 mo STM for $160 but covers nothing. Was on employer plan for $470 but as Indiv it was going to go up to $600. Healthy, only used bc but stopped recently. Only other issue was knee surgery 8 years ago. Lives in Aspen and goes to Dr. 1x per year for annual physical.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-16 12:19:57', '2019-07-16 12:19:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038261003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280403', 'Marne Gleason', NULL, 'SPECIAL NOTATION:
50/50% Sharded Commission between Patterson & Frohman
50/50% Shared $100
$25 MPB

This was a lead from Joann Vaccarino (Charles Frohman).  Lead arrive at Ron Patterson''s email to contact and present products and education to Marne.  She is a current Liberty Health Share member (not through MPB).  We discussed the Partially self directed plan.  Her son Alec (age 23) and daughter (age 26) are also with Liberty Health Share.  I recommend all three move over to MPB.  Marne enrolled today and she sent  emails to her children informing them she has moved to MPB and suggesting they do the same.  We are setting dates to have a conference call with Alec and Kendra to cover the details of Partially Self Directed plan and hopefully get them to enroll. I called Charles to discuss a slight discount for 3 new enrollments from the same family.  No decision has been made about that yet.
Marne also told me she emailed her friend  Tom Stark who wants to look at the plan.  She told me Charles told her he spoke Tom but Tom said he doesn''t recall ever speaking to Charles.  If Tom comes enrolls we put Tom under Charles.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-16 12:18:43', '2019-07-16 12:29:36'),
