  ('zcrm_1579374000038239046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377058', 'Parker Thompson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on both numbers. Sent email to reschedule online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-16 11:04:11', '2019-07-16 11:04:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038239041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122004', 'Michael Bradley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-16 10:46:48', '2019-07-16 10:46:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038239036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741557', 'Ethan Pajak', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-16 10:41:35', '2019-07-16 10:41:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038215013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, 'Andre needed to be transferred to Wendy, he did not specify what the issue was exactly. All he told me was he is from Aspen and needed to talk to her right away. Tried transferring to Wendy and she did not answer, left a message with members name and number to call back when she can. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-16 10:38:20', '2019-07-16 10:38:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038215008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, 'Peter called in and was confused on what had happened with his medication that was supposed to be called into his local Target(CVS) pharmacy. I asked if he had used the Teladoc service and he did not know. He told me all he did was speak to a doctor Bradley on the phone last night and the dr. called in a script for him at the Target. Peter said when he went over to Target to pick it up they had no record or any information on a prescription for him. So that is why he called in here to see if I could pull the info up for him. I explained that here at MPowering this is just the concierge and we don''t have files or paper work like that. I asked for the phone number that he used for this Dr. and he said it was a text with the number 888-407-7928. I put the number into google and the first link was Redirect. I went back to his profile and that is the plan Peter and his wife have. So I called him back and told him that info about it being the plan he has with Redirect and he needs to call them directly. I explained that with Redirect they are always the first call that needs to be made in regards to any questions he might have, appointments, medication, ect. I let him know the 888 number is Redirect phone number and he can call it and get all the info he needs. I also let him know before we hung up that if he wants, I can look up decently cheap coupons for him if he can get the name, dosage, and quantity of his prescription that is called in. I let him know that I may find a coupon for somewhere other than Target(CVS) or just a coupon for Target that is cheaper than what was being offered at the pharmacy. He was very interested to know this info about me finding coupons and will most likely give me a call back with the info. At the beginning of the call I could tell he was frustrated with the fact that he was being throw in different directions and just wanted to get his medication. After I found what the number belonged to and told him to call them and they will have everything he needs and about the coupon he sounded a LOT more relieved and happy with his questions being answered in a timely manner right then and there on the phone. Another satisfied member! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-16 10:32:28', '2019-07-16 10:32:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038239028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162322', 'Esther Turner', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-16 10:19:39', '2019-07-16 10:19:48'),
