  ('zcrm_1579374000038219008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216055', 'Paul Geersen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 08:25:29', '2019-07-16 08:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038206005', 'Marie Brennan', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-16 07:50:31', '2019-07-16 07:50:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038215003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530190', 'Mark Hogan', NULL, 'Mark called in and said his wife is not doing well at all and has to take her to the ER. He was just calling to let us know what as going on. I told him about his $5000 IUA and he already said he understood what the means, that he is responsible for the firs $5000. I told him that is correct to to not pay anything more than that. I explained what happens when he meets his IUA and how Sedera then gets involved and he submits his bills to them. I told him if he thinks this is going to be something more that his IUA to contact Sedera after he gets off the phone with me. I provided Mark Sedera''s phone number and sent him an email that explains how to submit his bills to Sedera. I also explained how he is going to present himself to the ER front desk, as a cash paying patient. He fully understood and was happy I could give him this info right away. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-16 07:45:06', '2019-07-16 07:45:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377244', 'Kay Magruder', NULL, 'called to update payment method.  sent online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 18:30:52', '2019-07-15 18:30:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141256', 'John Phibbs', NULL, 'called in to make sure that all info that she shared in her welcome call was inputted in our system- then she asked then why wasn''t it showing on the Teladoc app- I told her that Sedera probably needs to update it in their system.  she wanted to know the difference between us and Sedera.  I told her- she seemed VERY anxious about the whole situation, I tried to calm her down the best that I could and said that I would reach out to LIz and John about it tomorrow to confirm that it''s been done. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 16:49:02', '2019-07-15 16:49:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001837009', 'Andrea Hinman', NULL, 'sent him in network colonoscopy facility options. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 16:19:00', '2019-07-15 16:19:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'Eben called to check on the doctor that the doctor and facility that he had found was in network.  I checked- they are.  I sent a request to ASI with Eben tagged in it requesting replacement PDF and hard copy to be sent to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 16:09:40', '2019-07-15 16:09:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, 'John is suffering from some pretty significant anxiety and Heather wanted to know what her benefits were in regards to him seeing a psch- I first started off by stating that Sedera will share up to $3,000 for "other" psch services besides involuntary hospitalization.  I then told her that she gets a discount through Sedera to be able to utilize Teladoc''s behavior health platform- for therapy and psychiatry.  I also told her about the counseling service provided through Sedera.   She asked me about preventive care for herself- I sent tons of emails for preventive and illness or injury.  She was interested in John using the Teladoc program- I walked her through how to get the app on her phone as well as gave her Teladoc''s number just in case she got stuck.  I told her that I hoped John felt better soon! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 15:43:54', '2019-07-15 15:43:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001837009', 'Andrea Hinman', NULL, 'Stephen called in to get some direction as to where to start if he is due for a colonoscopy.  I told him that he should make a wellness visit with his primary- who I checked on and is in network.  I told him that I would also get together a list of facilities in the area that he can go to, and email him my findings. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 15:35:44', '2019-07-15 15:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in with many questions, the first was that she wanted to make sure that the correct changes were made with her account, because she doesn''t think they were.  Changing from DPC to Group.  I tried Patti''s line but she was gone for the day- I told Elizabeth that Patti would be the best person to talk to about this and gave Elizabeth her direct line.  She said she would call tomorrow.  Elizabeth also told me that her son had racked up $12,000 worth of just blood work as now there are 2 doctors trying to pinpoint an autoimmune disease.  I told Elizabeth about how important it is to get Sedera involved as soon as sh thinks that she is going go over her IUA.  She said she hadn''t because she is still waiting on a diagnosis.- I told her that Sedera would highly appreciate her call and run down on what is going on.  I sent her instructions and a link on how to submit bills to Sedera- I told her that their number was in the email, and she told me that she would give them a call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 15:16:04', '2019-07-15 15:16:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605336', 'Lori Moehn', NULL, 'called to cancel- got a new job with benefits.  sent her a form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 14:51:08', '2019-07-15 14:51:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038185028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377059', 'Teri Mock', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-15 14:14:16', '2019-07-15 14:14:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038185023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377059', 'Teri Mock', NULL, 'Member canceled MPBS and enrolled in MPBA PSD Plan effective 8/1/19', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-15 14:13:35', '2019-07-15 14:13:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377058', 'Parker Thompson', NULL, 'Parker called to state that the pharmacy tech he spoke to told him that they didn''t accept coupons.  I told him to go and ask for the manager or pharmacist about the issue.  I told him that I would be here until 10 est in case he needs other coupons. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-15 14:10:33', '2019-07-15 14:10:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038185018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377059', 'Teri Mock', NULL, 'I clarified w/Jane that this member wishes to enroll in the Partially Self Directed even though she has a DPC.  Jane said that she is concerned about the Individual mandate possibly being changed again.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-15 14:09:57', '2019-07-15 14:09:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038201008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'Sent signed HIPAA request form to MD office requesting medical records related to performed medical procedure...waiting on return of documents from MD Office.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-15 13:58:57', '2019-07-15 13:58:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Spoke to Monica at ASI....ASI did pay for preventative PAP smear from 8/2018.   Informed Monica that I informed client that Transvaginal US was not preventative and no reimbursement would be made at this time.  Monica and I discovered that none of the PAP smears from 5/30/2019 were never billed to ASI, hence ASI has no record of them.  Trying to reach client to inform her of our findings...left message for client....waiting on call back.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-15 13:52:35', '2019-07-15 13:52:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038185013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377058', 'Parker Thompson', NULL, 'Called in for prescription coupons.  Sent 4 - stored in Google Drive - Member support cases- Thompson', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-15 13:42:53', '2019-07-15 13:42:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038182036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '7-15-19 Fox and Mitchell are asking many questions about financials and what happens if their provider charges way more than another. They want to ensure they can go where they choose or if/when they can be denied to go where they choose. Want to go to BCH. Suggesting Redirect may be best solution for them to avoid challenges of Apex and ins. component since super concerned about getting denied coverage to see dr of choice. I''m going to have them speak with Luke also to answer their questions since I can''t make promises that they want to hear. I will send them Financial Commentary as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-15 12:48:36', '2019-07-15 12:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038174041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130153', 'Zachary Mixon', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-15 11:26:30', '2019-07-15 11:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038192003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Had a scheduled call with Allison today and did a full presentation.  She currently is with Aliera Health.  She was concerned about pregnancy because she has been with Aliera for over a year.   She also was under evaluation is her thyroid due to family history.  She had testing done but her thyroid is normal but they are want to do  PTH labs which she hasn''t had been done yet.  Other, she has no medical issues.  I told her to call Aliera and confirm what they would pay beyond the $7500 IUA.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-15 11:22:24', '2019-07-15 11:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038174036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082617', 'Melinda Kadinger', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-15 11:19:55', '2019-07-15 11:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038171051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167692', 'Andrew (Andy) Ioele', NULL, 'Andy called in and needed some help finding a provider for getting his annual wellness physical done. He had a providers name that was recommend to him and I looked that provider up and he WAS in network. Andy was very happy to hear that. I asked if he still wanted me to find other providers in his area and send a list and he said yes just in case. I am sending him the provider list I found, a screenshot of the provider he had given me that he is in fact IN network, and an email that explains how to present himself. I asked if he had his ASI card b/c that is what he needs to have to give the receptionist at his appointment. He was not sure and could not look at that very moment. I told him to let me know ASAP if he has it or not and to let me know before he makes an appointment so I can send a request out for a PDF copy and hard copy sent to him to have for the appointment. He said when he looks and finds out he will respond to me from one of the emails I am sending him. He was very happy with how easy and quick it was to get the info he needed and looking up a provider. I will update in notes once I find out about his card situation. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-15 11:05:48', '2019-07-15 11:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038174031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741047', 'Shane Bright', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-15 11:01:22', '2019-07-15 11:01:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038185008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361747', 'Monika Flurer', NULL, 'Sent provider look up with instructions for preventative visit.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-15 11:01:20', '2019-07-15 11:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038174026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466143', 'Taylor Davey', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-15 10:53:32', '2019-07-15 10:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038174021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030252004', 'Jennifer Ferrara', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-15 10:46:44', '2019-07-15 10:46:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038171046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Iris called in with 2 questions. The first question she wanted to just make sure she was going through the right steps of submitting her bills to the correct people. Weather is be ASI or Sedera. I explained who both of the vendors are and when and for what reasons she would submit to either of them. I explained that ASI is part of her preventative care and bills would be submitted to them if she has received a bill that she shouldn''t have gotten for a preventative procedure. I told her Sedera is the vendor that deals with diagnostic injury/illness procedures. She is going into Smiles Imaging tomorrow for an appointment to look at her liver or kidney I believe because some cysts have popped up and her provider just wants to keep an eye on them. She asked if there is any sort of card that she shows the facility. I let her know that No she does not show any card because that is diagnostic in nature and all she has to do is present herself as a cash paying patient. I told her that her IUA is $500 and that is ALL that she pays out of pocket, nothing more. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her to give them a call to let them know what is going on ahead of time so they can be prepared for getting involved if the bill is over her IUA. I told her that what they do is when the bill of something that is going to be a "Need" is over the IUA, Sedera then contacts the provider/facility and negotiates the bill down to a final cost. Once they have done that they will reach out to her and let her know what is going on and that they will be sending a check out to her, she then uses that check to pay the provider herself. She full understood all the info that I gave her and was happy I was here to help and guide her in the right direction. I sent out an email that explains how to submit her bills to Sedera and it has more info for her to read and look at to help even further. Iris was very pleased with the customer service she got from here at MPowering. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-15 10:20:04', '2019-07-15 10:20:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038174013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141397', 'Philip Lang', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out today 2nd QR Life code card for wife Veronica. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-15 10:18:54', '2019-07-15 10:23:02'),
