Sent by MPowering Benefits HR on 7/15/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-15 07:53:13', '2019-07-15 07:53:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038120018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'Sent HIPPAA relase of information for client to complete to help with outstanding bills related to colonoscopy....waiting on client to complete document....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-12 15:59:18', '2019-07-12 15:59:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038113052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'Maureen called to see if her doctor and facility were in network- I was having some difficulty finding the facility but I did find the prescribing DR.  Maureen is going to make a few calls to the facility- basically because the OLD name of the facility if showing in network- but Banner imaging is not.  She said that she will call in for more help with this next week. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-12 15:56:42', '2019-07-12 15:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038120013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032206031', 'Bryan Tew', NULL, 'Spoke at length with client Mr. Tew....Client stated he was never informed about finding out if his PCP was in network...initially from agent and from welcome call...informed client that welcome call personnel are experts and I personally know that they are experts in explaining to inform (MPB) us about preventative MD visits and procedures that will cost $0....and confirm providers and facilities in network.  Client disputed this remark....Client further asked about how he was going to be reimbursed....informed client that it was not going to be reimbursed...client was not happy with this decision....after further discussion with client....client was recommended to have a cardio/echo diagnostic exam ....from preventative exam....informed client that then this expense may go towards his IUA...Further instructed client to get final response re: the MD request for cardiac/echo exam...with lab results....informed client this may be added to his IUA....Client wanted concierge department to send him in-network providers in his general vicinity.  Waiting on client to send additional information re: his cardiac/echo referral to find him acceptable facility with low cost for this procedure....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-12 15:09:00', '2019-07-12 15:09:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038113047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516237', 'Pennye Nixon', NULL, 'Pennye wanted to go over the plan from square one, so that''s what I did and answered her questions in between until she didn''t have any questions left.  I sent a ton of educational emails including her guidelines as requested. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-12 14:58:10', '2019-07-12 14:58:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038113042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032206031', 'Bryan Tew', NULL, 'Bryan called in upset that ASI didn''t have him in their records.  Patti explained to me that it was because he is with APEX not ASI- he was totally confused at this point, he asked then how he could submit his claim.  I told him that I needed to see if his doctor was even in network or not- it wasn''t.  He told me that the whole reason he signed up was because there wasn''t any network.  I told him that he was correct when it came to his injury or illness visits, but this did not apply with his preventative care.  He was getting frustrated, I asked if he wanted to speak with someone that can go over how his plan works and he said yes.  I transferred the line to Guy.....- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-12 14:27:46', '2019-07-12 14:27:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038079046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '07.12.19:  Rec''vd email from Kelly C. forwarded from Jennifer Chasteen (RCI/Apex):  "Yes I did get the information back that it is still not in network however I was able to get it sent back to be reprocessed and paid per the plan documents. There is a small part that states if no choice of a network provider, plans will be paid as though an in network one. I have called the member as well and let her know of this."  Called Daryll to confirm.  She said she spoke with Jennifer and the facility fee is resolved.  I spoke to her about ReDirect and DPC plans. She asked me to send her info. on them for when her plan anniversary date comes up next year.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-07-12 13:41:36', '2019-07-12 13:41:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038113034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019308021', 'Rachel Ravey', NULL, '7-12-19 Talked with Patti and we can''t back date the MEC. Therefore MEC start date is 7/1/19. I called and told Rachel. They have one preventive visit in June and told her she''d need to pay for that herself. She''s ok with that. She will call me for help to understand how to upload current bills into system and start a Need for Bodhi. Has an upcoming scan next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-12 13:28:22', '2019-07-12 13:47:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038113029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019308021', 'Rachel Ravey', NULL, '7-12-19 Wendy - 

I chatted with Hayli and we agree that since it was obviously the member''s intent to add Bodhi to their membership as of their date of birth AND since they were already participating as Member + Family, we will retro date Bodhi''s membership to his date of birth and help with his Need.

Please note that this is an exception based on the member''s unique circumstance and not standard practice for Sedera.


Kindly - 

Dañia Heffington
Dir. Member Experience

Sorry -

To clarify - we will retro date Bodhi''s start date to be 4/1/2019  - the same date that Rachel''s membership began.


Kindly - 

Dañia Heffington
Dir. Member Experience', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-12 13:23:12', '2019-07-12 13:23:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038092053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141080', 'James Ashford', NULL, 'Member was driving during the welcome call and didnt have access to a computer.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-07-12 12:49:49', '2019-07-12 12:49:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038092048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530062', 'Debra Alier', NULL, 'Member didnt have access to a computer during the welcome call', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-07-12 12:44:28', '2019-07-12 12:44:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038113024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038170085', 'Jeffrey Dickinson', NULL, '7-12-19 Enrollment complete with the $1500/$507 Redirect. He forgot he had acute pancreatitis Jan. 3rd 2019. I helped him add it to the app. It was just dehydration that was resolved immediately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-12 12:31:30', '2019-07-12 12:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038120008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Called in and needs me to look up 3 different provider search results for her to go and get some preventative testing done that her doctor recommends. Bone Density(yes she is over 60 and it is approved for preventative), colonoscopy, and the Herpes Zoster(Shingles) shot. I will look these up and send her all the approved in network providers. She was very very happy that it was that easy to get this done and approved. She thanked me very much for making this process so much easier than any traditional insurance she has ever had. Loves out company and said that my customer service skills are at the top of anyone she has come in contact or talked on the phone with and I am very nice and a sweet girl!!! Very happy member! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-12 12:29:41', '2019-07-12 12:29:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038092043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'new Plan: Emp Only $500 IUA 50+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-12 12:26:03', '2019-07-12 12:26:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038092038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Member submitted a change request to remove her son who is aging out of plan.  I will inform ASi &amp; Sedera and change billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-12 12:12:55', '2019-07-12 12:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038120003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'Called in because she needed to know what to do about getting reimbursed for vaccines she had done on her daughter and what vaccines are covered or not. I went and grabbed my list of the 64+ and looked under the vaccine section for children. I read the list to Snatam and she said OK yes those are the ones that I am getting done for my daughter. So she has already gotten some of them done and wanted to know what to do to get paid back. I stopped her there and I asked if she has already paid for it out of pocket? She said yes and I stated that she should not have done that and asked if Ron, her sales agent, explained to her that there is her ASI card that she is supposed to present and show to the front desk at the providers office and the preventative care is processed through that. I explained the ONLY time she pays out of pocket is when it comes to the diagnostic injury/illness part of her plan. As in god forbid she falls and breaks her arm, or any type of surgery, sickness like the flu or a stomach bug, so on and so forth. She understood what I meant and I could tell she was a little bit upset that none of this was told to her(or she forgot because she has had a welcome call). I told her to send me the bills that she has for the first couple of shots she has already paid for and I will send them over to ASI and see what they can do. She will from now on and for the rest of the vaccines she is getting done for her daughter will present her ASI card. I made sure she has the correct card over the phone. I will be sending a few educational emails and I also asked if she wants me to send her a scheduler for another Welcome Call. She said yes and i let her know that it would be a good idea since the last time she had hers was over a year ago and this would be a great refresher. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-12 12:11:28', '2019-07-12 12:11:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038113019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038170085', 'Jeffrey Dickinson', NULL, '7-12-19 Explained Provider Directed option to him and he''s ready to enroll now. He sounded a bit distracted but seems to understand. Choosing the $1500 or $1000 IUA for $507 or $530 a month. Wants earliest start date Aug. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-12 12:07:17', '2019-07-12 12:07:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000038090053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033866053', 'Anthony Locke', NULL, 'Not able to leave a message. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-12 11:28:11', '2019-07-12 11:28:11'),
