  ('zcrm_1579374000038113003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '7-10-19 Works for Terri Fox. Just officially divorced as of 7-9-19. Ins ends either the 15th or 31st, she''s not sure. Healthy, no meds, no tobacco. Kids going to college 18 and 20. 18 year old is paying $300 a month through CU! She hates Kaiser! Feels like they are cattle herding. Had an abnormal pap and then did a  2nd one 6 months later and never heard anything back from Kaiser. Told her to check her records to see if it was clear. She''s 50 7/29/58 and we''re discussing Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-12 10:01:32', '2019-07-12 10:03:43'),
