  ('zcrm_1579374000038009013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Sydney is at her yearly annual wellness check up with Dr. Denise White at 23 Crossroads Dr Ste220 Owings Mills, MD 21117. The Doctors office was calling to confirm that Sydney is on her mothers plan. I first made sure that the actual provider Dr. White was in network and she is, I then asked the lady at the doctors office(front desk) is the card that Sydney gave her said RCI in the bottom right hand corner. She said no that all it said was PHCS network, mpowering benefits, and the prescription info. I let the young lady know that that is the incorrect card and it has to say RCI on it . She told me that it did not say that anywhere on the card. I then told her to ask Sydney if she had that card on her at all. She asked and Sydney said no. I put the office on hold and asked Patti if she could send a PDF copy to Syndey quickly b/c she was at her appointment as we speak. I got an email from Sydney that she could pull up on her phone right there and Patti sent the PDF copy to that email. I gave RCI''s claim address to the doctors office while we waited for the email to go through. Sydney got the email and was able to provide the correct card and information. I also clarified with the providers office that this was just strictly a [preventative wellness visit. They said yes and Sydney was good to go. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-11 09:24:00', '2019-07-11 09:24:00'),
