  ('zcrm_1579374000037982038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209064', 'Damian Smith', NULL, 'Damian''s wife Jacci called in to schedule a welcome call, I forwarded her the email that includes a welcome call scheduler link.  She asked if it was too late to add another member (her) to the plan.  I told her not at all, to fill out the member change form that I sent.  I told her that I would be unable to give her a price though.  I also told her that Damian would be the one that HAD to participate in the welcome call, but she could either be on that scheduled call, or schedule one for herself separately. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 17:55:47', '2019-07-10 17:55:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037982033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151462', 'Kirra Kviteng', NULL, 'Kirra called in to update her payment info. Sent the form- will contact Sunny, because last note in CRM was 10/18  - and Kirra''s status is cancellation pending????- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 16:45:24', '2019-07-10 16:45:24'),
