  ('zcrm_1579374000037978018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', NULL, '6-26-19 They are with LHS now and frustrated with them. Healthy family of 4. Live in OR. Jenny''s turning 38 in July and Tyler 35 in Aug. Girls 6 and 8. Healthy and use naturopathic docs. Looking to join local DPC Sys Q Vital DPC. Looking at high $5000 IUA $344 with $200 DPC or $2500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-10 16:44:16', '2019-07-10 16:44:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037982028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'reached out to Annette to see if she has received her Liberty RX card yet and if not gave her a phone number to Liberty RX per Mady at Sedera''s instructions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 16:15:06', '2019-07-10 16:15:06'),
