  ('zcrm_1579374000037978013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '7-10-19 Elizabeth wants dental insurance but wants to go to Studio Z who doesn''t accept any ins. Instead of doing dental discount plan which probably won''t work either I shared the HMA option with her. She''s going to process this and think it over and let me know if she wants to proceed down that path.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-10 15:54:02', '2019-07-10 15:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037982023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033996146', 'Ted McMullen', NULL, 'called to cancel due to financial issues.  sent form to fill out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 15:40:44', '2019-07-10 15:40:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037982018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, 'Monica called in to speak with John, and to update her address. I told her that John was out of the office for the day but provided her with his direct line and email address.  I sent her the online form needed to update her address as well.  She said that she was having issues being able to access her LIberty sharebox. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 15:36:01', '2019-07-10 15:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037982013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096243', 'Karen Sebbens', NULL, 'Karen called thinking we were Liberty again.  She wanted to know if Liberty has paid out a claim and the date.  She says that this isn''t in her sharebox.  I told her that we do not have access to what is going on in Liberty''s billing department and are not the ones that pay these bills.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 15:23:31', '2019-07-10 15:23:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037982008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411061', 'Donn Kellogg', NULL, 'Donn called in a bit grumpy that he would have to front $3,000 for 3 different needs he has going on at the same time.  I started to answer his questions about the needs process- he cut me off after I explained what bills he should be collecting.  He says that he is very disappointing with this, and it is a waste of money.  He did not like all of the work that he needed to do and wanted something more streamlined.  He said that he was taking the word of one of his employees that is on the plan, and that he shouldn''t have.  I asked if he wanted me to have Wendy call him and he said yes, but that he is planning on getting rid of the plan tomorrow, and that it is probably a lost cause. I called Wendy right after to let her know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 15:03:18', '2019-07-10 15:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037982003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480088', 'Sheila Finch-Manzagol', NULL, 'Sheila called in frantic, from her doctors office asking me to give her credit card information so that she could make a payment.  I explained that she has Redirect, and that she needed to call that number shown on her card. She scoffed and said she did, but that it went to vm- I told her the best thing that she could do was to go to their extrahelp page and make a request there.  That it goes to upper management.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-10 15:01:37', '2019-07-10 15:01:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037978008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411061', 'Donn Kellogg', NULL, '7-10-19 According to Kelly C who just spoke to Donn he''s extremely frustrated now with his membership and said it''s probably a lost cause if I call him. I just called and left a vm to see what I can do to help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-10 14:54:51', '2019-07-10 14:54:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037973016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, 'Daryl emailed in a few bills that she got sent to her in regards to a colonoscopy. I sent all the information over to Jennifer at RCI for her to take a look and see why they were being denied. This was her response:
Kelly,

 

The claim 3979145 is the facility claim, which is Jupiter Outpatient Surgery Center and I do not show the surgery Center in network. I do show the hospital in network but not the surgery Center and I also checked with the NPI listed on the claim and it does not come up as in network. I will call multiplan to confirm before calling the member.

For the Provider claim, yes he is in network however it is not covered because this is a charge for an office consult and they do not have that benefit on their plan. They only have office visits with a primary care physicians and this is a specialist office consult.

 

Thank you!

 

Jennifer 
The actual surgery center that Daryl went to for the procedure was not in network and the Provider IS in network but the charge was for an office consult which is considered a specialist visit and that is not what is covered under her plan. She is going to have to pay out of pocket for this one. Jennifer is going to call MultiPlan to 100% confirm everything and then will give Daryl a call to fully explain all of this. I emailed Daryl to let her know what was going on and she should be hearing from Jennifer soon. If not I gave her RCI''s phone number just in case she may need it to call in and check up on her claim''s. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-10 14:13:04', '2019-07-10 14:13:04'),
