  ('zcrm_1579374000037978003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019308021', 'Rachel Ravey', NULL, '7-10-19 Rachel''s 5 month old was born with a Kidney issue and needs a renal scan done. Scan as self pay is about $2000 plus dr. fee and possible surgery. Will need a specialist and radiology bc maybe a blockage in ureter which may need to be removed. Told her to try to see if WI has any CHP but husband earns $90K so may not qualify. They are legally married as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-10 12:35:47', '2019-07-10 12:35:47'),
