  ('zcrm_1579374000037973008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'I was advised by Salena that Machelle needs to get in contact with her provider and let them know that the bill from Quest is coded wrong as diagnostic and they need to re code it as preventative and re submit the bill. Machelle emailed me again this afternoon with ANOTHER bill she got from Quest. I am not sure if this is still from the same issue or a different issue now. I compared the 2 quest bills and they are totally different and have different date of service dates. SO I am assuming it is a different appointment. Machelle seems pretty frustrated with this whole situation and stated that "No one seems to care and just wants more $ from me". I assured her that that is not the case on our end or ASI''s. I told her that her provider is the one that coded everything wrong and she needs to let them know that and re code and re submit. I told her as well that I will send an email right now over to Leena at ASI with the new bill she sent me and get on it right away. I tried to let her know that I am working on this as quickly as possible and she will be cc''d in every email I send and come through so she will be in the loop with everything and there will be no miscommunication. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-10 10:46:30', '2019-07-10 10:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037968033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593093', 'Teresa Nash', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-10 10:44:07', '2019-07-10 10:44:07'),
