  ('zcrm_1579374000037929008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Spoke to client Lori Brandenberg about billing issue with ASI....Informed client that she will need to contact Sedera about any issues with other bills....client agreed to contact Sedera directly....Gave tasks to client about medical records for her daughter(Sara) bills from clinic....Informed client that the Transvaginal ultrasound procedure performed would not be reimbursed as it was a diagnostic procedure...client agreed...additionally, this advisor will contact ASI to confirm issues about bills that have been paid and what has not been paid.  Hope to follow up with client week of July 15, 2019.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-09 18:40:56', '2019-07-09 18:40:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037929003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Lori Brandenberg called my phone...was unable to get call...immediately called her back...no answer, left another message for her to call me back...awaiting call back...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-09 16:38:01', '2019-07-09 16:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037886070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Melissa called in to ask if the shingles vax was covered,  I told her that it was, but as long as it is coded as preventative, I asked if she had already had her physical with someone in network and she said she had, and at the time she declined the vaccine.  Her Dad just developed shingles and now wants the vax.  My advice was to call the doctors office to explain that she did in fact want the vaccine and ask that they code it as preventative.  She then got hooked on wanting to go to a CVS clinic instead.  Although I did find them in network, I told her that to be safe and have it covered to just go to her GP.  I sent her a list of CVS''s in her area as she requested, and she understood what I was recommending. -I just don''t know how seriously she is going to take it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-09 16:27:10', '2019-07-09 16:27:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037886065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, 'Suzy called to let us know not to give her anymore script coupons to Sams Club, because she doesn''t have the "Plus" one, and her antibiotic cost her $18.  She requests in the future that we find a different location for her medications. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-09 14:15:06', '2019-07-09 14:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037900023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677493', 'Caroline McClure', NULL, 'Micheal the father of Caroline called in and him and Caroline are VERY confused on what to do. He told me that him and Caroline have spoke to many different people and they can''t remember any names, and they were told to call into here at MPowering to get help with setting up an app to submit bills and that they would be given a Representative to help. I saw in notes that Caroline has not had a welcome call and Liz here at the office said she can do one right now with them to hopefully clear up any confusion. Transferred over to Liz. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-09 14:11:14', '2019-07-09 14:11:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037925003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'Member called in to check on 2 bils, quest and radiological associates.  Checked with ASI, bills were received 6/28 and 7/1 and are in process - 2-3 weeks out.  Informed member.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-09 14:08:41', '2019-07-09 14:08:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037902008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653045', 'Mary Poole', NULL, 'Per John this member elected to take our offer of $250 to resolve BBB complaint.  Member assumes no consumer responsibility.  I will mail check 7/9/19.  Copy of check in Attachments', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-09 12:59:10', '2019-07-09 12:59:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037900018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307054', 'Michael Brooks', NULL, 'Michael called in asking for PDF and hard copies of his ASI card sent to him for himself, his wife, and his son. I told him I would send a request out via email to the ID dept over at ASI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-09 12:35:50', '2019-07-09 12:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037891013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '7-9-19 Wants to make sure he''s all set with all aspects of membership. He just got logged into Teladoc finally. He couldn''t find an email from Redirect. He''s going to call them to make sure he''s in their system and told him to call them for any time he needs care except for ER visit. He''s calling them now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-09 12:16:25', '2019-07-09 12:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037891008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '7-9-19 Lori had hair pulling experience trying to find dr for her annual wellness visit. She spoke with someone at PHCS who was on the line with her for an hour and spent another hour or two calling doctors, none of whom could confirm that they are part of the PHCS network. They tried to give her their tax id #, etc. No luck. She also needs a prescription for estradiol right away. She will try Teladoc and if that''s not possible then she will go in to place of her choice and self-pay. We will also move her to Provider Directed so she can get her mammogram complete without further troubles. She will complete the Request via email to Patti today or tomorrow. She will keep her $1000 IUA and cost is $350 a month. She was irate to begin with and now is feeling better with some solutions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-09 11:50:06', '2019-07-09 11:50:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037886051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141001', 'Kevin M Ryan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated email on file. Out of town right now but when gets home will check if he received his cards needed. He will reach out to us if he needs them resent. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-09 11:05:18', '2019-07-09 11:49:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037900013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862130', 'Marion Steed', NULL, 'Called into confirm what her new rate change was because in the email that was sent to her it said a completely different number that what is should be. I checked the rate change table with what her plan is and I reassured her that she is at the $294 rate not what was in the email. I apologized and told her that it was a typo and not to worry. She was relieved when I confirmed that for her. She also asked about what to do when it comes to submitting bills for a "Need" for her and her daughter who has her own separate plan. I explained how their IUA''s work and explained that they would present themselves as cash pay patients ONLY for diagnostic or injury/illness. Not for preventative services. I explained to her who Sedera is and how they come into play after they have met their IUA. I told her I would send both her and her daughter an email explaining how Sedera works so they can have the info for their records instead of trying to remember it all over the phone. She was extremely thankful for my help. She said I made her feel a LOT more comfortable with this plan and this type of "insurance". Very happy member! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-09 11:04:08', '2019-07-09 11:04:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037886046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530365', 'Steven Robinson', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-09 10:55:41', '2019-07-09 10:55:41'),
