  ('zcrm_1579374000037886036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141080', 'James Ashford', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-09 10:44:20', '2019-07-09 10:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037900008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, 'Clove called in and needed copies of her id cards sent to her because her wallet was recently stolen. I told her I would put out a request for her to ASI and get it sent out right away. She also asked about a "need" that she had started with Sedera and if I knew what was going on. I let her know that she would need to contact Sedera about that because I do not have access the files over there. She has Sedera''s phone number and will give them a call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-09 10:43:09', '2019-07-09 10:43:09'),
