  ('zcrm_1579374000037833003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610129', 'Bethany Stoll', NULL, 'Bethany called in and was told by her agent Darius to call into here about the progress of her reimbursement from ASI for her husbands colonoscopy. She told me she has been in talks with Nancy over at ASI and the last she heard from her was June 11th. She seems to be very frustrated with the whole process and is being pulled in every direction. I told her to give Nancy a call since she does have her phone number and I asked her to forward all their emails between each other over to me and I will send them the Leena at ASI to see if she can figure out what is going on. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-09 07:03:55', '2019-07-09 07:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037818031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881199', 'Linda Nehls', NULL, 'Linda just opened our rate change and compliance letter in the mail today- I resent the email to her and went through it with her.  I showed her the link to complete the HRA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-08 18:12:08', '2019-07-08 18:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037818023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'Annette called in to ask about many topics. She wanted to get permission to go in for her annual physical and get any bloodwork that goes along with it.  I did a search of the lab that she normally utilizes as well as searched for her doctors name, they were both showing in network.  I thanked her for calling, but told her that your basic annual physical in network should be under $500, and we sent that email so that people would be mindful and to confirm more expensive screenings like mammography and colonoscopy.  I told her that I would send a handful of educational emails on the subject of preventative care so she could use it kinda like a compass to guide her.  She really liked the sound of that.  Also she wanted to tell me that she had yet to receive her LibertyRX card.  I told her that it should be on it''s way but that I would make sure with Sedera that it is.  Next she wanted to vent about her recent experience with Sedera, she said "oh, I don''t want to get this girl in trouble."  saying that bills that she was uploading that were tied to a need that was open were not getting paid, and she asked if Sedera was "going out of business or something"  I told her no....but that some cases- bills- can take a bit longer.  She said that her needs coordinator was really great at first...but now she''s slow.  I told her that I could reach out on this end, but she told me not too, that she is going to try to call "her" this week and if she is still getting frustrated she will call in and make sure that we know.  She was pretty happy to have been able to just vent. I told her that if she needed us to contact management over there on her behalf that we would do so.  I left it like that with her but will be sending these notes to Dania just to be safe. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-08 18:03:54', '2019-07-08 18:04:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037803041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141256', 'John Phibbs', NULL, 'Need to correct birth date for Connor with Sedera and Teladoc.  Already changed in CRM.  Need to order MPowering and RCI cards for Connor', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-07-08 17:25:52', '2019-07-08 17:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037803036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039613005', 'David Anderson', NULL, '7-8-19 Guy told Kelly C his daughter has leukemia at the age of 5. Likely NOT a good option for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-08 17:07:34', '2019-07-08 17:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037818018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'his daughter''s college is giving him a hard time in regards to the coverage she has, he is going to try and explain it to them again, but may want to request a letter from Sedera. He is going to keep us updated. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-08 16:54:14', '2019-07-08 16:54:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037803031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037008015', 'Kellie Whitney', NULL, '7-8-19 Planning to join her local DPC for $75 a month and includes women''s pap screening. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Husband just changed jobs. She''s looking for Sept. 1st start date! Enrollment appt on Thursday, July 11th. Looking at $1500/$230.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-08 16:21:43', '2019-07-08 16:21:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037822003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Left message to Lori Brandenberg to discuss issue related to bills received....waiting on call back from Miss Brandenberg....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-08 16:09:06', '2019-07-08 16:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037818008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, 'called in unsure as to how to update his credit card info with us as well as with Liberty.  I sent him a form to fill out for our needs as well as a link and instructions on where to update payment info with Liberty.  I had tried transferring him to someone at Liberty but ended the call after 10 min. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-08 15:25:09', '2019-07-08 15:25:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037818003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris called in to ask about Teladoc derm option,  she is excited about using it.  Also wanted to know that if she submitted bloodwork that she paid for at a discount through a CO program called 9 health.  I told her that if it didn''t come through an actual DR it may not be considered eligible for reimbursement.  I told her that it wouldn''t hurt to try submitting it just to see.  She also asked if Teladoc could script her out some sort of lung cancer screening bloodwork that she spoke to Sedera? about.  I told her that she would probably need to see her doctor or specialist first, and that it may lean on the specialist side of things, but that it wouldn''t hurt to ask.  She asked me for the number to Teladoc and thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-08 15:24:29', '2019-07-08 15:24:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037803023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, '7-8-19 Rick is potentially leaving current job to work for small company w/o benefits and wanted to understand pre-x clause. He has prostate cancer in last 2 years and is in active surveillance for past 18 months. Had knee surgery 10 years ago but within past 2 years has bone on bone and may need knee replacement in next 1-5 years. Also diagnosed with low testosterone within last 1-2 years. No treatment for that. I told him this is NOT a good option for him bc of the pre-x clause and it''s too risky for him in this situation. He appreciated the guidance and is looking at other options. He didn''t sound as convinced that this isn''t an option as he should though. He was hoping to wait out the pre-x clause but again told him I highly discourage him from joining. Not a safe option!  RickWhitcomb@q.com.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-08 15:22:54', '2019-07-08 15:23:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037803018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039613005', 'David Anderson', NULL, '7-8-19 Impatient. Needs to wrap this up by end of July. Left him 2 vm on each line and responded to email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-08 15:11:15', '2019-07-08 15:11:15'),
