  ('zcrm_1579374000037803013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel.  Took a job with Benefits.  Sent cancellation email.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-07-08 11:54:20', '2019-07-08 11:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037783018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034425052', 'Douglas Osness', NULL, 'Doug called in and just wanted to double check with me first about a procedure that he is going to have done and what he needs to do. I explained to him about what his IUA is and how that works. I told him anything over his IUA he needs to get in contact with Sedera, I gave him their phone number. He seemed to understand everything that I had told him and was thankful for the help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-08 11:03:34', '2019-07-08 11:03:34'),
