    Jennifer', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-05 10:54:18', '2019-07-05 10:54:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037742003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out a QR life code for wife. Also sending request to Patty for another RCI card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-05 10:08:26', '2019-07-08 07:49:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037739003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'Julie called in this morning and asked if there was any progress with her bill she got in the mail for her annual mammogram and pap smear. I see that Kelly C tried calling Shelley over at RCI on June 28th and left a voicemail. There are no other notes stating if she got any answers. So I asked Julie to send me the bill she has to my email and I will send it over to Jennifer who is taking over for Shelley at RCI. I sent the email and am waiting for a response. In the meantime I asked Julie to try and get a hold of the detailed medical bill that has the CPT or EOB on it because the bill she has sent me is just the statement and only says what she owes on it. I still set the statement over to Jennifer regardless to see if they work with that for now. Will update notes once I hear anything from Jennifer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-05 09:56:07', '2019-07-05 09:56:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037688008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, '7-3-19 Lori called and shared nightmare stories about entire experience with ASi and Sedera and Karis Group. Nothing has worked or been a smooth process. They have about $80K of bills they are tending to with all 4 family members. See notes in notebook. She''s in process with Katie''s bills now and wants to wait until next week to see what comes about before I get involved. She does want two more cards for each family member.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-03 17:17:07', '2019-07-03 17:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037686024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064120', 'Robert Land', NULL, 'Robert called complaining of a bad knee that just isn''t getting any better- he says that he exercises alot and plays tennis...but after he plays tennis his knee will still hurt after 2-3 days. He told me that all of this started about 3 months ago,  and that he was pretty stuborn about getting seen, but it seems like it just isn''t getting any better.  He wanted to know if there was a network that he needed to adhere too- I told him no that he may go to any doctor he wishes, he said that he is trying to see a sports injury doctor that takes care of local basketball players.  I told him that it was fine and that when or if the doctor wants to do some imaging tests to ask for the CPT code or codes and give Sedera a call (if this is estimated to go over his IUA) let them know what is going on and give them the codes so that they can find the best cash price in his area.  I told him that it was great that he called because a knee injury can get pretty pricey fast.  I asked him if he knew how 2nd MD worked (just in case future sx) and he explained it great!  I told him that I would send more info on that, as well as how to submit bills to Sedera, and all of the Sedera video''s.  I told him that if he had any further questions he could call me back, and that I would be here until 10 eastern.  He kept saying that all of my help was "awesome" and that I answered everything. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-03 15:59:03', '2019-07-03 15:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037686019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005914665', 'Michele Grybeck', NULL, 'Michele called to cancel and wanted to make sure that she wouldn''t be charged on the 5th- so I got a hold of Sunny and she told me that she would handle it. I sent Michele a cancellation form as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-03 15:03:52', '2019-07-03 15:03:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037688003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, '7-2-19 Mom/Kristen is signing up her daughter whose turning 26 for the PSDHC likely. Emily is in CA and travels intl as well. Healthy, no tobacco. Takes Adderall and bc. Both affordable. Like the $1500/$243. EXPLAIN it''s per incident!  I forgot to make that clear!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-03 14:47:08', '2019-07-11 11:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037686008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662082', 'Samantha Tucker', NULL, 'Samantha called in because she wanted to know if going to a nutritionist would be covered as preventative- because "it is kinda"  I asked her why she was going to see the nutritionist and she said it was because she has been feeling "fatigued" and "running slow".  First I explained why seeing a nutritionist is not service that is mandated by the ACA so it would not be covered by her MEC- secondly I told her that being fatigued and running slow are symptoms she is experiencing- thus wanting to seek a professional for a cure.  I told her that if she was exhibiting symptoms, or been diagnosed with anything that Sedera has a 36 month look back period and this would not be something that is shareable.  She then said "it''s been more like a month and a half, but definitely not 36 months."  I corrected her and said that it didn''t have to be 36 months ago,  it just needed to be within that time frame for Sedera to consider it.  I told her that if this was something that JUST happened, what bills she needed to gather- plus How to Submit bills to Sedera email, all of Sedera''s video''s, preventative care email with attached ACA list of benefits.....and a Welcome Call scheduler, because she hasn''t done one yet. I ended the call with a suggestion to look at her Sedera Guidelines. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-03 14:40:50', '2019-07-03 15:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037686003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819541', 'Jorge Usabiaga', NULL, 'Tried to contact member and no voice mail available, responded to her email to provide a valid phone number to contact...waiting on response from member...to discuss issue with lab bills.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-03 14:29:44', '2019-07-03 14:29:44'),
