  ('zcrm_1579374000037665018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Leena from ASI got back to me this afternoon and was able to find the claim that was put in from Linda about her lab bill. Leena has put the claim through to be processed and put through the check run to pay out to Quest Diagnostics and Linda will owe $0. Quest has noted this in Linda''s account and put it on hold for 45 days until they get the payment, so no more bills will be sent out or go to collections. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-03 11:25:47', '2019-07-03 11:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037628053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out QR Life code card for husband Joseph. Wanted to know if Teledoc has specialists(not specific)checked with John yes that there is with a extra charge. Member asked about Mammogram if its covered I said she has to contact DPC Doctor and see if services are done at DPC office if not if you have to go else where you would have to pay upfront and then send to Sedera for reimbursement. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-03 11:14:42', '2019-07-03 11:25:58'),
