  ('zcrm_1579374000037620013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie recently tried signing up for Teladoc and Teladoc told her that they could not find her info and to call into here at MPowering. I asked Patti if she knew anything about that and she said that it is something that is on Sedera''s end and she is going to contact them and as soon as Patti hears back from Sedera she will give Marie a call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-02 13:37:09', '2019-07-02 13:37:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037620008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521418', 'Joshua Keith', NULL, 'Joshua called in and asked specifically to speak with Wendy about some questions regarding the health risk assessment. I told him that I could help him out with that. His 2 questions were 1. If he selects individual sole proprietor for the tax info and 2. what he puts for his tax ID number. I told him yes that he clicks the sole proprietor and for the ID number it will be his social security number. He was glad I was able to help and not have to transfer him all over the place and Wendy possibly not answer. He is all set with the HRA and is submitting it now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-02 13:27:27', '2019-07-02 13:27:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037628008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036082029', 'Brea Judge', NULL, 'Member was missed for billing due to a confusion about billing Moxie girl. Set up FTNI with reoccurring payments out of Moxie Girl/Amanda Thomas'' account and charged set up fee. Already on Redirect as of 7/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-02 13:16:14', '2019-07-02 13:16:14'),
