  ('zcrm_1579374000037602018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033064', 'Michael Matyasz', NULL, 'Member address updated in ASi &amp; Sedera &amp; FTNi', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-07-02 13:14:06', '2019-07-02 13:14:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037620003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359037', 'Erich Bichsel', NULL, 'Kari gave me a call to just make sure she is doing the right thing when she goes in for her daughters yearly physical today. I first made sure the provider is in network and they are. This is a provider that her and her husband and kids use for everything. I told her that she just needs to make sure she is handing the provider her RCI card and to 100% make sure that the visit is strictly preventative. She fully understood what I meant when I explained the difference between preventative and diagnostic. She also let me know that from her husband Erich''s yearly physical she got a bill in the mail. I explained that what could have happened is the provider could have coded it incorrectly with diagnostic codes. I said that happens a lot of the time and it is a simple fix. I told her to email me the bill she got and I will send it over to Shelley at RCI. I looked at the bill and unfortunately it was just the billing statement. I still sent it over to Shelley but I emailed Kari back and let her know that what we need is the detailed medical bill with the CPT codes on it. I explained in the email what the CPT codes are and why it is important we get those. I am still waiting for a response from Shelley and Kari. Will keep notes updated when I hear anything. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-02 12:37:56', '2019-07-02 12:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037619003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036932053', 'Brent Anderson', NULL, 'July payment went through. Sent email for set up fee returned', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-02 12:37:09', '2019-07-02 12:37:09'),
