  ('zcrm_1579374000037558003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032731105', 'Breantt Wollis', NULL, 'Joe referred Sharon Kolodney from Smash.  She asked for Kyle and I took the call to handle.  I called Kyle and left a VM about this.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-07-02 07:50:06', '2019-07-02 07:50:06'),
