  ('zcrm_1579374000037500042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162592', 'Aaron Lujan', NULL, 'Aaron called in wanting to know what his price per month would be if he were to raise his IUA,  I told him that the main office was closed but that someone would get back to him in the morning.  He said that if he couldn''t change it, or, if the price didn''t drop far enough that he was going to cancel us to go onto a new plan that he had found.  I messaged Patti and asked that someone at home office get back to him mid morning CO time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-01 18:44:18', '2019-07-01 18:44:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037535008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243389', 'Edward Seymour', NULL, '6-26-19 Wendy - 

The Review Board (Community Stewardship Board) agreed that Ed''s costs should be shared.

