Kindly - 

Dañia Heffington
Dir. Member Experience', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-01 16:16:26', '2019-07-01 16:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037543003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Called Mindy Grabau regarding colonoscopy, there is still a problem.  Working on the problem..', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-07-01 15:29:12', '2019-07-01 15:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037500037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471284', 'Michelle Caldwell', NULL, 'Michelle called in because she was having a hard time registering for Teladoc.  I emailed her the step by step instructions and then we went over them together and she was able to get in.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-01 14:51:59', '2019-07-01 14:51:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037500032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'Eben wanted to know how to get a covered colonoscopy- I told him that it needed to be coded as preventative- I asked if he had a history of polyps (because he told me that he has had a colonoscopy before) and he told me no.  I asked for the name of his GP- who is a Dr. Matthew Brett @ Salud Family Center.  I told him to get in touch with him and ask for a colonoscopy script and 1 or 2 (would be better) facilities that he would like him to go to.  He is going to get that information and call us back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-07-01 14:15:58', '2019-07-01 14:15:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037518035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'Acct was set up wrong. FTNI is fixed and July processed', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-01 14:15:23', '2019-07-01 14:15:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037539013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Linda called in and said she has been fighting back and forth with Quest Labs about a bill and she found out that the doctor coded everything wrong but did re code it as preventative and re submitted it. She is stating that the lab has yet to hear back from ASI about anything and keeps billing her. I told her to send the bill to me and I will get in touch with someone over at ASI asap for her.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-01 13:48:44', '2019-07-01 13:48:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037539008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033212', 'John Brausen', NULL, 'Carol called in and said she was going to go have an x-ray done of her shoulder this afternoon and just wanted to call in to let us know and if there is anything else she needs to do. I explained that that procedure would be diagnostic and not covered due to an injury. I told her that her IUA is $1000 and that is what she is responsible for out of pocket. She stated she knew that and just wanted to call and double check. I let her know the process is the bill is more than her IUA and who Sedera is and what they do. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and sent the email out explaining how to submit a need with them. She was very thankful for the information and seemed like she fully understood. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-01 13:47:18', '2019-07-01 13:47:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037539003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672169', 'Nermijad Mehmedovic', NULL, 'I emailed Shelley over at RCI with the bill that Nermijad sent me for lab tests from his wellness visit. Shelley got back to me and said that there was no insurance information submitted with the bill and that she gave all the information over to the provider and they will resubmit the claim to RCI and to disregard any of the bills that Nermijad has gotten. I have him cc''d in the email so he knows what is going on. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-07-01 12:42:59', '2019-07-01 12:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037518027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031810039', 'Morgan Adams', NULL, 'Thomas Adams is Morgan Adams'' dad. He pays for her insurance but this was never listed and no third party payer was noted. Payments have been coming back because we had her billing address on FTNI and not his so Chase kept not horning the payments. 
Fixed FTNI with the correct address and noted that there is a third party payer. Also re-ran July payment and voided late fees as we should have caught that earlier.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-07-01 11:36:57', '2019-07-01 11:36:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037535003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881351', 'Ronald Stear', NULL, '7-1-19 HRA is complete. He tried to do it again but couldn''t bc already complete. He also wanted to know worst case scenario of someone got cancer. I explained to him again how IUA''s work and per incident with 5 max. He''s super pleased and super nice thanking me profusely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-07-01 10:37:34', '2019-07-01 10:37:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037528041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364176', 'Andrew Bibb', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-07-01 10:30:01', '2019-07-01 10:30:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037511028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962166', 'Tammy Dowdy', NULL, 'Emailed from Jenny Franco: 
