  ('zcrm_1579374000037484003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963011', 'Andrea Collins', NULL, 'I received a cancellation request from this enrollee.  I have cancelled her in RCI and Sedera and requested refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-28 08:48:07', '2019-06-28 08:48:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037423074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'I got a call from Quentin Green, he wanted me to explain why he was charged an amount of $500 + and another charge of $271 ???  he says that he knows that there was a rate increase, but that is not what he is concerned about, he says that he had spoken to someone concerning the way he takes care of his own and his sons account, and wonders if it all reversed on itself and this now is the outcome.  He is expecting a call from someone in finance at 773-418-5359', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-27 17:39:42', '2019-06-27 17:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037423069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963011', 'Andrea Collins', NULL, 'she called to cancel her plan, I told her that because home office was closed she would have to wait to hear from Patti until tomorrow, I told her that I would ask Patti to reach out to her, I also asked that she fill out the cancellation form that I sent her. I tagged Darius and Patti in the email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-27 15:32:49', '2019-06-27 15:32:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037423064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299149', 'Grant Hudson', NULL, 'Grant called in to speak with someone in finance, I told him that home office was closed for the day, but that I would reach out to Sunny and ask that she call him back tomorrow morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-27 15:25:39', '2019-06-27 15:25:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037423059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'Andrea called in because Brian wanted to make sure that he had fulfilled his obligation to fill out his HRA- I explained that he did not need to do complete that for the second time if he had already referred someone.  I then read the letter that he received from Jennie on MAY 24 that stated the same.  I told Andrea that Brian was an awesome awesome member, and has been very graceful about the preventive medical claim situation that he is in.  She said that he is always referring people. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-27 14:51:57', '2019-06-27 14:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037423054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001111021', 'Anna Edwards', NULL, 'Gavin Edwards called saying that he still hadn''t heard from Sunny about his wifes monthly premium.  I told him that because she was with Liberty, his monthly amount owed to us would be $50, he said that he understood that but he thought that was for the "concierge service"  I told him that yes it was but that he would have to speak with Liberty about their monthly fee.  I gave him their phone number and then transferred him to a live operator there. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-27 14:49:51', '2019-06-27 14:49:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037423049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024472005', 'Heidi Geldean', NULL, 'Heidi reached out via filling out a MEC help request form in regards to how she should submit a bill for breast ultrasound. And other questions about how her plans work, I informed her that this would not be a covered expense and told her why- told her who she should be contacting once a claim is submitted to RCI, how to submit a need to Sedera.  I also sent her many many educational emails and put emphasis on her watching the short Sedera videos, I told her that I thought they would help give her some better understanding as to how her plan works and told her that if she had any further questions she could always reach out to MPowering, RCI or Sedera about any questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-27 14:35:19', '2019-06-27 14:35:19'),
