  ('zcrm_1579374000037428026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '6-27-19 Jody needs to move daughter onto own plan now that out of college. I told her to email LHS to make the change. Patti agreed that we can keep her daughter on HES as is.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-27 13:56:53', '2019-06-27 13:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037417087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035116005', 'Carol Smith', NULL, 'Carol,
     I have heard back from Sedera about your issues registering your husband for Teledoc.  He had been left off the file that was sent to TeleDoc, he will be able to register on Monday.  But please keep in mind he will have to register himself as he is an adult.  Let me know if you need any further assistance.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-27 13:51:27', '2019-06-27 13:51:27'),
