  ('zcrm_1579374000037428018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037471035', 'Judith Lucas', NULL, '6-27-19 Judy is enrolling now for DPC membership and referred by Dr. Lee! His site isn''t set up yet so we are using mine for now. She is 56 and healthy. Just takes blood pressure meds and has arthritis. She understands pre-x clause for arthritis. No meds for arthritis. Paying $750 now for Kaiser and $7000 Ded. She''s choosing $1500 IUA with $230 month and $80 to Dr. Lee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-27 13:33:34', '2019-06-27 13:34:27'),
