  ('zcrm_1579374000037417041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000243019', 'Rachel Streater', NULL, 'Member called in to update her CC and since she has had CC issues  charge declined.  Said she would just like to cancel.  I will send her cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-27 11:33:02', '2019-06-27 11:33:02'),
