  ('zcrm_1579374000037423030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438063', 'James Kreitman', NULL, '6-26-19 Works for small company who is members of Cloud Medical and Sedera but as Individuals, not group. Elizabeth and Leland Aoxley and Amber Rego are members who work with his company. I can''t find them in the CRM. I''m guessing they signed up directly with Hint via Cloud. He contacted Sedera and got routed to me. He had a hip replacement 7 years ago. He went to Dartmouth and is from Weymouth, MA! Doing stem cell treatments in Cayman Islands for knee. Played sports all life. Now can do many of his activities again.  He''s paid for all treatments on own. Even professional football players have used this with great success. Local place is Centeno Schultz in Broomfield. Can help with all types of issues with bone on bone, etc. Super cool!  Enrolled on 1st call with DPC $500 IUA / $273.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-26 13:31:20', '2019-06-26 16:12:09'),
