  ('zcrm_1579374000037417018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, 'We had member+ family $1000 IUA and it should have been $500 IUA. Notified member and updated FTNI to reflect the correct monthly rate of $890.00', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-26 12:19:21', '2019-06-26 12:20:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037428008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023275014', 'Wesley Dibble', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Sedera and cancel RCI.  Also cancel in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-26 12:16:57', '2019-06-26 12:16:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037408018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068140', 'Michele Venne', NULL, 'Michele called in and has yet to use her plan and just needed a run down on how everything works. What she first needed help with was finding a provider in her area for a yearly physical. She gave me a providers name that she used a couple years ago to see if he as in network. If it is the correct name and address that I found then, yes, he is in network. I sent her his name and address to clarify if that was the same provider she was talking about. In the same email I attached a list providers in her area. I also explained how the plan works and the 2 different ways it works, as in the preventative side and the diagnostic side with injury/illness. I told her that I would be sending her a bunch of general educational emails that will help further explain everything and it will help her have actual notes and paper so she does not have to remember everything that I just told her on the phone because it is a lot of info. I also suggested her to have a 2nd welcome call and she said she will read  my emails first and see if she can just understand it from there and if not than yes she will ask for a 2nd welcome call. I sent her the email on how to present her MEC, provider lookup instructions, how to submit bills over to Sedera, 64+ preventative services covered by the ACA, and lastly an email that gives 5 steps on how to avoid surprise bills that can be avoided by being preventative. She sound pretty confident with all the info that I gave her over the phone and was very very thankful for me taking the time to sit down and explain everything to her without feeling rushed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-26 12:12:42', '2019-06-26 12:12:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037428003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141299', 'Jeff Carden', NULL, 'Proof of DPC Sent to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-26 11:53:45', '2019-06-26 11:53:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037408013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, 'Analisa called in and said that Kelly is getting billed for a preventative service that she has recently gotten done. I emailed Kelly and asked her to email me the bill that she is getting and I will take a look and send it over to the right people to get the issue resolved asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-26 11:49:06', '2019-06-26 11:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037408008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, 'Susan called in and she needed some help on finding some providers and facilities in her area for her to go and get her annual mammogram screening done. I of course told her I would be more than happy to help her out. She gave me a few diferent area codes to look into in CO. She also told me that I could look up some places in the Madison Alabama area because she sometimes is in that area visiting her mother and will be there sometime in July next month. I sent her the 2 lists and also an email on how to present herself to the provider''s office upon arrival. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-26 11:26:29', '2019-06-26 11:26:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037423008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438028', 'Richard Reiter', NULL, '6-26-19 Kinda is applying now for Richard to join DPC option now for Aug. 1st start date.  Rick has ongoing chiro visits for back issue. Understands pre-x clause. Cytellopram (?) typically for depression and for him to keep him calm. Chose the $5000 IUA with DPC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-26 11:17:17', '2019-06-26 11:32:07'),
