  ('zcrm_1579374000037308013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-25 09:24:16', '2019-06-25 09:24:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037308008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, 'Mailbox is full. Not able to leave a message. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-25 09:18:00', '2019-06-25 09:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037307003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, 'Sent 2nd request for Proof of DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-25 08:29:09', '2019-06-25 08:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037305003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'Floyd called in and needed some help with finding a provider that was in network to be able to take care of his annual physical. I let him know that I found about 19 results and that it is up to his digression on who he would like to choose. I went through the process on how he presents himself and which card he needs to show at the front desk. I also let him know that what is covered with his preventive plan and that if he is to bring up any symptoms or any sort of pain that is talked about could possibly lead to becoming diagnostic. I explained to him what that entails and what diagnostic means. He fully understood and was very very happy that I could provide him the help and a list of doctors that will be covered with his plan. I also sent him a couple emails that have the 64+ services that are covered and considered preventative by the ACA and an email on how to present himself when he gets to his appointment. He was very happy and sounded a lot more confident with the info and the knowledge that I gave him. :) -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-25 08:28:42', '2019-06-25 08:29:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037284013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Rhonda called in wondering if Quest Diagnostics were in network or not.  I asked what the bloodwork is for preventative or diagnostic.  She told me that it wasn''t preventative because she had "a lot of inflammation going on"  I told her that there wasn''t any network for injury or illness, that she may go to whom ever she liked, ask for a CPT coded receipt along with her cash receipt in case this need were to go over her $1500 IUA, she asked what an IUA was.  I told her that I was going to send her many educational emails, and stressed the importance of a welcome call.  She said that she thinks that it was scheduled.  Between my notes and Kelly F''s I think it is fair to say that a Welcome call is desperately needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-24 18:22:07', '2019-06-24 18:22:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037253056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757110', 'Brandon Lowitz', NULL, '6-24-19 Patti said she''d change the billing for Aug. 1st start date per his application and per showing under the start date in CRM.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-24 18:11:16', '2019-06-24 18:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037253048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438028', 'Richard Reiter', NULL, '6-24-19 Rick is self-employed. Looking at this for him and maybe their daughter who will need to be on her own membership at 24.  Rick belongs to Washington Park Direct Care @http://washingtonpark.md/. Enrollment meeting on Wed. June 26th with Kinda Reiter to complete for husband.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-24 18:02:45', '2019-06-24 18:04:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037253043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038170085', 'Jeffrey Dickinson', NULL, '6-24-19 They do not have ins now. Cilla turns 65 in Aug. so not an option. Husband just turned 60 in Feb. As couple cost was going to be $3000 with Anthem! Jeff is healthy, no meds. Only had mole removed 5 years ago, maybe melanoma. Nothing since. No tobacco. Want an Aug. 1st start date. Redirect is best option bc of age.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-24 17:56:44', '2019-07-12 11:25:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037253038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '6-24-19 Moving back to CO from AZ. Son 5 has asthma and landed in hospital 2x in last 2 years. So, they will keep him on traditional ins with Anthem for $494 likely, Silver plan with lower ded. Husband  Robert had a knee replacement 1 1/2 yrs ago and is doing great. He bikes and climbs without any trouble. They understand pre-x clause. She only went to PT for mild hip pain and no problems since or otherwise. Pd for that out of pocket. Like Provider Directed with Redirect for ease of use and added value and modest price difference. Also likes the $500 IUA option best. $500/$710 for couple. He''s 55, she''s 44 and son 5. They have an HSA now but can fund it fully for 2019 and not beyond.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-24 17:42:47', '2019-08-12 11:14:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037284008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497031', 'David Harap', NULL, 'David emailed me with some preventive billing information, I copied him on the forwarded email to Monica and Leena at ASI, hoping that they could explain the charges. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-24 16:52:30', '2019-06-24 16:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037284003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Debra called stating that she had yet to hear from anybody concerning the note below, I apologized, tried to get a hold of Sunny and then eventually reached out to Patti to see if she could shed some light as to what is going on for Debra. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-24 14:44:45', '2019-06-24 14:44:45'),
