  ('zcrm_1579374000037253028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Rhonda called in a little confused from a letter that she got in the mail from her annual mammogram visit stating that she might qualify for financial support. which means that the facility is charging her for something. She said she has not gotten any bills or any results yet in the mail. Rhonda was calling in to see if we had the medical files from that visit if anything went through. I let her know that with her RCI plan that we do not have any sort of files like there here at MPowering. I let her know that that would be on RCI''s side. I provided her with RCI''s number to give them a call and see if she can get the information from them. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-24 13:54:27', '2019-06-24 13:54:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037282003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521158', 'Jennifer Hansen', NULL, 'member called in regarding the IUA mismatch.  Was billed for 2 months for a $500 IUA (783) then billed for the correct amount of 638. (1000 IUA).  Son had fractured elbow and had bills of approx 900.  She asked if there would be any way to recoup the 400 difference between the 500 IUA and the 900 cost for son''s injury.  I suggested to Patti that the only money due the Hansen''s would be the difference between the monthly share contribution for a 500 IUA and 1000IUA.  (149 x 2 months).  Checking with Rod for decision.  Also asked about Cologuard being covered.  Spoke to Monica Lugo at ASI and it is an eligible expense.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-24 13:29:13', '2019-06-24 13:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037268008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601171', 'Susan Bradley', NULL, 'Spoke to Susan Bradley....Client informed me she was billed E&amp;M Level 3....for ER visit.  Instucted client to receive medical visit notes from facility re: ER Visit.  Then we can possibly identify if ER claim is valid.  Waiting on client to obtain Medical Record notes re: ER visit.  Will then see if notes are comparable to E&amp;M Level 3 codes.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-24 13:26:19', '2019-06-24 13:26:19'),
