  ('zcrm_1579374000037253023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034356029', 'Grant Whitus', NULL, 'Grant called in, in regards to the missed call from Vanessa. Vanessa is out of the office today 6/24/19. I asked if she can call him 1st thing tomorrow morning and he will be traveling all day but said he can do a call 1st thing Wed 6/26/19 morning. Left note on Vanessa''s desk. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-24 13:07:34', '2019-06-24 13:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037253018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, '6-24-19 Spoke with Suzy and she is doing well! It turns out it was a serious migraine and/or concussion from a recent fall on the stairs. She successfully was picked up by friend who took her to ER and they ran many tests included cat scan on brain and neck and also did x-rays on elbow and foot. We got cut off bc she took another call. But, she was feeling good again and was super nice. Thought she had a $5000 Ded, not remembering she only has a $1000 IUA. She still wants help with the process as she''s completely uncertain. Knows our line and also gave her Sedera''s phone to deal with bills.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-24 13:07:04', '2019-06-24 13:07:04'),
