  ('zcrm_1579374000037253013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819469', 'Joseph Stafford', NULL, 'Joe called in and had a question on what he needs to do to submit his bills for back pain that he has been having for some months now that he has been going to a chiropractor for. I let him know that when it comes submitting his bills to start a "Need" that would be through Sedera. I explained to him who Sedera is and how that process works, as in what Sedera does on their end. He understood and I gave him their phone number and told him I would be sending him an email that explains how to submit bills over to Sedera. He was very thankful for the information and asked for my direct line for the future if he has any other questions. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-24 11:43:52', '2019-06-24 11:43:52'),
