  ('zcrm_1579374000037268003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601171', 'Susan Bradley', NULL, 'called 2nd time to discuss billing...left second message to call me to discuss situation.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-24 10:08:47', '2019-06-24 10:08:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037262003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530294', 'Caleb Dokken', NULL, 'Application pended member never submitted childs SS#', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-24 08:58:43', '2019-06-24 08:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037253008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Joy has called and said she was out of town until last night and just got all the emails in regards to the IUA change and asked if there is anyway she can still get it changed. I let her know that the deadline was on the 17th of June and I was made aware that it can not. She asked to speak to someone about this. Transferred to Patti who is the one taking care of the IUA changes. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-24 08:25:18', '2019-06-24 08:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Sandra phoned in and had a question if a certain procedure was covered or not. It is called a Colpo/Leep. It is a procedure that her woman''s well visit doctor had said she needed to have done in regards to an A typical cell that was found. It is a procedure to prevent a form of cancer. She does NOT have cancer, this is just a precaution. I let her know that unfortunately this would be considered diagnostic in nature. She was a little upset because it is technically preventative for cancer and what not. I calmed her down and let her know that I understood and I agree that this is something that is the right thing to do, but with how her plan works, if something is found during a preventative visit that, that portion of the visit would not be covered and thats when her IUA of $1000 kicks in. Once I said that she understood and had said she has already paid about $500 towards this. I let her know that once she has met her IUA she then asks to be billed the rest(if this procedure is going to be more than her IUA) and to contact Sedera to let them know and to submit the bills over to them. I explained who Sedera is and how to work with opening a "Need" She fully understood and was 100% accepting of how it work. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and sent her an email that explains how to submit the bills. She was very happy that I gave her all the info she was calling in about and seemed to be happy with the results. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-24 07:48:00', '2019-06-24 07:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037174033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601171', 'Susan Bradley', NULL, 'called and left message for client to call me...waiting on call back.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-21 17:55:45', '2019-06-21 17:55:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037154122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009143063', 'Adam Rothberg', NULL, 'Adam called in asking how he can submit a claim to ASI, I told him to scan or take a picture of his detailed coded medical bill and send it to claims@asibenefits.com - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-21 17:23:36', '2019-06-21 17:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037154117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Debra called in stating that more money came out of her bank account than she thought it would.  She wanted to confirm that the $1000 IUA was put into play as discussed with Patti.  I told her that I would try getting a hold of Sunny, I left a message and asked that Sunny call Debra back at her earliest convenience.  Debra was pretty happy with the effort. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-21 17:22:10', '2019-06-21 17:22:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037154112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601171', 'Susan Bradley', NULL, 'Susan called in because she has hospital bills that have been stacking up due to an ER visit thinking she was having a stroke to all of the symptoms being caused by a salivary stone.  She really is a great sport and has already negotiated down bills....now she is asking for more tips to chew down the rest, I told her that I would have Guy call her on Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-21 16:55:21', '2019-06-21 16:55:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037154107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480226', 'Konstantinos Stamatiou', NULL, 'Ioanna called in confused about registering with Teladoc.  The email that was sent to her says to make sure that you indicate MPowering Benefits...but there was only an option of Sedera.   I told her that she should be stating that she is with Sedera and apologized for the typo.  I asked if Teladoc did not recognize her husbands name, she said that no, they did have his name but did not recognize MPowering Benefits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-21 16:45:18', '2019-06-21 16:45:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037144428', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141539', 'Gwen Henson', NULL, 'Billing set up', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-21 16:24:59', '2019-06-21 16:24:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037144423', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141488', 'Evian Hanshaw', NULL, 'Billing Set Up', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-21 16:15:44', '2019-06-21 16:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037154102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Yen-Yen called in so as to know what to expect with being a cash pay patient for her upcoming colonoscopy, she said that it will be cash pay because she has a history of polyps.  She seemed confused, I told her that I could transfer the call to someone at Sedera so that they could go over how needs sharing works with her and she seemed to like that idea.  Natalie picked up AND SHE just got off of the phone with Yen Yen, that Yen Yen called Sedera to speak with Coreen (ASI) to talk about a PREVENTATIVE colonoscopy.  I told Natalie that I think she is just very confused and needs to be told the needs sharing process so as to know what to expect. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-21 16:11:59', '2019-06-21 16:11:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037144418', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141445', 'MarySue Bonetti', NULL, 'Billing set up', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-21 16:03:34', '2019-06-21 16:03:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037154097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, 'Susan called to ask if she needed to go to the ER what facilities she could go to, I told her that she can go to the closest one if need be there is no network for illness or injury.  I told her to present herself as cash pay, not to pay over her $1000 IUA with Sedera and ask to be billed the rest.  To call Sedera when she was stable.  She asked me to text her Sedera''s number.  I did via Skipio. She called me back to make sure she wasn''t supposed to show the hospital her ASI card, I told her no, that it was for her preventative care only.  She told me that she was in the car and said she had people coming to get her, that she was losing her vision and her eyes were not co-operating, they were "just doing their own thing" she asked if she could call an ambulance if needed and I said "ABSOLUTELY!  Susan, if you think that you need to call an ambulance then that''s what you need to do!  Do you think you need to call an ambulance?" she said (sweetly as always) "no, there are people coming for me"  I didn''t want to leave her on the phone the way that she was, she told me that luckily for her this happened on a quiet residential road. She said that 3 days ago she fell down some stairs, she was having migraines ever since and she was afraid that this was related.  She told me that her eyes were moving all over the place, and she couldn''t see well.  I stayed on the phone,  she said that she had people picking her up any minute, she said she wanted to let me go, I told her that I would pray for her.  I tried her phone again, but it went to voicemail.  I am going to share my notes with Sedera and her rep Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-21 16:02:44', '2019-06-21 16:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037144413', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141397', 'Philip Lang', NULL, 'Billing set up', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-21 15:58:11', '2019-06-21 15:58:11'),
