  ('zcrm_1579374000037174008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Machelle called in and she is pretty upset that she is getting bills for her annual physical she had gotten done when she was told at the front desk of the facility that everything was fine and covered with her plan. I had checked for her and the facility is in network. She made sure to let the provider know that her visit was strictly preventative and that she should not be billed, the provider told her that that is correct and everything is coded as preventative. She also got a bill in the mail from the blood work she got done and it seems to be the same situation. She told the front desk at the blood work office that it is preventative and made sure that she would not be billed and the front desk said no she will NOT be billed. I told Machelle to send me the bills via email she has received and I will send them over to someone at ASI ASAP. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-21 11:00:21', '2019-06-21 11:00:21'),
