  ('zcrm_1579374000037121003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'Madonna called in and was a little confused on how she should go about paying off her catscan. She mentioned to me that when she told the facility she is self pay they took $2000  off the bill already. She told me that the total for her blood work and the catscan is about $3000. I let her know that she needs to meet her $1000 IUA and asked to be billed the rest. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her to contact them asap to let them know what has been going on and that she will be over her IUA, so they can start a "Needs" case with her. She let me know so far for everything she has only paid about $400. I told her Sedera would be able to help walk her through the process of what she needs to do and that they are the people that deal with "Need''s" after she has met her IUA. Madonna will let me know what she hears when she gets in contact with Sedera. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-21 07:27:45', '2019-06-21 07:27:45'),
