  ('zcrm_1579374000037059297', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141445', 'MarySue Bonetti', NULL, '6-20-19 Mary Sue enrolled right away with $1000 IUA. We just added her husband! He''s going to cancel his employer plan. So, new cost is $655 a month since he''s in his 50''s also. He''s 53 or 54. Just gets skin checked every year and sometimes has basal cells removed. He''s a red head. Otherwise totally healthy, no tobacco.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-20 17:08:56', '2019-06-20 17:08:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037059292', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141445', 'MarySue Bonetti', NULL, '6-20-19 Healthy, no ins. now. Looked into LHS and Native American option but didn''t like them. She has an irregular heart beat and gets it checked every so often, 1x per year. She is NOT worried that there can be any problem with her heart at all. Just had annual visit and doc super happy with her health. No smoking ever. Now 51 almost 52 next month. Referred by Jim Geib her accountant who noticed she doesn''t have health ins at all now bc it was way too expensive. Pays cash for all visits already and gets a 20% discount off retail rates.  She has Atrial Ceptal Defect and hemachromatosis. Keeps eye on serotin levels and gives blood every so often.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-20 16:36:12', '2019-06-20 16:36:12'),
