  ('zcrm_1579374000037031008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, 'Called in and was not able to reach anyone here on 6/18/19 and left a message with the betty''s. John tried calling back and she did not answer so he left a message. Still have not heard back from her yet. Sent an email explaining everything that she needs to know and do when it comes to her type of situation with hip pain. It would be considered an injury/illness diagnostic in nature. I explained when it is diagnostic she has to pay out of pocket up until her IUA. I explained in detail what an IUA is and that she does not need to be in network for anything that is diagnostic. I told her that she could probably go to an urgent care because they tend to be a lot cheaper than a hospital. I also recommended an Orthopedist if she does not want to go to urgent care. I advised her to call ahead of time and see how much research and care the Orthopedist puts into hip issues, because Ortho''s specialize in the musculoskeletal system and may not sub-specialize in the hip area. I am also sending her an email that explains how to submit her bills to Sedera to start a "Need" if deemed necessary along with Sedera''s phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-20 12:17:44', '2019-06-20 12:17:44'),
