  ('zcrm_1579374000037031003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862150', 'Judy Flanagan', NULL, 'I received an email back from Judy this morning and she made a mistake and needed information on an HSA, not the health risk assessment. So I sent her the link she can click on the the page about an HSA from mpoweringbenefits.org website. I also sent her 2 other emails that have templates about the HSA we recommend and if she wants to sign up there is also a link that will bring her right to the form to enroll. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-20 08:24:26', '2019-06-20 08:24:26'),
