  ('zcrm_1579374000037007028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Chaz called to cancel, I sent him a form. -NOTE I did tell Chaz that he needed to fill out and submit this form tonight so that Patti could get to it bright and early in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-19 18:32:15', '2019-06-19 19:19:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037007023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'reached out via sales IQ for membership guidelines to download.  I sent him his very own PDF copy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-19 18:16:37', '2019-06-19 18:16:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037007018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, 'called to confirm what type of medical bills were needed to open up a need with Sedera- I told her CPT coded ones.  Also sent her a how to on uploading bills to Sedera and Sedera educational videos. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-19 17:35:49', '2019-06-19 17:35:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037009008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Spoke to client about his problem related to eye vision exams for children....Explained to client the difference between preventative vs. diagnostic eye exams...requested client to send me what he received from ASI.  waiting on client to send documents for me to review...will follow up with client after analysis of documents when received...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-19 16:58:30', '2019-06-19 16:58:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000037007013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Guy spoke to Marc and explained to him WHY he will most likely be the one paying for his kids 4 eye exams.  Marc wanted to argue about what is included in "Obamacare" and Guy broke it all down for him to be able to understand. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-19 16:53:43', '2019-06-19 16:53:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036966073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037016198', 'James Geib', NULL, '6-19-19 CPA in Aspen and paying over $1000 a month! Only medical event was a blown out knee in March 2015. Looked into LHS and Christian HS but saw bad reviews for slow reimbursements. No Meds, healthy, sees dr. 1x yr and every quarter for hemi facial spasm where facial muscles tighten and cause extra blinking. Uses botox to deaden muscles. Costs about $250-$350. Chose Provider Directed for PCP visits and wellness since in Aspen. Chose $1000 IUA. 53 years old.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-19 16:48:07', '2019-06-19 16:48:07'),
