  ('zcrm_1579374000036979158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-19 13:35:54', '2019-06-19 13:35:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036966058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '6-19-19 Works in TX and slipped off sloping roof yesterday and wants to get some x-rays. He asked if he should go to ER to do so and I told him definitely not. Go to Urgent Care but please call Concierge first to get best practice. I couldn''t reach John. Wants to x-ray ribs and needs to heal as fast as possible to keep working on the ranch he''s contracted to work on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-19 13:32:35', '2019-06-19 13:32:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036966053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, 'Kristen called in and she wanted to know how to go about getting testing and some shots covered for her 10 yr old daughter that has a severe case of rapid puberty. I told her that would be something that is injury/illness and she pays out of pocket up until her $1500 IUA. Anything after to that be billed and contact Sedera to start a "Needs" case. She knows that her daughters first visit for the shot will be around $4800. I told her to contact Sedera as soon as she can to let them know everything she has just told me and that it will defiantly be over her IUA. I provided her with Sedera''s phone number and sent an email on how to submit her bills with Sedera. She was very thankful for the information I provided her and understood how her plan works. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-19 13:31:00', '2019-06-19 13:31:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036979153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, 'Pmt updateed in FTNI - renewal 2019', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-19 13:24:15', '2019-06-19 13:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036966048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Yen-Yen sent in another MEC billing request form with all the detailed information and the attached bill with the CPT codes. I forwarded the form with the bill over to Leena and she got back to me ASAP. She stated she informed Monica about the situation and will keep me updated, I CC''d Yen-Yen in the email response to Lenna so they can also stay in the loop. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-19 13:11:37', '2019-06-19 13:11:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036979148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482208', 'Arman Sharafshahi', NULL, 'pmt updated in FTNI - renewal 2019', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-19 13:10:55', '2019-06-19 13:10:55'),
