  ('zcrm_1579374000036966043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, 'Lynn called in and I explained what she needs to do with going to get an xray she needs to have done. She already has a general idea of how is works with injury/illness. She took the words right out of my mouth with no network and paying out of pocket up until her $1000 IUA. I am going to send her an email that explains how to submit her bills to Sedera if need be. She was very happy that I took the time to call back and help her out. Ticket Closed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-19 13:00:59', '2019-06-19 13:00:59'),
