  ('zcrm_1579374000036966038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, 'Thomas called in and explained that he had just recently slipped and fell on his roof and is having pain on his right side. He asked if there is possible another option to go to a facility other than a hospital because they charge very large fees. I told him an urgent care place could be a possible option. I told him that anything that is injury/illness he is responsible for his $1000 IUA. I explained what that is and that is all he is to pay out of pocket. I gave him Sedera''s phone number to contact them after he is done speaking with me and to tell them everything he has just told me. They will be able to help guide him through the process. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-19 12:49:07', '2019-06-19 12:49:07'),
