  ('zcrm_1579374000036966033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299149', 'Grant Hudson', NULL, 'Called in and wasn''t sure why he was billed for his annual wellness visit. All he had was the statement and a reciept. I told him to contact his provider and to ask for the detailed medical bill that has all the CPT codes on them. Once he gets that bill to email it over to me and I will send it over to someone at APEX/RCI to have it looked and start a case. He said he will do just that and let me know when he gets it and will email it to info@mympb.com. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-19 12:43:41', '2019-06-19 12:43:41'),
