  ('zcrm_1579374000036979063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402045', 'Aida Bukovica', NULL, 'I took a call from this member who told me that she has to have a Hysterectomy and she has presented the Hospital with the MEC card. They want her to prepay for her surgery $17,000.  I asked her how much she had spent so far and she said that she had not spent anything.  She told me that her surgery was scheduled for 6/28.  I told her that her next call should be to Sedera and that they would step her through the process from here.  She had no idea who Sedera was and expressed to me that she should have bought insurance.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-19 12:01:11', '2019-06-19 12:01:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036966028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993542', 'Deborah Smith', NULL, 'Deborah called in and she needed some help looking up some providers for an annual wellness visit in her area and one other area she stated she will be in next moth. She also asked if I could find some reviews for the providers. I gladly helped her with finding providers in the zip codes she gave me. I also found reviews for all of the providers for both lists and made links she can click on to read the reviews. I also sent her an email on how to present herself to the providers and an email on how to do the provider search herself for the future. She was very happy I was able to help her in a timely manner. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-19 11:33:29', '2019-06-19 11:33:29'),
