  ('zcrm_1579374000036946048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'Spoke to John McBride about the billing issue about his colonoscopy.  Informed client that we have escalated this issue to people in ASI and Sedera.  He just wants to be informed about status and what he needs to pay or do to get this corrected or paid.  I informed client we will get back to him when we receive an answer.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-18 14:06:47', '2019-06-18 14:06:47'),
