  ('zcrm_1579374000036936144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025370062', 'Jeffrey Janower', NULL, 'Jefferey called in upset that he was getting billed for labwork that was taken at a preventative visit.  I tried to explain (he was cursing and loud) I tried to send him over to Shelley at APEX but I left a message.  I told him that she would be calling him shortly, and that in the meantime he could send me pictures of the statements he was looking at.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-18 13:06:33', '2019-06-18 13:06:33'),
