  ('zcrm_1579374000036922078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752446', 'Sabine Kortals', NULL, 'from Leena- I have let Sabine know- KC
Hi Kelly,

 

I apologize for the delay in my reply – I was out of the office a few days last week and I am still trying to catch up today! Is this in regards to the 4/20/18 date of service with Diversified Radiology for $171? If so, this claim was processed by ASi in April – the check did not go out until 5/29/19 though as our accounting department was waiting for approval for the release of this check. The ASi EOB is attached showing that Sabine’s responsibility is $0. Since the check just went out about 2 weeks ago, typically we wait about a month to do a check tracer, but I can check with our accounting department to see if they can run a check tracer on this check before the month waiting period to see if the provider has cashed it and then contact them to resolve. If Sabine could send over the most recent statement she is receiving, that would assist me in resolving this claim. If this is in regards to another invoice, please send a copy of the invoice so that we can look into this further.

 

Thank you,

 

