  ('zcrm_1579374000036930043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Spoke directly with the client  and informed her what to do regarding getting the colonoscopy completed.  Gave her education on how to speak to the facility about pricing the procedure.  Gave client my phone number regarding any additional questions she may have.  Client informed me she will call me tomorrow about results with conversation with the procedure facility. Will follow up after her call.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-17 18:36:22', '2019-06-17 18:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036936114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '6-17-19 Left vm answering her vm to confirm she''s compliant with HRA now and just needs to complete rate change for only if wants to change IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-17 16:01:05', '2019-06-17 16:01:05'),
