  ('zcrm_1579374000036922073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Yen Yen uploaded a billing support form that I sent to her with specific instruction mid April. She barely filled it out, I sent her an email requesting the specifics I tagged Kelly F in that thread as well so that if she has an issue regarding this request that Kelly F can be right on it during the day. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 15:52:16', '2019-06-17 15:52:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036936104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, '6-17-19 Dr. Peter Lehmann with Vintage Direct called Joseph because his waiting list opened up and they can get in now. It is the cheapest option and they love Dr. Lehmann. So, he thinks they''ll go with the DPC option which is $510 + $160 total. Tent appt for Wed to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-17 15:42:44', '2019-06-17 15:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036922068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677493', 'Caroline McClure', NULL, 'Caroline and family all called in to ask about getting another ASI card as well as her membership benefits with Sedera surrounding a pos pregnancy.  I sent her an email going over how to submit bills to Sedera, I also went over the rate change with her and told her that even though there is a rate hike she should stay where she''s at due to the pregnancy sharing guidelines being better on group. I tried to transfer them to Sedera, no one answered so I left a message on their behalf for a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 15:32:17', '2019-06-17 15:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036936099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '6-17-19 Answered more questions about benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-17 15:30:30', '2019-06-17 15:30:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036922063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Christine called in again for tech support with Sedera.  No one would answer the phone there so I left a message on her behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 15:29:58', '2019-06-17 15:29:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036922058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Christine was having trouble utilizing Sedera''s app.  I spoke with Maddy at Sedera and she said that Christine was having an issue because there was no phone number associated with her.  She put in the phone number and told me that Christine should be able to use it now.  Christine was super grateful. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 14:51:27', '2019-06-17 14:51:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036922053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Christine wanted to know how to submit a full body scan in to Sedera as a need.  She said that she is a cancer survivor and has been cancer free since 2017 just long enough, she says, to be able to meet Sedera''s guidelines for not having a pre ex.  I sent her an email with a link an instructions on how to open up a need with Sedera.  She also has a UTI that she has been taking meds for but that she is running out and didn''t know if she should use Teladoc or go to her GP.  She decided to go with her GP because she is very uncomfortable right now and she trusts him.  I told her that it was fine, that she would just ask him for a cash discount and a detailed medical receipt along with the cash receipt just in case it went over her IUA. I sent her many many educational emails and she was thrilled.  I told her to call me back with the script details so she at least could get a discount with her CVS. The CVS that she uses is important because she has celiac disease and they are accommodating to her when it comes to making sure that all of her meds are gluten free. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 14:46:37', '2019-06-17 14:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036910096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679158', 'Cheryl Stephenson', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled. Casey Hebb will get $100 after Cheryl is on the plan for 60 consecutive days', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-17 14:30:05', '2019-06-17 14:30:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036922048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Chaz called stating that he received a bill from his doctors office and he wanted to know why.  Because he found the doctor in network and he thought that this was covered.  I sent him an email requesting more info so that I can send it to Leena at ASI.  He was thankful for the help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 14:14:50', '2019-06-17 14:14:50'),
