  ('zcrm_1579374000036910088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881277', 'Brandon Dwight', NULL, 'Brandon called back after speaking to Kyle still a little confused about the rate change and compliance issue.. was able to clarify completely and he will be sending the HRA and had no further questions about the rate change. He also had questions about not receiving referral fees for referring Donnelly Sports, will address and sent him an email explaining the reasons.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-17 12:51:26', '2019-06-17 12:51:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036936054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '6-17-19 She is super healthy, used to be a body builder, eats well, hikes and walks, doesn''t smoke, drinks on occasion. Meds acyclovir and vaginal cream which costs her $178 thru Cigna. She''s paying only $700 Total per year with her current employer and they pay the rest. That includes dental and vision for $100 each within the $700. She will contact me 3 months before retires to look at this and C4HCO. She''s going to try to live off of about $28K which will give her a huge subsidy to get trad ins. if she truly lives on that little.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-17 12:46:24', '2019-06-17 12:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036936043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '6-17-19 Hi Wendy,

I’m a neighbour of Renae Einspahr and she shared your email and phone number so that I could contact you for information regarding health coverage.  I’ve been working for a life insurance company for years.  The company has subsidized our health coverage.  I’m now planning retirement, hopefully early 2020.  My biggest concern is health coverage so I’m eager to find answers and learn that I can in fact retire and not go broke before becoming eligible for medicare. 

I’m 57 this August, I have no existing medical conditions and I’m in general good health.  I work out regularly, visit my family physician annually and perform all the appropriate preventive tests (mammogram, pap-smear, colonoscopy) when needed, and so far, have produced all good results.  My parents both live and are 85 years old and are both relatively healthy also.  I’m hoping to find a health coverage I can afford on a fixed retirement income. 

When convenient, would you be willing to contact me at this email address or call me at 720-530-5445?  Thank you.

Lisa Birkhofer

720-530-5445

Birko1.lb@gmail.com

Lisa.Birkhofer@hlramerica.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-17 12:43:04', '2019-06-17 12:43:34'),
