  ('zcrm_1579374000036936038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881277', 'Brandon Dwight', NULL, 'Spoke with Brandon to inform of rate change and compliance issue. His email regarding the rate change had an error for his new rate amount, hence some confusion on his end. I was able to clarify as well as inform of compliance issue. He will remedy these issues immediately', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2019-06-17 11:52:59', '2019-06-17 11:52:59'),
