  ('zcrm_1579374000036922013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000316', 'Symone Sandquist', NULL, 'Symone was trying to call in over the weekend for verification of benefits whilst using her APEX COPAY card for the first time at an urgent care.  The facility finally figured it out and she paid her $50 dollars.  I asked if there was medication involved that I could help out with but she said that they already had called it in for her- she just hasn''t gone to pick it up.  I told her that we do not have weekend hours YET but that we did recently extend our week day hours to accommodate our west coast members. She thanked me for giving her a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 09:33:57', '2019-06-17 09:33:57'),
