  ('zcrm_1579374000036922003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830286', 'Maureen Gannon (Hanson)', NULL, 'Maureen called because she received a bill from the radiologist facility that read her mammogram results.  I told her to call the office and give them her ASI info, ask them to call ASI and speak with Leena.  She sounded a bit timid so I told her that I would send the "script".  She was so thrilled with that idea!  I told her if she needed further assistance to not hesitate to give us a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-17 08:41:31', '2019-06-17 08:41:31'),
