  ('zcrm_1579374000036863171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377059', 'Teri Mock', NULL, 'Teri called at 9 PM to speak with Patti about the association stating that Jane didn''t have time for her and promised to send her the info but never did.  She said that our schedule does not work for her!  I calmed her down, took her to the .org site, I told her I wasn''t in sales but I could go over basics- she already has been paying out of pocket for a concierge doctor so I told her about the DPC plan, and really  it sounds like the perfect fit, she was really happy that information.  She said that she will call Patti on mon or tues when she''s not busy for Patti to help her make the switch and go over numbers.  I emailed Patti and Jane. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 19:20:59', '2019-06-14 19:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036888029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, '6-14-19 Debra received a Compliant email but she hasn''t been paid in 2019. She will complete new mini HRA now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-14 16:33:55', '2019-06-14 16:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'called in for Wendy- transferred the line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 16:32:31', '2019-06-14 16:32:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036888024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085274', 'Richard Gulling', NULL, '6-14-19 Completed mini-HRA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-14 16:13:18', '2019-06-14 16:13:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'soooooo Julie called in to make sure that the mammogram facility that she was at is in network.  It took me a bit to find it but it was!  Grand River Hospital District General on 501 Airport RD in Rifle CO 81650 also she wanted me to find out if she was ok to have a bone density test. I found in the APEX documents that bone density is only covered for over 60.  I sent Julie the file.  I told her that if she would like us to find the best place/price facility that is something that Sedera can do but that they would need the CPT code on the script her doctor gave her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 15:56:46', '2019-06-14 17:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'called in about Wendy''s email that went out- she was confused stating that she had already completed the HRA- I told her not to worry than if she had just done it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 15:45:46', '2019-06-14 15:45:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740001', 'Margaret Johnson', NULL, 'Margaret called stating that the link to the HRA was blank.  I walked her through the entire email and helped her find the actual link that wasn''t blank. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 15:44:43', '2019-06-14 15:44:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036888013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, '6-14-19 Left her a vm to answer her questions about compliance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-14 15:30:45', '2019-06-14 15:30:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036888008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, '6-14-19 Called to answer her questions and left vm. She completed the HRA and Change of IUA all at once last week. She wants to make sure we have it. I emailed Patti and Jennie to confirm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-14 15:28:45', '2019-06-14 15:35:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called in looking for John, I told her that he might have gone home for the day because he wasn''t answering the phone.  She said that she had spoken with Sedera and now wants to have a "talk" with John. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 15:21:55', '2019-06-14 15:21:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, 'Ryan called in pretty grumpy sounding wanting to speak with Wendy regarding all of the emails that he has been getting.  He said that he wanted a phone call from her today due to the deadline.  I left a message on Wendy''s phone and emailed her as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 15:17:17', '2019-06-14 15:17:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'Andrea called in upset wondering why she received an email saying that she wasn''t compliant with her plan because she had filled out the form via the link 2 or 3 days ago.  I told her not to worry, that if she remembered filling out the form it probably just isn''t updated in the CRM.  I told her that I would try to reach out to Liz to confirm that they have been finished on our end.  I also reached out to Wendy about this as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 15:07:30', '2019-06-14 15:07:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Megan called in upset wondering why she received an email saying that she wasn''t compliant with her plan because she had filled out the form via the link right after she received our email at the end of last month.  I told her not to worry, that if she remembered filling out the form it probably just isn''t updated in the CRM.  I told her that I would try to reach out to Liz to confirm that they have been finished on our end.  I also reached out to Wendy about this as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-14 15:05:50', '2019-06-14 15:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036885008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, '6/14/19  JR  Called and emailed Kymberlee about the rate increase.  Did not reach her but left messages and sent the email.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-06-14 14:49:48', '2019-06-14 14:49:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036885003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779471', 'Molly Lease', NULL, '6/14/19 spoke with Molly - she sent in her form to increase her IUA', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-06-14 14:42:33', '2019-06-14 14:42:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036845081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-14 14:28:35', '2019-06-14 14:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036845076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'Pmt update in FTNI - renewal 2019', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-14 14:28:22', '2019-06-14 14:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036874018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '06.14.19:  Called. L/m explaining they could lower their new monthly share fee by changing their current IUA of $1000 to $1500 through clicking on the link in their email to complete the IUA change form and it must be done by Monday, June 17th.  Got a text from Kim asking me to text her.  Texted her same info.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-06-14 14:09:34', '2019-06-14 14:09:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036875018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, 'Andy called in to go over a few things with some emails that he has gotten and just some general education. He first off wanted to double check that his wife was added to his plan effective July 1st. I confirmed for him that she was. He also wanted to make sure that his IUA change was put through from $500 to his new IUA of $1500. I checked and it was put through by Patti on June 6th 2019. He then had some general educational questions about how his plan works when it comes to preventative and diagnostic. He stated he also got the email for per-authorization for big procedures. He was a little unclear on what that meant exactly. I told him that that was for big procedures as in colonoscopy''s, mammograms, ect.. I told him that what we are doing is advising the member to call in and let us know what type of preventative procedure they are having, for him it is a colonoscopy. Once we find a provider or the provider they were recommended to is in network, we then go ahead and give the provider/facility a call and get the general price range, to make sure they are in the price range that we(MPowering Benefits) will accept. The highest we will go is $2500. He totally and fully understood everything that I explained to me. I re sent the non complience email to him becasue he could not get to the link that was written as a URL in the hard copy that was mailed to him. The URL was not working. So what I did was re send the email version that has the link that he can click and will bring him right to the form. I also sent him and email that explains on how to submit his bills to Sedera to start a "Need" if need be, he wanted that just in case if his colonoscopy turns into something that is diagnostic. He was ok with that and understood why it might, if they "find" something. Happy member after all info provided and said I was a HUGE help and made him feel more comfortable with his plan and how his benefits work. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-14 14:01:21', '2019-06-14 14:01:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036874013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, '06.14.19:  Called Cathy- l/m explaining their option to change Karl''s IUA from $1000 to $1500 to lower his new monthly share fee. Mentioned they must do so by this coming Monday and to call me w/any questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-06-14 13:43:11', '2019-06-14 13:43:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870150', 'Andrew Barbo', NULL, 'spoke with Andrew and he has already completed the new Health Risk Assessment and submitted his IUA change form as well.', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2019-06-14 13:30:04', '2019-06-14 13:30:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, 'Spoke with Andy about non-compliance. He is aware, sees the email, and is going to fix this immediately.', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2019-06-14 13:26:50', '2019-06-14 13:26:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'VM left on phone regarding rate change and non-compliance', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2019-06-14 13:20:39', '2019-06-14 13:20:39'),
