  ('zcrm_1579374000036874008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '06.14.19:  Called Brooke. Reviewed her option to change their IUA to $1500 to lower their monthly share fee.  Said she''d consider it. Told her the deadline is this coming Monday to change. Said she still had the email and would use the link to the change form if they decided to change.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-06-14 13:16:15', '2019-06-14 13:16:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, 'VM left on phone regarding rate change', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2019-06-14 13:11:58', '2019-06-14 13:11:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010492001', 'Anabella Aguilar', NULL, 'Spoke with Anabella regarding the rate change and compliance issue. She would like for Wendy to give her quick call to address some questions as well as to be re-sent the non-compliance email so that she can complete.', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2019-06-14 13:02:08', '2019-06-14 13:02:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036875013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'Maureen called in and needed a little guidance on what to do if she needs to go to an urgent care for a bad cold she has. I let her know that that is injury/illness and she can go to any doctor or any urgent care, there is no network. I explained how that works with her IUA and submitting bills to Sedera. I also told her she should use Teledoc so she can skip the bill of going to and urgent care. She really liked the idea of that and could not member is she was registered or not. I sent her the registration email for Teladoc and an email for submitting her bills with Sedera. She said she remembered and knew how that worked but I sent it to her anyway so she can have a refresher because she said it has been almost 2 years and has yet to utilize anything. She also, since I was on the phone already, asked me to look up her GP is he was in network still. I looked up her provider and he is indeed in network. I also sent her an email on instructions on how to look providers up in her own spare time if she would like. She really liked that idea of being able to do it herself without having to call in and "bother" me. I let her know it is no trouble at all and that is what my job is :) she laughed and thanked me very much. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-14 13:00:18', '2019-06-14 13:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036863093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354156', 'Amy Moore', NULL, 'VM left on phone regarding rate change and non-compliance', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2019-06-14 12:53:07', '2019-06-14 12:53:07'),
