  ('zcrm_1579374000036875008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000272', 'Katelyn Doty', NULL, 'Katelyn needed help with the Health Risk Assessment in regards to the section where it asks for the Tax ID number. She was not sure if there is a special number from us she puts in or her companies tax ID number. I spoke with Patti and she said all Katelyn has to do is put her own SS number in. For the business name section to leave it blank if it is different than her name right above that box. She fully understood and is completing the assessment now to be in compliance with us. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-14 12:14:07', '2019-06-14 12:14:07'),
