  ('zcrm_1579374000036845041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to add newborn son.  I have updated pricing in FTNI and advised member of getting SS# to me upon issue.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-14 11:35:22', '2019-06-14 11:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036875003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243474', 'Alan Bardwell', NULL, 'Alan wanted to change his IUA and stated that with the letter he got in the mail, that the link for him to go to was not working when he entered it in his URL it did not work. I told him I was going to send him via email the same letter and in the letter under the rate change table is a link he can click and it will bring him straight to the form to fill out. Was happy I was able to do that within minutes and it wasn''t going to be a long process. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-14 11:22:27', '2019-06-14 11:22:27'),
