  ('zcrm_1579374000036863003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'Scheduled a one-time payment for July using the CC on file and set up all future payment after that coming out of the account. Changed the monthly share amount to reflect the IUA change from $1000 to $1500

