  ('zcrm_1579374000036833008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Spoke to client today and she stated that the MD office was coordinating the issue regarding extensive lab bills.  The MD office will get all the coding corrected and resubmit the bill with correct codes.   Waiting on corrective billing will take two weeks per client.  Waiting on response from client and corrected billing.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-13 17:46:53', '2019-06-13 17:46:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036833003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'Spoke to John McBride...he was never informed by MD performing procedure or facility that anything regarding hemmorrhoids or diverticulousis was corrected during preventative colonoscopy....these ICD10 codes are on the detailed HCFA form from the facility performing the procedure.  At this time I informed clients that we will need to forward any additional amounts to Sedera due to need..."according to the HCFA bill provided by the facility."  Monica Lugo at ASI informed me that they would have sent a letter to client stating "ineligible" amounts provided on the billing from the facility.  Client has stated that he has not received any correspondence from ASI regarding any "ineligible" billings....Need to follow up with ASI.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-13 17:44:19', '2019-06-13 17:44:19'),
