  ('zcrm_1579374000036789055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Update on the colonoscopy search results I have found for Sondra yesterday on 06/12/2019. I am still doing some digging and calling for some facilities on the list i have found to get general ideas of price ranges that are approved for not being too expensive. Will keep notes updated and Sondra. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-13 13:10:23', '2019-06-13 13:10:23'),
