  ('zcrm_1579374000036789050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025370020', 'Patricia Druckman', NULL, 'Called in and was confused on why her EOB was stating that some of the blood work testing was not being covered when it was her annual woman''s wellness visit and it was just "routine blood work". She told me that the facility was telling her they are going by the CDC guidelines and not the ACA guidelines. I transfered the call into Patti b/c i have never heard that before and wanted to give her the right answers. Patti spoke with her for a little bit and had Patricia email her the EOB and Patti gave it over to John to take a look.  John is working on the case as we speak. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-13 13:07:57', '2019-06-13 13:07:57'),
