  ('zcrm_1579374000036789045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'Terry gave me a call and asked who he needs to call or speak to, to refer his friend Jeff Abbott. I went to take down Jeff''s contact info and Terry did not know his phone number or email. He let me know that he will be meeting up with his friend Jeff shortly today and asked if I could just text him Ron''s info. Skipio was not working at that moment so I asked if I could just email him and he said email was fine. I just sent the email out with Ron''s name, number, and email address. i stated in the email the reason why I am specifically giving him Ron''s info. typically I am supposed to give Charles'' info since that is who is Terry''s sales rep. Patti told me that Charles and Ron have something going on with each other together so I can give it to Ron. Jeff will reach out to him at some point today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-13 13:01:37', '2019-06-13 13:01:37'),
