  ('zcrm_1579374000036767003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-13 08:03:29', '2019-06-13 08:07:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743151', 'Julie Rice', NULL, 'I had sent Julie an email on what is needed to open a claim with ASI as well as with Sedera.  She sent plain statements pretaining to a fall as well as something about bloodwork.  But majorly lacking information.  Not the type of billing that we need not the CPT codes.  She wrote back "you must be joking right?"  I responded to her (see emails) and told her that if she had more questions about the process she could speak with Guy Travis or Leena at ASI.  She does not want to lift any fingers. 
Guy and Leena were copied on the letter. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-12 19:03:34', '2019-06-12 19:03:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925046', 'Susan Korzon', NULL, 'Michelle Korzon is not on the plan but if she is calling in regards to Elton Susan Korzon wants us to speak with her.  BECAUSE Michelle is the new wife who is taking care of Elton- and Susan wants nothing to do with her (per therapists and police officers) BUT WE CAN talk to Michelle about Elton.  Also.....Susan never got the emails that were sent because she doesn''t have access to them.  I asked if she wanted to give me her email and she said no she doesn''t want an email.  so she gave me her husbands  secretaries email so I can forward these emails to that one- ginapinaire@gmail.com She also wants 3 cards due to estrangement with her family at the moment.  I told her that I would ask.  I explained quite a bit of the plan to her and she said I helped her make more sense to it.  I told her that she could call into us tomorrow and the next day if she has questions.  She appreciated that.  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-12 18:30:53', '2019-06-12 18:30:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, 'sent her quotes for her malaria meds. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-12 17:03:53', '2019-06-12 17:03:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called in upset that he was still receiving bills from his colonoscopy- he said that he wanted to write to John to say "John, you might just need to cough up that $4,000 buddy" he also said that Jane said that everything was taken care of.  I gave him John and Guy''s email.  I spoke with guy on the phone about this as well so that he can speak to John about it in the AM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-12 16:36:17', '2019-06-12 16:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'Michele called in 1 hour prior to her mammogram appointment to ask if the facility was in network.  I told her that I could not find it- I contacted ASI as well as transferred her to sit and wait to speak with someone at multiplan.  I did speak with Guy about this and he is stating that if this does turn out to be a huge bill the responsibility will be on this member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-12 16:34:22', '2019-06-12 16:34:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036743038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757110', 'Brandon Lowitz', NULL, '6-12-19 Brandon is enrolling now for Provider Directed with Redirect since he has expensive meds and upcoming colonoscopy and endoscopy, etc. Family of 4. $1500 / $801. NewChoiceHealth shows endoscopy will be $1550-$4000 in Boulder location. Told him to call and find out best cash price.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-12 15:36:00', '2019-06-12 17:00:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036743033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, '6-12-19 Completed enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-12 15:09:17', '2019-06-12 15:09:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743151', 'Julie Rice', NULL, 'Julie had sent Jennie a slew of misc billing- it was clear to me that most of them needed to be going to Sedera IF they go over her IUA.  She was treated for a fall. Also there is bloodwork that doesn''t look coded as preventative (I have reached out to Guy)  I sent Jule an email and instructions on how to open up a claim with ASI and or how to upload a medical need with Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-12 14:36:03', '2019-06-12 14:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036743028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, '6-12-19 Asked Patti to update her address with ASi and Sedera bc was sent new cards to old address. We already had her new address.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-12 14:13:39', '2019-06-12 14:13:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member''s address needs to be changed only with ASi as we have the correct address here.  Not sure how that happened as member did not submit address change.  I will notify ASi.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-12 14:12:04', '2019-06-12 14:13:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, 'Member submitted member change for a change of address I will update in RCI Portal &amp; Sedera. &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-12 13:56:00', '2019-06-12 13:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036729033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'Steven called in and was not sure on how to present himself or if his addiction therapy appointments are covered or not. I let him know that that type of appointments and therapy are not covered. So he needs to keep ALL of his bills that he has paid so far and he is only responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA. Anything after that is submitted to Sedera. He said he is very close to that threshold of his IUA so I gave him Sedera''s number and to call them ASAP to start his "Need" process.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 13:26:24', '2019-06-12 13:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036743021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530137', 'Sarah Pak', NULL, '6-12-19 Sarah gave Patti kids SS #''s just now and Stefano will complete Preferred Practitioner Agreement probably tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-12 12:20:12', '2019-06-12 12:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036733016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030962125', 'Brent Peterson', NULL, 'Received cancellation fro Sue @RCS Foods.  I will let Sedera know.  I have call into Shelly @ RCI to advise how to cancel as I don''t have portal for RCS Foods.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-12 12:16:18', '2019-06-12 12:16:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036729023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Sondra called in and wanted to check and make sure the facility she is going to tomorrow for her annual mammogram screening is in network. I looked up the facility she provided me and they are in network and the price is around $200 which is approved on our end of being reasonable.  She asked me look up some providers for a colonoscopy and I found 147 results and will be calling a few of them for pricing and email them over to Sondra. She was very happy to hear that her facility for mammography is in network along with her annual provider for general services(general practitioner). -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 12:03:34', '2019-06-12 12:03:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036729018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630064', 'Katherine Carroll', NULL, 'Katherine called in and asked what the process is for her being at her Osteopathy appointment because she left her card at home. I told her that when is comes to the type of appointment she is at that is considered an injury/illness so she is presenting herself as a cash pay patient and does not need any sort of card. I told her that her IUA is $5000 so she is paying out of pocket up until that amount. When she is close to her IUA to call Sedera and start her "Need". She understood everything and will start to keep her medical bills to give to Sedera. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 11:59:27', '2019-06-12 11:59:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036743013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757110', 'Brandon Lowitz', NULL, '6-12-19 Lyrica is a controlled substance. On Goodrx it''s $460 for 150 or 300 mg. Maybe get 300 mg since basically same price if possible/allowed. It''s a capsule so can''t be divided.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-12 11:50:07', '2019-06-12 12:00:01'),
