  ('zcrm_1579374000036733011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151266', 'Anne-Sophie Mavroleon', NULL, 'Canceled this member and refunded $50 for June.  Went on Medicare', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-12 09:52:49', '2019-06-12 09:52:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036729013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497108', 'Kathleen Walsh', NULL, 'Called to let me know she has an annual wellness visit today and just wanted to make sure she was presenting herself the right way and making sure she was showing the right information. I let her know she needs to show her ASI card and I double checked with her that the provider is in network. I also forewarned her that if anything "found" or any sort of symptoms come up that she may be billed for that portion because it would turn into diagnostic. She 100% understood that and was fine with it. Very happy for the quick and useful help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 09:48:19', '2019-06-12 09:48:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036729008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151266', 'Anne-Sophie Mavroleon', NULL, 'Anne-Sophie called in and said she cancelled with Liberty about a month ago and she doesn''t understand why she is still getting a $50 charge. I explained to her that the charge is from us here at MPowering and we are separate from Liberty. Liberty should have told her when cancelling with them she needs to also call us at the same time to cancel with us so the $50 charge will stop as well. She was not told this so I told her I will send her the cancellation form with us and we will refund the $50 charge from this month since she was not told and it is not fair on her end. She was very happy to hear that and greatly appreciated it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 09:45:55', '2019-06-12 09:48:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036730013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509132', 'Brandi Webber', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-12 09:38:21', '2019-06-12 09:38:21'),
