  ('zcrm_1579374000036733003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021782202', 'Michael Deifik', NULL, 'Belinda from Axis Solutions called in and let me know that this member (her employee) had left their employment and did not want to continue  with plan since he would have to pay full price.  I will send her out cancellation form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-12 09:33:13', '2019-06-12 09:33:13'),
