  ('zcrm_1579374000036729003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021782202', 'Michael Deifik', NULL, 'Axis Solutions called in to let us know that Michael no longer works for them anymore and they are the ones that pay for his membership here at MPowering Benefits. She needs to have him cancelled off his plan. Patti took the call and got her email to send the cancellation form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 09:07:57', '2019-06-12 09:07:57'),
