  ('zcrm_1579374000036713008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085037', 'Kaitlin Robinson', NULL, 'Spoke to member booked her 15 minute welcome call for Friday, June 14, 2019 at 1:00 p.m. eastern time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-12 08:44:56', '2019-06-12 08:44:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036719008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830286', 'Maureen Gannon (Hanson)', NULL, 'Maureen called in asking how it works when it comes to getting prescriptions with us. Patti was at the phone at the moment and explained that what we do here with prescriptions is have you(the member) fill out our prescription quote form that we sent out via email, and just send it back into us. The concierge(Me Kelly or other Kelly C) take a look at it and we research the best possible prices around in the members areas and send out the coupons attached in emails back to the member. She was thrilled with that info and how fast we can get it done. I sent her the form. She was also asking about the rate change and what is going on with that and what an IUA and what hers was. Patti explained in detail what the IUA is and what the rate changes will be. I sent out another email about the rate change to her and let her know there is a table that has all the numbers and changes on it. She was very happy with how simple it is she get all this info! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 08:36:57', '2019-06-12 08:36:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036719003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Called Ryan back and he stated that when he went to go to have his daughter get her surgery at 10AM this morning he said the provider was having a hard time figuring out the coverage plan. I explained to him that when it comes to a surgery or anything along those lines that is injury/illness and is not covered. I let him know that he is responsible for his IUA of $2500, anything after that he needs to be asked to be billed the rest and he submits those bills over to Sedera. I gave him Sedera''s phone number because this bill is going to defiantly go over his IUA. He is calling right now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-12 08:13:16', '2019-06-12 08:13:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036713003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, 'Sending out add''l QR Life code card today for spouse Susan Flores. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-12 07:56:35', '2019-06-12 07:56:35'),
