  ('zcrm_1579374000036639028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, 'Joanna Gillette’s claims is also being forwarded to RCI. It appears that she termed coverage prior to coming on with RCI, so in order to process her claims we’ll need all of her demographic information per Joe Lovelidge at RCI. Patti is working on JoAnna''s demographic info. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-11 11:52:43', '2019-06-11 11:52:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036639023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, 'As the last and final update on Katherine''s claim''s: One of Katherine Richardson’s claims are being sent to RCI for processing. The others had previously been paid by HMA per Joe Lovelidge from RCI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-11 11:50:52', '2019-06-11 11:50:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036639018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'As a last and final update regarding Austin''s claim with HMA, everything was paid out and complete on 04/09/2019 per Joe Lovelidge from RCI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-11 11:49:27', '2019-06-11 11:49:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036639013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, 'As a last and final update on David''s claim with RCI everything has been processed and paid out and complete. In the transition to RCI they were sent to HMA per Joe Lovelidge from RCI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-11 11:47:53', '2019-06-11 11:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036639008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'As a last and final update in regards to Steven''s RCI claim, payment has been sent out, processed and paid out. In the transition to RCI they were sent to HMA. per Joe Lovelidge from RCI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-11 11:43:02', '2019-06-11 11:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036639003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Steve gave me a call to look up some providers for dermatology facilities in his area. At first he asked me to look up a specific facility called Dermatology Consultants. It gave me 109 results and they were all provider names. What I did was name off a couple street names to see if he recognized any of them nearby. 2 street names he instantly said yes! The first one he said that one of his friends actually goes to that facility and both of the exact address''s he knew. I gave him 2 providers each with the names and phone numbers. He wrote everything down, I offered to make up an email for him to make it a little easier and he said what he had was perfectly fine. Him and his wife were both extremely so happy and said that I am always always helping them out and getting the perfect information for them. They both stated they have yet to have an issue with anything with this plan or with customer service. Happy happy members! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-11 11:41:35', '2019-06-11 11:41:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036626003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, '6-11-19 He''s going to read through info and start application. He''ll call or email if he has more questions or problems. He wasn''t quite ready to enroll since he hadn''t done his homework yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-11 11:04:03', '2019-06-11 11:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036600028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162144', 'Monica Berry', NULL, 'Spoke to member booked her 15 minute welcome call for Wednesday, June 12, 2019 at 9:30 a.m. pacific time/ 12:30 p.m. eastern time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-11 10:41:03', '2019-06-11 10:41:03'),
