  ('zcrm_1579374000036600018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'Address update sent to ASi &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-11 10:32:25', '2019-06-11 10:32:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036619003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Extraordinary rude.  Started with Patty. has $1200 in expenses she wants to be reimbursed for. Went to Chiropractor / Nutritionist.  Dr. Dulin, is not in network.  He ordered a slew of tests to set her up with a nutritional program.  Lab order has 6 ICD 10 codes, none of which are preventative. (hyperlipodemia, hypothyroidism, inflammatory liver disease, anemia, D deficiency and "abnormal finding in blood chemistry.)
none of these expenses are for either preventative services or a medical need.  When asked if this visit was related to her acid reflux (in previous notes) she said "not really".  when I told her that none of these services are preventative and would not be covered, she hung up on me.  I called her back and she said I could have had all of this covered by BC/BS for the same money.  I said ''it sounds like you should go back to BC, this plan isn''t for you.  she then accused me of being rude and nasty so I hung up...... not a good call.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-11 10:16:58', '2019-06-11 10:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036618003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862222', 'Christopher Morano', NULL, 'Chris asked to terminate his membership and was also asking about a check that he said he was supposed to receive in regards to a claim he filed. I told him I would be sending him a cancellation email with a form to fill out and submit and I let him know when is comes to claims that would be Sedera and gave him their phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-11 10:15:24', '2019-06-11 10:15:24'),
