  ('zcrm_1579374000036548031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, 'Monday June 10th
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 4:42 PM

I am traveling overseas and need some vaccinations. I assume I just pay for these through my health savings account? Is there anything else I should know? I looked up passport Health, and it looks like I''ll need to be spending a total of about $500 for everything ($85 admin, $148 for typhoid, $279 for yellow fever). Pricey!
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 4:49 PM

I also need some support finding a good place to get malaria pills.
You Mon Jun 10 6:29 PM

Gretchen, do you have a doctor already for your preventative care?  also, fill out this form for your malaria pills- https://www.cognitoforms.com/MPoweringBenefits1/PrescriptionQuoteRequest  
Logo mark
Skipio™ Mon Jun 10 6:32 PM

Gretchen Wegner clicked your link: https://www.cognitoforms.com/MPoweringBenefits1/PrescriptionQuoteRequest
Monday June 10th
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 6:32 PM

I have a doctor, but they don''t provide the two vaccinations that I need. I''m considering not getting them at all, but I''d like to collect a complete set of information before I make that choice.
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 6:32 PM

Filling out that malaria farm right now.
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 6:33 PM

The malaria form asks me for the specific medication I want. I don''t know that, so I should do some research?
You Mon Jun 10 6:34 PM

Yes, I cannot give you a quote without that info. Sorry.  As far as your vaccines go- you can go to your doctor and ask that the vaccines are coded as preventative.  
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 6:36 PM

The two vaccines that I need, though, are not actually administered by my primary care doctor. You can only get yellow fever and very specific places. I think I can get the typhoid at wall greens. But I will not be able to get either of those at my preventative care place.
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 6:36 PM

I will reach out to my doctor to see what kind of malaria medication they recommend.
You Mon Jun 10 6:46 PM

Gotcha, we would love to help you with your Malaria pills however!  Just let us know what the doctors office says!  
Gretchen Wegner Mon Jun 10 6:57 PM

Ok! Will do.


  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-10 17:23:38', '2019-06-10 17:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036548026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'Karyn called in scared to death that she would have to pay out of pocket for a mammogram she had on the 14 of May.  She legitimately knew nothing about a network- I calmed her fears and explained everything about preventative care from scratch.  I sent all of the corresponding emails as well (she was so excited to learn) she thanked me for all of my time and teaching because she was completely in the dark with it all. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-10 16:25:33', '2019-06-10 16:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521534', 'Steven Russell', NULL, 'Spoke to Mr. Russell about his MD office visit and Colonoscopy procedure location being out of network.  Informed him that we can not authorize any out of network procedures and that he must see an approved MD and location that is in the network.  Client was not too happy, but he understood the situation.  Client will email his location and request Gastro MD and location that is in the network....waiting on his request.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-10 15:56:23', '2019-06-10 15:56:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036500131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '6-10-19 Enrolling right now for Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-10 15:54:53', '2019-06-10 15:54:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036548021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014765004', 'Samuel Berryman', NULL, 'Misty reached out to cancel Liberty RX- I tagged Patti in the email to let her know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-10 15:37:59', '2019-06-10 15:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036548016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521534', 'Steven Russell', NULL, 'Called in to ask Guy about info on his upcoming colonoscopy- I transferred the call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-10 15:36:46', '2019-06-10 15:36:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036548008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'there is a battle between ASI, Lab Corp, and Andrews Doctors office regarding coding.  Salena and team are doing the best that they can trying to fix this for Andrew, but he doesn''t seem to understand that and is getting rather impatient.  I am going to reach out to Guy about this one to see if he comes up with any solutions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-10 15:07:54', '2019-06-10 15:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036548003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311105', 'Michael Nedrow', NULL, 'Michael called in because he has been having severe back pain and the chiropractor isn''t helping.  He said that the ib profen he has been taking isn''t taking the edge off and he wants to go to someone that can get him help for the pain.  I told him that he has redirect and that I would be happy to transfer the call- he found the number on his card and declined the transfer stating that he would call himself. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-10 15:02:15', '2019-06-10 15:02:15'),
