  ('zcrm_1579374000036493010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871102', 'Julie Weck', NULL, 'Julie called in and had no idea on what anything with her plan was or how to use anything. She did not have any type of cards, more importantly her ASI card because she has an appointment for her annual well woman''s visit. She was totally confused and thought what she needs was her MultiPlan ID number. I explained to her what MultiPlan really was and that when she is calling to confirm with her provider that she needs to verify with them that they are under the PHCS network. I explained to her that when she is going in for a preventative care visit she needs to present her ASI card. I let her know that I put a request in with ASI to have a PDF copy emailed to her and hard copies mailed to her address. She was happy to hear that I was able to have that happy as easy as it was. I saw on her profile and asked if she had a welcome call and she did not. I told her that that is something that is very important and will makes this a lot more clear. I emailed her the welcome call schedular email and a BUNCH of general education emails on her plan, how to present, how to submit bills with Sedera and what that means in general, I also sent her the 64+ preventative care list so she knows what is covered by the ACA and what is not. She still seemed very very confused and a little upset with how confusing all of this is with all the different names and 3rd party admins she has to go through. I re assured that after her welcome call things will all fall into place and to be sure to read every email I will be sending her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-10 08:21:30', '2019-06-10 08:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036532008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508164', 'Kerri Wade', NULL, 'Member called back with updated address. Made the change. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-10 08:06:46', '2019-06-10 08:06:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036522013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530062', 'Debra Alier', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-10 07:44:21', '2019-06-10 07:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036532003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480226', 'Konstantinos Stamatiou', NULL, 'No response for his 15 minute welcome call left message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-10 07:40:57', '2019-06-10 07:40:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036522008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516085', 'Harold Workman', NULL, 'Harlod called in inquiring about the prescription medication benefits that he has- I told him that he did get a mail order service along with his co-pay plan, also I went over what we do at MPowering Benefits- now with Cypress Pharmacy, as well as our help for members with Reid.  I searched one of the 3 maintenance meds the generic valtrex and found it for 19 dollars which was $50 less than what he has been paying at CVS.  He was thrilled! I asked him to fill out a prescription quote form that I sent to fill in the rest of the meds and that I would be comparing all of the plans and finding the best one for him. He was very excited. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-07 15:39:47', '2019-06-07 15:39:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036522003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in for help with more prescription meds- I searched for the best fit for her price/location wise.  Elizabeth is thrilled that there are extended hours. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-07 15:35:38', '2019-06-07 15:35:38'),
