  ('zcrm_1579374000036519003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '6-7-19 Healthy, 51 husband and 52 Suzy. Suzy has thyroid issue for years but just takes meds and gets checked every 3 - 12 months. Also takes generic version of Adderall. Was laid off in April and has supplemental ins for now. Like the PDHC with ReDirect to allow her to go to dr. as much as needs for thyroid even though sometimes only goes 1x per year. Told her PDHC is easier utilization and less surprised.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-07 14:06:41', '2019-06-07 14:06:41'),
