  ('zcrm_1579374000036461023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605292', 'Annika Gagne', NULL, 'Another attempted welcome call.  Annika wasn''t in, left message, sent 2nd attempt e-mail.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-06-06 16:46:24', '2019-06-06 16:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036461018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963048', 'Drostan Baker', NULL, '6-6-19 Showed him the 2 DPC sites to read through. Explained value of MPB. He''s happy to have support since he''s not sure how he will be able to provide that and run his practice. He''s going to do a little more reading. We have his enrollment appt set for June 18th at 3:00 MST / 2:00 PST. He''ll be opening his practice Sept. 4th, 2019! He wants his family signed up for Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-06 16:15:26', '2019-06-06 16:15:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036431046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004971047', 'Jeff Myers', NULL, 'I spoke with Pam and she thanked me for all of my help.  Here is the site- 
https://www.courtneyhuntmd.com/about-us - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-06 14:53:27', '2019-06-06 14:53:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036431041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004971047', 'Jeff Myers', NULL, 'I found that Desert Jewel Wellness and Dr Courtney are one in the same. I left a message on Pam''s phone and sent an email with a link to the site. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-06 14:50:17', '2019-06-06 14:50:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036431036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004971047', 'Jeff Myers', NULL, 'Pamela called in wanting to make sure that her doctor and facility were in network.  I found the doctor- Courtney Hunt M.D. but not Desert Jewel Wellness center- I sent her all of Courtney''s info and 2 addresses that are showing in network.  I told Pam that I would do some more digging on the facility and let her know.  I sent her a script which she was excited about as well as the 5 steps to avoid surprise bills link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-06 14:38:33', '2019-06-06 14:38:33'),
