  ('zcrm_1579374000036435018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Spoke to Dania at Sedera.  The Petty''s have been in touch and a need has been opened.  Needs coordinator is Marquis. Told her that a Social Worker has said that David needs to be moved to a rehab facility. Member Needs to call Sedera to coordinate care (transport, new facility, treatment protocol etc.)
Related info to Guy.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-06 12:17:08', '2019-06-06 12:19:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036435013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640011', 'Rich Piotrowski', NULL, 'Followed up with Ellen.  Very pleased with Sedera and the 2nd MD process.  Had a lumpectomy, think she is going for a mastectomy.  Sounded terrible but happy with Sedera so far.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-06 12:11:45', '2019-06-06 12:11:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036435008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220137', 'Deoni Levy', NULL, 'Deoni called in.  Has had a back issue that has left her basically bed ridden.  Went through PT and Cortisone injections with no relief. Doctor is recommending surgery.  Explaained the 2nd MD process and sent instructions to open a need.  Told her to call Sedera immediately to get them involved.  Explained that providers might require payment up front.  Sedera might be able to persuade the provider to bill the member.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-06 12:10:11', '2019-06-06 12:10:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036433047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001060051', 'Matthew Ross', NULL, 'Compliance email was initially sent out with the wrong premium amount ($249 instead of $294). Re-sent the email to the member with correct info', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-06-06 11:51:52', '2019-06-06 11:51:52'),
