  ('zcrm_1579374000036445003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Client Tammie Petty texted me about a social worker to speak to about her husband''s possible discharge....Spoke to Social Worker Betthany - ph#:303-912-1683.  She was inquiring about benefits related to David Petty''s need for an inpatient rehab visit and possibly outpatient dialysis post discharge from inpatient rehab hospital.  Informed SW that this would now be part of Sedera cost sharing community...further informed SW that I needed to speak with Tammie Petty re: her conversations with Sedera and if she had contacted Sedera, Tammie Petty may a contact name at Sedera....waiting on speaking with Tammie Petty re Sedera contact.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-06 09:39:26', '2019-06-06 09:39:26'),
