  ('zcrm_1579374000036406008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $500 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-06 07:17:33', '2019-06-06 07:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036406003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630521', 'Stephanie Paula', NULL, 'Member submitted a cancellation request.  I will cancel &amp; refund 1 month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-06 06:54:29', '2019-06-06 06:54:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036384036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610002', 'Deborah Vaughan', NULL, '6-5-19 Adjusted rate to include MEC and now added correctly. Was showing $655 and should have been $659 if no MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-05 16:44:42', '2019-06-05 16:44:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806131', 'Elaine Bryan', NULL, 'called in to state that she was shocked and horrified by the fact that she had called and left a message 6 months ago asking to cancel, and just noticed a $50 payment come out.  She wants it reversed.  I sent a group email to Patti, Sunny and Jennie. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-05 16:40:09', '2019-06-05 16:40:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361787', 'Cammy Dwyer-Abbey', NULL, 'Cammy called in wondering if we didn''t get confirmation that she had completed the HRA in this past week because she received the same information in letter form in her mail today.  I have reached out to both Liz and John on the matter. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-05 16:37:00', '2019-06-05 16:37:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008639011', 'Ken Parsons', NULL, 'Fran called in with many questions- we went over the IUA change- I reached out to Patti about that question, preventative care, directlabs.com.... I sent her many emails as well.  I ordred a PDF replacement copy of their card and 2 hard copies to be sent to their house. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-05 16:13:54', '2019-06-05 16:13:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257159', 'Michele Schwadron', NULL, 'called in wondering how to fill out the section of her HRA that goes over 1099 info.  I told her that I would reach out to Patti Baron and try to get the answer tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-05 16:11:00', '2019-06-05 16:11:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036386008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Spoke to the client Melinda, requested all contact information she has from Midtown Diagnostic Center.  Informed client that once this information is received....I will reach out to Monica at ASI and Midtown Diagnostic Center to ensure that the Colonoscopy diagnostic test is scheduled.   Waiting on information from client Melinda Grabau to proceed to next steps.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-05 15:28:13', '2019-06-05 15:28:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036384031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243389', 'Edward Seymour', NULL, '6-5-19 Ed had cyst bigger than golf ball attached to main facial nerve. They thought is was small before they got in there to find out how significant it was. Got 2nd MD opinion to move forward with surgery. He thinks somehow 2nd MD is to blame for Sedera deciding this was pre-x. He''s waiting for his Dr.''s letter to prove it''s not pre-x. Calling dr. now and will pass it along to me. Worked with Eddisha the entire time. He passed the bills to her and she took it from there. He never uploaded the bills himself. He now owes $6K that he getting harassed for from hospital for that Sedera says is pre-x. He cancelled bc of this. He had numbness in hands that triggered imaging to be done. Imaging said they saw something 10 years ago, unbeknownst to him. Nothing was said or done. Also there was no mention of the fact that Sedera would consider this pre-x before he got the surgery done. If so, he would have waited a year or so. But, he really only needed to wait until June to pass pre-x 1st year clause. The cost of surgery went from $7500 down to $1200 as self-pay. Anesthesiologist didn''t discount rate at all. That was $3600. He was told Sedera would not negotiate any of the bills bc it''s pre-x. Told him they will always negotiate whether or not pre-x. Surgery was on 2/18/19.  Now he''s concerned because he still has numbness in hands and such. Thinks it''s a neck or back pressed nerve issue. Was really hopeful this would work but not after this experience. I''m waiting for dr letter that he will email me to then speak to Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-05 15:20:25', '2019-06-05 15:20:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'She called in confused and frustrated- I transferred the line to Guy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-05 15:06:28', '2019-06-05 15:06:28'),
