  ('zcrm_1579374000036384026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294009', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, '6-5-19 She''s paying ONLY $200 a month for insurance through her husbands employer. Wanted to see if there''s something better and cheaper. With Kaiser and $1300 ded and $2600 mop. Husband will have that ins for at least another year. She is 58, rarely sick. Teacher for over 30 years in Boulder Valley and now also care taking aging parents. Told her to stay put with husband''s ins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-05 13:52:02', '2019-06-05 13:52:02'),
