  ('zcrm_1579374000036379057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497031', 'David Harap', NULL, 'David called in in regards to check if a specific doctor is in network with us to get a colonoscopy be done. The doctor Crystal Bowden-McKay is indeed in network with us. I let David know that before the appointment can be scheduled I need to call ahead of time to get a general idea of pricing due to the new pre-authorization process that MPowering is now doing. I got transferd over to the Endoscopy dept. and no one picked up and it went to voicemail. I left a detailed message on why I was calling and who I was with MPowering Benefits and that I needed to call to get a price check and to call me back when they have the chance. I will keep notes updated once I hear something back, I am going to call David back to let him know I left a message and will keep in touch when I get an answer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-05 13:29:02', '2019-06-05 13:29:02'),
