  ('zcrm_1579374000036384021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, '6-5-19 Dave had a stroke 6 years ago but he''s been cleared since. He was cleared just a few months after the stroke. It''s been 6 years as of May, 2019. He has very slightly high blood pressure and takes 5mg of med for that. Healthy otherwise. Mtn bikes, surfs, 6''2" and 205-210 lbs. Stroke may be more genetic than lifestyle. They don''t know what caused it. Wife is going through menopause and son had appendix out a few years ago. Otherwise, good. Paying $1477 month now with $6300 ded with UHC group plan for his family and 1 employee. Employee cost is $415 and she pays 25% of the $415. He may give her an increase in salary so she can buy her own plan with APTC showing about $182 with new income at $43680 if he does that. Sent him Bright Health Silver plan options for her. She has pre-x and she dealing with.  Her DOB is 5/24/19 and is 45. Currently paying her $19 hr but will increase it to pay for ins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-05 12:58:10', '2019-06-05 12:58:10'),
