Hey, I had a member Therese Antonino looking for a new representative in her Arizona area, she''s unhappy with her current representative. Could someone reach out to her? Her phone is 602-770-7222 or by email (she may be out of town for a few days) terri@markandterri.com Thank you!', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-05 12:30:40', '2019-06-05 12:30:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036379049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291686', 'Craig Frithsen', NULL, 'Craig called in and stated that he was trying to fill out the health risk assessment and he could not find the assessment on our website. I stated to him that there should have been an email(because he was talking about the hard copy he received in the mail) and in the email there is a link right in the first couple sentences, he can click on the and it will take him directly to the assessment to start filling out. He said he opened it and everything was there and working. Happy that I could help him find it. I told him once he fills that out and sends it back to us he will be in compliance and satisfied on our end of compliance. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-05 12:29:14', '2019-06-05 12:29:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036379041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda called in still pretty frustrated and really confused with what is going on with getting her colonoscopy scheduled with the Midtown Surgery Center. It has been a back and forth battle with the center trying to get a 100% clear answer on being in network. John has been working on this case diligently and he did receive an answer from Monica over at ASI that yes, Midtown has a contract with PHCS. Whoever it may be over at Midtown has been telling Melinda that yes they do have a contract with PHCS but not with ASI and that is why they wont cover the procedure. What Midtown does not seem to understand is that what matters is the contract with PHCS, not ASI. John asked while I was on the phone to transfer Melinda over to him to straighten this out. I asked and she said she is at her hair appointment and will call back right when she is done. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-05 12:11:10', '2019-06-05 12:11:50'),
