  ('zcrm_1579374000036384013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233260', 'Brandy Echery', NULL, '6-5-19 Patti confirmed it''s been at $1000 and she doesn''t need to do anything to keep it at $1000. All set.  Also been dealing with pain in leg likely just muscular that she''s been treating with PT. She''s close to reaching $1000 IUA and wants to know the process when reaches $1000. Told her to upload all proof and bills into her portal to start the need. Told her process if wants alternative treatment like acupuncture, etc. She understands process and is happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-05 10:51:38', '2019-06-05 10:56:27'),
