  ('zcrm_1579374000036379028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497204', 'Charles Strother', NULL, 'Charles called in because his wife just finished up with her 2nd MD appointment last night and they have gotten all the notes from the doctor and she is going to have a surgery scheduled out. He was asking how to submit the notes from the doctor and I let him know that those are supposed to go over to Sedera because they are the ones that deal with "Needs". I gave him Sedera''s phone number and sent an email on how to submit a "Need" with Sedera. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-05 10:41:31', '2019-06-05 10:41:31'),
