  ('zcrm_1579374000036379018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630521', 'Stephanie Paula', NULL, 'Called in and stated that she cancelled with Liberty a month ago and was wondering why she just had a $50 charge come out of her account. I explained to her that when she is cancelling with Liberty she also has to call into us to let us know she wants to cancel with us. No body over at Liberty explained that to her. I told her that I am sending her a cancellation email for us and we will refund the $50 for her asap. She was very happy to hear that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-05 10:18:19', '2019-06-05 10:18:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036379013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034859046', 'Bryan Potter', NULL, 'Bryan called in to let me know that his phone that was put down for his welcome call this morning at 9:30am went out last night and is currently still non functioning. He wanted to know if someone could do a welcome call with right then with his friends phone he was using to call in to me with. I checked and Vanessa was currently on a welcome call. He said that is fine and to reschedule for sometime next week. I sent an email to him to re schedule. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-05 10:17:20', '2019-06-05 10:17:20'),
