  ('zcrm_1579374000036378018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111350', 'Jason Calito', NULL, 'Received phone call from Tara Frix that this member left their employment on 5/17.  I will cancel w/ Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-05 09:42:49', '2019-06-05 09:42:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036328023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025959066', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'Gretchen called in regarding a screening mammography.  Sonnenlap Breast health is the facility her doctor directed her to.  Sonnelap is part of diversified radiology which is owned by Vail Health.  I called Vail Health and they are contracted with MultiPlan/PHCS.  Called Gretchen and told her how she needs to present the card.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-05 09:42:33', '2021-07-30 14:15:22'),
