  ('zcrm_1579374000036378013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402045', 'Aida Bukovica', NULL, 'Member called in from the providers office.  She had presented them the HMA card and was told she was canceled.  Member clearly did not read email or look at new cards that were sent to her.  Told me she was "very busy" and could not make another appointment.  I sent her temp ID card and ordered new cards sent to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-05 08:11:56', '2019-06-05 08:11:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036378008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377058', 'Parker Thompson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-05 07:48:58', '2019-06-05 07:48:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036379003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402045', 'Aida Bukovica', NULL, 'Aida called in to ask about what her plan entails. She stated she has yet to use anything with her benefits. I went over the preventative care steps and what she has to do when she is making an appointment and how to present herself. I let her know that the appt. has to be STRICTLY Preventative, as in a Annuall Wellness Visit, Woman''s Wellness visit, mammogram screening, colonoscopy screening, ect.. She understands what all of that entail''s now. I let her know what her IUA is and what it is for and how it is used. I told her that she should never pay more than her IUA and needs to be asked to be billed the rest if she is having a procedure done that is more than that and to contact Sedera before hand if she has a general idea she will be over the IUA. I explained who Sedera is and what they do when it comes to submitting a "Need". Aida also fully understood that info. She asked me to do a provider search for a Mammogram, Gynecologist, and for a Gastroenterologist. I emailed her all 3 lists, as well as how to submit bill''s to Sedera, the 64+ preventative care list, how to sign up for Telodoc, and an email on 5 steps to avoid surprise bills. Aida was very thankful that I took the time to explain all this to her and she feels more comfortable now with her plan. She looks forward to being able to use her plan and be more Preventative! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-05 07:08:20', '2019-06-05 07:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036378003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004672035', 'David Spenard', NULL, 'Member called in confused as to why he was charged $50.  Cancelled Liberty and not us.  I refunded 1 month and will cancel going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-05 06:48:06', '2019-06-05 06:48:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036368003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605292', 'Annika Gagne', NULL, 'Called and left a VM. Sent reschedule email for welcome call', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-04 18:05:22', '2019-06-04 18:05:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377058', 'Parker Thompson', NULL, '6-4-19 Referred by Jason Garvin who mentioned LHS. Told Parker it''s no longer the best option. Parker takes 4 meds for anxiety. Generic of Abilify $18, $30, $20, $3 approx for each through GoodRX. He also has ADD. Wife is 27 and healthy but also has anxiety. They just had their first kid, 1 month old. They might get CHP for baby. Told them they can add child by 20th of the month for next month''s start date if baby isn''t covered by CHP+.
Healthy, no tobacco. Enrolled now for the $1000 / $521.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-04 16:59:09', '2019-06-04 17:19:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036364023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377059', 'Teri Mock', NULL, 'from the email I just sent to Jane-
Good evening Jane! 

I just got off of the phone with Teri Mock and she was FLAMING MAD about the letter that was sent out going over her either re doing the HRA to stay on her group plan or going over to the association.  She wanted to know what the association was exactly and I asked if she had spoken to you and asked that.  She said she hadn''t.  I told her that the best thing to do would be to speak with you because you can go into the differences of the two plans in great detail.  We went through the letter and I explained what I could and she seemed to have calmed down.  She wanted your number so I used the one off of her CRM -I am sorry if that is your cell! 

KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-04 16:48:50', '2019-06-04 16:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, '6-4-19 Spoke with Linda Brown and she will still complete the IUA change form to put her info into the system. They will show proof of DPC membership as well for July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-04 16:27:37', '2019-06-04 16:27:37'),
