  ('zcrm_1579374000036364018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, 'Sorel called to speak with Korrin at ASI- I transferred the call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-04 15:42:19', '2019-06-04 15:42:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036364013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda called in perterbed that Midtown SX center wouldn''t listen to her and are discounting the email that John had sent to her just yesterday.  I called ASI and left a message on Monica''s email to give Melinda a call ASAP.  I told her that I would let John know all of this.  I couldn''t say that it would be resolved by Monica tonight- but that John would definitely work on it in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-04 15:34:28', '2019-06-04 15:34:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036364008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605169', 'Rahul Vadera', NULL, 'Rahul called in because Teladoc told him that he couldn''t register because he wasn''t in the system yet. - I transferred the line to Natalie at Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-04 14:53:08', '2019-06-04 14:53:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036359018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377153', 'William Moomaw', NULL, '6-4-19 Choosing Provider Directed with Redirect. Just finished application now. Set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-04 14:28:39', '2019-06-04 14:28:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036364003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, 'Kim called in, in regards to the per-authorization letter she received for certain procedures. All she wanted to do was schedule an appointment to have an annual woman''s wellness visit. I explained that we are only having members call in for that for major procedures as in, colonoscopy''s and or mammograms. She gave me a few provider names she was recommended to and I was able to fins 3 of them for her. I sent the 3 lists. She was so so so ecstatic with the help that I was able to give her and all the explanations. She fully 100% understood everything that I explained to her and was just so thrilled with how easy everything was. she said she will most defiantly be referring some friends and family to us..', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-04 14:23:10', '2019-06-04 14:23:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036323201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521158', 'Jennifer Hansen', NULL, 'Member called in to the Concierge because she had a question about her IUA.  She tought it was $500 Sedera had $1000.  Turns out she put both amount on respective applications.  I called and left VM for her and let her know that she would have to submit IUA change form and make the universal change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-04 14:17:28', '2019-06-04 14:17:28'),
