  ('zcrm_1579374000036359008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Spoke with Ian and clarified how medications work for curative vs maintenance. He feels better now since he doesn''t have any meds but if he would it would be for accident or major injury like broken bone or torn acl. He also wasn''t able to set up Teledoc bc Sedera''s info hadn''t been transferred to Teladoc yet. Told him to wait a week or try on Friday. He will. He was also nervous about high cost scenario of hospital needs down payment for major surgery. I told him how that process works. He gets it now. We did talk about 2nd MD and deposit situations in past. But, he''s just very nervous and skeptical.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-04 12:55:54', '2019-06-04 12:55:54'),
