  ('zcrm_1579374000036359003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001171017', 'Thomas Williams', NULL, '6-4-19 Spoke with Tom about Daniel and Christopher Oehrle and they are going to cancel bc they can''t afford it. They aren''t making any money now. I told him to put them on Medicaid which he''s not excited about them living off gov. But, it''s really their only option. He was pissed about the rate change but he''s keeping his membership. Angry at Obama for the open enrollment time frame and that they can only get subsidy for Jan. 1st 2020 since no life change event.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-04 12:39:08', '2019-06-04 12:39:08'),
