  ('zcrm_1579374000036328003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026950477', 'Bonnie Blair', NULL, 'Received a bill from Geisinger Wyoming in the mail.  CPT codes indicate x-rays of the knees.  Bill is in her member support file.  I have a call in to Bonnie to explain it isn''t for preventative.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-04 09:19:55', '2019-06-04 09:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036323003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Spoke to Member it is her intention to possibly switch over to a DPC upon renewal in July.  I will email her special rates reflecting DPC &amp; Academy pricing + rate increase.  For reference rates are below in email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-04 09:12:06', '2019-06-04 09:12:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036291003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, 'Email sent to Sedera &amp; ASi to add spouse eff 7/1.  I advised member that they also needed to submit IUA change form to update their IUA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-04 08:08:39', '2019-06-04 08:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036274003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044007', 'Anne Winther', NULL, 'emailed this member about her question re: pausing her membership.  Email below.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-04 07:33:00', '2019-06-04 07:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036267003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553345', 'Megan Eldridge', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  I will cancel in Subscriptions', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-04 06:22:19', '2019-06-04 06:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, 'I sent many many prescription scripts to Duane and Deanna- I am also waiting on Reid to get back to me to see if he can source the medicated cream for less. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 19:47:51', '2019-06-03 19:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Ian first called in having issues registering for Teladoc- I tried to transfer him but was unable.  We tried over the phone and I just couldn''t understand what he was looking at- I told him that Teladoc is a third party and I am unable to see in real time what he may be looking at.  I sent the step by step instructions as well and he told me that he would just call on his own. BUT he wanted to vent on how shocked and dismayed he was about Sedera''s stance on medication- and how he is used to his BLUE cross plan just paying for everything.  I gave him my own story and others on the savings that we find for our members....and he said. Yeah...but you still have to pay don''t you?  I told him yes, but also not paying an arm and a leg for traditional health insurance.  He brought up how he thought Wendy had told him all there was to know (I agreed) but then stated that this was something that needed to be addressed.  also see Liz''s notes below. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 19:13:08', '2019-06-03 19:13:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044007', 'Anne Winther', NULL, 'Anne called in to state that she will be out of the country for a few months and wanted to know if we could "pause" her membership while she was away- I told her that Sedera does pick up the bill if she falls ill or is injured as long as the medical bill is in english, but she said that she doesn''t need that because she has insurance where she is going.  I told her that Patti would get back to her tomorrow on this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 18:03:41', '2019-06-03 18:03:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009453001', 'Jeff Kanter', NULL, 'Nancy called in to be transferred to Teladoc. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 18:01:07', '2019-06-03 18:01:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553345', 'Megan Eldridge', NULL, 'called to cancel.  sent link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 17:38:06', '2019-06-03 17:38:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361908', 'Paula Ward', NULL, 'Paula called in flusttered over the HRA email that went out.  I just was patient and walked her through it. She thanked me for my help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 17:27:26', '2019-06-03 17:27:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243389', 'Edward Seymour', NULL, 'called to cancel due to starting separate coverage last month.  I sent cancellation link and tagged Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 17:11:25', '2019-06-03 17:11:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Leena could not verify that this imaging center is in network, but sent a whole list of imaging centers in her area that are AND I nominated the facility on Michele''s behalf.  Tracking number is 060319YR5- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 16:32:31', '2019-06-03 16:32:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036233026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152191', 'Gulrukh Rizvi', NULL, '6-3-19 Spoke with Dania just now and they will allow them to enroll in the DPC membership with both parents on the DPC now. Kids aren''t allowed on that DPC membership. But, they will join a new DPC that is opening up in Sept. Wife is a DPC herself, Dr. Rizvi. They are on LHS now but have heard so many great things about Sedera that they want to switch.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-03 16:11:42', '2019-06-03 16:11:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David called to speak with John to let him know that a check from ASI had finally got to him in the mail today and to let John know not to worry about it anymore. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 15:32:20', '2019-06-03 15:32:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Linda called because she lost the plan rate change and IUA email.  I helped her find it, she also is planning on using a DPC - I found the email template that Patti uses- sent it and copied Patti so she could follow up with the Browns. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 15:28:02', '2019-06-03 16:11:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006496003', 'Charles Grosel', NULL, 'Wendy called in needing help with finding a doctor that is in network for a prescription refill.  She said that she spoke with Liberty and they told her to call us.  I tried to find the doctors name off of the Liberty site but could find nothing. I told her to call Liberty again and if they wouldn''t help her ask for a manager- I also told her that I could help out with the price of medication refills. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 15:26:23', '2019-06-03 15:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Received the lab request order from Marsha Huber today.  The physician''s office did note preventative ICD 10 codes, but not preventative CPT codes.  According to client, the MD office will call the lab billing office to change the lab procedure codes to preventative and agreed with the client that the lab bill was exorbitant.  Client informed me she will send the corrected lab bill when she receives it from lab billing office.  I will then analyze the bill for final disposition of possible reimbursement or client may need to pay full amount.  Waiting on further documentation to rectify this preventative lab billing issue.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-06-03 14:44:41', '2019-06-03 14:44:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'I called the Rose Hospital Outpatient Imaging facility that Michele is interested in having her mammogram done at.  I spoke with a Levi and he said that the facility accepts many off the PHCS groups but that patients are required to reach out to their TPA to make sure that they are in network.  I tagged Michele in an email to Leena asking that Leena somehow fill in the gap to figure out if they are or are not in our network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-03 14:28:52', '2019-06-03 14:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036233021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '6-3-19 Patti will move MEC to ASi since no longer has DPC membership. She''s fine with $728 / $1000 IUA for 7/1/19. She will have the  MPB Group EF.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-03 14:10:33', '2019-06-03 14:10:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Fam $1500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 14:00:46', '2019-06-03 14:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'pmt update in FTNI - Renewal 2019', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 14:00:34', '2019-06-03 14:00:34'),
