  ('zcrm_1579374000036221076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Family $1500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 13:02:42', '2019-06-03 13:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'pmt updated in FTNI - renewal 2019', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 13:02:21', '2019-06-03 13:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899046', 'Thomas Mills', NULL, 'Sedera notified us that they would make an exception in this members case.  He to stay on the plan until 10/1 when he is eligible for Medicare.  Per Rod there will be no MEC Coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 12:57:14', '2019-06-03 12:57:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036243013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Member appeared overwhelmed and confused by plan. I encouraged him to review the materials, and to reschedule another welcome call if he still felt confused.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-06-03 12:35:51', '2019-06-03 12:35:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036233013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530219', 'Eva Hogan', NULL, '6-3-19 Her phone doesn''t work where her computer is located. They''re ready to enroll and I sent her the instructions. Her husband will choose the $5000 IUA for low monthly of about $189 since he already has VA benefits. She will choose the $2500 IUA and Provider Directed with Redirect since live where Redirect will work best and she''s in her 60''s. They want a July 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-06-03 12:28:19', '2019-06-03 12:28:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036249008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Got the answer from ASI.  Have informed the client.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-03 12:20:40', '2019-06-03 12:20:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036249003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Hi John,
I contacted the provider Mid Town Surgery Center. They stated they were contracted with Multiplan/PHCS. So gave them benefits at 100% based on the contracted rate with the network. They did not have her scheduled, so if you would like to have the member reschedule her procedure.

Let me know If you have questions.
 

Thank you,
Monica Lugo', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-06-03 12:20:02', '2019-06-03 12:20:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035679034', 'India Carney', NULL, 'India was not charged for June start.  I was not notified that this member needed payment setup.  Moxie girl has filled out the list bill form but we need a better process.  There are not any employees listed on the form to be charged...

On the list bill form in Cognito it states if it is an invoice or individual auto charges. They chose auto-pay which would get setup in FTNI.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-06-03 12:14:39', '2019-06-03 12:17:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268055', 'Earl Henderson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 11:26:46', '2019-06-03 11:26:46'),
