  ('zcrm_1579374000036224048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605292', 'Annika Gagne', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 09:21:08', '2019-06-03 09:21:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036233008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243220', 'Cynthia Pittman', NULL, 'Called in and asked if she changes her IUA if her plan is going to restart because of a pre-existing condition her husband had last year. I was made aware that nothing restarts and it is all just based on their start date. Cynthia was happy to hear that answer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-03 09:17:12', '2019-06-03 09:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036233003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656126', 'Kevin Lever', NULL, 'Called in and stated that he needed to go into the emergency room last night due to a urinary tract infection and is now on a catheter. He asked what he should do in taking further steps because he has to go see his urologist today. I explained to him that what is going on is considered an injury/illness and he is responsible for up to his $1500 IUA and anything after that he needs to get in contact with Sedera when he feels he is close to being over the IUA. He said that he knows he is most certain he is over his IUA . I told him then he NEEDS to contact Sedera ASAP right away to let them know what is going on and to start the claim process and get him through the bills he will be receiving. He had Sedera''s phone number already in front of him and is calling the now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-06-03 09:12:34', '2019-06-03 09:12:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034584109', 'Jill Humphreys', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 09:11:18', '2019-06-03 09:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034209013', 'George Jones', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 09:04:52', '2019-06-03 09:04:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034425101', 'Ranya Malouf DeLapine', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 08:59:31', '2019-06-03 08:59:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209103', 'Jeanie Thomas', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 08:57:40', '2019-06-03 08:57:40');
