  ('zcrm_1579374000036224028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547057', 'Amy Ruggeri', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 08:52:20', '2019-06-03 08:52:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007622391', 'Spencer Lindholm', NULL, 'Need billing info.  He is in zoho subscriptions, sent an email requesting he fill out a payment capture so we can move him to FTNI.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-06-03 08:49:48', '2019-06-03 08:49:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547326', 'Kyle Evans', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 08:48:22', '2019-06-03 08:48:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605089', 'Nicholas Paille', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 08:43:15', '2019-06-03 08:43:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605213', 'Allison Lemke', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 08:33:53', '2019-06-03 08:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209064', 'Damian Smith', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 08:31:20', '2019-06-03 08:31:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036224003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Did not receive her QR Life code card or RCI card yet. Said if she doesn''t get it by the 15th to give us a call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-06-03 07:59:41', '2019-06-03 07:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391062', 'Andra DelMonico', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel in ASi &amp; Sedera and cancel in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 07:53:34', '2019-06-03 07:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036221003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752192', 'Craig Nash', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation request I will let ASi &amp; Sedera know and cancel billing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-06-03 07:34:33', '2019-06-03 07:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036196033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Mary called in early on Saturday and left a message concerning Teladoc- because the phone was not rerouted to the Betties and went to my vonage voicemail- I felt bad for the member and wanted to be able to help her figure out how to be able to utilize the service. I am going to contact John and try to have him fix this situation with the phones. I left a message with the member as well as sent out a how-to type email to both addresses that we have in our system. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-06-01 08:34:27', '2019-06-01 08:34:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036194018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031714111', 'William Kirk', NULL, 'spoke to client William Kirk...told him he is enrolled in program...He would like an email detailing his enrollment status.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-31 17:47:38', '2019-05-31 17:47:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036194013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594050', 'Stephen Yost', NULL, 'Spoke to Mr. Yost about his paymnt from ASI...sent email to Monica at ASI requesting clerification about check being sent to him...awaiting response from Monica.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-31 17:40:25', '2019-05-31 17:40:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036196028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Chaz called in beause he thought the HRA was over the phone- I pointed him to the link that is in the email.  He thanked me for my time and I told him that he could call back anytime if he needed assistance. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-31 16:38:42', '2019-05-31 16:38:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036196023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Michele called in wanting to know if her daughter could use her preventative services for an annual physical for college even though there is a three month hold.  I told her that due to the timing and dead line that of course she could albeit that it is strictly an annual exam that is preventative in nature.  Michele also wanted me to search into the Rose medical center in denver to see if it was in network or not- I told her I would and keep her posted.  I guided her through the multi plan site- showed her how to use it and sent a TON of educational emails on the subject to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-31 16:06:46', '2019-05-31 16:06:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036196018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636283', 'Mella Webster', NULL, 'Mella called in reading off a list of bills that hadn''t been paid and I asked if she thought that she had called Liberty.  She said yes, that is what she thought, I gave her Liberty''s number and transferred the call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-31 15:58:40', '2019-05-31 15:58:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036196013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752192', 'Craig Nash', NULL, 'Craig called in wondering if I could help him find a urologist in network- I reminded him that there wasn''t a network of doctors for injury/illness.  He thanked me and understood. He also mentioned that he will be aging out and needed his coverage to end at the end of June- I sent him a form and asked him to fill it out, I also asked him to mention in the notes that he will be cancelling but his wife is going to stay on until the end of December. I copied Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-31 15:29:49', '2019-05-31 15:29:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036196008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called in to ask about an anti malaria drug for her daughter who will need to begin taking the script in 14 days- I looked up the med on goodrx and gave her the best price/place coupons to her via text.  She did say that she was waiting for a return call from the girl that she spoke to the other day, she was told that she would be called back either way with an answer.  I told her that I read KellyF''s notes and told her that it looks like both KellyF and John did an amazing job trying to dig in to see if this is a facility or doctor that is in network, and that Kelly was still going to be on the lookout to see if this doctor''s office responds with the info needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-31 15:24:07', '2019-05-31 15:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036196003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243610', 'Paula Chavez', NULL, 'Paula called in from the hospital stating that the hospital does not except cash pay patients, only Summit.  She is being discharged from the hospital due to her pneumonia and they will not let her leave with an oxygen tank.  I tried to transfer her to Sedera but ended up leaving a message on her behalf.  I tried to call her back several times to go over her IUA but she reminded me that this was all from the breast cancer- it lowered her immune system and she got the Rhino virus.  They did end up finding that she had Sedera Healthshare and they ok''d the oxygen tank.  The woman is so gracious and sweet- thanked me for my help- I told her that I would inform Sedera what is going on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-31 14:53:53', '2019-05-31 14:53:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036194003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036193007', 'Bradley Jahnke', NULL, 'Spoke at length with both physicians re: our DPC program....both were very receptive and have a large business group - explained that we can help with them about the group.  DPC will complete practitioner agreement and send back to me...and we will proceed with further training and marketing materials development when agreement is returned to me or office.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-31 13:01:45', '2019-05-31 13:01:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036176013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033305', 'Margaret Shiroda', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation request .  I will notify Sedera &amp; ASi and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-31 11:07:11', '2019-05-31 11:07:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036190003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530137', 'Sarah Pak', NULL, '5-31-19 Looking at PSDHC for family to gain tax benefits I think. Also psyched to open this up to his members and for us to help bring members to his practice. Visiting their office in person next Friday and need to bring flyers and add my contact information to them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-31 11:00:51', '2019-05-31 11:00:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036176008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822002', 'Elizabeth James', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation request I will submit to ASi &amp; Sedera and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-31 10:12:52', '2019-05-31 10:12:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036166021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480177', 'Andrea Rice', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out today add''l QR Life code card for husband Stephen. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-31 09:31:43', '2019-05-31 09:31:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036176003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006435077', 'Marcia Skaro', NULL, 'Member called into the concierge with her bank on the phone wanting to cancel.  Member sounded very infirmed so I took cancellation over the phone.  Cancelled her immediately.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-31 08:18:03', '2019-05-31 08:18:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036166016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024193001', 'Mike Montes', NULL, 'Mike had called in last week sometime about the HSA plan and we advised him we would do some digging and get back to him. We have still yet to hear back from Dave Schull for the final answer. As soon as we get a call back I or John or Patti will give Mike a call back to relay the message. Until then it is still being looked into. Ticket Closed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-31 08:15:01', '2019-05-31 08:15:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036166008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006435077', 'Marcia Skaro', NULL, 'Marcia had her bank call in with her on the line because she did not understand what the $50 charge was. I explained in full what the charge was and Marcia chimed in and said is that really necessary now that I am on Medicade? I said well if you are on Medicade than you should not have this plan at all. She asked to cancel and I was more than happy to assist her with that. I said I would send the cancellation email and Kim who was on the line from the bank end, asked if there is anyway we can do it over the phone with Marcia because she does not have access to a computer or able to do it on her cell phone manually.  I asked Patti if that is possible and since Marcia has the HES plan she is able to do it over the phone with them. I transferred over to Patti and Patti was able to complete the cancellation process over the phone. Marcia was pleased it was as simple as it was. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-31 08:10:51', '2019-05-31 08:12:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036166003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659139', 'Terry Fuller', NULL, 'Called back in and get the whole story. She was having very bad abdominal pains and she went to an urgent care. they checked her out and put a catheter in and ran some tests. She wasn''t sure on how to present herself at the time and used her ASI card, which i advised her for next time she should not use for something that is injury/illness. That care is strictly for preventative services only. she fully understood. I told her her next step is to call Sedera and let them know the whole story and that she has yet to pay anything towards it and these bills will defiantly be more than her $1500 IUA. She has to go back in either today or tomorrow morning.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-31 07:15:48', '2019-05-31 07:15:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036142042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331105', 'Kathleen White', NULL, 'Kathleen called in wanting to get started on her preventative care through ASI.  She had many questions and was taking notes, reading them back to me to make sure that she understood correctly.  She is a WONDERFUL thoughtful member and was thankful for all of the hand holding. I sent her quite a few emails to help her in her journey.  I also ordered replacement ASI cards for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-30 20:33:02', '2019-05-30 20:33:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036142034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659481', 'Noel Fleming', NULL, 'Noel called in to ask if his ex wife could take his children for their annual physicals a few months early.  Last year they had them in Aug- I called ASI and the answer was no, that they needed to wait until September- I let Noel know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-30 18:09:50', '2019-05-30 18:09:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036142026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447231', 'Susan O''Bryan Kinney', NULL, 'Susan called in stating that she wants to know how to use her preventative care services and said that because there are no facilities and doctors in her area that she was prepared to go 100 miles away and wanted to go to the Mayo Clinic in Minnesota.  I told her that just because there were some Mayo facilities popping up didn''t mean that the doctor and anesthesiologist would be a good fit, that is why I wanted to wait.  I tried to transfer the call to Guy but she said that she had a speaking engagement  and wondered about tomorrow.  She said that this was an emergency stating that "I don''t want to die."   I told her that we needed to look into the Mayo clinic as well as figure out what we CAN orchestrate for her.  She was impatient- she asked what "normally happens" when members call in- I told her that it is usually less than a 24 hour process.  I also told her that her case was unusual due to her area, and the fact that she wants to go to Mayo clinic.  In our conversation, after we had found a MN Mayo Clinic Hospital she said "ok, this is what I''ll do.  I''ll call them and tell them what I am coming in for.  It will take them about 2 weeks to put me with a doctor, I will call you, give YOU the doctors name and you will approve them!"  obviously I corrected her and said that at that point we would need to find that doctor and make sure that an anesthesiologist in network would all line up.  She said that this was tougher than she thought it would be.  I told her that I would be reaching out to Guy Travis in regards to her case and ask him to give her a call.  I told her that I would be getting a list together of facilities and anesthesiologists closer to her than MN. I sent an email on preventative care and pointed out the attachment going over all of the mandated services. I sent a TON of educational emails mostly on preventive care -  I did find an Internal Medicine doctor of Gail Mizner in network as to which Susan exclaimed "she''s my friend!  I didn''t know she was a doctor"  but then seemed ho hum due to the fact that she was setting all of her sites of Mayo. KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-30 17:21:05', '2019-05-30 18:19:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036144011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752474', 'Eric Fields', NULL, '5-30-19 Ric called saying he got a response from ASi that his visit isn''t wellness and not covered. He doesn''t remember giving them his ASi card at the visit. Told him how to upload bills into system and to go back and tell them that he''s not insured and needs their best self-pay patient price. Gave him Concierge phone number as well to help him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-30 16:47:00', '2019-05-30 16:47:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036148003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594050', 'Stephen Yost', NULL, 'Called and left message for client to call me regarding his ASI issue with reimbursement....waiting on client to call me back to discuss issue.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-30 16:43:19', '2019-05-30 16:43:19'),
