  ('zcrm_1579374000036081071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, 'Shawna called in because she told me that she just cracked her head open and might need stitches. She said the bleeding stopped and its not that bad of a cut but she obviously needs to get it looked at. She was asking how she goes about this processes. I explained to her about her $1000 IUA and that is what she is responsible for out of pocket for anything that is injury/illness. She asked if I knew of any places or what type of facility she would go to. I informed her that she does not need to go to anywhere specific and that with injury/illness there is no network she needs to stay in and its of her choosing. She completely understood and was happy with the answers provided. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-29 13:32:21', '2019-05-29 13:32:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036081066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, 'Non compliant and rate change email sent', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-29 13:30:30', '2019-05-29 13:30:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036081061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie had a couple questions about an HSA. First she wanted to know if she needed to have her benefits started before she signs up for an HSA, I told her no she does not need her benefits started to sign up. Secondly she asked if she has to go through the HSA Bank that we use here or if she could use any local bank. She was happy with the answers that I provided her and is excited to open one up! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-29 13:27:08', '2019-05-29 13:27:08'),
