  ('zcrm_1579374000036100003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, '5-29-19 Joe is 56 and wife is 58. Healthy, exercise, eat well, don''t smoke. Have Kaiser now for $1450 Bronze plan and tired of how they operate and how crazy expensive it all is and unflexible. Considering Vintage DPC or PDHC or least interested in PSDHC. Does have HSA and wants to fully fund it now and will talk with tax professional. Wife has Hoshimotos and underactive thyroid, also migraines since kid when eat wrong foods such as wine, caffeine, chocolate. They see doctor couple times a year. Want the $500 IUA which is $710 with Redirect, $510 + $180 with DPC and $680 for PSDHC. Leaning towards Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-29 13:04:58', '2019-05-29 13:04:58'),
