  ('zcrm_1579374000036067051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005573087', 'Britany Kamai', NULL, 'This member called in very upset that she had benn being billed $50 for past 2 yrs for a service that she was not aware of.  I explained what HES was and she said that she had cancelled with Kari some time ago.  I said that she should contact Kari she told me that she is impossible to deal with.  She wanted to speak to Rod which i told her that he was on vacation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-29 11:10:47', '2019-05-29 11:10:47'),
