  ('zcrm_1579374000036067008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482108', 'Gina Schwichtenberg', NULL, 'I spoke to this member to clarify to her how the Self Directed plan worked.  She was told this back in Aug of 2018 by Kelly C.  Called in again and Kelly F gave her incorrect info re: Preventative.  She expressed to me that she was unaware when she signed up that this was not insurance and that Robin told her that there would be more options in Jan.  She told me that she needs traditional insurance and that she wished to cancel.  I sent her out cancellation form to fill out. Gina also stated that Robin never informed her what type of company we here at MPowering are, that it was never mentioned to her that we are Medical Cost Sharing and not Traditional Health Insurance. She proceeded to state asking why people would choose us over traditional insurance. Patti tried explaining everything to her and making it easier on Gina and she just did not understand. -PB/KF', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-29 09:25:44', '2019-05-29 11:08:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036067003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Pmt changed in FTNI - renewal 2019', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-29 08:22:10', '2019-05-29 08:22:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036038008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990403', 'Donald Sandy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel FTNI and email ASi &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-29 08:08:16', '2019-05-29 08:08:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036039033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'Michele called in and stated that she just got the rate change email and that unfortunately she has to cancel because she will not be able to afford it. She was pretty upset that she had to cancel and really did not want to, but "You gotta do what you gotta do to be able to feed yourself". She said we over here at MPowering have always been great and she really loved our products and how the plan works. She just simply can not afford it with the rate change going up. She wanted to make it clear that everyone here at the office and everyone she has talked to has always treated her with respect and kindness. She hopes that she will be able to come back on in the future and that she highly recommends us to anyone. She has told a lot of her family and friends about us and how everything works on MPowering''s side. She thanked me very much and is sad to leave. Sent the cancellation form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-29 07:52:33', '2019-05-29 07:52:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036039028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068058', 'Alden Hagardorn', NULL, 'Alden rang in this morning confused on why he is getting billed for his annual wellness visit he had back in April. I asked if he showed the provider his ASI card, he said "Absolutley!", next I asked for the providers name and looked up his doctors name in the PHCS network and his provider and facility did show up and is in network. Third I asked if anything came up or was "found" or if any symptoms were brought up, all answers were a No. So I then asked if the bill he was looking at was the detailed medical bill with the CPT codes. He explained what was on the bill and it was just a statement saying how much he owed. It has no explanation what so ever. Just the DOS and the amount owed. I told him to get in contact with his provider and request for the detailed medical bill and to make sure that it has the CPT codes on it. Once he receives that to email it over to me and I will review it to make sure it is the correct type of bill with the codes and then I will send it over to Leena at ASI to see if she can see what is going on and why he is being billed. He was perfectly fine with that and will get back to me ASAP when he gets the correct CPT coded bill. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-29 07:50:17', '2019-05-29 07:50:17'),
