  ('zcrm_1579374000036003019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '5-28-19 Jacquelyn want to join the membership as well! Waiting to see if we can add her to MPB Group or put her on Assoc. separately. She''s 42 and retiring from BARA! She''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds. Goes to Dr. 1-2x per year if that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-28 17:00:33', '2019-05-28 17:00:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036012023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030491006', 'Trent Buttars', NULL, 'from Amanda Singer''s notes-  	

Amanda called in wondering where she needed to send her sons bill for medication.  I asked her for her name to look at her account  and said that he wasn''t under her account but her husbands.  I asked her a bunch of questions and answered different senario''s but she would only tell me that "it''s just medication for my son"  I explained Sedera''s sharing guidelines with medication, and that they do not cover maitnence meds, I said how-ever we provide prescription medication assistance.  She cut me short said "no that''s alright.  We already paid for it. Thanks for all your help! Now we know that we need to open up a need first. Thanks again!"   to me she struck me as clueless AND really doesn''t want to take the time to actually learn how things work.  I initially thought that she needs another welcome call, but....I don''t know if that is actually going to help.  sending this to Patti so she can brainstorm this and the fact that she is calling in for "her son" that is on a completely separate plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-28 16:51:26', '2019-05-28 16:51:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036012018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030403126', 'Amanda Singer', NULL, 'Amanda called in wondering where she needed to send her sons bill for medication.  I asked her for her name to look at her account  and said that he wasn''t under her account but her husbands.  I asked her a bunch of questions and answered different senario''s but she would only tell me that "it''s just medication for my son"  I explained Sedera''s sharing guidelines with medication, and that they do not cover maitnence meds, I said how-ever we provide prescription medication assistance.  She cut me short said "no that''s alright.  We already paid for it. Thanks for all your help! Now we know that we need to open up a need first. Thanks again!"   to me she struck me as clueless AND really doesn''t want to take the time to actually learn how things work.  I initially thought that she needs another welcome call, but....I don''t know if that is actually going to help.  sending this to Patti so she can brainstorm this and the fact that she is calling in for "her son" that is on a completely separate plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-28 16:42:00', '2019-05-28 16:42:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036012013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie called in worried that she hadn''t yet received her Sedera Welcome pack via email yet.  I told her not to worry that she was all set up here and that Sedera is currently in the process of uploading the new members for next month start.  I showed her where on the checklist she could download the welcome packet, I encouraged her to wait until the middle of the month for her welcome call so that all the cards and info that she will be using is all right in front of her and can be explained easier.  I told her that she could call anytime with questions and we will be happy to help! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-28 16:04:04', '2019-05-28 16:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000036012008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031810039', 'Morgan Adams', NULL, 'Morgan''s father called in to speak with someone about the credit card charged being declined because it alerted as fraudulent, he said that he had asked Analisa to ask us to reswipe the card, but that he never heard back.  I tried to transfer the line Sunny, but she was on the other line.  I emailed her all of this info and asked that she reswipe the card and reach out to Mr. Adams at 720-505-7084 - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-28 14:39:05', '2019-05-28 14:39:05'),
