  ('zcrm_1579374000036007003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Ryan called in today to ask a few questions on how billing, his IUA, and just general education on his plan and how it works. I explained everything and sent emails on how to submit bills to Sedera, how to present himself with his MEC to the providers, and lastly the information for 2nd MD and how all that works in a separate email. Ryan was extremely pleased with the information that I had given him and said he really understands it now and feels a lot better/comfortable with his plan!! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-28 10:16:22', '2019-05-28 10:16:22'),
