  ('zcrm_1579374000035902033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', NULL, 'Shelley wrote this note to both Lauren and myself- Guy also knows about it.- KC

---- On Fri, 24 May 2019 17:11:09 -0500 Shelley Steinmark <shelley.steinmark@regionalcare.com> wrote ----

    Hi Lauren,

     

    I am touching base with you about the claim for Sydney from March 3rd at Cleveland Clinic. It is not uncommon for two claims to be submitted, one from the facility and one from the physician. The issue lies in the facility billing as a place of service as outpatient hospital. When that claim is submitted with outpatient hospital as the place of service it will deny because there is no benefit for outpatient hospital for a preventive visit per your plan. However, I have reprocessed the claim to pay 100% so you have no responsibility. You had no way of knowing that the clinic would submit the claim under outpatient hospital, which is not wrong it’s just that your plan doesn’t cover preventive services at a place of service outpatient hospital.  . If you and your family were to go to there for a preventive visit this will happen again.

     

    Let me know if you have any further questions or concerns – I’m very happy to help.

     

    Have a great holiday weekend!

     

    Shelley', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-24 18:14:51', '2019-05-24 18:14:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035902028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283080', 'Trevor Graham', NULL, 'called to ask if immunizations were covered by his preventative care coverage.  I told him as long as the doctor is in network and they are making sure to code the vaccines as preventive. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-24 16:29:09', '2019-05-24 16:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035902023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806201', 'Marti Winkler', NULL, 'Marti called in to change her payment info.  I guided her to the online form, told her to fill it out and submit it and that finance would see that email on Tuesday and update that info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-24 16:01:28', '2019-05-24 16:01:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035902018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508078', 'Charles Edwards', NULL, 'Called to check to make sure that his doctor is in network- I looked it up.  Paul Keinarth- and he is indeed- I told him that he would have to call in for approval of colonoscopy, his wife mammogram so on and so forth.  He understood and was thankful that I looked up his Dr.  He then asked how the process would work because he is aging out in Jan- but his wife is 6 months younger.  I told him that I would have Patti reach out to him on Tuesday to go into more detail. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-24 15:58:12', '2019-05-24 15:58:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035895023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Spoke at extreme lengths with client re: lab invoice from Boulder Community Health.....Requested client to obtain lab orders from MD office prior to 10/17/18 lab draws...client informed me that she will obtain lab order request from MD office and send lab request order to me to review.   Informed client that I will review lab request order and make a determination on how to proceed re the billing of lab tests....Waiting on response from client and lab orders from MD office.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-24 15:09:13', '2019-05-24 15:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035902013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda called in to speak with either Kelly F or John Kach- I told her that Kelly was gone for the day and transferred the line to John. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-24 14:58:30', '2019-05-24 14:58:30'),
