  ('zcrm_1579374000035895018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Tried to call ASI regarding the client bill with Lab Tests...all interested people are not in today....will call after holiday weekend.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-24 14:02:42', '2019-05-24 14:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035871013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda got another call from the Midtown center where she would be going for the colonoscopy and they are saying the are NOT in network, which did not make sense because John made a call to find out and was told yes. So John got on the phone with a few different people and indeed the facility is not in network. I called Melinda to let her know that and John advises her to cancel the appointment and that he will do some research with ASI to find a facility that is 100% in network so we do not run into this problem again. Melinda was a little upset because the doctor she had her appointment with is someone she has been going to for a while and trusts him. So her concern is if she uses a different doctor she wont be comfortable and wont know if she can trust them. I tried to reassure her that we would never send someone to a facility/doctor that had a bad rep or bad reviews. I told her that I will personally look into which ever doctor we find and look into reviews and try and get a good understanding about that doctor to make her feel comfortable. She felt a lot better after me saying that. John said we should have some answers for her by Tuesday since this is a holiday weekend. I will call her when John found some places. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-24 14:00:26', '2019-05-24 14:00:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035884018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656126', 'Kevin Lever', NULL, 'Member called in and advised that email that he received about renewal had EO pricing.  I gave him the ES pricing and he will be changing to the $1500 IUA.  I directed him to fill out form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-24 13:53:23', '2019-05-24 13:53:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035895013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Spoke to client and educated him to just make sure that he knew to use our network re preventative wellness exams and lab tests...can call us to ensure providers he uses are in network....He was a little concerned when I told him this was not insurance....he assumed it was insurance or part of it was....Re-educated to him that none of it is insurance and we a little "un- nerved" about that....He concluded the call by stating he would call back on Tuesday due to work situation.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-24 13:45:05', '2019-05-24 13:45:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035884013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899046', 'Thomas Mills', NULL, 'Member called in and say if rate was going up to $345 that he was going to cancel.  I advised him that he was no longer eligible for the plan anyway because of age.  I sent him out the cancellation form and will cancel him for 6/1. Will have Sunny refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-24 13:30:17', '2019-05-24 13:30:17'),
