  ('zcrm_1579374000035895003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Tried to contact Marsha Huber regarding lab bill received....phone did not connect to voice mail...so could not leave a message.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-24 13:06:00', '2019-05-24 13:06:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035871008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Iris called in wondering about the email that was sent out in regards to the rate''s going up in June. She just wanted to know if she needs to sign anything for us at MPowering to take more money out of her account. I let her know that the only thing she would have to sign or fill out is if she wants to change her IUA. She said she doesn''t think she is going to change what she has. She was happy with the answers I provided her and said we have been such a big help to her! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-24 13:04:22', '2019-05-24 13:04:22'),
