  ('zcrm_1579374000035884003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578069', 'Karla Degginger', NULL, 'Spoke w/ Karla re: Rate change and possibly splitting off her son to his own membership.  Advised her of new IUA.  She will think over what to do.  Realized in conversation that her daughter was still on the plan  (she was married last year) so I had Elizabeth remove her from membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-24 11:00:43', '2019-05-24 11:00:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035849008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177635', 'Suzanne Oster-Keilt', NULL, 'Sent her an email that refund will take 3-5 business days; processed 6/4', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-24 10:56:08', '2019-06-04 10:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035871003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda called in because she has a colonoscopy appointment scheduled for Tuesday and received a call from the center that they do not take ASI insurance and she needs to either pay upfront or pay a $500 cancellation fee. I got the providers name and the facility name and BOTH are IN network. Melinda gave me the phone number that she got this call from and John called and spoke to April. He got everything authorized and set up that they will in fact take ASI through the PHCS network. Melinda was EXTREMELY  thrilled with how quickly and accurately we got all this figured out for her. She stated that we are much much better than Blue Cross Blue Shield and that she is going to refer a lot of people over to us and that she just had her brother sign up. Very satisfied member! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-24 10:07:26', '2019-05-24 10:07:26'),
