  ('zcrm_1579374000035815037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'reached out to ASI again- this time included Leena.  sent a note to Brian to let him know that we havn''t forgotten about him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-23 18:53:29', '2019-05-23 18:53:29'),
