  ('zcrm_1579374000035786058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672389', 'Scott Schemel', NULL, 'Member called and said card should be good, asked to re-try the payment. Processed on 5/23. Will monitor', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-23 12:44:15', '2019-05-23 12:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035786053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217005', 'Kimberly Carpenter', NULL, 'Changed commissions to reflect adding a child. Adjusted the task to change commissions back to Member Only after April and May commissions are paid out. FTNI updated with all changes', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-23 10:20:15', '2019-05-23 10:20:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035786048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130659', 'James Kalow', NULL, 'Changed commissions to reflect removing spouse. FTNI updated.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-23 10:17:26', '2019-05-23 10:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035801003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Machelle called in a little confused on why her provider for her annual wellness physical said to her in office, that she is being billed for new patient visit''s. She called in just to confirm that this preventative visit is covered and why the provider would be billing her for that. The provider IS in network. She hasn''t gotten any physical bills as of just yet. I gave her Sedera''s phone number to try and get with them to see why she would be billed. I told her that her best bet is to call her provider and get a detailed medical bill with the CPT code''s and send it in so we can figure out what is going on. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-23 10:11:51', '2019-05-23 10:11:51'),
