  ('zcrm_1579374000035785003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to change her address I update will all carriers and FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-23 08:35:41', '2019-05-23 08:35:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035766003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028501151', 'Amanda Noble', NULL, 'Received cancellation request from this member submitted on 5/22 at 11:56pm.  Per Kelly she was looking to have her payment stopped since she was cancelling.  Unfortunately  this request was submitted too late.  I will email the member and advise her of this.  I have cancelled RCI, Sedera &amp; will stop further billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-23 08:08:14', '2019-05-23 08:08:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035762003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537009', 'Jeanine Ford', NULL, 'Jeanine called in about the new per-authorization letter that was sent out for procedures bellow $500)colonoscopy''s, mammograms, etc..) She was looking to go for her annual mammogram screening. She gave me her providers name that she always goes to and the facility, I did some research and both the provider and facility is in network! I also did research on what they charge and they are fairly cheap, ranging for $150-$250. Very happy client and is looking forward to working with us in the future! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-23 07:53:42', '2019-05-23 07:53:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035750018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028501151', 'Amanda Noble', NULL, 'Amanda called in to cancel her plan she was hoping that she could stop this payment from going out but I told her that it would fall on the decision of Patti at the home office and that she would look at this email first thing in the morning and if she needed reach out to Amanda then. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-22 18:22:20', '2019-05-22 18:22:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035750013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497031', 'David Harap', NULL, 'Hey Guy,

I just finished digging in to a facility and anesthesiologist for Mr. Harap.  There were many facilities in network but only one that matched 4 anesthesiologist''s.  The name of the facility is Seton Medical Center and the Dr.''s names are as follows-

Mario Nieto
Arsia Dabiri
Matthew Teicher
and Grace Bednar.

I will make sure that I put all of this into the notes,  Please let me know if there is anymore I can help you with!



Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-22 18:15:54', '2019-05-22 18:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035750008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Lori called in to help jog her memory as to where the address change form was online.  I guided her to it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-22 17:53:16', '2019-05-22 17:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035750003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Kimi called and stated that she was calling in because her doctor wants her to have a mammogram and bone density test on top of the colonoscopy that she has scheduled at the end of the week.  She was a bit myphed by the fact that she received the Addendum and called to ask if she could even go through with it.  I told her that I would try to transfer her to Guy Travis, but that it was the end of the buisness day so I might not be able to. She asked what would happen if I couldn''t get a hold of Guy- I gave her his cell number.   I got a hold of Guy but Kimi had disconnected. I spoke to Guy and he will speak to Kimi later on tomorrow.  She wants to go out of network for everything- Her Dr Gail King is out of network AND Apen Valley- where she wants to go for the colonoscopy.   Guy says that Bone Density is out of the question because- she is 51 years old so wouldn''t qualify for ACA bone density screening, the other possibility being that she has been diagnosed with osteopenia or osteoporosis, and at that point it would be out of pocket up until her IUA.   In this case I thought it would be best for Guy to have a conversation with her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-22 16:55:37', '2019-05-22 16:55:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035748008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-22 15:15:18', '2019-05-22 15:15:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035748003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937151', 'Janae Sowards', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. Updated FTNI, charged June payment and charged the yearly fee that declined on 5/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-22 15:12:09', '2019-05-22 15:12:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035740013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521534', 'Steven Russell', NULL, '5-22-19 Left vm for Steve bc Patti and Guy spoke with him and he''s apparently forgotten that there is the PHCS network for annual wellness visits. I will refresh his memory about that part. Guy is also going to talk with him according to Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-22 14:01:42', '2019-05-22 14:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035740008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521534', 'Steven Russell', NULL, 'Steven called in, in regards to the pre-authorization letter he recieved about getting a colonoscopy he had scheduled. He gave me the providers name and the facility. I did some research and neither of them are in network. He said he was never made aware that there is a network he has to go to and is very upset. I spoke with Guy about this and Guy and he said he will do some more digging and get back to Steven tomorrow. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-22 13:58:15', '2019-05-22 13:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035713008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called in asking if a certain facility was in network called Ma''am Exams. Me and John did some research on their website and we did not see anything indicating Insurance that they take OR a list of providers on their website. That''s kind of a red flag. So I called the facility and no one answered so I left a message asking if they are contracted through the PHCS network and if they have a list of providers on their website and to call me back when they get the chance. I called heather back to let her know and asked if she still wanted me to look up a list of providers instead. She said she would rather wait until I hear back from them because the facility does a lot of different services and she would rather go to one place to get what she needs done instead of driving all around. I told her I will let her know when I hear from them ASAP. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-22 12:09:09', '2019-05-22 12:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035713003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535099', 'Shirley Ospina', NULL, 'Nikolas called in (Shirley''s son) to ask for some help on looking up a few providers for him in his area. He was looking for a GP, Dentist, and a Dermatologist. I explained to him that a Dentist and Derm are not considered preventative, it is diagnostic, and that Shirley will be responsible for her IUA of $500. Anything after that a detailed medical bill with the CPT code''s will need to be submitted over to Sedera as a "Need". I sent him the email that explains on how to submit bill''s. Along with the 3 provider list''s he wanted I attached the 64+ preventative care list so he can know what screenings are approved by the ACA. He was very happy with the help understood about the Dentist and Derm. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-22 11:32:44', '2019-05-22 11:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035691031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035679124', 'Scott Jensen', NULL, 'Billing Set up in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-22 11:23:22', '2019-05-22 11:23:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035707008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030403126', 'Amanda Singer', NULL, 'Amanda called in stating that when she went for for annual wellness visit her provider was very confused when Amanda handed them her RCI card. The provider said they did not know how to go about handling that and just billed her. Amanda asked if she should just pay it or what she should do. I told her defiantly do NOT pay anything just yet until we can get this figured out. I asked her to get a detailed medical bill that has the CPT codes on them and then submit that over to me via email. I told her once I receive that I will send it over to someone at RCI and have them look into this for her. She 100% understood and will be getting the medical bill for me ASAP. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-22 10:04:51', '2019-05-22 10:04:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035691023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273678', 'Paula Ward', NULL, 'Received Cancellation request I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-22 10:01:51', '2019-05-22 10:01:51'),
