  ('zcrm_1579374000035667003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529389', 'James Schooling', NULL, 'James called in to cancel because his wife had just lost her job and their bank account will not be able to support the charge coming out on the 24th of the month. Sent him the form to fill out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-22 07:43:02', '2019-05-22 07:43:02'),
