  ('zcrm_1579374000035663013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605126', 'Annmarie Lancaster', NULL, 'Annmarie is set up under Nicholas Paille on FTNI as they have same address, zip and use the same bank name and account FTNI would not let me set up separate profiles.  Acct set up fee of $25 and billed on 5/22. Good to go for a 6/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-22 07:34:02', '2019-05-22 07:34:02'),
