  ('zcrm_1579374000035663003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610380', 'Laura Watson', NULL, 'I put a hold on today''s payment and scheduled a single payment for 5/24. I sent her an email that this would be the last time we accommodate and she would not be able to switch the draft date.

From: Laura Watson <lbw77@me.com>
To: "Sunny Terziyska"<sunny@myahe.org>
Date: Tue, 21 May 2019 14:36:21 -0400
Subject: Re: MPowering Benefits - Change of Payment Date
============ Forwarded message ============

    I’m sorry to ask this again, is it possible to move tomorrow’s draft date to Friday 5/24?

    Moving forward, as I review my budget and auto draft dates with other bills... is it possible to pick a new draft date for my health insurance payments?

    Please advise...

    Thank you very much. 
    Laura Watson', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-22 07:11:06', '2019-05-22 07:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', NULL, 'I did receive Lauren''s email to us that came in during the morning- I have sent it to Emily and have tagged Guy in it as well so that he can fill in during the day tomorrow if need be. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 19:13:10', '2019-05-21 19:13:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466094', 'Chad Broker', NULL, 'Chad reached out to ask for a copy of his insurance card.  I left a vm message and sent an email stating that Patti would send him one in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 18:19:31', '2019-05-21 18:19:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine called with many questions, she still hasn''t received her APEX card, and she still was in the dark about what network she had for preventative care.  I stayed with her on the phone for awhile until she felt more comfortable.  Let her know that APEX uses the PHCS network.  Gave her many many emails.  She is eager to learn- though a very large learning curve for her.  She thanked me for my time.  I am going to message Patti about at least getting her a PDF card. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 18:16:03', '2019-05-21 18:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594050', 'Stephen Yost', NULL, 'Stephen called in upset because he says that ASI still has a lack of funds from us to send out his check.  I told him that I do not have the authority nor do I work in finance but that Jennie Schluth would get back to him tomorrow morning.  He has been waiting since November to be reimbursed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 18:04:47', '2019-05-21 18:04:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033271', 'Shannon Drake', NULL, 'she called in wondering what to do with a bill from her dermatologist totaling $380 I told her that she should scan and upload a CPT coded copy to the sedera app and just keep it in the receipt drawer that they have now.  I sent her an email going over how to submit a need to sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 17:03:21', '2019-05-21 17:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535076', 'Todd Lary', NULL, 'Todd called in about bloodwork that he had been given a script for from his Primary Doctor,  it sounded like he wanted to get it pre-approved- he mentioned something about diagnostic codes and I told him that I thought the best course of action would be for him to send this over to me so that I could give it to Guy to take a look at and let him know if this was preventive care or diagnostic.   Diagnostic was his word and not mine. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 16:45:58', '2019-05-21 16:45:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497031', 'David Harap', NULL, 'David called in to make sure that his primary doctor was still on the phcs list- Dr. Weeks- and I checked- he is.  He said he just wanted to double check because he had read the memo that Guy had sent out.  I gave him a few tips and sent him multiple educational emails on preventative care. He asked about colonoscopy I told him that we can begin looking for him, but he will need a script from his doctor.  He said that his doctor has been wanting him to get one since he turned 50 but he just kept putting it off, so he thinks he will.  I told him that Guy and I will start the process now,but to give us a call when he''s all set to go.   Member very understanding of the memo and agreed that as a membership we need to have some guidelines in place. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 15:43:33', '2019-05-21 15:43:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035609048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Tammi''s husband needed to go to the hospital for a severe head injury 4 weeks ago- the total bill is 2 million dollars Guy told her that she should''ve contacted Sedera from the start, but she stated that she has been a bit too preoccupied.  I sent her instructions and link on how she needs to open up a need with Sedera (Guy had already gone over the right kind of bills she needed to submit) I told her that their phone number was on the email- she was very busy and just home for a bit to take a shower and then go back to the hospital.  She told me that she would give Sedera a call on the way back to the hospital.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-21 14:50:09', '2019-05-21 14:50:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035613014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243220', 'Cynthia Pittman', NULL, 'Spoke to Cynthia and eased her concerns regarding one of her childs being immunized...she was happy and comforted with the discussion....she will call if any additional preventative testing is needed and obtain pre-authorizations.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-21 14:35:22', '2019-05-21 14:35:22'),
