  ('zcrm_1579374000035638003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535076', 'Todd Lary', NULL, 'Ellen needs a lumpectomy.  Called Dania and asked that Sedera reach out.  She will Have someone call.  Confirmed wit Ellen', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-21 13:21:44', '2019-05-21 13:21:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035630026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937096', 'Ramon Pinela', NULL, '5-21-19 Ramon went to Dr. Crystal Roney in 81637 and she''s In-Network! He got the cash discounted price for their testing of cholesterol, high blood pressure, etc. Sounds like a wellness visit. Gave him Concierge phone # to submit bills for reimbursement. Cost is only around $260. He understands he needs to show the bill and what the visit was for and coding. But, he will need more coaching for sure.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-21 12:49:51', '2019-05-21 12:49:51'),
