  ('zcrm_1579374000035608081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Spoke to Iris and she wanted clarification on the communication memo re: pre-authorizations.  She was happy with the answers and will call us if she is scheduled for a preventative test.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-21 12:36:56', '2019-05-21 12:36:56'),
