  ('zcrm_1579374000035608061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Spoke to Mary Linebeck...wanted to know the procedure related to getting the pre-authorization for a colonoscopy.  Going to preventative wellness visit to get referral for colonoscopy.  Client will call back with specifics re the facility where procedure will be completed.  We will then proceed to determine costs associated with procedure.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-21 11:47:53', '2019-05-21 11:47:53'),
