Question : would like to start an hsa', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-05-20 18:15:45', '2019-05-20 18:15:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035565028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962554', 'Natalia Guillot', NULL, 'Left client a message on her voicemail regarding her injury issue.  Spoke to Kelly Cheever about this member.....May need to be referred to RREMCC corporate HR department re injury on job..', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-20 16:48:41', '2019-05-20 16:48:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035585023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962554', 'Natalia Guillot', NULL, 'called in wondering what coverage she has for Tendinitus surgery that she says she was injured on the job from.  She said that she can''t come up with the money for it and wondered if her insurance through us would help with any of it.  I told her that I would reach out to Guy Travis- one of the guys that was at her Denny''s that explained the program to her.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-20 16:29:17', '2019-05-20 16:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035585018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013427005', 'Amber Schorie', NULL, 'Amber called in wondering what steps she could take because her daughter wants to go to therapy for her anxiety.  I told her about the Head to Heart counseling that Sedera offers- I sent her all of the info.  I told her about the discount that is available through Sedera to use their therapy services ($75) I told her that if her daughter needed medication that we could help find the best prices for her.  I told her that Sedera is now sharing in "some" cases and that there is a cap- I told her that the best thing to do would give them a call, let them know what is going on and have them explain the exact benefits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-20 16:20:54', '2019-05-20 16:20:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035585013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Kristy called in because she was diagnosed with Arthritis in her hip,  Wendy told her to call in and get some info on a second opinion.  Kristy was very confused about the program, but sweet about it.  I explained that she needs to call Sedera and have the 2nd MD consult right away- because this surgery (hip replacement) that she needs will go over her IUA.  I sent an email about 2nd MD,  how to submit bills (and what kind) to Sedera, I also sent Sedera''s educational video''s as well.  She also asked about colonoscopy,  I told her that she would be submitting it the same way but to ask Sedera to tell her all of the steps and walk her through when she calls to tell them about the hip replacement.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-20 15:23:10', '2019-05-20 15:23:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035585008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'Guy called me and asked that I reach out to Regina with all of the info that she needs to open up a need and submit her bills concerning her arthritic knee over to Sedera- she told guy that she was diagnosed with this in March- so it should be covered.  She has been paying out of pocket and has far exceeded her IUA.  Guy spoke with her about the importance of submitting your bills after reaching your IUA.  I spoke with her on the phone, she was doing some homework concerning a colonoscopy. I took down all of the info- I am going to do a bit of researching and then send everything to Guy.  He told me that he will do it tomorrow.  I sent the submitting bills to Sedera email as well as the educational Sedera videos. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-20 14:50:23', '2019-05-20 14:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035565023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521614', 'Eleonora Steinberg', NULL, 'Spoke to client and explained to her the need for the preventative preauthorization memo.....she was very happy and will comply when she needs a mammogram, colonoscopy, or other procedure.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-20 14:48:14', '2019-05-20 14:48:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035585003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521614', 'Eleonora Steinberg', NULL, 'Eleonora called in wanting more info about Guy''s memo- I transferred the line over to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-20 14:38:00', '2019-05-20 14:38:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035565018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, 'Sent response email to client re Pre-authorization memo....Tried calling client to explain reasoning for communication ....no answer....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-20 14:35:36', '2019-05-20 14:35:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035565013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'Spoke to client Regina Rauch, she had 2 questions....#1Knee diagnosis - Arthritis, Physical Therapy visits totaling $1,000. Her IUA is only $500...Instructed her to complete Sedera paperwork to recoup amount over $500.  Spoke with Kelly Cheever to email her Sedera forms and/or ways to contact Sedera for Bill submission.  #2. Needs Prevent Colonoscopy...informed client to please inform MPowering Benefits office about provider location where procedure will be performed. This will be a pre-authorization for a procedure.  Kelly Cheever is actively working on this issue with Gy Travis. Follow up needed....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-20 14:33:14', '2019-05-20 14:33:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035544043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'Michelle called to update her payment method to a CC. She wanted to use the CC only for the June payment (on May 22nd) and then continue to use the bank account on file moving forward. I held the payment from the bank account on FTNI and scheduled just a one time payment using the CC for May 22nd.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-20 13:29:09', '2019-05-20 13:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035542077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547456', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-20 13:18:10', '2019-05-20 13:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035542072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547415', 'Grant Curatola', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-39 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-20 12:56:43', '2019-05-20 12:56:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035556016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, 'Valerie called in  a little confused on how the process works with opening her first "Need". She has already gone through the process of getting a 2nd opinion through 2nd MD and was told her IUA would reduce to $750 instead of $1000. She has thought that the $750 is going to us here at MPowering. I explained to her that her IUA is what she is paying out of pocket to the provider and needs to ask to be billed the rest. She mentioned that she already had someone named Lauren over at Sedera working on a case. I told her since she already has someone at Sedera helping her with a case she needs to stay in contact with them on what her next steps are. She finally understood how to go about it and will be contacting Lauren her case manager at Sedera for her next steps. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-20 12:55:08', '2019-05-20 12:55:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035565008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '5-20-19 Ian is enrolling now for the PDHC w/ ReDirect for $1500 / $297. He''s very nervous about getting rid of his Anthem plan since this is new and different. But, he knows it''s been  working for the Yaw''s. He''s asked every question possible.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-20 12:47:19', '2019-05-20 12:47:19'),
