  ('zcrm_1579374000035556011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Called in to have her first name changed in our system, serdera''s, and ASI''s. She had her name legally changed to Deb. I changed her name in our system and am sending out a member info change form for our records and Patti is going to contact Sedera and ASI to have her first name changed on their end and have new cards sent out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-20 10:54:25', '2019-05-20 10:54:25'),
