  ('zcrm_1579374000035401128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032739022', 'Kim Fowlkes', NULL, 'reached out for another script of pred...sent out another coupon. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-16 14:52:27', '2019-05-16 14:52:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035401123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990428', 'Tyler Lane', NULL, 'Tyler emailed me back, frantic that he couldn''t get a hold of anyone at Sedera and that he had called 4 times, I told him that I had reached out to a manager there and that between his voicemails and me reaching out to management someone WILL call.  Dania wrote back that they were on the phone with him. - KC *Note I did state in my emails and phone conversation that if he felt that he needed to go to the er than that''s what we all wanted him to do* - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-16 14:51:55', '2019-05-16 14:51:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035401118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990428', 'Tyler Lane', NULL, 'Tyler called in because he wanted to know is ER benefits.  When probed it didn''t sound as though he wanted to speak to me as to why.  I asked what was going on....I asked if he had gone to see his primary or gone to an urgent care for his symptoms and he said he had but that he isn''t feeling better.  I asked about the urgent care bill he said it was $150...I told him that if he goes to the ER...he should present himself as cash-pay and not pay them anything more than his remaining $850 of his IUA and ask the hospital to bill him the rest.  I told him that if he was going to the ER he needed to call Sedera, or I could transfer him right away.  He declined and said that he would give them a call, I gave him their number.  I also told him that I would send an email that explains how to open up a need and submit bills to Sedera.  He thanked me for my time, I told him to feel better and STRESSED that if he KNOWS he is going to the ER and KNOWS that the charge will exceed his IUA he NEEDS to contact Sedera right away.  He said he understood.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-16 14:20:16', '2019-05-16 14:20:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035387036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035379141', 'Christopher Jackson', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-16 13:18:06', '2019-05-16 13:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035413003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '5-16-19 Ian went to Stratton Mtn School and is 48. Healthy, no pre-x. But, did have knee and shoulder surgery many years ago, 12-13 years ago for shoulder. Getting married soon and fiance with LHS. Had good experience with LHS years ago and just re-enrolled. Had bad experience with Anthem and cyst removal from ovaries. Got it worked out but it was bad situation. Ian is paying $580 month now for $5K ded in network and $10K out of network. Recommending Provider Directed option bc of his location. Had colonoscopy already and it was clear. $1500 IUA / $297.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-16 12:34:57', '2019-05-16 12:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035370021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035379085', 'Laura Bush', NULL, 'Find address info for Nawbo in the cognito referring entity form.  Need w-9 - Do not pay referrals without it.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-05-16 12:32:35', '2019-05-16 12:33:26'),
