  ('zcrm_1579374000035387003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716907', 'Joleen Gerber', NULL, 'Member submitted new address, I replyed to ASi letting them know and will contact Sedera and change in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-16 09:18:58', '2019-05-16 09:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035385003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000234350', 'Alex Arenas', NULL, 'Member filled out a cancellation form. Billing killed in FTNI, all add-ons cancelled. Patti, please cancel with providers', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-16 09:13:57', '2019-05-16 09:13:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035370008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000234350', 'Alex Arenas', NULL, 'Alex called in, sounding a little frantic, to cancel his membership. I sent him the email with the cancellation link to submit. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-16 08:11:40', '2019-05-16 08:11:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035370003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521183', 'Samuel Conklin', NULL, 'Deb called in and just wanted to get some more info on 2nd MD because she had to go in for a mammogram for a bump that was seen a couple months ago. After the mammogram the provider stated that it is most likely breast cancer that is spreading and her provider wants to do surgery. I let her know that a way that Sedera can help even more with cutting her bills down is going through 2nd MD and taking any suggestion that MD suggests for her. I also told her that if she does NOT follow MD''s suggestion Sedera has the right to increase what she pays. She was perfectly fine with going ahead and doing that to help with bills. I explained she is responsible for the first $1000 of her IUA and then submit the bills into Sedera as a "need". She completely and fully understood how the process works and is looking forward to get the ball rolling on the ASAP. She was very great full for the info I provided her and how simple it really can be! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-16 07:40:16', '2019-05-16 07:40:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035316028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine called in with a multitude of questions, and I spoke for awhile with her, she said that she felt much more confident after we spoke.  She was having issue finding any doctors on the Network By Design site, and I could see why.... there is only 1 doctor listed that she could use and a medical group.  I am going to reach out to John about this.  I also emailed Patti to make sure that Maurine gets a copy of her APEX card sent.  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-15 18:35:36', '2019-05-15 18:35:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035316023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035345001', 'Amanda Thomas', NULL, 'W9 Attached. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-15 15:15:32', '2019-05-15 15:15:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035316018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521236', 'Laura Chasko', NULL, 'Laura called in to see if any of the chiropractic and physical therapy she is receiving for her shoulder, hip and neck pain would be sharable.  I asked how much she has already incurred with her bills. She said $600 for the PT and about $500 at the chiropracter''s office.  I told her that she would need  a diagnosis from her doctor and a schedule of treatment with a curative end result and to send that into Sedera to gain pre-approval.  I gave her their number, tried to transfer her to Sedera- left a voicemail on her behalf, and sent the "submitting your bills to Sedera" email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-15 14:55:04', '2019-05-15 14:55:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035316013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, 'called in to state that he tried calling last week as well.  He said that he wanted to sign up one of his employees to this plan.  I found that his rep is Ron and transferred the line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-15 14:48:50', '2019-05-15 14:48:50'),
