  ('zcrm_1579374000035324008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268015', 'Catherine Watson', NULL, 'Acct set up waived as husband enrolled separately. Billing set up to start 5/22. Good to go for a 6/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-15 13:53:31', '2019-05-15 13:53:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035324003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268055', 'Earl Henderson', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 5/15.Billing Set up to start 5/22. Good to go for a 6/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-15 13:27:16', '2019-05-15 13:27:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035316003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028390001', 'Chyla Walsh', NULL, 'Chyla called in asking a few questions about Teladoc and that she wanted to complete a welcome call. She has yet to do so. I explained a few things with Teladoc and she got through to registering but a message popped up when she tried requesting a visit that Teladoc is not available in her state, which is not true. I told her that her best option at this point would be to call Teladoc and get in contact with someone over there and that they can help her and request and online visit for her is there are still some issues. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-15 12:51:13', '2019-05-15 12:51:13'),
