  ('zcrm_1579374000035281018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656126', 'Kevin Lever', NULL, 'Kevin called in and stated that his doctors office has no record of Sedera negotiating his bill down. He said it was previously $25,000 and Sedera was able to get it down to about $16,000. The office is saying they have no record. I told Kevin he needs to get in contact with Sedera ASAP.  I gave him Sedera''s phone number. He than asked me to look up a few different providers for him in his area. I gladly did so and sent him 3 lists. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-15 11:49:30', '2019-05-15 11:49:30'),
