  ('zcrm_1579374000035281013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740001', 'Margaret Johnson', NULL, 'Margaret called in asking for some help on finding providers in her area in network for a GP and for getting a colonoscopy. I helped her out over the phone and sent her 2 lists for both types of doctors. She said that I have been a HUGE help for her during this time and is very happy with the services thus far. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-15 11:38:56', '2019-05-15 11:38:56'),
