  ('zcrm_1579374000035286003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'Spoke to Madonna.  Told her she has an IUA of $1000 and she has spent about $100.  Doctor want her to get a cat scan and blood work.  Told her to tell them she is a cash patient and ask for a discount.  Also to ask them to bill her.  If cost is prohibitive and they want advanced payment, we can contact Sedera and ask them to contact providers.  Madonna will call me back to let me know the outcome.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-15 08:25:39', '2019-05-15 08:25:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035279008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268055', 'Earl Henderson', NULL, 'Member only $5000 IUA 60-64 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-15 08:09:35', '2019-05-15 08:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035283003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged /15. Billing set up for 5/22. Good to go for a 6/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-15 08:05:05', '2019-05-15 08:05:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035281003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'Madonna called back in and said she had a hard time trying to get an appointment asap with some of the providers I had sent her. The earliest would have been June 6th and she no not wait that long. She went to her primary last night 5/14/19 and they are recommending a cat scan and blood work. She was calling to see if there is anyway that we can call the billing dept and bypass all the procedures of giving her card and what not. I transferred into John and John explained what she needs to do and to call her primary and get a quote for how much the cat scan is and to call us back and we will work from there. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-15 07:59:51', '2019-05-15 07:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035279003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268015', 'Catherine Watson', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-15 07:57:40', '2019-05-15 07:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035229016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268055', 'Earl Henderson', NULL, '5-14-19 Life and health apps completed. Chose not to get accident bc bought life instead with LB for $150K, 20 yr term with NLG. Chose Self Directed with $5K IUA for each with separate policies bc of ages.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-14 16:35:15', '2019-05-14 16:35:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035244008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078368', 'Diane Humphrey', NULL, 'Diane called to ask for a PDF and hard copy of her ASI card to be sent to her asap. She also had a question about a preventative mammogram screening that she got and received a bill in the mail. I told her to email it to me and I will get it looked at and to the right people. Very please with me helping her out today and making it so easy! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-14 14:04:09', '2019-05-14 14:04:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035249003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447148', 'Marie-Christine Carel', NULL, 'member submitted 916 in medical expenses.  $500 was applied to her IUA.  She was sent a check for $416 on 5/3. ($172 re-reimbursement for her and $244 for the remaining balance to Summit.  She will have to continue to pay at the time of service and submit for reimbursement.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-14 13:44:46', '2019-05-14 13:44:46'),
