  ('zcrm_1579374000035239003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031714111', 'William Kirk', NULL, 'Sent John an email on 5-10-19.  We spoke about William today to verify if John saw my email and had enrolled William.  John instructed me to contact William and go through the Selerix qualifying questions and if there no changes then enroll him on-line.  I called William on my cell and office line but the call will not connect up to his cell phone.   I made John aware of the situation and I will continue to try to contact Willam via phone.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-05-14 12:05:36', '2019-05-14 12:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035233008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-14 12:00:46', '2019-05-14 12:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035229011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, '5-14-19 Sandra was asking about little female procedure she needed in office. The dr. visit was about $200 and labs about $350. She''s wondering if she can get it cheaper as self-pay. I told her to talk to the lab and ask them for their best self-pay patient price and see what happens. She''s been happy to be able to speak to humans when she''s called MPB. She referred the Wetzelberger''s and wanted to know how she''s credited for that. She didn''t even remember that she gets $100 for the referral. She''s been referring a lot of people but told her to do a 3-way email for us to track it and best help her friends. She''s agreed to do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-14 11:50:41', '2019-05-14 11:50:41'),
