  ('zcrm_1579374000035168013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006496003', 'Charles Grosel', NULL, 'Wendy called in asking about a couple bills from lab work she got from back in October. I told her to just scan in the bills to me here and I will take a look and go from there. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-14 10:39:35', '2019-05-14 10:39:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035168008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018019042', 'Alexandria (Lexie) Hall', NULL, 'Called in asking how to go about finding an urgent care for a UTI. I told her since that is considered an Injury/Illness that there is no network and she can go to any of her choosing. She also asked about prescriptions. I sent her the request form, she was very happy how easy it is to get coupons for that.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-14 10:38:01', '2019-05-14 10:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035199003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447148', 'Marie-Christine Carel', NULL, '5-14-19 Marie-Christine is super frustrated with MPB for not following up with her after multiple calls and requests. She reached out to me to help her. She has more PT necessary for her shoulder and wants to know how to handle it since she''s exceeded her IUA now. Sedera has been great about following through and paying her back right away but MPB has not followed through with responding to her needs. I''ve explained she will still remain as self-pay. Her dr. won''t bill her and is making her pay at the time of service. So, she will need to continue to do so and submit the bills to Sedera. She also wants to know options for renewal in July. I told her about ReDirect as option and she will explore. This will eliminate all of her struggles she''s having now in the mountains. She will decide when sees pricing. She might keep her membership as is since she knows where to go for wellness stuff now and thinks she''ll pay more for ReDirect which is likely true. John is planning to follow up with her today. He''s waiting to hear back from Sedera right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-14 10:18:39', '2019-05-14 10:18:39'),
