  ('zcrm_1579374000035168003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740226', 'David McMahon', NULL, 'David called in and stated that his son had broken his arm back in march and he has paid over his IUA of $500 and got his medical bills in the mail for the remainder. He asked what he needs to do from here on out with the bills. I told him to email me the detailed medical bills, not the statements, over to me and I will take a look at them and send them over to Sedera to see what they can do from there. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-14 08:00:27', '2019-05-14 08:00:27'),
