  ('zcrm_1579374000035148016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411061', 'Donn Kellogg', NULL, 'Donn called with questions ranging from a stiff shoulder, to how preventive care works.  I gave him a briefer run down than what I normally do because he rushed and said that he would start with the info I gave and call back if he had any further questions.  I sent just about every email I could think of. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-13 17:47:04', '2019-05-13 17:47:04'),
