  ('zcrm_1579374000035110019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006333009', 'Allison Dutton', NULL, '5-13-19 Allison and I talked and she just needs C4 to back date her policy to April 1st  According to Cigna it needs to come from C4 of course. Proof is showing with C4 that she''s neen working on this since March. They should back date her plan. Also had a newer address change in May but still wants same plan as chosen for April. Spoke with Jackie at C4 and their systems are down and suggested we call back tomorrow. Allison will call herself and try to get it fixed tomorrow. Super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-13 12:46:47', '2019-05-13 12:46:47'),
