  ('zcrm_1579374000035068049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819248', 'Linda Pan', NULL, 'Linda called in and stated that she got 2 bills in the mail that are saying nothing has been paid yet, and these bills were from when she had HMA. John said to tell her to send the bills to me and we will get them processed as soon as we can. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-13 11:36:49', '2019-05-13 11:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035068044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171274', 'Diane Thomason', NULL, 'Diana called in a little confused on the process of how to use 2nd MD and how she is supposed to pay/submit her bills into Sedera for a surgery that her doctor recommends she get. I trued explaining to her that she ONLY has to pay for her bills for this procedure up until her $5000 IUA. Anything after that is submitted to Sedera. Diana was still not understanding how she pays while only the $2000 that she has left of her IUA. I transferred her over to Patti to better explain how it all works. After Patti explained it in further detail Diana was able to understand the process much. Diana is calling  Sedera right now and letting them know the situation and that she needs some guidance with 2nd MD. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-13 10:59:36', '2019-05-13 10:59:36'),
