  ('zcrm_1579374000035068021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'Madonna called in seeing if I could help her find a list of providers in her area for an ongoing issue from the past 3 days of diarrhea. I explained to her that this would not be considered preventative and that she could go to any doctor of her choosing and that it would be out of pocket until her $1000 IUA. She completely understood and just wanted to find a gastroenterologist with good ratings from out list. I sent her 2 different lists that were separated by male and female. She was so happy that I could do this over the phone with her and how helpful and understanding I was with all of this. Very pleased with our process! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-13 09:13:30', '2019-05-13 09:13:30'),
