  ('zcrm_1579374000035029083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447318', 'Laurel Kelner', NULL, 'Laurel''s husband reached out earlier today wondering how I couldn''t get him a better price on his Adderal than $23 at Walgreens his pharmacy choice or $16 cash at Walmart that I had found for him...he wondered if I had searched generic yet, which I assured him I had.  Larel called from Walmart pharmacy stating that they would not fill her meds and that the coupon didn''t work, I told her that she needed to have one of their pharmacisits call goodrx directly if they had any issue, also try speaking to the main pharmacist rather than just a tech, and the other thing was to ask if they could pull it up online to check and see if it that price is being promoted on goodrx''s site.  I wished her luck! and will reach out later to see how it went. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-10 17:26:46', '2019-05-10 17:26:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035049003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006333009', 'Allison Dutton', NULL, '5-10-19 Left vm for Allison. I couldn''t understand what she needs to fix. So, asked her to call me on Monday to help her. Cigna is backdating her plan for her she said. Also she''s having to pay balance owed which is fine.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-10 15:34:18', '2019-05-10 15:34:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035029078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003785031', 'Susan Wojciechowski', NULL, 'Susan wanted more info on the process behind getting a mammogram through Sedera, she said that she is a tad confused because the answers have been a bit different.  I told her that I was not sure as to the nuts and bolts that goes into the process, and that I thought it would be best if I gave her Sedera''s phone number and try to transfer her to someone that can answer her questions.  I ended up leaving a voicemail on her behalf, I told Susan that someone would either get in touch with her in the next hour, or sometime on Monday.  She was happy with that! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-10 15:14:45', '2019-05-10 15:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035029073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085163', 'Teresa Baker', NULL, 'Teresa called over to schedule a welcome call with Vanessa, I gave her Vanessa''s direct line and work hours, she is going to call her monday morning to see if she can do the call then. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-10 14:23:51', '2019-05-10 14:23:51'),
