  ('zcrm_1579374000035014053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'finished up a script quote for Faith after hours. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 20:13:35', '2019-05-09 20:13:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035014048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, 'Charles called in stating that he was in the pharmacy parking lot and was told that no one had called his scripts in for him and that he had talked to me last week and was assured that it would be done.  First he thought it was me, I had to clarify that it wasn''t, and explained the "Kelly Situation".  He thought that if he were to just fill out his prescription form that it would just continue to roll over month after month.  I gave him an explanation about how it works and what the form was for.  I told him that only a medical doctor would be able to script any medication out for him so he could get any medication from the pharmacy.  Then he said that he DID talk to a doctor "with you"  I asked if what he meant was a Telamedicine doctor and he said yes, I told him that as far as I knew Teladoc will give out a week, maybe a months worth of meds but for a maintenance medication he would have to speak with his primary care.  He said that it was his understanding that he could just use Teladoc, that he wasn''t a "pill person" or "doctor person"  I told him that I wanted to transfer him to Teladoc, so that he can ask for another script for his cream and migraine pills and that he can ask them about whether or not he would be able to call again several more times.  I transferred him to an Ashley that at first was having a tough time finding him in the system.  I gave Ashley the low down, that he may want to speak to a doctor about getting another script for his meds, and will also have questions for her and the doctor.  She did finally say that I could transfer the line.  He was pretty upset, but I let him vent, I told him that I understood his frustration and to please let me know if the staff at Teladoc tell him anything different than what I told him! I asked that he please reach out to let us know how this goes.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 19:22:06', '2019-05-09 19:22:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035014043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447318', 'Laurel Kelner', NULL, 'just finished up a prescription quote request for the Kelner family. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 17:40:34', '2019-05-09 17:40:34'),
