  ('zcrm_1579374000035014028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509089', 'Denise Cahill', NULL, 'Denise called in to say that she has moved as well as wants to cancel effectively June 1.  I sent her the cancellation form and tagged Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 16:58:26', '2019-05-09 16:58:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035014023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630194', 'Frances Primus', NULL, 'Frances called in stating that she just received a letter from the IRS, and told me that she had never received a 1095.  I called ASI and told the situation to "Dede" , she asked me what mailing address we had on file and it was a completely different one from the one they had. I transferred the call over so that Frances could give Dede permission to email a PDF version. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 16:38:39', '2019-05-09 16:38:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035018008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354084', 'Ioanna Petropoulou', NULL, '5-9-19 Likely choosing ReDirect for June 1st start. Wants to discuss with husband one final time. Answered many more questions for her. Husband has high cholesterol well managed with meds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-09 16:38:13', '2019-05-09 16:38:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035018003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, '5-9-19 Applying now for Schaana and Paul. Son is getting job with USPS and will have good coverage with them. Schaana $1500/$322 and Paul $1500/$507.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-09 15:20:18', '2019-05-09 15:20:18'),
