  ('zcrm_1579374000035014013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030419', 'Christopher Ambrose', NULL, 'He called in asking about the services that we provide and to update his payment info.  I explained all of our services as well as sent him a payment update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 15:12:38', '2019-05-09 15:12:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035014008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521016', 'Catherine Jaimes Llanos', NULL, 'notes from Skipio dated today by Kelly Fredrickson- KC

Thursday May 9th
Catherine Jaimes Thu May 09 12:11 PM

Hi Kelly, how are you? This is Catherine Jaimes. I had my annual exam at my obgyn, and they have to do an additional test. The code is 57454. Would you be able to tell me if that''s covered under my plan?
You Thu May 09 12:47 PM

Hi Catherine, If your provider ever has any sort of additional tests from your annual then it is unfortunately diagnostic. So you will have to pay out of pocket up until you''re  $1000 IUA. Anything after that will be considered a "Need" and you will submit those bills into Sedera. -KF  
Catherine Jaimes Thu May 09 12:52 PM

Ok. Thanks :/', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 14:57:06', '2019-05-09 14:57:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000035014003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839060', 'Peyton Bell', NULL, 'Peyton called returning KF''s call, John called in at the same time to relay a message to her.  I asked if she had a genetic history of breast cancer where the relative was 50 or under when it was diagnosed.  She stated yes.  Then I told her that she will need to get pre-approval for the test, her doctors office will have to call Shelley at RCI for this.  John spoke with her earlier and she gave him a lot of kick back regarding 2nd MD, but she was pretty pleasant to me. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-09 14:48:40', '2019-05-09 14:48:40'),
