  ('zcrm_1579374000034899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781069', 'Bill Bailey', NULL, '5-8-19 Bill is 63 and wife is 62. They missed open enrollment through work with UHC. Cost is $865 and good plan but not sure he can get back on that plan.  Live in Denver 7 mo and AZ 5 mo. Healthy, no meds. Referred by friend Kathy Van Goethem but not sure if individual or emp group. Can''t find her in CRM.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-08 11:35:25', '2019-05-08 11:35:25'),
