  ('zcrm_1579374000034880028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'Sedera called in(I didn''t catch the lady''s name unfortunately) asking about Ilian and if I knew about 2 separate car accidents he had and when they were. The notes from Kelly C did not state when the dates were and I gave her Kelly C''s number to maybe see if she knew anymore info. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-08 11:28:45', '2019-05-08 11:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034880023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Vanessa came to me about Maurine and gave me her phone number to call her and help her find some non preventative providers in her area. I called and she did not answer so I left a message. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-08 11:23:59', '2019-05-08 11:23:59'),
