  ('zcrm_1579374000034880018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'Julie called in and explained to me that when she went for her annual wellness visit that some symptoms had come up with her uterus and needs to go have an ultrasound. Her question was how she handles that. I explained that if anything comes up/symptoms talked about, then the visit turns into Diagnostic not Preventative so she will have to be paying out of pocket up until her $1000 IUA, anything after that she will need to submit her bills into Sedera as a "Need". She full understood and happy I have a template to send her that explains the process on submitting her bills. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-08 10:36:52', '2019-05-08 10:36:52'),
