  ('zcrm_1579374000034846003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Kimi called in all fired up to get a colonoscopy, per Guy''s instructions I attempted to give the line to John.  John answered and asked me to get a list of gastro drs, facilities, and anesthesiologists in her area.  I did, Kimi called back to say that the Dr we had found earlier wasn''t in network.  She asked about my list and where they were located and she just doesn''t want to bother with a 40min or hour long drive.  She wanted me to send the lists anyways.  I told her that she still could submit the bills if she wants to go out of network but know that she will be paying for a bit of it.  I told her that ASI will pay for 130% medicare allowable.  She said that she was ok with having to pay upfront and get reimbursed 130%.  I sent her many educational emails.  I told her to give us a call if she needed help with anything else.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-07 15:57:29', '2019-05-07 15:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034844008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001842007', 'Lora Stone', NULL, '5-1-19 Lora is super frustrated with LHS now. They won''t answer the phones. She has about $1300 outstanding that she can''t get reimbursed for. She left vm and I just called her back and left vm to help her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-07 15:41:02', '2019-05-07 15:41:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034836008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027977653', 'Amber Porter', NULL, 'Left a VM and will send a reschedule link for the welcome call', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-05-07 14:46:03', '2019-05-07 14:46:03'),
