  ('zcrm_1579374000034835003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, 'Put in a prescription quote request form, found 2 coupons and sent via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-07 13:13:25', '2019-05-07 13:13:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034834003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919719', 'Dan Haski', NULL, 'Received a email from Lauren Whetstone @Sedera advising me that we are to add Elite''s son to the plan.  She told me that she has been in much contact with Elite as she has had a rough pregnancy.  I told Lauren that she must go through us to add her son and that I would reach out to her to explain and send her out Member change form.  I have left 2 vm''s (5/3 &amp; 5/7).  I will email form tomorrow if I don''t hear.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-07 13:09:20', '2019-05-07 13:09:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034808003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'Monica called and started with "This insurance isn''t working for me" and went on to explain that she is getting billed for her visit.  Sent email and asked she send her bills to me.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-07 12:00:03', '2019-05-07 12:00:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034786005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, 'I emailed David Shull for an update on this member.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-05-07 11:21:30', '2019-05-07 11:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034775018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171274', 'Diane Thomason', NULL, 'Diana called in to let me know that she was recommended by her doctor for surgery to remove some cysts. She was asking questions on how the bills will be paid and what and where to go from here. Patti spoke with her and told her to go through the 2nd MD program and to give Sedera a call asap to let them know about the recommended surgery and that she will defiantly  be going over her $5000 IUA, I sent her the email that explains how to submit her bills as a "Need" to sedera and an email explaining how 2nd MD works and how to contact them. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-07 11:12:44', '2019-05-07 11:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034797003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162592', 'Aaron Lujan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-07 10:49:52', '2019-05-07 10:49:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034781006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003785031', 'Susan Wojciechowski', NULL, 'Susan called in to f/u on mailings.  I advised that she should have received the Welcome call scheduler email frm Sedera which she hadn''t.  I stressed importance of this and sent out scheduler template.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-07 10:33:07', '2019-05-07 10:33:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034783023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034128115', 'Amanda Zannis', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-07 10:24:58', '2019-05-07 10:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034783018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162144', 'Monica Berry', NULL, 'Mailbox is full. Not able to leave message. Set email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-07 10:22:08', '2019-05-07 10:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034783013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-07 10:18:34', '2019-05-07 10:18:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034783008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162629', 'Christopher Spencer', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-07 10:17:32', '2019-05-07 10:17:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034780013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-07 10:09:19', '2019-05-07 10:09:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034775013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004249190', 'Frank Jonathan Simcic', NULL, 'Frank called in to double check that he was cancelled and that he was still getting charged from Liberty. I let him know that, that is something on Liberty''s end and we are separate from them and to give them a call. He stated he already had their number and just wanted to make sure it wasn''t on our end. He also stated that he did not need anymore help with billing. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-07 09:45:01', '2019-05-07 09:45:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034775008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Kimi called in and stated that she just got a bill from her annual wellness visit. I asked her if she showed her ASI card to the doctor and she said yes but the doctor said "they don''t take ASI." So I am assuming she went out of network. I told her that I will be sending her a form for her to fill out in MEC Billing Assistance and to make sure she has ALL bills to send in so we can get this to the right people and be able to see exactly what happened. She said she does not have everything quite yet and will make sure to scan everything through when she receives it all.. was happy with the fact that it was simple as just sending the form. I did inform her though that she needs to make sure the providers are in network for everything to be covered as long as it is strictly Preventative. Sending a network lookup template as well. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-07 09:21:37', '2019-05-07 09:21:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034783003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085274', 'Richard Gulling', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-07 09:15:16', '2019-05-07 09:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034780008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162017', 'Lucas Klinkhammer', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-07 09:08:46', '2019-05-07 09:08:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034780003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162541', 'Harry Shaffer', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-07 09:04:16', '2019-05-07 09:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034775003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Shelley just called in from APEX to let me know that she tried getting in contact with Melissa and left her a message. She let me know that Melissa''s lab work was sent over to be processed. Shelley let me know that everything will be taken care of and processed by the end of next week and she will be in contact with Melissa through this process. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-07 08:43:02', '2019-05-07 08:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034767003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322438', 'Surya Yalamanchili', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-07 07:46:47', '2019-05-07 07:46:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034739028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096243', 'Karen Sebbens', NULL, 'I just wrote this as a ticket for John- KC  -

Karen Sebbens 07:04 PM ( just now )

John,

Karen called in frantic because she just received a pre-collections notice in the mail and she doesn''t know what to do.  I told her that I saw the note that you wrote earlier in the day, and she said that yes, everything was fine and explained...but now this letter has gotten her pretty fired up.  Please give her a call and try to suggest the next step she should take. 

She said that you could call early if you like, even though she is on the west coast, because she gets up at 5 am anyway.

Thanks!
Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-06 18:05:31', '2019-05-06 18:05:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034739023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830324', 'Terry Thomsen', NULL, 'Terry called in stating that she was having an emergency with her kidney''s (I know she has been suffering awhile as you can see in previous notes)  I told her to go to the ER and to present herself as cash pay, if they asked for any money I told her to pay ONLY the difference (from previous medical bills/same need) that she thinks she has left of her IUA and ask them to bill her the rest.  I told her that it was past buisness hours for Sedera, but I had her write down their number.  I told her that if she wanted she could leave a message with them tonight, or she could call them in the morning/or if need be a family member call and update them as to what is going on and they will walk her through the process.  I also sent another prescription medication quote form just in case she is sent home with scripts. I will reach out to Dania as well so that she can check to make sure that someone has reached out- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-06 17:23:46', '2019-05-06 17:23:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034739018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'I did end up hearing from Shelley, in just a few minutes after I had left a voicemail on Melissa''s behalf.  She said that she called Melissa and had to leave a message,  she said she will call again in a bit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-06 15:45:24', '2019-05-06 15:45:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034739013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862168', 'Amrik Singh', NULL, 'Gurprpeet called in very distraught that the emails and explanations weren''t what she needed.  She insists that her account needs IN LETTER FORM NOT EMAIL the total amount that was paid every month and the total of the year.  She says that she doesn''t need the MEC total amount...but the full amount.  Also, she is a bit concerned that her 1095 only has one page.  I told her that I was unable to help her but that I would get in touch with Jennie and she will reach out to her tomorrow.  The number to reach Gurprpeet tomorrow is - 602-718-0868 -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-06 15:16:01', '2019-05-06 15:16:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034739008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Melissa called in disheartened by the fact that she had just received a bill from Quest when she was told that everything would be covered.  She seemed to flustered to fill out a MEC help form, so I tried to call Shelley Steinmark at APEX to transfer Melissa to but it went to voicemail.  I left a message asking Shelley to reach out to Melissa.  Melissa didn''t like the idea at all that she should be calling me or wait on Shelley to give her a call back.  She said that she was told that all she needed for anything is to call the concierge and they would fix everything.  I told her that she did call the right place and that I am here to let her know where to go for the help that is needed.  That Shelley would give her a call as soon as she can.  She then mentioned "oh, I can just scan this bill and send it to Shelley! is it the same way I would have to on the form you sent?"  I told her that she could either scan it for Shelley, or myself....but that it was going to get to the right place. She said that she shouldn''t be in this plan....and that it is too much work for her.  She says it is nothing like how it was initially presented to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-06 15:10:27', '2019-05-06 15:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034739003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Elizabeth called concerned that she got a bill in the mail concerning a mammogram that she had done last June.  I sent her a MEC billing help form and told her that as soon as I got it I would send it to ASI management. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-06 14:42:15', '2019-05-06 14:42:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034719021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035070055', 'Rebecca Dearing', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 60-64 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-06 14:03:22', '2019-05-06 14:03:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034722083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096243', 'Karen Sebbens', NULL, 'Member called in with Liberty share box questions.  Reviewed and answered questions.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-06 13:23:38', '2019-05-06 13:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034717008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530219', 'Eva Hogan', NULL, '5-6-19 No real medical issues other than slightly high blood pressure and thyroid meds. She had thyroid cancer 25 years ago but thyroid taken out. So, can''t get that again. Also had hysterectomy while ago but she''s not worried about that at all either. Knows and understands pre-x clause. Her meds for blood pressure cost $30 for 90 days. Gets some of those issues handled at their local health fair to get prescriptions. Cobra is ending this week but thinks she has a 30 day grace period somehow. So, wants a June or July 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-05-06 13:20:41', '2019-05-06 13:20:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034719016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001980009', 'Tim Brown', NULL, 'Subscription cancelled.  Refunded 1 mon', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-06 13:03:55', '2019-05-06 13:03:55'),
