  ('zcrm_1579374000034722053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, 'Liat called in regarding charges for an ENT doctor and a cat scan on her nose (deviated septum).  
Explained that all expenses related to this medical event are subject to her IUA. Sent video on how to open a need and upload bills.  Reminded her to request medical bill not just a statement.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-06 10:46:03', '2019-05-06 10:46:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034696033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033451023', 'Scott Ballard', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Scott and Wife Orlena. Very pleased members of the plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-06 10:26:37', '2019-05-06 10:26:37'),
