  ('zcrm_1579374000034696023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033996146', 'Ted McMullen', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call, Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-06 09:49:46', '2019-05-06 09:49:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034696018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034221050', 'Lily Williams', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member not in front of computer at time of welcome call. She said she will need to change address but not until Nov. Explained where to do that online on our website. Will submit form for prescription pricing for her birth control. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-06 09:29:52', '2019-05-06 09:29:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003321085', 'Kerie Hagler', NULL, 'Member cancelled with LHS in Sept 2018 didn''t know that she had to cancel with us as well.  Refunded for March.  April and May declined.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-05-06 09:27:52', '2019-05-06 09:27:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034719003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030962039', 'Michael Farina', NULL, 'Found out that to cancel Dental &amp; Vision  just a email to Agent support.  Sent this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-06 09:19:36', '2019-05-06 09:19:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034696013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033266001', 'Konstandinos Roumeliotis', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-06 08:31:02', '2019-05-06 08:31:02'),
