  ('zcrm_1579374000034619018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085037', 'Kaitlin Robinson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-03 09:30:01', '2019-05-03 09:30:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034619013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085127', 'Ryan Mackley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-03 09:27:04', '2019-05-03 09:27:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034619008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034128004', 'Nancy Warburton', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-03 09:23:25', '2019-05-03 09:23:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034598045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640101', 'Carl Brown', NULL, 'Carl called in wanting to know how to get started with his preventive care, I went over how it works, I looked up doctor''s in his area to give him a for instance overview on how many doctors are in network in his area because he told me that he was having computer problems and couldn''t receive emails on his phone or on his computer.  I told him that I would be happy to go over the list and have him write down the doctors contact info.  I went over how to present his card and what to say to the doctor while he is there.  He said that he is working on getting his computer fixed and just to send all of the info, and that he will call me back if needed. He thanked me for my time.  I sent a multitude of emails on preventive care. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-03 09:14:17', '2019-05-03 09:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034598040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779423', 'Lela Glick', NULL, 'Ron called in because he had received a bill from his GP that looked as if they never sent the claim to ASI at all, I asked if he had showed them his card and he said that he did.  I told him that I would send him a MEC billing help request form to fill out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-03 08:48:48', '2019-05-03 08:48:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034619003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162440', 'Michael Kava', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-03 07:50:43', '2019-05-03 07:50:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034609013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to update her address I will change with all vendors', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-03 07:14:55', '2019-05-03 07:14:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034609008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752112', 'Dana Marangi', NULL, 'Dana called in because it was after hours for her GP office and her daughter has symptoms of strep throat, so she wanted to know the steps on getting her to see a doctor tonight about the issue.  I told her that Teladoc is great because you can go over all of the symptoms with a doctor and they will give you their expert opinion on whether or not it is something that can be treated over the phone with medication''s or if you should go to Urgent care/ or ER.  I told her to download the app, I sent her registration instructions, and then forwarded the call to "Chastity" over at Teladoc and asked that she walk Dana through the process. I also told Dana that I would be sending her a prescription request quote form so that I could get the best price on any meds that might be scripted, I told her that I would be here until 10 if she needs me! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-02 16:44:01', '2019-05-02 16:44:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034609003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Debra called to make sure that she was updating her payment and address info correctly by filling out our online forms.  I told her that she was doing it correctly and that I would reach out to the main office to be on the lookout for the forms. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-02 15:21:32', '2019-05-02 15:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034608008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, 'Valerie is at Honor-Shea hospital.  The Admissions person is:  Christine Virga, ph: 480-323-3780. Works T-Sat, 6-2:30 pm
They agreed to bill her as a cash pay patient with a 50% discount. Valerie has a 500 IUA and will pay them $500 deposit.  Hospital requires balance paid in  60 days.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2019-05-02 14:40:22', '2019-05-02 14:40:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034608003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, '5/2/19
Call from Valerie. She was admitted to ER last night in great pain. They are admitting her and doing surgery today for gall bladder. She has an infection so it''s emergency. 
I called Patti Baron and she agreed there is no time for 2nd MD. Advised me to call Sedera Member Services.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2019-05-02 14:37:56', '2019-05-02 14:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068349', 'Robin Roman', NULL, 'Robin called in to request for a PDF and hard copy of her ASI cards to be sent out and also had a few questions about prescriptions. I told her that I have a form that she can fill out and send back to me and I look up the cheapest pricing for her in her area or I could look up for her while on the phone. She very much liked the idea of this and I went ahead and helped her over the phone. She was ecstatic on how easy all these process''s were and how much I helped her out today, very satisfied member! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-02 13:46:23', '2019-05-02 13:46:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034590018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330172', 'Rose Sonrise', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Sedera &amp; ASi and cancel in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-02 13:19:57', '2019-05-02 13:19:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034590013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034584109', 'Jill Humphreys', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 18-29 Copay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-02 12:50:36', '2019-05-02 12:50:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191489', 'Luis (Luigi) Devoto', NULL, 'Called in to speak directly with John, transferred over. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-02 12:48:18', '2019-05-02 12:48:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, 'Christian called in to have both of his prescription coupons sent to him again from the first time he filled out a form. Sent them to him via email. Was very happy with how easy of a process this is. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-02 12:45:40', '2019-05-02 12:45:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330172', 'Rose Sonrise', NULL, 'Rose called in to cancel with her entire plan because she was just offered insurance through her job. I told her that I will send her an email that has a link to take her to the form to fill out. I gave her Sedera''s number to cancel through them because we do not cancel with them. She was please that is was that simple. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-02 12:00:43', '2019-05-02 12:00:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034598028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177635', 'Suzanne Oster-Keilt', NULL, 'Acct set up $25.00. Switched FTNI details to match everything and set up for billing.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-02 11:29:49', '2019-05-02 11:29:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034598023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034584049', 'Lisa Moran', NULL, 'acct set up fee charged 5/2., Billing set up, good to go for a 6/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-02 11:19:40', '2019-05-02 11:19:40'),
