  ('zcrm_1579374000034589033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924223', 'Ana-Aegi Clothiaux', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-02 10:47:04', '2019-05-02 10:47:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466180', 'Sarah Pyper', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-02 10:42:26', '2019-05-02 10:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130659', 'James Kalow', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-02 10:28:03', '2019-05-02 10:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018748124', 'Scott Sobke', NULL, 'Called in stating he has a very clogged ear and what to do since he is on vacation. I got details on hi symptoms and asked if he was registered with Teladoc. He said he is not and John sent the template that helps guide Scott with registering. Scott was very happy that is was that simple and will be registering right now and utilizing. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-05-02 10:12:55', '2019-05-02 10:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034598003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010340009', 'James Marciano', NULL, 'Wasn''t set up for monthly shared amount after recent hanges. Set him up and charged May payment on 5/2', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-02 10:10:34', '2019-05-02 10:10:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034590008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034584049', 'Lisa Moran', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-02 10:08:39', '2019-05-02 10:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355042', 'Babak Bashar', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-02 10:05:49', '2019-05-02 10:05:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029894166', 'Steven Brooks', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-05-02 10:01:27', '2019-05-02 10:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034590003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177635', 'Suzanne Oster-Keilt', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled w/ wife as primary.  I was able to change primary in RCI and changed in CRM so all information matches.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-02 09:18:48', '2019-05-02 09:18:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034589003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', NULL, 'Member called in.  has bills from her pediatrician that were submitted to HMA.  She''s sending them to me to be submitted to RCI.  New cards ordered, temp sent by patti.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-02 09:16:49', '2019-05-02 09:16:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034559003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212131', 'Dana Kuzma', NULL, 'Member called with a new CC  number. Update Zoho.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-05-02 08:00:51', '2019-05-02 08:00:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034558003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752474', 'Eric Fields', NULL, 'Eric called in.  Doctor has recommended echo cardiogram and a tilt table test.  He got pricing from Vail Hospital of about $2500.  IUA of $1000.  Calling Sedera to get them involved.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-05-02 07:56:19', '2019-05-02 07:56:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034540003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162075', 'Mark Crosby', NULL, 'Spoke with Robin on 4/30 about this member she advised that he had some billing issues  with CoveredCA and had been cancelled.  However he had just worked them out and would most likely be cancelling us.  I said we would have to know ASAP.  Received email overnight that he was cancelling, I sent out Cancellation Survey to Robin to be filled out by him', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-05-02 06:18:00', '2019-05-02 06:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032739022', 'Kim Fowlkes', NULL, 'Kim reached out and asked for help with a prednisone script price.  I sent her the coupon...tagged Guy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 19:04:34', '2019-05-01 19:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355042', 'Babak Bashar', NULL, 'Firouzeh called in confused and upset that it has been 8 months and she still doesn''t know how the plan works.  (she has been contacted twice in the past to schedule a welcome call) She said that she was promised a card with literature from Redirect and it never happened and now, when she spoke to them about some medical bills she was told just yesterday that "paperwork" would be sent so that she could fill it out....and now that hasn''t happened.  I appologised and told her that I would speak to management about that.  I asked her if she had ever heard of the extrahelp website and told her that it would be the quickest way to get in touch with someone there.  I told her that I would reach out to Redirect tonight but she would probably hear back from someone tomorrow.  I sent a very long extrahelp message on Fayes behalf.  I also emailed Jennie so she can follow up if need be tomorrow, as well as to ask Vanessa to reach out for the welcome call a third time.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 18:44:04', '2019-05-01 18:44:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034513053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032739022', 'Kim Fowlkes', NULL, 'Called and left Kim a message to call me about the issue she had with with Teladoc phone call to discuss her problems and satisfy her issue....waiting on call back.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-05-01 16:38:55', '2019-05-01 16:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899526', 'Andrew Dougherty', NULL, 'sent prescription coupon as requested. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 16:21:48', '2019-05-01 16:21:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'I have reached out to Leena to ask if any decision had been made for Marsha yet.  I am going to email Marsha as well to let her know that I have been checking for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 15:45:34', '2019-05-01 15:45:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'From Leena on April 25-
Hi Kelly,

 

In checking on this, Carent Laboratories did bill us again – but they did not change the coding one bit. L So, I think now we need to get the ok from John to process these as an exception.

 

Hi John,

 

A little background on this one – Carent Labs outsources their billing to India so they are having a hard time understanding what we are needing. The member was very frustrated when this came up and we did try to get the coding corrected by Carent, but they are still coding it incorrectly. They are using one preventative code, but they are not indicating that it was the primary reason for the labs, so I’m 99.9% sure they are preventative, but I still need an OK from you to proceed with allowing to be repriced by the network as an exception. Let me know if you have any questions.

 

Thanks,

 

Leena Basurto

Claims Department Manager

MERP/HRA/Dental/Vision Plans

Administrative Solutions, Inc.

P. O. Box 5809│Fresno, CA 93755

Ph. 559.256.1320 │Fax 559.475.5780

LBasurto@asibenefits.com │www.asibenefits.com', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 15:43:50', '2019-05-01 15:43:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032739022', 'Kim Fowlkes', NULL, 'Kim called in a bit blustered because she was told this morning that she would receive a call back to confirm whether or not dermatology was an extra $75 if she wanted to use it.  I told her that for another member there was, and he ended up utilizing that service.  She said that the cash price for her local derm was $35, but she was upset because now she missed the appointment while waiting on the home office to give her a call back.  I apologized, and told her I understood her frustration.  I offered to transfer her to someone at Sedera, and she declined.  She said that she would go ahead and try to set up an appointment for the small rash on her face through Teladoc, to hopefully tell her if they would recommend her going to a dermatologist or not.  She was disappointed because she thought it would be free.  She thanked me for my time. I also told her that I was going to send a prescription medication quote form just in case she gets scripted anything. I am going to let Guy know about this. - KC *****NOTE I did end up confirming the cost with Elizabeth Vargas at Sedera*******', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 15:35:33', '2019-05-01 15:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111466', 'Ruscelina Ceiba Winters', NULL, 'I just emailed Ruscelina to ask if she had any luck getting through to Labcorp to give the correct department her billing info.   When I hear back I may ask Leena for an update. KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 15:09:32', '2019-05-01 15:09:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'I have reached out to Leena about Brian''s claim, and let Brian know that I am still on the lookout and thanked him for his patience. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 15:03:32', '2019-05-01 15:03:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862168', 'Amrik Singh', NULL, 'Gurprpeet (the daughter of Amrik) called in because she is helping her parents with their taxes.  She said that she had received the 1095, but it wasn''t what she needed.  She requested an official run down of monthly cost because her parents experienced some issues last year.  I told her that she could find the receipts in her fathers email, but that is not what she wanted.  I also told her (per Patti) that her parents paid $520 a month.  But that still didn''t satisfy her.  I told her that I would leave a task with the office manager to get back to her tomorrow to see if she could find a solution for this. Best number to reach her- 562-469-5632  and she would like this to be emailed to her father''s address. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 14:23:58', '2019-05-01 14:23:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034521018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc reached out to Leena about his kids "behavioral screenings" and wondered why they were not being covered by ASI.  This is Leena''s response- KC
From: Leena Basurto 
Sent: Wednesday, May 01, 2019 9:06 AM
To: Marc Krawatsky <Marc.Krawatsky@Krawatsky.com>
Cc: ''kellyc@mympb.com'' <kcheever@mympb.com>
Subject: RE: MEC services for children

 

Hi Marc,

 

I’ve spoken to Dr. Ewing’s office today and the reason the visit will not be covered under the MEC plan is the medical CPT code that they are going to use. A CPT code is the medical code that the doctor bills with to let us know what services were provided. When evaluating if claims are eligible under the MEC plan, we review the CPT codes and the diagnosis codes, as both must fall within preventative guidelines. The office informed me that the visit will be coded with CPT code 90791 for the first visit and CPT code 90834 for any follow-up visits, which does not fall under the codes approved for Behavioral Assessment. Behavioral assessment codes include CPT code 96110 and 96127, so that is the reason we told the office that the visit will not be covered under the MEC plan. Please let me know if you have any questions.

 

Thanks,

 

Leena Basurto

Claims Department Manager

MERP/HRA/Dental/Vision Plans

Administrative Solutions, Inc.

P. O. Box 5809│Fresno, CA 93755

Ph. 559.256.1320 │Fax 559.475.5780

LBasurto@asibenefits.com │www.asibenefits.com', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-05-01 14:01:11', '2019-05-01 14:01:11'),
