  ('zcrm_1579374000034521003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, 'Susan called in very confused in regards to billing, she was just a mess.  I explained the whole program again to her, she admittedly says that she doesn''t think that she picked the right plan because of all of the work involved.  I tried to transfer the line to Shelley over at RCI/APEX but she was gone for the day.  I left a message with Shelley to give Susan a call back, gave her a bit of info and Susan''s number.  I told Susan that I would send the billing form over to Shelley.  I will let Wendy know what is going on.  There was some confusion over emails that were sent earlier in the day, but I didn''t have any notes from today to let me know what was really going on.  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-30 16:18:59', '2019-04-30 16:18:59'),
