  ('zcrm_1579374000034513033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025959066', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'Gretchen called and asked what she has to do if she is going to be having a surgery that her doctor is recommending. I told her anything that is injury/illness than she is going to have to pay out of pocket up until her IUA. Anything after that she would be submitting her bills into Sedera. I told her is she thinks this is something that will go over her IUA she needs to give Sedera a call ahead of time and they will her guide her. I gave her Sedera''s number and she was happy I had it handy and is giving them a call now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-30 12:58:21', '2019-04-30 12:58:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034513028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'Called to ask on how to go about getting her annual wellness visit with a Gynecologist and how to look up doctors. I told her I would send her a template that has the link and explains what she has to do to look up a provider. I also looked up providers with her over the phone and sent her a list in her area. She also did not know how to present herself when she gets to the doctor. I sent her another template that explains what she has to say to the front desk on presenting herself. She was extremely satisfied with all my information provided. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-30 12:13:07', '2019-04-30 12:13:07'),
