  ('zcrm_1579374000034468008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, 'Shelley ended up being very proactive and called the pediatricians office, the office did not have RCI on file, so they are going to reprocess and send to RCI. I let the Mullikin family know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-29 14:58:13', '2019-04-29 14:58:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034468003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'Ilian called in because he said that he had a "sports related accident" that made him end up in the ER. I asked how he was and he told me "better now".  He said that the hospital originally thought that he was with Blue Cross Blue Shield, so when he called the hospital about this they told him that having his type of "insurance" would make his hospital bill drastically higher.  He said that they had to do a few CT scans.  I asked if he was going to need follow up treatments and he said "no".   I explained how Sedera works, I sent him the corresponding email about how to open up a need with Sedera and start uploading bills, I gave him Sedera''s phone number and tried to transfer him, when it felt like it was just going to go to voicemail I transferred the line.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-29 14:26:30', '2019-04-29 14:26:30'),
