  ('zcrm_1579374000034386033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, 'Gordon called in because he was having trouble locating his Welcome Packet in his inbox...I reached out to Sedera and asked that it be resent.  He got Liz''s email to set up a welcome call when we were on the phone, and I send him many preventive care emails, nomination email, Sedera videos, he sounds very eager to get started with our program, he is planning on opening up a HSA and HMA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-26 15:35:50', '2019-04-26 15:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034386028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, 'Mandy called in to ask how to submit a preventive care bill, I sent her a MEC help form to fill out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-26 15:14:20', '2019-04-26 15:14:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034386023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Family $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-26 14:39:04', '2019-04-26 14:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034386018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'Michael reached out admittedly embarrassed that he didn''t know how his plan worked.  I told him not to be, and that I would help him gain some understanding, I answered who we are, who ASI is and who Sedera is as well.  It turned out that he was sent to an emergency room by his doctor because he got a staph infection in his elbow.  He had to get a bag of antibiotic fluids...and it also needed to be flushed out by an Orthopedist.  I sent him an email on how to submit bills to Sedera,  and reached out to Patti and asked that she look up his IUA.  I told him that he could call anytime with questions, he thanked me and said that I had been very helpful. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-26 14:30:08', '2019-04-26 14:30:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034351054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830286', 'Maureen Gannon (Hanson)', NULL, 'Maureen Hanson = Maureen Gannon', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-26 13:24:50', '2019-04-26 13:24:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034351049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354084', 'Ioanna Petropoulou', NULL, '4-26-19 Husband is leaving job soon and wants a June 1st start date. Family of 3. Cobra about $1800 month, C4 about $900-$1330 for Bronze or Silver. They have 2 1/2 year old so likes the idea of ReDirect or Co-Pay Network in case son needs to go to dr. Price is $801 ReDirect or $799 Co-Pay at $1500 IUA! Healthy, no meds, no pre-x. Kostas went to chiro 1x, son urgent care 3x in 2 1/2 years, 3 PCP visits, Ioanna 0x. Also wants dental since has many dental problems. Maybe Spirit Dental.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-26 13:01:23', '2019-04-26 13:01:23'),
