  ('zcrm_1579374000034331023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038370', 'Christine Allen', NULL, 'A Stephanie from a Pediatrics Billing office was calling on behalf of Christine Allen  to send us her claims that were left on file, there were 4 in question.  The number that Stephanie called from - (303-779-5437) I told her that Christine''s plan had been cancelled and read her Jennie''s notes,  I told her when Christine Plan began and ended and apparently that got rid of 2 of the claims.  I told her for the other two she needed to contact Shelley over at APEX/RCI .  I gave her direct line as well as her email.  Stephanie thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-25 15:44:41', '2019-04-25 15:44:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034317013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, '4-25-19 Rob''s colonoscopy is scheduled for Monday, April 29th at Gastoenterology of the Rockies. She doesn''t know the doctor''s name but they told her they are in-network. They also told her if they find something in the visit that the entire visit is re-coded. I explained that the diagnostic portion and treatment portion will not be covered under the MEC. She thinks it''s not covered at all if they find something. I told her to find somewhere else if that''s true. I left vm for John to make sure I''m instructing appropriately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-25 15:44:38', '2019-04-25 15:44:38'),
