  ('zcrm_1579374000034269019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361869', 'Robin Tolan', NULL, 'Member submitted change request to remove Husband John who will be starting on Medicare eff 7/1.  I will notify Sedera &amp; ASi and make a task to change prices when they are finalized re:Renewal', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-25 08:52:00', '2019-04-25 08:53:42'),
