  ('zcrm_1579374000034278003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283041', 'Kelly Noblit', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-25 08:03:45', '2019-04-25 08:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034271003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584192', 'Gregory Skochko', NULL, 'May declined. 1st notice sent', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-25 07:39:03', '2019-04-25 07:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034269003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233193', 'Rebecca Kirk', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to add son Wade.  I will let Sedera &amp; ASi know.and change billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-25 07:36:24', '2019-04-25 07:52:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034245036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330097', 'Craig Nelson', NULL, 'Kimberly called because she wanted to know how to fill out her son''s camp form in the insurance section.  I explained that ASI was her family''s only form of insurance, that she could TRY to use that and their EIN number, but sometimes it does not work.  She understood, was ok with that, but voiced her frustration about the entire plan being so confusing, so I took the time to explain everything to her , answered her questions and told her that I would send many many educational emails to help with any left over confusion, the other thing that she had mentioned was her ordeal with her family''s vaccinations, and she said that the pharmacy and the front desk staff said they had never heard of them so they ended up paying out of pocket for all of it, I told her that I wanted her to fill out the MEC billing help form and that I would run it by Leena to see if anything can be done.  She was really relieved to get all of this information because she said that she has been pushing her husband to cancel us due to all of the headache of everything.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-24 17:06:08', '2019-04-24 17:06:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034245031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001038039', 'D. Scott Hinckley', NULL, 'called in wondering why he was getting charged $50 a month. I explained, listed the benefits.  He asked to cancel because he does not use our services.  I sent a cancellation link and tagged Patti in it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-24 16:33:29', '2019-04-24 16:33:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034245026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Iris called in from a lab asking "so do I just give them my ASI card and then it''s covered?" I asked who scripted the blood work, if this was ordered by  a primary physician or did she seek medical help due to symptoms or on-going diagnosis. She got kind of annoyed and said that she wanted to know exactly what to do, I promised her that I would.  She apologized for being "sharp" stating that she is just freaking out because her husband has cancer and she''s overwhelmed.  I said it was ok, that I understood.  She said that the bloodwork script was coming from her Endochronologist to check certain blood levels due to the medication she is on. I explained why it would not be covered. She asked panicked about what she should do, I told her to present herself as cash pay.  She thanked me for giving her an answer, and apologized again for how stressed she was.  **I wanted to say more to Iris, but she was panicked and rushing me.  I am going to send her a load of educational emails on the back end here.***  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-24 15:27:46', '2019-04-24 15:27:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034245021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010714068', 'Karie Walker', NULL, 'Karie Walker called in because she needed guidance as to how she opens up a need with Sedera.  She was seeking treatment for strep and the medication gave her a horrible allergic reaction.  She is doing better now.  I gave her the gist of how it all works, sent her an email with instructions and a link to get started,  sent a prescription quote form as well and explained that benefit so she can use it next time she is faced with cash paying for prescriptions.  I gave the number and hot transferred the call so that she could leave a message, I am also going to reach out to Sedera and ask that someone reach out to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-24 15:02:05', '2019-04-24 15:02:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034204013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672020', 'Bein Tran', NULL, 'Member called in..... absolutely no Idea what he has for benefits.  Very thick accent.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-04-24 14:19:33', '2019-04-24 14:19:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034236113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740180', 'Oliva Basener', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. Processed payment on 4/24', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-24 14:17:10', '2019-04-24 14:17:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034236108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679315', 'Robert Neufeld', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form, new CC still declined due to NSF. Sent him another email', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-24 14:00:21', '2019-04-24 14:00:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034208039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, '4-24-19 Nancy is recommending her sister Elaine to call me. Elaine''s daughter is turning 26 and needs July 1st start date. Nancy hasn''t used membership yet and was asking how to get her annual wellness visit taken care of. Searched for Dr. Richard Zane and Dr. List Lefkovits are both in network. Sent her search tool as well if needs another doctor for any reason. Explained how to go in as self-pay patient as well. She''s all set. She will call Concierge for new card that she can''t find.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-24 13:51:50', '2019-04-24 13:51:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034208034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006333009', 'Allison Dutton', NULL, '4-24-19 She realized she hadn''t selected her plan until today for the $179 payment amount with her corrected income. She chose it and should be good moving forward. She spoke with someone at Cigna who told her that her current payment will suffice which was the original $8.39 not $244. She''s not really sure why but will leave it alone and see what happens. She''s all set for now she thinks.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-24 13:36:43', '2019-04-24 13:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034245013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830324', 'Terry Thomsen', NULL, 'Terry called in to ask what to expect when going to an emergency room for her UTI that simply has not gone away with the antibiotics that the Teladoc Dr AND the Urgent Care Dr scripted out to her.  She said that she is miserable and wanted to know the process of visiting an emergency room for this issue.  I told her that all of the money that she has spent regarding this one need will count towards her IUA, and to only give the hospital that remaining amount.  I told her that if the bill was going to go over to give Sedera a call and let them know what is going on.  To make sure that she is requesting the CPT coded medical bill along with the cash receipt.  I told her that I would send her a link and directions on opening up a need with Sedera, and that she should call them if need be at the number on that email.  I also told her that if they decide to script her out more medication, to give me a call, because we had recently extended our hours, so that I can find the best price for her.  I sent that form as well.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-24 13:20:15', '2019-04-24 13:21:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034245008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663189', 'Michele Ream', NULL, 'Michele called to cancel.  I sent her the online form and tagged Jane in the letter.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-24 11:54:50', '2019-04-24 11:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034240043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322546', 'Christopher Roussin', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-24 11:24:46', '2019-04-24 11:24:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034236093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177222', 'Amy Vasterling', NULL, 'Reissued $100 referral check for Candi Broeffle. New check#1051 and i''s mailed out on 4/24', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-24 11:17:51', '2019-04-24 11:17:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034245003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024472005', 'Heidi Geldean', NULL, 'Heidi submitted a billing help request yesterday that I forwarded to Shelley right after.  Shelley contacted me today and this is her message-
