  ('zcrm_1579374000034204008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640011', 'Rich Piotrowski', NULL, 'Spoke to Rich regarding Ellen''s mammogram.  Explained that there are out of network benefits with their MEC.  Asked that she forward the bill to me when she gets it.  Further explained that the cheapest traditional insurance plan available to them through BC/BS costs $1495/mo as opposed to $599 for HEP.  That''s a difference of $10,000 a year.  That comes with a trade off.  Personal responsibility and being involved with you own care AND billing.  He want''s to see if they can drop the MEC.  Will check with Dania. They''re ok for now.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-04-24 10:14:34', '2019-04-24 10:14:34'),
