  ('zcrm_1579374000034236003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, 'May payment declined "NSF", sent an email and will call later. He is a 5/1 start so I advised we need a payment immediately', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-24 07:50:55', '2019-04-24 07:50:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034212054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459001', 'Jessica Tabachnik', NULL, 'Jessica called in after she had contacted a Doctor''s office that she had found off of the PHCS network for a primary well visit.  They told her that it would be $100, when she had thought that she would only have to pay a copay.  I told her that her preventive care visit should be covered completely, and that she most likely spoke to someone who had never heard of her insurance before.  I told her that it is very important to present her card correctly so that there is more understanding, I told her that I would send her a script that she can read through and use when making appointments over the phone and in person.  I also told her that she should either ask someone in billing or even the manager to have this settled.  She was grateful for the help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-23 18:45:59', '2019-04-23 18:45:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034212049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, 'Jill emailed in with all questions pertaining to a new need that she has, I emailed back and encouraged her to give Sedera a call in the morning and that they would help guide her through the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-23 18:12:47', '2019-04-23 18:12:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034212044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Johana, Tatiana''s assistant, called to ask about the email that she had sent over to info@ I told her that Kelly F was out sick and that I was catching up on answering her emails.  I asked WHAT the bloodwork was for.  I told Johana that she needed to ask Tatiana where the bloodwork script originated...from a wellness visit, or a doctor visit that was to manage a chronic condition, or to address new symptoms or illness.  I explained how both camps work,  I also mentioned direct labs.  She thanked me for my time and said that she would ask Tatiana about the blood work.  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-23 17:34:41', '2019-04-23 17:34:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034212039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165306', 'Bonnie Eckert', NULL, 'Bonnie called in to change her payment info.  I sent her the form and tagged Sunny in the letter. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-23 14:58:47', '2019-04-23 14:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034212031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034221050', 'Lily Williams', NULL, 'Acct set up fee and May payment charged on 4/22. Billing set up', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-23 13:16:59', '2019-04-23 13:16:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034212026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002934033', 'Garry Stahl', NULL, 'Member called after receiving decline notification. Had no idea what the service is and wanted refunds since September 2018 when he cancelled with LibX. Explained and told him that he has been declining for several months. After all no refund and he seemed ok, just wanted to make sure everything is cancelled. Billing killed.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-23 13:09:09', '2019-04-23 13:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034212021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059151', 'Guilford Robinson', NULL, 'So "Gill" called in because Jeff Kanter had hinted that we may be able to help him find the best price for a test that he wanted to have done.  He said that he doesn''t want to go through having to call from a list to ask and see where the best price is.  I told him that if he had the CPT code then Sedera might be able to help him find the best option in his area.  I asked what the test was for and he said it was for the Cervical Spine and the code was 72040 The moment I asked him about his back issue he stated that it wasn''t my concern, that he didn''t want a second opinion.  That he was going to do whatever he and his internist discussed, he wanted to use his HSA, and not get anyone involved.   I tried to explain a second time but he wanted none of it.  I asked if he would like to be transferred to someone at Sedera, or if he wanted me to reach out to them on his behalf.  He said that he was going to find their number and give them a call, and then ended the call with me.  My gut reaction is that he doesn''t fundamentally know truly how his membership with Sedera works.  I am going to share this note with John Kach and wait for instruction on what I should do next. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-23 13:01:39', '2019-04-23 13:29:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034222056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, 'Difference in price between $528-PSD &amp; $586 Redirect is $58.  I will charge a one time adjustment for 5/1 monthly share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-23 12:34:45', '2019-04-23 12:35:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034222048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784641', 'Amy Loseke', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Survey I will notify Sedera &amp; Redirect.  Billing already cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-23 11:55:14', '2019-04-23 11:55:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034171148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-23 11:17:34', '2019-04-23 11:17:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034222043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034221050', 'Lily Williams', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-23 11:02:40', '2019-04-23 11:02:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034222038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'Member called in and advised that he had moved and wanted to know if that "messed anything up".  I advised no however that I would email him out Member Change form so we could update his address.  I will send.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-23 10:57:54', '2019-04-23 10:57:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034222033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899119', 'Kathy Spanski', NULL, 'Kathy called in asking about yearly Mammogram and also another test that provider i recommending. I advised since other test would be diagnostic she would present as a cash pay patient.  Advised she would be submitting a need to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-23 10:54:48', '2019-04-23 10:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '4-23-19 John wanted to understand how to handle his wife''s recent ER visit for A-Fib. May be considered pre-x bc happened once before in time after enrollment before start date. Now reappeared within 1st year of membership. Told him to contact Concierge for assistance in helping with price negotiations to get best possible price as self-pay patient. He already told the hospital he doesn''t have ins. He understands the unfortunate timing of everything. Waiting for bill to arrive before starts the process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-23 10:48:01', '2019-04-23 10:48:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034171140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent out today QR Life code cards out for her and her husband. Verified address as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-23 10:21:50', '2019-04-23 10:44:57'),
